window.AKK_TRANSMIGRATED_AS_THE_MALE_LEADS_VEGETATIVE_SISTER_IN_A_GAME_NOVEL_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_TRANSMIGRATED_AS_THE_MALE_LEADS_VEGETATIVE_SISTER_IN_A_GAME_NOVEL_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Transmigrated as the Sister in a Vegetative State in a Male-Oriented Novel","paragraphs":["“Xiao Fu, your brother made some money. I bought you the highest-end game pod. You can stay in it for a month without eating or drinking. Level up well inside, and you can even bring the strength into reality!”","Huh? Wait, who are you, buddy?","Chu Fu regained consciousness and realized she was trapped in a pitch-black world.","But she could hear sounds from the outside—whoever was speaking was right by her ear.","She could even feel the warmth of their breath, but Chu Fu couldn’t respond.","Soon, the voice moved farther away.","“I’m leaving my sister in your care. Make sure to feed her nutrient solution every month on schedule to keep her online. I’ll come to check on her!”","“Don’t worry, Mr. Chu Feng. Our hospital is also researching whether using game helmets can stimulate responses in vegetative patients and help them recover from locked-in syndrome.”","Hearing this, Chu Fu’s scalp felt like it was splitting from pain, as a flood of another person’s eighteen years of memories poured into her mind.","Chu Fu, Chu Feng!","Three years ago, a car accident took their parents in one blow, leaving her a vegetative state. The only one who came out whole was Chu Feng.","And the rich kid who crashed into their family kept pressuring her brother, got forgiveness from other victims, and ended up with just seven years in prison.","This memory felt so familiar!","Wasn’t this the unfinished novel she’d stayed up all night reading yesterday, Reborn: The King of Slaughter in Online Games?","The novel described Blue Planet suddenly being graced by a game called Prime Gate. It was said that clearing the game would grant a final grand prize of 10 billion.","This instantly drew global attention, countless players flocked in, and Prime Gate became a second world.","In reality, corporations and the wealthy established countless gaming studios, spawning a legion of star players.","To cover the medical costs of his vegetative sister Chu Fu, Chu Feng joined a studio to farm for gold.","Despite his strength and talent, the studio kept him in chains, working harder than a coal miner in a black-market pit.","And a year later, the monsters from the game actually descended into reality.","Blue Planet’s land was also affected by unknown substances, expanding ten thousand times.","Survival became incredibly harsh. People could only gain power in the game to fight monsters in reality.","In her first life, Chu Fu was killed by monsters in the very first wave of the game’s invasion.","Chu Feng survived for ten years.","He ultimately perished under the extreme weather of an elemental tide—intense cold, blistering heat, and the overwhelming fire meteors of the Fire Spirit King.","Then, Chu Feng was reborn!","In his second life—after rebirth—Chu Feng awakened the SSS-grade King of Slaughter, became a Shadow Assassin, and charged forward without resistance.","He even gave his sister an advanced game pod ahead of schedule and picked the best hospital for her treatment.","Chu Fu was that vegetative sister who lay there until the novel was abandoned, never waking up.","“Who wants to be a vegetable?”","As soon as Chu Fu spoke, a voice echoed deep within her soul.","[ID Confirmed: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]","Huh?","Wait!","It turned out that when she was accepting the memories, the game kept asking her to name herself, and she blurted out this ridiculous name.","Before she could argue, the scene before her suddenly shifted.","A gate opened amid the stars, countless lights illuminating her darkened world, and Chu Fu’s body was involuntarily drawn into it.","The ethereal voice spoke again.","[You have crossed the Prime Gate. Your innate talent has awakened.]","[You have awakened the S-grade talent: Plant Person.]","[S-grade talent Plant Person:","Feature 1: Plant Mutation—You can make plants grow rapidly and mutate.","Feature 2: Plant Control—Plants you nurture will be under your command.","Feature 3: Wood-element magic power increased by 100%.]","“So I really am a plant person!”","Chu Fu grumbled.","She realized she couldn’t go back. Thinking of her own ordinary life in her original world, she suddenly found the current situation not so bad.","At least, the vast, thrilling game world described in the book piqued her immense interest.","In her original reality, her parents were divorced and each started new families. Since childhood, she had been passed around like a hot potato, and not a cent of support was given.","After high school, she went straight to working in a factory. Reading novels was one of the few hobbies she had that cost nothing, brought joy, and broadened her horizons.","Now, even if she wasn’t the lead in the novel, she was at least connected to the main character!","In the book, whether Chu Feng forgot or the author overlooked it, her vegetative character never made an appearance until the story was abandoned.","How could that stand?","She needed to fight monsters and level up fast, find Chu Feng early, and latch onto that big, strong thigh of his.","And her talent wasn’t bad either!","It was only a step below the top SSS and SS grades, still one in a million.","Chu Fu’s lips curled into a smile, and her eyes sparkled.","[Based on the scan, your base stats are: Physique 1, Strength 1, Agility 1, Spirit 10.]","Chu Fu’s smile froze.","No more laughing!","Normal humans averaged a 5, and her Physique, Strength, and Agility were all 1.","That was just too realistic!","Before she could complain, countless statues appeared in the space around her: armored warriors, mages in flowing robes, archers with bows, and assassins with daggers.","Statues of all professions.","Soon, several statues stepped forward, glowing with a golden light that indicated they could be chosen.","[Based on your talent attributes, the following professions are recommended.]","[Life Profession: Farmer.]","[Life Profession: Florist.]","[Half-Life, Half-Combat Profession: Plant Scholar.]","[Combat Profession: Wood-Element Mage.]","[Combat Profession: Toxin Master (Special Profession).]","[Gray statues cannot be selected. Player’s base stats are insufficient.]","Within Prime Gate, initial awakenings came in four tiers: common, special, hidden, and unique.","Naturally, the rarer the profession, the stronger it was.","After observing, Chu Fu found she couldn’t choose professions like Warrior or Archer.","She had little choice in the matter.","An option with a special profession popped up without much hesitation, and Chu Fu selected the fifth statue.","The moment she chose it, a substance greenish and speckled with purple-and-blue hues flowed into Chu Fu’s body.","[You have become a Toxin Master.]","[You gain Toxin Master feature: All skill attacks deal Toxin damage equal to 10% of spell damage, ignoring physical defense.]","[You gain Toxin Master starting skill: Toxin Technique—Releases a Toxin attack causing 110% of spell attack as Toxin damage, lasting 15 seconds, with a poison effect every 3 seconds, stackable up to 5 layers.]","[Profession selection complete.]","[Do you wish to enter the game now?]","“Yes.”","[You have entered Prime Gate, Newbie Village 0308888.]","Her vision went black briefly, and a slight weightlessness set in. When she opened her eyes, Chu Fu noticed a more obvious change: she stood at the entrance of a village. The village was not small, and the noise of bustling people filled the air.","A constant stream of people moved back and forth, all dressed in coarse linen clothes and carrying wooden weapons.","Further ahead was the area beyond the village, where red-eyed rabbits hopped in the grass.","As soon as a rabbit appeared, dozens of weapons would strike at it, cutting it down into a flash of white light.","Many people were arguing.","Just then, a harsh voice shouted, \"The Huanyu Studio has taken over this spot. Who the hell told you to steal our monsters here? Get lost, or else we'll kill you right now.\"","\"Don't say I didn't warn you newbies—dying in [The Primordial Gate] means your character gets deleted.","If you die today, you'll have to wait 24 hours before you can play again.","Right now, the servers are packed, and reservations take half a month. Even your talent level will drop.","Our Huanyu Studio was founded by Wan Huanyu, the son of the chairman of Wan Tu Real Estate in Linjiang City.","Our boss says the studio is hiring combat-type players with A-rank talent or higher—starting base salary of 10,000.","Life-type players with B-rank or higher—starting base salary of 5,000.","Make money while gaming—don't miss out!\"","Chu Fu paused in her steps, and her body stiffened.","A surge of anger naturally rose within her.","Wan Huanyu!","He was the fiancé of Sun Jingya, the one responsible for that chain car accident—and a passenger in the same vehicle.","It was also him who dragged out the payment for Chu Fu's medical bills and forced Chu Feng to sign a letter of understanding.","This was Chu Fu's enemy.","Perhaps because Chu Fu's gaze was too full of hatred, the burly warrior in charge of recruiting for the Huanyu Studio locked eyes on her. His face instantly lit up.","Chu Fu had been in a car accident at age 15 and had lain in bed for three years. She was frail, looking as if a gust of wind could blow her over. Her face was as small as a palm, with grape-sized, pitch-black eyes that resembled the most delicate and beautiful doll.","Pale skin, a thin body, and a childlike expression.","She seemed like someone weak and easy to bully.","\"Little beauty, are you a mage? What's your talent? What's your class? Want to join the Huanyu Studio?\"","A warrior with the ID Huanyu Kuangba approached her."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Mutant Plants: Chainsaw Dandelion","paragraphs":["Chu Fu withdrew her hate-filled gaze and forced herself to calm down.","There was no way she would join Wan Huanyu’s studio—she even wanted to cause him trouble.","“No need. I’m just an E-rank talent.”","“Wow, the beauty’s voice is sweet too!” the warrior said, even more delighted. “No problem, E-rank talent is no big deal. You can do something else—come work as a receptionist at our Huanyu Studio, recruit some new people. I’ll pay you fifteen thousand a month, how about that?”","Chu Fu sneered inwardly.","Was being a receptionist at Huanyu Studio really a good job?","It was basically a selection pool for Wan Huanyu and a bunch of rich second-generation playboys.","“No thanks. I’m socially anxious. I’m not joining.”","Chu Fu didn’t let the warrior bother her any further. She hurried away as if fleeing.","The warrior, losing face, immediately turned cold.","He didn’t stop her from leaving, but he signaled to a thief in his team with a sharp look.","“Ah Wu, tail that little beauty. Have some fun with her.”","“Got it, Brother Ba. Leave it to me!” Huanyu Kuangwu winked and trailed behind Chu Fu.","To avoid the area near Huanyu Studio, Chu Fu naturally headed toward the outskirts of the village.","But everywhere around her were trees and vegetation, blocking the view, and few red-eyed rabbits spawned—she’d have to search for them.","Finding a secluded spot, Chu Fu decided to test a skill.","“Poison Technique.”","A cloud of dark green venom shot from her branch-shaped staff, hitting a red-eyed rabbit.","Instantly, the rabbit turned a sickly green, and a -15 damage number floated above its head.","The rabbit squeaked, locking its blood-red eyes on Chu Fu, and leaped toward her.","The rabbit was faster than she was!","She cast another Poison Technique.","The rabbit now had two stacks of poison.","-30.","Chu Fu turned and ran to widen the distance.","-30.","Only 25 HP left—three seconds more, and the poison would kill it.","Her damage was very high compared to other players.","But just then, a dark figure darted out from the side.","Huanyu Kuangwu’s dagger landed a precise final blow.","-28.","The red-eyed rabbit dissolved into white light, and a single rabbit tooth fell to the ground.","“Thanks for the help, beauty.”","Huanyu Kuangwu bent down, picked it up, and waved it at her with a grin.","Chu Fu’s face turned cold.","Huanyu Kuangwu laughed. “Oh, mad? Go ahead and keep fighting. I’ll keep picking them up—we make a pretty good team, don’t we?”","But since they weren’t in a party, only the player who dealt the killing blow to a wild monster got the experience.","Huanyu Kuangwu had obviously stolen her kill.","What’s more, it was clear he planned to do this to annoy her.","And with only Poison Technique at her disposal, Chu Fu’s basic attack was just hitting things with her staff—but she had only 1 point of strength.","No matter how she looked at it, she couldn’t take down Huanyu Kuangwu.","Fortunately, she had her S-rank talent.","Her gaze shifted to the surrounding plants.","[Ordinary Weeds: Can Mutate into Giant Weeds.]","A flicker of surprise crossed Chu Fu’s eyes. She could actually see what the plants would become after mutation.","She kept examining.","Trees, shrubs—they could all mutate.","But they didn’t seem useful.","“Little sis, why aren’t you fighting any more monsters? Why not come back with me to Brother Ba’s place, treat him well—ah, I mean, work hard. Fifteen thousand a month.”","As Huanyu Kuangwu spoke, he leaned closer, so close that Chu Fu could smell his stinking breath.","This game was way too realistic.","It had even copied his bad breath.","She was thinking about how to take him out when she suddenly spotted a fluffy, fuzzy cluster of dandelion seeds.","Chu Fu’s eyes instantly lit up with a genuine smile.","Even Huanyu Kuangwu was startled.","This beauty really looked stunning when she smiled!","But instead of stirring his sympathy, it sparked a sadistic urge.","Huanyu Kuangwu was a street punk, a thug—when out of money, he’d curse out his parents; when he met a girl, he’d harass and bully her until she cried, and then he’d gloat.","He didn’t like seeing people smile; it was like a rat in the darkness panicking when exposed to sunlight.","“What are you looking at, beauty? A scenery lover? Not interested in fifteen grand? A rich girl from a wealthy family?”","He followed her gaze and spotted the dandelion.","“Like this? Heh!”","Huanyu Kuangwu lifted his foot to crush it.","Just then, Chu Fu made her move.","S-rank Plant Person Trait 1: Plant Mutation.","A flash of vibrant green light landed on the dandelion.","In an instant, the dandelion visibly swelled and grew. Its leaf edges sprouted fine serrations that gleamed like cold metal.","The stem grew tall and straight as a giant umbrella, rising to nearly two meters.","Huanyu Kuangwu’s foot, originally aimed at crushing the dandelion’s puffball, instead landed on its leaves.","“Vroom!”","The serrated leaves whirred like a chainsaw, instantly slicing off Huanyu Kuangwu’s raised foot.","“Aaaargh!”","Huanyu Kuangwu screamed.","[You have been attacked by the mutated plant belonging to “Who Wants to Be a Plant Person.”]","[You have 5 minutes of self-defense time.]","“What?”","Huanyu Kuangwu howled in pain, rolling and scrambling away, looking at Chu Fu with eyes now full not of sticky malice but fear.","“Are you crazy? Attacking a player gives you a red name—you won’t even be able to enter the city!”","“I may not be able to get into the city, but you’ll have your character deleted. It’s been 30 days since launch. You came to Zone 030 because you were killed before, right? What level is your talent now? After being killed, you’ll drop another level—won’t that make you completely useless?”","In [Origin Gate], player character death meant deletion, and re-entering the game required a 24-hour wait.","Zone 030 was the 30th server opened. There were 10,000 servers in total, each holding 10,000 players.","That meant a hundred million accounts were opened daily—not just new players, but also old players recreating characters after death.","But each death lowered a player’s talent rank. Huanyu Kuangwu had definitely died before.","As Chu Fu spoke, she cast Poison Technique on him.","Instantly, Huanyu Kuangwu’s face turned green.","“I was wrong, beauty! I was just joking! You don’t have to be so vicious!”","“You’re not sorry—you’re scared.”","Huanyu Kuangwu really was scared. But compared to Chu Fu, he had a big advantage: he’d entered the game with the Huanyu Studio crew at midnight launch, so he had supplies—HP and mana potions.","He quickly pulled out a red potion and drank it.","Amazingly, his severed foot wound healed rapidly.","With a roar, Huanyu Kuangwu turned and ran!","Chu Fu was just a mage—she could never catch him.","And that mutated chainsaw dandelion seemed unable to move; fighting here was a disadvantage.","He opened the game’s private chat.","Immediately, he sent Huanyu Kuangba a message:","“Brother Ba, that bitch you told me to tail is trouble—her damage is insane, and she can make plants grow huge. She’s definitely high-tier talent. She’s trying to kill me now. We can’t let her live. Send some guys to help me.”","They must kill all the high-level gifted individuals in Zone 0308888 to dominate this place.","Huanyu Kuangba received the message and immediately responded.","\"Where are you? Send me your coordinates.\""]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Dandelion Hot Air Balloon, the Flying Girl","paragraphs":["Huanyu Kuangwu immediately wanted to input the coordinates, even regretting that the [Primordial Gate] had no positioning system.","But the next moment, a chilling pain struck his entire body.","Poison Art!","He spat out a mouthful of green blood.","A -18 poison damage floated above his head.","Two layers of poison status, lasting 15 seconds.","“What?”","Huanyu Kuangwu knew Chu Fu’s movement speed from following her, and he realized her basic stats were really not great.","Her face was pale, and she looked very weak.","She seemed like someone who had been ill for a long time.","After the [Primordial Gate] exploded in popularity, many disabled and sick people entered the game to play, and Chu Fu was clearly one of them.","He had been injured earlier, but after drinking a potion, his movement speed hadn’t decreased, so how did Chu Fu catch up?","He turned his head to look.","But there was no one behind him.","Yet the next moment, a shadow covered Huanyu Kuangwu’s vision. He instinctively looked up.","And saw a girl, floating in the sky, holding a huge dandelion puffball.","It was that mutated dandelion.","[Mutated Dandelion:","Feature 1: Chainsaw Dandelion – The dandelion’s leaves turn into chainsaws to attack enemies.","Feature 2: Hot Air Balloon Dandelion – The dandelion seeds can float in the air, turning into a hot air balloon to carry you into the sky.]","Chu Fu had discovered that whenever she tried to mutate a plant, she could see some of its mutation directions.","Other plants either grew bigger, became toxic, or yielded more fruit.","Only this dandelion could be used for combat.","So she had not only used the chainsaw dandelion to cut Huanyu Kuangwu’s leg but also let the hot air balloon dandelion carry her, catching up to him.","From high above, she looked down, her staff glowing with a green light.","The next moment, it aimed at Huanyu Kuangwu.","“Poison Art!”","Three layers of poison stacked.","The poison status was still 15 seconds, and this time, with three layers, it had reached 27 points.","Huanyu Kuangwu’s defense was higher than that of the Red-Eyed Rabbit, and he had two pieces of equipment, so three layers of poison only did 27 damage.","But Chu Fu clearly wasn’t about to let him off.","“Poison Art!”","Four layers of poison stacked.","-36 damage.","Players started with 100 health at birth. One point of physique could add 10 health and 10 defense. Huanyu Kuangwu had a total of 140 health.","Now he only had 37 health left.","In another three seconds, he would be down to one health point.","In an instant, the fear of death overwhelmed him.","The [Primordial Gate] was too realistic. He didn’t want to die again. If he did, his talent would drop from C-tier to D-tier, and he would fall behind the main group.","Forget about private messaging—he pulled out a health potion!","Small Health Potion: Instantly restores 50 health.","“Gulp!” He drank it down.","+50","-36","His health was still 51.","Just then, Chu Fu raised her hand again.","“Again? Big sis, I beg you, I’m really wrong, spare me!” Huanyu Kuangwu screamed in agony, because potions had a cooldown of 30 seconds before the next one could be used.","[Poison Art!]","Four layers of poison.","-45","+50","-45","-45","Huanyu Kuangwu’s hand holding the potion bottle paused, his head tilted to the side, and he breathed his last.","He was dead.","[You have killed Huanyu Kuangwu. Sin value +100.]","[Current penalties: White-named players attacking or killing you will not increase your sin value; village guards will actively attack you; while red-named, you cannot enter safe zones or trade with NPCs.","1 hour online reduces sin value by 1 point; killing 100 monsters reduces sin value by 1 point.]","Chu Fu steered the dandelion hot air balloon to land beside Huanyu Kuangwu’s corpse.","On the ground lay a rusty iron dagger of poor quality, 25 copper coins, three health potions, five mana potions, and one piece of rabbit meat.","Free supplies?","Thank nature for the gift.","Chu Fu stepped forward and unceremoniously gathered all the items into her coarse cloth backpack.","...","Linjiang City.","Inside a rundown, decrepit apartment, amid the pungent smell of rotting food and a chaotic room, a roar of fury erupted.","“Fck that btch! Don’t let me catch you!”","Huanyu Kuangwu yanked off his helmet, and thinking of the system notification he had just received, his rage only intensified.","[Your character has died. Character deleted. A new character can be created in 24 hours.]","The penalty system of the [Primordial Gate] was very strict.","Each character only had one life (unless after level 20, they encountered a priest with Resurrection).","After dying, creating another character took 24 hours.","Moreover, each server could only accommodate 10,000 players, and once full, no new characters could be created on that server.","The game was so popular that, upon release, it had exploded worldwide, with reservations from a total of 5 billion players, and 100 million player slots opened each day.","Huanyu Studio had chosen this server and occupied it with a full 200 players, all of whom had reserved their spots two weeks in advance.","Once dead, server 0308888 was not only full, but they would also need to re-book another server, which might take ten days or even half a month to get back in.","This game was this good—not playing it felt like losing a fortune!","Huanyu Kuangwu was absolutely frantic.","Hate, anger, a desire for wild revenge, and the urge to tear that sickly wretch to shreds.","He immediately grabbed his phone and called Huanyu Kuangba.","The other party had the game helmet set to answer calls, and it connected quickly.","“Xiao Wu, what the hell are you doing? You better not be telling me you’re dead?”","“Brother Ba, I’m really dead. That little bitch killed me.","She turned a dandelion into something like a chainsaw, chopped my leg off in one hit.","Then she could fly, with this huge dandelion, and I couldn’t even reach her. I’d need an archer to take her down. Her talent is definitely S-tier!”","Huanyu Kuangba also cursed and shouted back.","“Useless! Don’t spout nonsense. Where did you die? If we offend someone like that, we have to get rid of them. Otherwise, with good talent, won’t they be snatching bosses and first clears from us?”","That absolutely wouldn’t do.","Boss first kills, top five on dungeon lists, top five on clearing records—all gave attribute points.","And the final beast swarm siege on the village could drop reverse items like talent upgrade scrolls, skill upgrade scrolls, and class skill enlightenment scrolls.","They couldn’t afford to give that up.","“Fck it, forget the garbage. Where did you die? Why didn’t you send me the coordinates?”","Could he admit that he stopped to drink a healing potion out of panic?","Absolutely not!","Huanyu Kuangwu could only weasel out: “Brother Ba, she killed me too fast. I didn’t have time to say the location. She’s east of the village now, almost near the level 2 monster area. Her movement speed is slow, so she can’t escape.”"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Racing Rockets in Wheelchairs: A Disabled Duo","paragraphs":["Chu Fu's movement speed was slow.","But with the hot air balloon dandelion, the situation was different.","\"The male lead... oh no, my brother, he exploited plenty of bugs, used the terrain to kill the boss, bought lots of props to climb the high mountain. With just one dandelion, I can do the same. Why would I still grind monsters? I can just go straight for the boss and kill it.\"","Chu Fu activated the hot air balloon dandelion and moved toward the village exit. She also bent the stem of the dandelion into a J-shape.","Sitting on it, she looked like she was using a makeshift parachute.","After checking her bearings, Chu Fu drifted toward the Level 3 area, Wild Boar Ridge.","But she quickly realized that this hot air balloon dandelion also had durability.","As it flew, the dandelion seeds would scatter, and the stronger the wind, the faster they fell.","Chu Fu didn't dare fly high, afraid of dying from a fall.","When the scattered dandelion seeds drifted out, she immediately adjusted the balloon's direction, trying to catch them.","When she got a seed in hand, it turned out to be as long as a palm, like a huge thorn.","[You have acquired a Mutated Dandelion Seed (Black Iron Quality)]","It was actually Black Iron tier.","Just a moment ago, the dagger dropped by Universe Overlord was of Rough quality. Currently, the newbie village only dropped items of four tiers.","Rough, Common, Black Iron, and Bronze.","Rough items could sell for a few copper coins!","The novice staff in Chu Fu's hand was of Broken quality, even lower.","This showed that Black Iron quality was already a luxury item in the newbie village.","\"I wonder if this seed can be planted and then used to grow new dandelions?\"","Chu Fu thought to herself, planning to try it later.","If it worked, her fighting style would be clear.","Grow seeds, use mutated plants to fight.","At the same time, she would hide behind and sneakily release poison.","Perfect!","As Chu Fu pondered this, she floated in the sky for a full hour, finally spotting the peaks of Wild Boar Ridge.","Not only that, from within Wild Boar Ridge came the roar of the Wild Boar King.","On a distant peak, there was actually a player standing in a crevice, like a narrow skyline spot, trapping the Wild Boar King.","Someone had beaten her to it.","Chu Fu panicked instantly.","To be honest, she didn't want to steal someone else's monster, since the other player had worked hard to fight it. But she had flown for an hour—was she going to end up with nothing?","As she thought this, she hesitated about whether to land.","Suddenly, a strong wind blew.","Three seeds from the hot air balloon dandelion were suddenly blown away.","[System Notice: Please be aware that the hot air balloon dandelion quantity is reduced to 1/3. The special effect will soon disappear, and the floating effect will dissipate.]","\"What?\"","\"Ah! No!\"","Chu Fu tried to take new seeds from her bag to grow.","But then she wouldn't be able to use plant control to stabilize the current dandelion!","She was caught in a dilemma.","Fortunately, the dandelion still had some floating ability. It was forced to land, trembling as it avoided crashing into rocks, and finally landed in a crevice between cliffs, similar to a narrow skyline formation.","\"Don't die from the fall, don't die from the fall, please don't die from the fall!\"","If she died, her S-grade Plant Person talent would drop in rank!","Luckily, she barely managed to control her position. After entering the narrow skyline, she stretched out her legs, trying to do a split in mid-air against the cliff walls to slow her descent.","As she fell downward, Chu Fu clearly saw the player who was pinning the boss in that narrow skyline. His handsome, noble face showed a look of shock.","Then, instead of dodging, he stepped forward and tried to catch Chu Fu.","The next moment, Chu Fu slammed hard into him, knocking him to the ground.","-100 (Falling Damage)","At the same time, the player opposite her also took damage.","-80 (Impact Crush Damage)","[System Notice: You have maliciously PK'd \"Rocket on a Wheelchair.\" The other party may lawfully defend themselves against you for the next five minutes.]","Chu Fu's initial HP was 110, and now she had only 10 left—one hit away from death.","What's more, because of the fall, she was now in a dizzy state for a full five seconds.","And she had also killed Universe Overlord, making her a red-name player.","She really couldn't think of any reason why he wouldn't kill her.","\"Ouch... are you okay?\"","Rocket on a Wheelchair said hoarsely, wincing in pain but staying calm, and didn't attack Chu Fu.","There were still kind people in this world!","After five seconds passed, Chu Fu recovered from dizziness and quickly apologized.","\"I'm so sorry, I'm sorry for hurting you!\"","Chu Fu scrambled up, quickly took out a health potion, drank a mouthful, and restored her HP to 60.","Then she took out another one, intending to offer it as compensation.","\"Here, take this. Restore your health!\"","Rocket on a Wheelchair also stood up.","Chu Fu slowly tilted her head up and suddenly realized this player was really tall!","He had incredibly long, straight legs. He was wearing novice clothes, but his weapon was different—a very delicate... hmm, a slingshot!","The slingshot gave off a simple, natural glow; it was actually a Black Iron tier item.","\"It was just an accident, and you didn't do it on purpose. I didn't expect anyone else but me to make it here. Want to kill the boss together?\"","Rocket on a Wheelchair invited.","Chu Fu's eyes immediately lit up. This player not only didn't blame her for crushing him but actually wanted to fight the boss with her.","\"Sure!\"","Chu Fu quickly formed a team with him.","Team Members:","[Who Wants to Be a Plant Person]","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]","After forming the party, Rocket on a Wheelchair kept sizing up Chu Fu. He seemed to notice her frail, sickly face and eventually let out a self-mocking laugh.","\"Hah, so we're the disabled duo? One a plant person, the other in a wheelchair.\"","Chu Fu was stunned, then turned her gaze to Rocket on a Wheelchair's legs.","With such straight legs, he actually needed a wheelchair?","But in comparison, being a plant person seemed even worse than being in a wheelchair.","The difference was that Chu Fu had transmigrated, so she didn't feel sorry for herself at all.","But Rocket on a Wheelchair looked quite sorrowful, clearly not having accepted the fact that he needed a wheelchair.","Chu Fu couldn't help but feel some sympathy and tried to comfort him: \"It's okay, Wheelchair Bro. Right now, the game is a second world, and this game is really magical. No one in the whole world can find the game company's headquarters.","Maybe it's alien technology!","Who knows, one day we might get the power of our game accounts, like in the novels. Do you usually read novels? I recommend one to you, called 'Game Invasion: Spending Millions to Become the Number One Female Immortal.' It's about a female player who syncs her game account and goes on a rampage in reality!","【Primordial Gate】 doesn't even allow respawns—such harsh conditions always seem like they're hinting at something!","So we have to play this game seriously!\"","Chu Fu clenched her fist, making a cheering gesture.","She was also subtly hinting that in a year, when the game invades reality, players would be able to sync their in-game abilities.","By then, with their game stats, even being a plant person or having paralyzed legs—even if their legs were amputated—they could grow them back.","When someone said \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" she wasn’t sure whether to believe it, but the young girl’s comfort had already reached her.","Despite being injured and turned into a vegetable herself, Chu Fu still managed to warm others.","\"That’s right, keep it up, PlantGirl!\""]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Disabled Alliance, Mechanic Enhances Bronze Equipment","paragraphs":["An even more cruel joke.","But both of them burst out laughing.","The man in the wheelchair, who raced like a rocket, chuckled and then said, \"My name is Shen Chi. Chi as in speeding. You can call me Chi Ge!\"","Chu Fu felt this was even more ironic.","Long legs, handsome, but in a wheelchair, and his name means \"speeding.\"","What a life full of contrasts.","\"Mm, my name is Chu Fu, but if you call me Fu Mei, I always feel like you're calling me Guo Fu from the novel. It's also fine to just call me Plant Girl—people need to learn to face a bleak life.\"","\"That's fair. Then keep calling me Wheelchair Bro!\"","After they finished speaking, they both laughed out loud again, and the atmosphere was cheerful.","But as they laughed, the raging Wild Boar King beside them let out a furious roar and slammed violently against the narrow crevice.","The mountains shook and the ground trembled.","Rocks fell from above.","\"Be careful—rocks hitting us will also take off HP.\" Shen Chi quickly pulled Chu Fu to safety.","Then, he picked up a stone from the ground and pulled back his slingshot.","\"You pick up the stones, and I'll attack. This way, we'll kill it faster. By the way, what's your class?\"","\"Toxicist. I can help fight too!\"","\"Hand me your weapon. I can upgrade it. My class is Mechanic. I'm limited by materials, so all I can make now is a slingshot, but I can upgrade any equipment to improve its quality. The better the materials, the bigger the improvement.\"","Chu Fu's eyes immediately lit up.","Shen Chi's talent must be pretty good too.","But in the novel where Chu Feng is the main character, Chu Fu had never heard of Shen Chi's name.","That was normal. In fact, after meeting the people from Universal Studio today, Chu Fu finally understood why, in the novel Reborn Online Game: The King of Killers, the younger sister never showed up until the story was dropped.","She was likely surrounded and suppressed by Universal Studio.","A year later, not everyone could sync their in-game abilities to reality. At minimum, you needed level 10.","Many people wouldn't reach level 10.","But now that she had transmigrated here, she wasn't just a little girl who was physically eighteen but had been in a coma since age fifteen.","Chu Fu had been through the grind of society for over twenty years—scraping by in her youth, living freely in her later years. She might not do better than the original Chu Fu, but knowing the plot, she definitely knew how to play this game better.","\"Thanks, Wheelchair Bro. I don't have many materials on me. Can you use these? They're seeds from a mutant dandelion.\"","Chu Fu pointed at the dandelion seeds scattered all over the ground.","She had collected 100 seeds in her backpack already.","There were about 60 seeds scattered around.","Some had blown too far away, and she couldn't grab them in the air.","She pulled out another 90 seeds, making 150 materials in total.","She kept 10 as spares. The seeds on the ground were rectangular, about the length of a palm, and felt like sturdy wood.","\"Black iron grade material? Nice! If we're lucky, we might get a bronze-grade staff out of this.\"","Shen Chi piled the materials together and activated his talent to upgrade.","The next moment, the materials magically merged and attached to Chu Fu's novice staff.","Then, the staff transformed.","The cracked, damaged staff became sturdy, taking on a dark brown color. On top of that, a cute, chibi-style yellow dandelion appeared at the staff's tip.","【Dandelion Staff (Bronze Grade):","Physical Attack: 4-5","Magic Attack: 9-11","Spirit +1","Bitter: The target's mouth tastes bitter when hit.】","Shen Chi clicked his tongue.","\"One useless stat, but it'll do for now. We'll upgrade it again when we find better materials!\"","\"Wow, this is already great! I can use this staff all the way to level 10,\" Chu Fu said.","\"A level 10 staff will have much higher attack. We'll craft another one then,\" Shen Chi replied.","Chu Fu nodded.","Wheelchair Bro was really nice, generous, and didn't even ask for crafting fees.","But her ability only let her mutate plants—she couldn't offer Shen Chi much in return. She just had to deal more damage and, once the Wild Boar King dropped its loot, give Shen Chi a bigger share.","Chu Fu picked up her staff, and her attack power increased.","\"Venom Strike!\"","A burst of green light enveloped the raging Wild Boar King.","Even though she now had a bronze-grade staff though...","The damage number above its head was pitiful.","-6.","Chu Fu was speechless.","As a level 5 boss, the Wild Boar King had a massive level advantage over her. On top of that, it was the tanky, high-defense type.","That Chu Fu dealt 6 damage was only because, as a Toxicist, she had damage that ignored defense.","Luckily, her Venom Strike stacked, up to five layers.","That meant 30 damage total.","This time, it was Shen Chi's turn to be surprised.","\"You deal so much damage!\"","Shen Chi grabbed a stone and aimed at the Wild Boar King.","\"Swish!\"","Chu Fu felt something whistle past her head.","For a split second, only one thought popped into her mind: Being tall really has its perks—no worry about blocking your own sight when using a slingshot.","The thought passed in a flash.","The Wild Boar King's eye had already been hit by the stone!","-3! Critical hit!","Only 3 damage?","She looked at the Wild Boar King's HP.","80,560 / 100,000.","Chu Fu was stunned.","\"How long have you been fighting it? Didn't you spend five hours on this? At your attack speed, you'd need more than twenty hours to kill this boss!\"","Shen Chi nodded, picked up another stone, and pulled back his slingshot.","\"I logged into the game at midnight and used my talent to craft some mechanical wings.","I saw a video on the forums of a pro using this terrain to camp the boss, so I decided to try it.","Players need at least two days to reach level 3 before they can get to Wild Boar Ridge.","If I can kill this boss within thirty hours, I might get the first kill, which would give me bonus stat points.\"","What determination.","It looked like Shen Chi was also using a gaming pod, meaning they could team up and level together from now on.","\"Exactly. Now that I'm here, we'll be faster. When we get the first kill, make sure to hide your ID, or the guild people will definitely hunt you down. You'd basically be stealing their resource.\"","Shen Chi frowned.","\"What guild people?\"","\"Universal Studio!\" Chu Fu was also testing him. If Shen Chi was afraid of Universal Studio or wanted to join them, she wouldn't continue teaming up with him after this boss.","\"You know that when players apply for a server, they're grouped by location and time, right? So everyone on one server is probably from the same city.","Universal Studio is run by a rich second-generation named Wan Huanyu. They're ruthless. They're already blocking the newbie village entrance, forcing people to join.","My red name? That's from killing some of their people. If you don't join them, they'll harass you.","But their pay isn't bad—A-grade talents get a monthly base salary of 10,000!","If you steal their boss kill and don't join, you'll probably be hunted. If you die, your character is gone for good!","Wheelchair Bro, are you going to join them?\"","As Chu Fu spoke, she fully stacked five layers of Poisonous Venom.","The Frenzied Wild Boar King lost 30 HP over the course of 3 seconds.","At this rate, it would take only 2 hours for the Frenzied Wild Boar King to die.","Of course, that estimate didn’t account for Chu Fu’s mana regeneration, the Boar King’s rage mode, or its healing ability—so the actual time would likely double.","At that moment, Chu Fu didn’t notice.","Behind her, Shen Chi gripped the stone in his hand until his knuckles turned white.","In his sharp eyes flashed a glimmer of hatred, along with the burning rage of vengeance."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Hunting the Rampaging Wild Boar King, First Server Kill","paragraphs":["\"I'm not going to join them. In fact, I think a domineering guild like theirs won't let someone who took the newbie village boss off easy, either.","As long as I want to improve myself, we're bound to be enemies. We might as well find a way to take them out now.\"","Shen Chi calmed his nerves, keeping his voice as steady as possible, but the murderous intent in his tone was impossible to hide.","\"How many people do they have right now?\"","\"They've got over two hundred for now, Wheelchair Bro. Let's lie low for the moment, boost ourselves up a bit, then go after them.\"","Shen Chi nodded in agreement, then realized the two of them were standing one behind the other in the crevice of the cliff wall—Chu Fu probably couldn't see him.","He spoke again: \"No problem. I'll try to get my hands on some flying-type mechanical gear. If both of us can fly, those two hundred are just target practice!\"","That made perfect sense.","In this game, being able to fly versus not being able to fly was a night-and-day difference.","\"You got it! From now on, every one we see, we kill!\"","Chu Fu was thrilled too.","Finding a companion on the path to revenge—she was no longer walking alone!","\"Then let's pick up the pace!\"","Chu Fu pulled out a mutated dandelion seed and threw it within five meters of the Berserk Boar King.","But the result was a little awkward—it only flew two meters.","Her strength was too weak.","\"Uh, Wheelchair Bro, can you use this instead of a pebble? You don't need to hit the boar—just throw it next to it! Preferably right under its belly.\"","Chu Fu backed off again and handed the seed to Shen Chi.","Shen Chi didn't quite understand but followed her instructions anyway.","He raised his slingshot, used the seed as ammo, and even held back a little to keep from launching it too far.","Soon, the seed landed perfectly beneath the boar's belly.","Chu Fu's talent didn't require her to touch the plant—she just needed to be within five meters to cast her spell.","She used Plant Mutation on that seed.","Instantly, the seed sprouted at breakneck speed, becoming a new mutated dandelion.","But this time, instead of blooming right away, it first grew leaf blades like electric saws.","The leaves buzzed and whirled, rapidly cutting into the Berserk Boar King's belly.","In an instant, the boar's underbelly was a bloody mess.","-2-2-2-2-2...","The Sawtooth Dandelion had ten blades, each dealing 2 damage, for a total of 20 per wave.","And it dealt damage every single second.","The damage output was massive.","Chu Fu wanted to summon another dandelion, but her mana was completely drained.","Unwilling to use a mana potion, she sat down to rest, planning to recover enough magic to recast Poison Art.","Shen Chi noticed his own attacks were far inferior to Chu Fu's, but he didn't rest either. He kept picking up pebbles to shoot at the Berserk Boar.","And so, another three full hours passed.","With a pained shriek, the massive Berserk Boar King—stuck in the rock crevice, unable even to collapse—died on the spot.","In an instant, loot scattered everywhere.","Three items glowing green, five in dark black, twelve in white, plus materials and copper coins littering the ground.","At the same time, both of them were bathed in a few beams of light.","[You have reached Level 2!]","[You have reached Level 3!]","[You have reached Level 4!]","Starting from Level 1, after defeating the boss, they shot up three levels.","Chu Fu particularly gained 15 free attribute points.","On top of that, there were also system rewards.","[Congratulations! You have achieved the first kill of the Frenzied Boar King on server 0308888. As the server’s first kill, you receive the first kill reward: all stats +1 and a silver treasure chest.]","Before Chu Fu could feel happy, the system popped up another notification.","[A server-wide announcement will be issued soon. Would you like to hide your ID?]","“Hide it!”","Chu Fu shouted almost instinctively.","By hiding her name first, she could at least have a few peaceful days and keep the Universe Studio from tracking her down.","Shen Chi received the same notification on his end and naturally chose to hide his ID as well.","As both of them concealed their information, golden text seemed to float before their eyes, and an unavoidable system voice echoed in their ears.","Every single player on server 0308888 saw it!","[Server Announcement: Players “” and “” have slain the Frenzied Boar King, achieving the server’s first kill! Rewards have been distributed.] ×3","It repeated three times.","At that moment, the entire server exploded with chatter.","Some players, still hunting rabbits, were almost kicked to death by the rabbits in their shock.","Huanyu Kuangba led the members of Universe Studio toward the location where Huanyu Kuangwu had been, but failed to find Chu Fu.","He had also guessed that Chu Fu must have used a dandelion to fly away.","This game didn’t follow any rules at all, with its bizarre classes and abilities. While it added fun, it constantly caught them off guard and exceeded their control.","“Brother Ba, Xiao Wu said that girl looked sickly, with poor basic stats. Even if she flew away, she wouldn’t be able to fight level 2 monsters,” said a 16 or 17-year-old youth with the name “Huanyu Kuangshuai” floating above his head.","“If we just take control of the level 1 monster areas, she might end up dying in a higher-level monster zone!”","More importantly, they couldn’t track this female player named “Who wants to be a plant person” at all.","Rather than waste time, it was better to focus on grinding and leveling up.","He was about to reach level 2 soon.","They had been playing since midnight, and after more than ten hours, none of them had eaten.","The game was fun, but it was still tough to handle.","“Fine, all of you spread out. Search every level 1 monster area and kill that plant person if you find her!” Huanyu Kuangba was fuming, feeling insulted and challenged.","“Brother Ba, it’s noon now. Shouldn’t we go eat first?”","“Brother Ba, I’m broke. Can you order takeout for me?”","“Brother Ba, can I get an advance on my wages?”","Everyone chimed in, voices overlapping.","Huanyu Kuangba cursed inwardly, thinking of them as a pack of beggars, online parasites.","But these people had no jobs, no lives, spent all their time gaming, and were shameless enough to bully the weak in the game, quickly building up a force.","“Fine. Twenty yuan per person for a meal allowance—enough for a budget meal combo,” Huanyu Kuangba said.","“Hey, thanks, Brother Ba!”","“Brother Ba, you’re practically my godfather!”","“Dad!”","Each person got twenty yuan and sang Huanyu Kuangba’s praises to the skies before logging off to eat.","Huanyu Kuangba was in charge of this server and had organized a group of 200 people, making him a minor boss.","He lived in the staff dormitory arranged by Wan Huanyu’s studio.","In reality, he relied on the Wan family’s business conglomerate and worked in the Wan Tu Real Estate building, which had a cafeteria, gym, and other amenities.","Who would have thought that a former gangster who had done time in jail would one day become a white-collar worker?","Guan Liqiang and Wan Huanyu had been cellmates!","Three years ago, Wan Huanyu went to a bar with his girlfriend, Sun Jingya. After leaving, he drove drunk and slammed into four cars in a row. Two people died, several were injured, and Sun Jingya was sentenced to life in prison. Even Wan Huanyu was implicated and got three years behind bars.","Guan Liqiang met Wan Huanyu inside, and they became sworn brothers. After their release, the [Primordial Gate] just happened to open.","Guan Liqiang—a broke, unskilled, girlfriend-less old bachelor and lowlife who had been behind bars—turned into the captain of a guild.","He had started with an S-rank talent and even rushed to register Zone [001] alongside the guild leader.","But unexpectedly, after the level-10 village defense battle, they headed to Fengdu Town. Just as they left the town, an assassin wiped them all out. Having no other choice, they quickly applied and, five days later, joined Zone 015.","This time, Wan Huanyu survived, but Guan Liqiang got caught in the crossfire while fighting a boss and died again.","His talent had dropped to B-rank, and his rebuilt character ended up in Zone 030. The upside was that this time he no longer had to play second fiddle to Wan Huanyu—instead, he had become the big shot.","Guan Liqiang was incredibly smug, acting like a bully with borrowed power, already looking forward to using his new authority to hit on some cute girls in the guild.","What pissed him off, though, was that when he recruited a bunch of people today, hardly any women joined. A few even straight-up called him a toad lusting after swan meat, and he killed them in a malicious PK.","He couldn’t shake the feeling that after getting out of prison, the girls these days were nothing like the female players he used to meet in games."]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Blocking Chu Fu at the Dungeon Entrance, Do You Know Wan Huanyu","paragraphs":["However, none of those beauties were as stunning as the little vegetative girl he had seen today.","Strong in talent but frail in body—she looked easy to bully.","It was just that Huanyu Kuangwu was too useless, couldn’t even handle a vegetative girl, and needed him to step in and find her.","After eating, Huanyu Kuangba picked his teeth, put on his gaming helmet, and logged in.","The others had already arrived.","No one had slacked off to eat—after all, gaming wasn’t like work; one step behind meant falling further behind. These people were still heavily addicted to the game.","“Let’s try to reach level 2 before midnight, then head to the level 2 area to grind monsters. Get to level 5 within three days, and we’ll go to Wild Boar Ridge to hunt boars.”","If they got the first-kill chest, they’d claim a Silver-grade chest. If they lucked out and got a rare item, his account would become top-tier.","This time, he absolutely couldn’t die.","Just as he was thinking that, a system announcement suddenly appeared!","It completely stunned him.","[Server Announcement: Players “” and “” have slain the Raging Boar King...]","Huanyu Kuangba’s face turned red with rage!","“Who? Who the hell killed the Raging Boar King? It’s only been 12 hours since the server launched! How?!”","Huanyu Kuangba roared.","His lackeys were also outraged—they had claimed that BOSS was theirs.","But Wild Boar Ridge was at least four hours away from the beginner village. Even if they wanted to investigate now, they could only bark threats.","It was just impotent rage.","“Brother Ba, those two killed the BOSS, so they’re definitely level 3 now. Will they go after Field Mice?”","“Field Mice” was gamer slang—it actually referred to the level 3 dungeon: [Field Mouse Infestation].","The first dungeon kill also gave attribute point rewards.","Since they’d already killed the BOSS and gotten extra attribute points, they’d definitely hit the dungeon too.","“Right—the Field Mouse dungeon is by the field outside the village. Let’s go, follow me! We’ll block the dungeon entrance. I want to see who killed the BOSS!”","Huanyu Kuangba bellowed.","...","On the other side.","Inside Wild Boar Ridge.","Chu Fu looked at the Silver-grade chest in her inventory, said a little prayer, and clicked to open it.","“Open!”","The chest lid lifted, emitting a burst of silver light, and then a piece of equipment appeared in her inventory.","It was a dress in a Lolita style.","\"Primordial Gate\" wasn’t just popular with male players; even female players who disliked fighting praised the in-game armor designs. No telling how many concept artists they’d hired to create so many designs—especially ones tailored to Chinese aesthetics: no revealing outfits, no male-gaze designs, no suggestive looks.","Some styles were minimalist and sharp, others ornate and luxurious.","The higher the equipment quality, the more exquisite the design.","The dress Chu Fu had unboxed was clearly an ornate style.","[Green Poison Mushroom Dress (Silver-grade)]","Physical Defense +24","Magic Defense +35","Constitution +3","Spirit +3","Special Effect · Toxic Domain: Upon being attacked, automatically releases a poisonous mist counterattack, dealing 20% of magic attack as poison damage.","Class Restriction: Poison Master.","Level Requirement: 4.","Top-tier equipment.","Chu Fu immediately equipped the dress.","The top was a fitted waist design, with a round collar that showed off her collarbone and puffy sleeves on the shoulders that rose naturally. The fabric was soft and shimmered like silk.","The lower part was like a round mushroom cap, with green fabric adorned with several deep-green mushrooms that looked extremely poisonous. The hem had a thin layer of gossamer, scattering green spores constantly.","“Wow, does Silver-grade equipment already have special effects?”","Chu Fu spun around in delight, and with each turn, the spores’ glow scattered.","This dress was an amazing surprise.","Girls all loved looks—they dressed prettily, ate prettily, and even chose handsome men.","But more importantly, the dress brought huge attribute boosts.","The 5 points of Spirit added 10 magic attack.","The 3 points of Constitution added 30 HP.","Defense had also jumped significantly.","Assuming 1 Strength = 2 physical attack, 1 Agility = 1 physical attack,","most melee players had an average offense of around 15 points at level 1.","Mages with about 5 Spirit only had around 10 magic attack.","Against Chu Fu’s gear, they couldn’t even pierce her defense!","For her, with only 1 Constitution, it gave her a huge sense of safety.","After admiring her dress, Chu Fu turned to Shen Chi.","“What did you get from the chest, Wheelchair Bro?”","Shen Chi looked up from his own prize, his eyes sparkling, and lit up as he saw her.","“Your dress is gorgeous!”","Then he showed her his weapon.","A fierce-looking pistol appeared in his hand. The body was silver, with a strong metallic feel, and faint blue energy flowed around the muzzle.","[Energized Magic Blunderbuss (Silver-grade)]","Physical Attack 18-22.","Agility +4","Strength +2","Special Effect · Energy Bullet: Requires no ammunition, fires by consuming a small amount of mana. Range: 50 meters.","Class Restriction: Mechanic.","Top-tier.","A gun with no need for ammo was absolutely perfect.","If he’d had this gun before, Shen Chi wouldn’t have had to keep throwing rocks.","“Let’s check the Boar King’s loot,” Shen Chi reminded her.","“Ok, let’s see what we got!”","The two picked up everything.","They got three Bronze-grade items:","[Raging Boar Stone Leather Armor (Bronze): Defense 18, Constitution +3]","[Raging Boar Leather Boots (Bronze): Defense 12, Constitution +1, Agility +1]","[Raging Boar Bracers (Bronze): Defense 8, Constitution +2]","“I’ll take the armor; you can have the other two,” Shen Chi allocated.","“You take the bracers—you also made me a Bronze staff!” Chu Fu waved her Dandelion Staff.","But Shen Chi frowned.","“That’s too much on your side. You dealt three-quarters of the damage.”","“But you were the one who pinned the Boar King here, and that takes skill—it’s not easy to hold it in the crack mid-charge. So we contributed the same, right? Besides, you came here first.","If you feel bad about it, I’ll take this material instead.","But I’m calling dibs—this material is part of a chain quest. It needs not just the Boar King’s heart, but hearts from other BOSSes too. If we keep grinding BOSSes, don’t fight me for it!”","Chu Fu pointed at the Raging Boar King’s Heart (Bronze material).","In the original novel, gathering all five beginner BOSS hearts could be exchanged for a necklace with percentage-based damage.","Not only that, but only first-kill kills on beginner BOSSes dropped materials.","Chu Feng also had one!","Of course, Chu Fu wouldn’t let it slip by.","Shen Chi frowned, feeling it was practically a bargain, but since Chu Fu insisted, he finally nodded.","“Fine, then later when we kill other BOSSes, all materials go to you.”","Next came the distribution of seven Black-iron grade items.","Two of them Chu Fu could use—[Light Leather Boots of Agility (Black-iron): Defense 8, Agility +1] and [Conjured Gloves (Black-iron): Defense 7, Spirit +1].","In addition, they obtained a [Pigskin Shield (Black Iron)] and a [Pigskin Heavy Armor (Black Iron)].","There were 840 copper coins in total, with each person taking 420.","They also split some intermediate health potions, intermediate mana potions, and low-grade materials like pork, pigskin, and pig bones, filling their backpacks to the brim.","After dividing everything, the two looked at each other.","“Shall we go to the dungeon?” Shen Chi asked.","“GOGOGO!”","Chu Fu waved her staff.","...","Meanwhile,","Huanyu Kuangba and his group were already waiting at the dungeon entrance.","“Huanyu Studio is clearing the area. You, the swordsman, leave now.”","“Huanyu Studio? What’s your connection to Wan Huanyu?”"]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Field Battle, the Blind Sword Saint","paragraphs":["The player holding the sword wore plain white gear, and though the wooden sword in his hand was simple, he carried himself with an effortless grace.","What was most peculiar was his appearance. He had covered his eyes tightly with a strip of gray cloth.","ID: WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind?","Huanyu Kuangba glanced at the level floating above the other player’s head—Level 2.","Damn it, how were these people leveling so fast? He had logged in the moment the server opened and secured the best grinding spots, yet they were still outpacing him.","But there was no doubt: WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind had been killing monsters in the wheat field ever since he entered the newbie village.","The wheat outside the village was much taller than the grass near the starting zone, easily reaching waist or chest height for someone of average build.","Not only that—the wheat field was furrowed, making movement awkward and combat a chore.","It was far from an ideal grinding spot.","The monsters inside were mutated rats, each the size of a medium-sized dog.","With the wheat blocking visibility, a rat could spring out at any moment and kill you.","Level 1 newcomers who came here would die at the slightest misstep.","Yet WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind had been grinding here since the server opened. His talent and class had to be extraordinary.","He was clearly the one fish that Huanyu Kuangba had failed to recruit.","And when the stranger spoke Wan Huanyu’s name out loud, Huanyu Kuangba’s mind began racing.","\"Our Huanyu studio is run by Mr. Wan Huanyu himself. Do you know our boss, friend? Are you some young master from Yangcheng?\" Huanyu Kuangba asked politely.","If this guy turned out to be a friend of Wan Huanyu, even if he didn’t join the studio, he could still be a huge asset.","Plus, Wan Huanyu’s friends were all rich second-generation types who threw money around.","By acting as a middleman to flip some equipment, Huanyu Kuangba could make a killing—just like when Wan Huanyu gave him a budget: 30,000 for A-rank talent, 10,000 for B-rank. He’d skim off the difference and pocket the rest.","The thought of latching onto another cash cow made Huanyu Kuangba’s mood soar.","But the next second, he heard a cold snort.","\"Oh, I know him, all right. In fact, I have this blindfold to thank for my eyes. What a small world—running into him even in a game. I know you’re just an employee, but tough luck for you.\"","Before Huanyu Kuangba could react, WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind’s wooden sword shot forward, striking him square in the heart.","Piercing Damage: -200!","That was a terrifying amount of damage.","If his constitution wasn’t at least 10, that attack would have one-shot him.","But Huanyu Kuangba was the studio’s leader. His initial constitution was a solid 7, and the extra 3 points came from stripping his underlings of all their equipment.","His health was exactly 210.","\"Healer! Heal me!\" Huanyu Kuangba’s voice cracked in panic.","The healers in his party immediately targeted him, casting healing spells.","+50!","+50!","+50!","Three priests instantly pulled Huanyu Kuangba’s health bar back to a safe range.","Clutching his chest, Huanyu Kuangba rolled three meters back, his face pale as a ghost.","If the healers had been half a second slower, he would have been sent back to queue for a new character slot.","\"Kill that blind bastard! Attack!\" Huanyu Kuangba screamed.","He claimed to have a 200-man squad, but most players were scattered around the area. Still, four warriors, two assassins, and three archers surrounded them.","Everyone aimed their skills at WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind.","Even ants could bring down an elephant. If even half of them hit at once, WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind would be finished.","But something strange happened.","Even blindfolded, WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind seemed to see better than any of them. He dodged left and right, weaving between all their attacks with ease.","‘A pro!’ The thought struck everyone at once.","He had perfectly predicted every incoming strike and avoided them all.","After more than ten seconds, WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind’s figure flickered. Three afterimages appeared in his place while his real body vanished. The next instant, he was behind an assassin.","-237!","A massive damage number appeared above the assassin’s head, and the player crumpled to the ground.","Dead.","When a character dies, they have to leave and re-queue to create a new account.","\"Fuck! What kind of attack is that!\" Huanyu Kuangba was losing his mind.","The guy had to have an S-rank talent.","And he was right—WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind’s talent was indeed S-rank.","The “blind man” had awakened the S-rank talent [Mind’s Eye].","[S-rank Talent: Mind’s Eye","Trait 1: Blind Strike—Increases critical hit rate by 50% when striking a vital point.","Trait 2: Blind Dodge—When eyes are covered, perceive the surroundings with Mind’s Eye and predict enemy movements, granting a 50% chance to dodge attacks.","Trait 3: Sword Heart—Increases damage dealt by swords by 100%.]","Not only that, but he had also unlocked a powerful hidden class: Sword Saint.","Sword Saint Bonus: Increases attack speed by 20%.","Sword Saint Exclusive Skills:","1. Phantom Sword Shadows—Releases three afterimages, making the caster untargetable. The afterimages deal 110% base attack damage to enemies in their area.","2. Heaven-Piercing Strike—Ignores defense to deal 200% physical attack damage.","With two skills and maxed-out Agility for speed and evasion, WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind was a nightmare.","Huanyu Kuangba would survive due to his high health, but his minions couldn’t withstand such attacks.","WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind darted through the crowd like he was walking through an empty street.","Within five minutes, five players had already collapsed into white light.","But by then, Huanyu Kuangba’s troops had fully encircled him. With overwhelming numbers and concentrated fire, even WhoTheHellAreYouCallingBlind was struggling.","After using Phantom Sword Shadows, he crouched low, hiding in the wheat field, becoming impossible to find.","He was like a lurking killer.","\"Find him! Find him!\"","\"Archers, keep your distance and shoot!\"","\"Damn it, you useless bastards, you can’t take down one guy?\"","Not only could they not kill him, but he was also running circles around them.","As Huanyu Kuangba raged, two black dots appeared in the distant sky.","One of the archers, who had an \"Eagle Eye\"-type skill, spotted them first. As the dots grew closer, his jaw dropped.","\"Brother Ba! Brother Ba! Look at that!\"","\"Look at what? Just kill that blind piece of—\"","\"No, no—Brother Ba, isn’t that the plant-person Xiao Wu talked about? The one that flies with a dandelion?\"","Following the archer’s gesture, Huanyu Kuangba looked up.","A giant dandelion floated in the sky, its stem curved into a J-shape. Sitting on it was a girl in a green fluffy skirt.","From below, her face wasn’t visible, but her legs were slender—like a young girl’s still growing.","One arm wrapped around the dandelion stem; the other held a staff with a little yellow flower on its tip.","While everyone else was still in coarse linen, this figure’s gear was dazzlingly bright.","And it had a special effect—it glowed!","Silver-tier equipment! No doubt about it—it was silver-tier gear.","\"Hell, what are you waiting for? You can't hit the one hiding in the grass, but you can shoot the bird, can't you? Bring her down!\""]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: Joint Revenge: Universal Studio's Rout","paragraphs":["Under the azure blue sky, Chu Fu squinted her eyes, which looked unusually large due to her gauntness.","At the entrance of the dungeon, a crowd was in an uproar, all with the name \"Huanyu\" clearly displayed above their heads.","They were from the Huanyu studio.","Chu Fu's expression changed.","“Wheelchair bro, they must have guessed we killed the boss and blocked the entrance to stop us from entering the dungeon!”","Shen Chi’s face also darkened.","Then he let out a cold laugh.","“Then just kill them all!”","Behind him was a wooden mechanical wing, creaking as it moved, its speed just as pathetic, even slower than a floating dandelion.","In the air, he pulled out his energy-gathering magic gun but didn’t attack immediately.","At that moment, seeing them approach, the Huanyu studio members immediately raised their bows and shot at them.","Chu Fu maneuvered her hot-air balloon dandelion to dodge.","But Shen Chi actively collided with the attack.","[Malicious attack, legal self-defense...]","Not only that, but the names of the five players in that person's party began to turn slightly pink.","Shen Chi immediately raised his silver-tier magic gun, which looked like a hand cannon, and fired.","Three shots in quick succession!","“Bang! Bang! Bang!”","-50 -50 -50","The bullets were blue. After three shots, the archer fell to the ground, his bow dropping as loot. This was clearly not beginner equipment—the system would directly recycle newbie gear upon death.","Not just the archer, but Shen Chi didn’t spare his teammates either, firing several more shots.","Chu Fu suddenly saw Shen Chi in a new light.","Wheelchair bro is pretty sneaky!","Chu Fu also wanted to use self-defense, but she still had 84 points of sin value on her.","Six of those points came from being online for six hours, and the extra 10 points were deducted after killing a boss.","This meant that if these people attacked her, it counted as punishing evil and promoting good—they wouldn’t turn pink, and if she killed them, she’d turn red.","But it didn’t matter.","Chu Fu was fearless.","She waved her Dandelion Staff and aimed at an archer.","Poison Spell!","-72!","Not only that, but the archer instantly turned green.","The archer shouted, “Heal me! Damn, what kind of poison is this? It’s so strong my mouth tastes bitter!”","He spat repeatedly, completely ignoring the need to attack.","Chu Fu hadn’t expected the Bitter Spell on the Dandelion Staff to also be a “mental interference” skill.","Meanwhile, three priests scrambled in confusion.","Who should they heal?","But soon, they didn’t have to worry.","Because three seconds later, Chu Fu hit the same archer with Poison Spell again.","This time, the poison damage rose to 144 points.","The archer’s physique was only 4 points, with no extra gear. This poisoning killed him outright.","With just the first clash, two more of Huanyu Kuangba’s men were dead.","Meanwhile, from within the wheat field, “CallWhoBlind” jumped out again and killed another person.","His red name was very conspicuous. Though he hid in the wheat field, Chu Fu and Shen Chi could clearly see him from the sky.","He was an ally!","Chu Fu immediately sent an invitation.","Hidden in the wheat field, CallWhoBlind heard the system prompt.","[“WhoWantsToBeAVegetable” invites you to join the party. Accept or Decline?]","“Accept!”","Clearly, he also had a grudge against the Huanyu studio. An enemy of an enemy is a friend—let’s fight together.","The two flew in the sky as turrets while CallWhoBlind acted as an assassin in the wheat field.","In no time, three more people fell to the ground.","“Damn it, group up and attack together!”","Huanyu Kuangba fumed helplessly, but he only yelled at others, refusing to fight himself. He was even pathetically cautious, keeping all three healers in his party by his side.","Not only that, but more mages and archers came forward. As long as Chu Fu approached him, they would fire a coordinated volley.","Quantity led to a qualitative change. That made it risky for Chu Fu to attack him—being focused by the whole group could result in her death.","Chu Fu didn’t dare to charge recklessly and could only target the outer members.","They traded blows for half an hour.","Finally, only a third of the fluff on Chu Fu’s dandelion hot-air balloon remained.","This time, Chu Fu pulled back and landed early.","But Huanyu Kuangba and his people all saw it.","“Her dandelion can’t fly anymore! All melee classes, charge!”","“Rush in! Colliding will stun her!”","“Assassins, use Gouge!”","“Watch my Moonlight Slash!”","The Huanyu studio members howled as they surged toward Chu Fu.","They completely failed to notice three giant seeds in front of her.","[Plant Mutation]","Chu Fu drank a magic potion. The three dandelion seeds were all ripened instantly. Each leaf was a meter long, and the dandelions themselves were two meters in diameter, emitting a buzzing sound.","Chainsaw Dandelions.","“Ah! My foot!”","“Get away!”","“Don’t push me! Don’t! Ah!”","A horde of over thirty people chased Chu Fu like wolves and tigers. Those in the back pushed against those in front, causing the leading group to have their legs shredded by the chainsaw dandelions.","“If only the chainsaw dandelions could move on their own, I could actively kill them.”","As she thought this, the chainsaw dandelions spun like tops and moved across the ground.","But Chu Fu noticed that when they moved, a health bar appeared above them. Movement reduced the dandelions’ HP.","If they moved too much, the mutated plants would wither and die.","But for Chu Fu, that was just a loss of one seed.","“Spin, little tops!”","Screams erupted from the Huanyu studio side.","The thirty melee fighters who had chased her out were all mowed down by this wave of chainsaw dandelions.","Then, Chu Fu boarded her fluffy dandelion hot-air balloon again and flew back into the sky.","Huanyu Kuangba was furious to the point of bursting.","All told, his studio had lost fifty people.","Veins bulged on his forehead, and a chill ran down his spine.","If this continued, his people would be picked off one by one.","Sooner or later, they’d be forced to quit the game.","No! That couldn’t happen.","He couldn’t die.","“Everyone, retreat together! Stop fighting. That blind guy in the wheat field will ambush us—we’re at a disadvantage!”","For once, Huanyu Kuangba had a clever thought.","The other studio members stared at him resentfully: Why didn’t you say that earlier?","Their brothers had died for nothing.","Like whipped dogs, the Huanyu studio players began to retreat.","But once they left the wheat field, CallWhoBlind couldn’t easily attack. However, Chu Fu and Shen Chi pursued relentlessly.","“Kill! Kill as many as we can. Wipe out everyone with the Huanyu family name. Leave the rest—they’re just contract workers who joined maybe a day ago, with no loyalty to take risks yet!” Chu Fu’s weak voice carried a cruel killing intent.","“There are still 1,000 people in the novice village who haven’t reached level 10, or the village defense battle will start in 30 days. We still need cannon fodder—keep them alive.”","“Got it!” Shen Chi nodded, taking another shot at a slow-moving mage.","Now he was also red-named.","Three red-named players, yet they chased down Huanyu Kuangba’s 150 men—a wildly absurd scene.","Huanyu Kuangba desperately ran toward the novice village, even charging through the respawn point of the Red-Eyed Rabbits, triggering a wave of shouts from players. Everyone stared wide-eyed at the scene before them.","“Man, how did the Huanyu Guild get so messed up!”","“Did they pull a Boss? Couldn’t handle it? Now they’re running to the novice village for cover?”","“Run! A Boss is coming!”","“What? The Boss is slaughtering the village!”","Panic spread like wildfire. Everyone started running with him, the crowd growing larger and wilder. Chu Fu didn’t even know who to attack anymore.","Worse still, they quickly neared the novice village. Just then, the guards at the village gate blew their whistles.","“Enemy attack!”","The guards raised their bows and aimed straight at Chu Fu, whose name was blood-red with infamy!","Chu Fu immediately turned around.","“Forget it, forget it! Let’s get out of here—those guards are level 10 and have an 80-meter range!”","Chu Fu hurriedly urged their two teammates, who were already drunk on bloodlust.","In reality, Chu Fu had the highest sin value—a terrifying 3,694 points—making their name glow a deep crimson, almost purple. Paired with their strange username, they seemed like a living nightmare.","To avoid being attacked by any passing players, the three quickly retreated.","Huanyu Kuangba watched them leave and let out a huge sigh of relief—but then began trembling all over.","Rage flooded his mind.","After a full three minutes, a purple server-wide announcement appeared, visible to every player in the game.","[Server 0308888] [Huanyu Kuangba]: Wanted across the entire server: “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable”, “Wheelchair Rocket”, “Who Called Me Blind”. 10 coins or 10 silver per head. Send me the kill footage and add me as a friend to claim the reward. This offer is permanent. You three cripples, get ready to die!"]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Inviting a Blind Person to Join the Dungeon Run, Proud but Not Arrogant","paragraphs":["Universe Overlord actually used a full-server megaphone!","That required spending 10 silver coins to broadcast a message.","Every player on the server would see and hear it, and muting it would cost another 10 silver coins.","On top of that, Universe Overlord had put out a high bounty for the three of them.","These days, if your monthly salary was 3,000 yuan, it would take three years to save 100,000. But killing a single player could earn you that much?","For someone in dire financial straits, 100,000 yuan could even buy a hitman.","But this is just a game.","Killing someone carried no psychological guilt and no legal consequences.","Suddenly, many players grew tempted.","The entire server exploded into chaos.","Aside from the forced server-wide megaphone, there were other chat channels.","【Local Channel】: Visible within 100 meters.","【Zone Channel】: Visible within 1 kilometer.","But these couldn’t be seen without opening the chat interface.","Right now, players were crowded in the zone channel, heatedly discussing:","“Holy crap, 100,000? For real?”","“Who are these three? Their names are weird— ‘Vegetable,’ ‘Wheelchair,’ ‘Blind Guy.’ Is this like a disabled alliance?”","“What’s the big deal? My grandpa and grandma bought gaming helmets. They’re 80 and still play. It’s normal to have some disabled folks in the game!”","“I’m at the newbie village entrance and saw the wanted players. ‘Vegetable’ is a little girl in a green Lolita dress. That’s definitely Bronze gear. How many people have Bronze gear right now?”","“Get this: Two of them took the boss’s first kill. Universe Studio was being a bully, trying to kill them for loot, but they got wiped instead!”","“Haha, I won’t say who the clown is!”","“I know it’s wrong, but I really want that 100,000! Anyone want to team up for an assassination?”","“I’m just an E-rank talent level 1 newbie. Not my business...”","Chu Fu stopped paying attention to these messages.","The three of them returned to the wheat field. It was indeed a good hiding spot and safe enough.","More importantly, during the fight, the enemies had dropped a lot of loot—rabbit meat, copper coins, and even damaged or plain-grade equipment.","The three of them filled their backpacks to capacity.","“Thank you, but these are your spoils!” Blame-Who-Blind placed everything on the ground, refusing to take it.","Chu Fu never liked being greedy over small stuff. When dividing loot in a game, fairness was key.","“Everyone contributed, so let’s split it by kills! I killed 35!”","“I killed 12!” Shen Chi said.","Blame-Who-Blind checked his sin value.","“15!”","Based on that ratio, the three split the loot, but Chu Fu’s bag was already completely full.","This was a bit frustrating.","Shen Chi spoke up, “How about this: I still have one reinforcement attempt left today. Blind guy, my talent can upgrade weapons. The more materials, the better. These common gear pieces are enough.","You can buy these plain or damaged items from Chu Fu and use them to upgrade your newbie weapon to Black Iron.","That’ll boost your attack too, and we’ll get rid of the extra materials.","If you don’t have copper coins, no problem. We’ll run a dungeon later, and you can pay Chu Fu back with the money we earn—or trade equivalent gear!","Oh, and save one piece for me, since I’m upgrading your weapon.”","“You want to bring me in on a dungeon? I’m only level 2!” Blame-Who-Blind paused. They’d only just met casually. Chu Fu and Shen Chi had great gear and were level 4. There was no reason for them to drag along a level 2 dead weight.","Chu Fu sensed his hesitation but wanted to secure him as an ally.","“A level 3 dungeon only needs an average level of 3. Every player doesn’t have to be level 3. Later on, people will even make a living power-leveling others through dungeons!","But we’ve already made enemies of Universe Studio. We’ll be competing for boss first-kills and dungeon records in the future.","Right now, it’s day one of the server. Everyone only has one skill and low base stats. Our gear and talent give us an overwhelming edge, which is how we won this fight.","But as time goes on, players at level 5 will learn a second skill and get better equipment.","If Universe Studio targets us then, we won’t be able to handle them as easily as today—we might even get blindsided.","What I’m saying is, since we’ve already fought side by side, why not stick together and take down Universe Studio?","What do you think, Blind bro? Want to join us?”","Blame-Who-Blind pondered.","“Alright, I’ll join. Thanks for having me!”","“No need to thank us, Blind bro. You don’t mind me calling you that, do you? You can call me Plant Girl!”","“Call me Wheelchair or even Cripple,” Shen Chi said casually, completely unbothered by the self-deprecation.","Blame-Who-Blind paused, then asked, “You guys serious? One’s a vegetable, one’s in a wheelchair?”","“For real! But even if you’re blind in real life, you can see in the game, right?” Chu Fu looked at him curiously.","After all, Blame-Who-Blind’s skills were sharp, but his ID had never appeared in any records.","Chu Fu guessed it had to do with his talent, but whether he wanted to share was up to him.","Blame-Who-Blind thought for a moment, then took off his eye patch, revealing narrow, sharp eyes.","He could actually see in the game.","“This is my talent: wearing the eyepatch during combat boosts my attack. This game is really interesting—it ties talents to real-life conditions. I don’t know if being blind is lucky or unlucky, but I awakened an S-rank talent.”","He didn’t hide anything and shared his talent details.","He didn’t notice Shen Chi’s pupils suddenly contract, followed by him lowering his head as if avoiding something.","Then, realizing something, Shen Chi relaxed again.","The guy was blind, after all.","A bitter, slightly guilty look flickered in his eyes. Then, not wanting the atmosphere to turn awkward, he also shared his talent.","“Yours is combat-oriented; mine leans toward crafting.”","【S-rank Talent: Mechanical Modification】","Trait 1: Creation – You can designate a batch of materials to modify into a mechanical object you desire, with a chance for mutation. (3 uses per day)","Trait 2: Enhancement – You can use materials to enhance a designated piece of equipment. The upgraded item’s quality is based on the materials used, guaranteeing at least one additional affix. (3 uses per day)","Trait 3: Mechanical and trap damage increased by 100%.】","Since both had shared, Chu Fu felt obliged to do the same and showed them her talent: S-rank Vegetable.","All three had S-rank talents.","They were likely among the top players on the server.","...","On the other side.","After issuing the server-wide bounty, Universe Overlord finally calmed his anger somewhat, salvaging a bit of face.","\"Are those three gone? Let's keep leveling up. This server just launched, and those three have weird talents that we couldn't handle. Once we raise our levels, even a mouthful of spit from each of us will drown them.\"","\"Exactly, Bro Ba. Let's cut them some slack for now.\"","\"We need to level up fast. Each level gives us 5 more stat points. If we put them into Constitution, they won't be able to one-shot us anymore!\"","\"Right.\"","\"Let's go. Time to grind!\"","Universe Dominator waved his hand and led his hundred-man squad out again.","But by then, the best spawn point was already occupied.","And not just by anyone—it was a group of female players.","Leading them was a female player who looked overweight and puffy in her build.","She wielded an axe in her hand, clearly a Berserker class.","Her ID: Proud but Not Pampered.","Universe Dominator had seen this \"Proud but Not Pampered\" before. When he'd tried to invite her to his group, she'd brushed him off.","\"Ten thousand? That's pocket change. You want me to work for you? Get lost!\""]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Rose Alliance: Rich Lady Adds Chu Fu as Friend","paragraphs":["The two of them started arguing on the spot.","Huanyu Kuangba threw down a harsh threat: \"You fat cow, if you dare leave the safe zone, I'll show you what happens when I hunt you down!\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was still standing next to the newbie village guard, and she took a big step back.","\"Then come into the safe zone and try to kill me, old hag. Wait until I gather enough people, I'll tear your little studio apart.\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao turned around and went back to the newbie village.","There were still some errand quests in the newbie village. Jiaojiao Bu Jiao did the tasks while also recruiting people, planning to start an organization to fight against Huanyu Kuangba.","Wasn't it just about throwing money around? She had money too.","Soon, a group of female players gathered around her.","\"That Huanyu studio is way too arrogant. They won't even let us go out and hunt monsters. All the players who've been bullied should unite. Together, we'll charge out.\"","\"Sister Jiaojiao, a small misstep can lead to big trouble. We can't just have a showdown. If our characters die, that's it, they're gone forever. We have a lot of people, but our talent is pretty weak. We probably can't beat Huanyu's crew. To compete with them, we need people with strong combat talent! Let's do quests in the village first and slowly recruit more!\"","This suggestion came from Jiaojiao Bu Jiao's newly hired secretary: Suture Saint, a medical student with a PhD. She advised Jiaojiao Bu Jiao to be cautious.","What Suture Saint said made sense, and she was very capable. She quickly organized a group to run quests together. These people followed behind the two of them, and it didn't even cost Jiaojiao Bu Jiao any money.","They made a verbal agreement and established a \"Rose Alliance\" to help each other out.","Soon, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao's team grew into a hundred-member group.","They all stayed in the village, helping transport supplies, build fences, and dig pits for planting.","And the game \"Primordial Gate\" had a lot of diverse activities. Besides combat leveling, there were rich life skills and crafting professions.","Before long, this group of female players forced back to the newbie village started switching to life professions, learning gathering, cooking, planting, blacksmithing, alchemy, and sewing.","The most popular profession was animal husbandry—raising cute little animals.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao spent a long time petting a cat and even tried to steal it.","In the end, the NPC blacklisted her.","Between running quests and life skills, they played for over ten hours. Finally, the Huanyu studio guys couldn't hold out and left.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao let out a shout, and over a hundred people finally walked out of the newbie village gate.","Everyone formed teams and queued up to attack. They took over the spawning point of Rabid-Eyed Rabbits and even made a deal: \"You guys fight this round, we'll fight the next!\"","Their leveling speed was much more organized and efficient than it was when Huanyu Kuangba was around, running all over the place.","But just two hours later, surprisingly, Huanyu Kuangba was back.","He came back beaten and humiliated, chased by red-named players.","Three people had managed to drive off over a hundred of them—it was quite a sight for Jiaojiao Bu Jiao and her group.","\"Good, you finally hit a wall!\"","\"What goes around comes around.\"","\"Someone start recording. Huanyu Kuangba looks like a scared dog. We'll post it on the forum later and let everyone laugh at him.\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao and her group chuckled quietly.","But soon, trouble followed.","After the three red-name players left, Huanyu Kuangba came back with his people. When he saw Jiaojiao Bu Jiao's group, his face darkened.","He had just been chased back by those three red names, and he was still fuming. Now even these female players who refused to join his studio dared to occupy his leveling spots?","\"Who told you people you could farm monsters here?\"","Huanyu Kuangba pointed at them.","\"Haven't you heard? The Huanyu studio has taken over this area.\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao swung her axe and killed a Rabid-Eyed Rabbit. She bent down to pick up the rabbit meat, then looked at him with a cold, mocking smile mixed with a hint of contempt.","\"Where did this stray dog come from, barking and whining? What, couldn't beat those other guys, so you're taking it out on us?\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao raised her axe high and aimed it at Huanyu Kuangba.","\"Do you think I'm scared of you, old hag? I was afraid before, but am I scared now? You're only level one too, just a couple of monsters ahead of us. We're all level one—who's afraid of who?\"","\"If you want to fight, then fight. If I die, I'll cover the loss. One character costs ten thousand! Everyone, start recording now!\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao roared with dominant fury.","Immediately, over a hundred people gathered around her, presenting an imposing presence.","Not only that, they all glared angrily at Huanyu Kuangba.","\"Back then, you bullied just one of us. Now there's a whole group of us. How can you still bully us?\"","\"A bunch of street punks, losers in the real world, looking for importance in a game. Thinking you can look down on everyone by bullying others? Who's afraid of you? At worst, I'll just switch servers.\"","\"That's right, sister Jiaojiao, don't worry. Even if I'm about to die, I'll take one of them down with me!\"","They talked tough, though few of the girls were used to confrontation. Some were even trembling as they argued.","But not a single one backed down.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao didn't really want everyone to die for nothing, because Huanyu Kuangba's crew were all A-level and B-level class users.","However, besides those with \"Huanyu\" in their IDs, the newly recruited studio members all had regret written all over their faces.","Why had they believed Huanyu Kuangba's nonsense in the first place?","This bunch of thugs was stirring up trouble: first they provoked three top-tier players, then they forced a group of female players band together to defend themselves.","And they still dreamed of ruling the server?","Dream on!","But Huanyu Kuangba was no pushover. He could clearly see through Jiaojiao Bu Jiao's bluffing.","\"Come on, then! Think I'm scared of you? Look at you girls—talking about fighting like a bunch of scared kittens. Is that one in the back crying already? With you lot, thinking you can beat us? Dream on!\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao snorted coldly and said, \"We might not be able to beat you, but those three guys from earlier can! Weren't you offering ten thousand for someone to hunt those three down until they cried? Well, let's see who's stronger!\"","\"Server 0308888, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao: I'm offering one million to hire 'Rocket on a Wheelchair,' 'Who Wants to Be a Vegetable,' and 'Who Called the Blind Man a Blind Man' to kill Huanyu Kuangba! Please contact me or add me as a friend, you three big shots. Huanyu Kuangba has left the newbie village. Come quick!\"","The server loudspeaker went off again.","Instantly, the map chat exploded.","\"Sister Jiaojiao idol, do you have to hire those three specifically? I could do it too!\"","\"I might not be able to kill those three first-kill experts, but I sure as hell can kill Huanyu Kuangba!\"","\"I just set up an assassin squad to assassinate those pros. Now it looks like assassinating Huanyu Kuangba is a better deal!\"","Chaos, total chaos.","Huanyu Kuangba's face turned the color of pig liver.","He looked around.","Many random players were watching him.","Some clenched their weapons and even turned on their recording feature.","Huanyu Kuangba understood immediately: these people wanted to kill him!","If he stayed any longer, he might really get stabbed in the back.","\"Move out!\"","He squeezed the word out through gritted teeth.","\"We'll farm at a different spot.\"","\"Boss, this is the fastest spawn point...\" The underling behind Huanyu Kuangba clearly wanted to stay. Leaving like this was just too humiliating.","Face was more important than anything.","\"I said move out! Are you not listening to me?\"","Huanyu Kuangba turned around and slapped that underling full in the face.","The underling's expression twisted with fury, but he dared not say a word, because Huanyu Kuangba was now his boss.","If Jiaojiao \"Not Spoiled\" hadn’t chosen not to assign the three top players just now, he would have stepped in to backstab Huanyu Kuangba himself!","Soon, Huanyu Kuangba led his group away in disgrace.","The Newbie Village was vast. If this spot wasn’t suitable for leveling, they could move to another location. The only catch was that the danger level would be higher. The reason they’d been monopolizing the Red-Eyed Rabbit leveling area all this time was simply that it was right in front of the Newbie Village entrance, making it the easiest place to recruit people.","After they left, cheers erupted around Jiaojiao \"Not Spoiled.\" To Huanyu Kuangba’s side, it felt like mockery grinding their faces into the dirt.","...","On the other side, Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and \"Scold Whoever’s Blind\" were just about to strengthen their weapons when they heard the server-wide announcement.","Who the hell is this Jiaojiao \"Not Spoiled\"?"]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: The Female Supporting Characters and NPCs' Wails in the Original Work","paragraphs":["\"Add her or not?\" Shen Chi asked.","Chu Fu's eyes lit up.","Finally, she came across a familiar username from the original story.","If female characters in game-based novels were typically the male lead's fangirls, certain special ones stood out.","ProudNotPretty wasn't beautiful. She was strong and robust, some might even say plump. When the game synced with reality, her height stood out even more, reaching 1.8 meters.","But what people remembered most was her personality.","Loyalty!","ProudNotPretty was known for her fierce loyalty. She looked after the girls who followed her, forming a guild called Rose. Later, it became a powerful organization protecting Linjiang City, even clashing with Wan Universe and Sun Jingya.","Unexpectedly, the other was in the same server as her.","Without Chu Fu's presence, perhaps ProudNotPretty's character would have died and had to queue for another server to log back in.","\"Add her. A sugar mommy is a must-add!\"","Once Wan Universe's enraged server-wide message went out, many people tried to add Chu Fu, wanting to discuss splitting the bounty by killing her once—50,000 for a character loss was a deal too good to miss.","Chu Fu directly disabled the add-friend feature.","Now that ProudNotPretty had sent a message, Chu Fu proactively added her as a friend.","Of course, countless others were also adding ProudNotPretty, and she generously accepted them all.","In an instant, her friends list exceeded a thousand.","She searched and found three people: WhoWantsToBeAVegetable, Rocket on a Wheelchair, and WhoTheHellIsBlind, pinning them to the top of her list.","Knowing WhoWantsToBeAVegetable was a girl, she spoke to Chu Fu first.","\"Beauty boss, this bounty is long-term valid. Send me a screenshot when you kill Wan Universe, and I'll transfer the money immediately. Oh, and you got me a big batch. Also, about the boss drop, any good gear? I can pay for it. Black-tier equipment: 2-300 copper. Bronze-tier equipment: 2-3000 each. Better stats, negotiable! Also, are you running the dungeon? Can I snag a spot for the first kill? I'll pay 100,000 per slot!\"","ProudNotPretty planned to bring her chief secretary, Suture Saint, for two slots.","The newbie village dungeon required five players.","Three big shots, plus ProudNotPretty and Suture Saint, made five.","On Chu Fu's side, after reading ProudNotPretty's message, she replied, \"I'll discuss it with my team!\"","Chu Fu talked it over with Shen Chi and WhoTheHellIsBlind.","\"ProudNotPretty seems to be a wealthy woman. She can help us counter Wan Universe. But our average team level isn't high enough yet. We need Bladesaint Brother to reach level 3, and ProudNotPretty and her teammate to hit level 2. That might mean waiting about two hours before hitting the dungeon. What do you think?\"","Chu Fu figured calling WhoTheHellIsBlind \"Blind Brother\" sounded more respectful than using the full username, which was a bit offensive compared to calling Shen Chi \"Wheelchair Brother,\" so she opted for his class name instead.","This class was unique enough, so no confusion would arise.","Hearing Chu Fu's address, WhoTheHellIsBlind's originally cold expression softened into a small smile. \"I'm just being carried by you guys. It's all up to you!\"","Shen Chi nodded. \"Makes sense. Not bringing them wastes two slots. Also, we're all red-named now. Bringing ProudNotPretty lets her buy us potions since red-named players can't buy from shops.\"","\"Right. As a vegetable, I have no use for money. I'd rather exchange it for silver coins and potions.\"","The two turned to look at WhoTheHellIsBlind.","He froze. \"What are you looking at me for? Split the money among yourselves. I don't need it!\"","\"That won't work. If you reach level 3, we're teaming up; it's not like we're just carrying you. Your damage output is solid. Think of it as three carries two—you've got a share too!\"","WhoTheHellIsBlind hesitated. \"Fine, I'll take the cash then. Give me 30,000.\"","\"Then it's settled: 30,000 yuan, 60 silver coins. The remaining 10 silver goes to buying potions evenly split.\"","Chu Fu contacted ProudNotPretty, and the deal was done.","A basic healing potion cost 5 copper, a medium one 20 copper, restoring 100 HP and 100 MP.","There was also a stamina potion for restoring stamina, specifically for WhoTheHellIsBlind. Melee fighters didn't use MP but drained stamina.","\"After the deed is done, transfer 30,000 to this bank account. 60 silver coins should go to me and Rocket on a Wheelchair respectively. As a deposit, you need to pay upfront and help us buy the potions.\"","\"Got it. I'll bring you 300—200 medium red, 200 medium blue, 100 medium yellow.\"","\"No problem!\"","ProudNotPretty agreed immediately.","While waiting for ProudNotPretty to arrive, Shen Chi crafted a weapon for WhoTheHellIsBlind.","Shen Chi didn't upgrade his own weapon, planning to gather better materials to transform it into gold-tier, which would be hard to achieve in the newbie village.","Chu Fu also contributed her resources.","\"Dandelion seeds are black-tier. At the very least, they can push your weapon to bronze.\"","\"So I owe you both one bronze-tier piece of gear for this,\" WhoTheHellIsBlind said.","The two agreed, and Shen Chi enhanced the other's beginner wooden sword.","Chu Fu collected 150 dandelion seeds, 25 damaged items, 7 plain items, plus what Shen Chi gave and WhoTheHellIsBlind kept, totalling a large batch.","As Shen Chi activated his talent,","All items rapidly merged into the beginner wooden sword.","The sword expanded, thickened, and lengthened.","It transformed from a thin blade into a heavy sword.","[Mysterious Iron Heavy Sword (Bronze-tier):","Physical Attack: 14-18","Strength +2","Heavy Strike: 10% chance to trigger 10% extra damage with knockback effect.]","Jackpot!","Clearly, thanks to the added materials including other equipment, this weapon's attack and stats far surpassed Chu Fu's Dandelion Staff. The special effect was also useful.","Truly, you get what you pay for.","Still, Chu Fu wasn't worried.","Her current game pace was fast—soon she could clear dungeons and boss fights, inevitably netting a better staff. She could still rely on Shen Chi, the enhancement master, meaning gear wouldn't be an issue.","WhoTheHellIsBlind held the heavy sword, reluctant to let it go.","If he'd had this weapon earlier, he could have killed Wan Universe in one hit.","Soon, ProudNotPretty arrived.","\"We'll level up here. Once Bladesaint hits level 3, and you two reach level 2, we'll go for the first kill. By the way, we've got some gear. Want to buy it?\"","Chu Fu pulled out the boss drops: [Pigskin Shield (Black-tier)] and [Pigskin Heavy Armor (Black-tier)].","ProudNotPretty was interested.","Both items suited a warrior. The shield was a weapon with super-high defense, priced at 800 copper, and the heavy armor at 600 copper—both solid deals.","Chu Fu pocketed another 1 silver 400 copper.","On Shen Chi's side, after selling a batch of gear, ProudNotPretty became practically fully geared.","See, this is why you stick with the pros.","Otherwise, I’d still be stuck in my novice cloth armor after a whole day.","Now I finally feel like a decent player.","The five of them started grinding monsters to level up.","Even though ProudAndNotArrogant and Suture Saint hadn’t come out to fight in the village, doing quests still gave them experience points.","They were just a bit shy of level 2 now.","As for CallingWhoBlind, his solo farming speed was high; if Chu Fu and Shen Chi hadn’t stolen the boss from him, he’d probably be way ahead in levels.","Shen Chi flew into the air, looking down as he picked off the mutant rats with his gun.","Chu Fu observed and found that the mutant rats in the wheat field also had fixed spawn points, so she simply placed electric saw dandelions at those locations.","After setting seven electric saw dandelions, they somehow formed a linked instant-respawn spot.","Instant-respawn spot: A game mechanic where, after monsters at certain fixed positions die, the system considers the area cleared and immediately spawns new monsters instead of waiting for a timer-based respawn.","This allowed the monsters to keep coming endlessly.","The good leveling spot with the red-eyed rabbits worked the same way.","With this setup, the team had enough damage output and a constant supply of monsters, so leveling was fast.","An hour later, everyone had leveled up.","【Leader】【WhoWantsToBeAVegetable】: Poison Master, Level 4","【Member】【Rocket on a Wheelchair】: Mechanic, Level 4","【Member】【CallingWhoBlind】: Sword Saint, Level 3","【Member】【ProudAndNotArrogant】: Shield Warrior, Level 2","【Member】【Suture Saint】: Ancient Chinese Medicine, Level 2","“Alright, let’s go do a dungeon!”","At the edge of the messy wheat field, an old farmer NPC sat on the ground, wailing, “My crops! Damn mutant rats! Who can help me get rid of these mutant rats!”"]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Shrinking Potion: Conquer the Mutant Rat Nest","paragraphs":["Chu Fu and the others approached and saw an exclamation mark appear above the farmer’s head.","The old farmer’s gaze fell on them, and he said, “Honored Awakened Ones, have you come to eliminate the mutant rats?”","[Do you accept the quest: The Rat Plague in the Fields.]","“Yes!”","Chu Fu and the rest all accepted the quest.","The old farmer’s weathered face broke into a smile, and he continued, “That’s great. Thank you. But the mutant rats aren’t easy to wipe out. You’ll need to enter their nest to do so.","The only problem is, their nest is too small. You’ll need some special items to get in.","Here are five bottles of shrinking potion. After taking them, you can enter the dungeon.","Please note: the shrinking effect only lasts one hour. If you haven’t cleared the dungeon within an hour, you might get trapped inside the mutant rat nest.","So if you can’t finish in time, remember to exit the dungeon early to keep yourselves safe.","Of course, you can also buy more shrinking potions from me, so you won’t have to worry about that!”","Then a shop interface appeared.","[Shrinking Potion]: Shrinks your size by five times. Price: 200 copper coins.","[Night Vision Potion]: Allows you to see clearly in the dark. Price: 100 copper coins.","The one they called “Who Calls Me Blind” instantly turned pale.","After all, he was blind. He’d had to ask for help just to buy the game helmet, waited in a queue of over 30 million players to enter the game, and couldn’t even read strategy guides.","He had no idea that going into a dungeon would cost money.","He hadn’t expected the old farmer to seem pitiful—but as the saying goes, the pitiful often have their hateful sides.","What a crooked merchant.","He gritted his teeth and bought five bottles of shrinking potion—it took every last copper he had.","The only silver lining was that he didn’t need to buy the night vision potion, because he had his inner eye.","The group drank the potions and quickly shrank.","Chu Fu might have looked slender, but she wasn’t short—standing 168 centimeters tall. After shrinking by five times, she was about 33.6 centimeters, looking just like a Barbie doll.","With her green puffy skirt, she seemed delicate and resembled an SD real-life doll.","Of course, since everyone had shrunk at the same rate, their proportions stayed the same, so it didn’t feel odd.","But when they looked at the massive pit that was the mutant rat nest, it now looked like a dark, gaping maw ready to devour them, with an entrance twice their current height.","The dungeon had three difficulty levels, each with a larger tunnel diameter than the last.","A cold wind blew, carrying a stench like rat droppings.","A blue glow marked the dungeon entrance.","[Dungeon: Mutant Rat Nest]","[Level: 3]","[Party Size: 3-5 players]","[Difficulty: Normal, Hard, Nightmare]","[Dungeon Description: The rats living in the fields have mutated and multiplied rapidly. No one knows what’s happening inside.]","[Please select a difficulty!]","“Normal difficulty.”","Chu Fu didn’t hesitate long and chose the smallest tunnel opening.","Once the difficulty was set, a pull of force dragged all five of them toward the dungeon entrance, as if they’d been forced to take a few steps.","They entered the dungeon.","The surrounding light instantly dimmed.","With night vision, everything looked bathed in blue.","They could make out the cave: the ground was littered with clumps of dirt from the rats’ digging, along with wheat ears and dry grass—uneven terrain. For now, no monsters were in sight.","Chu Fu was also experiencing a dungeon for the first time, but since she was familiar with the plot, she instinctively took on the role of commander.","“Brother Sword Saint, Sister Prideful is up front, Wheelchair Bro and I are in the middle, and Sister Suture is in the back. Stay alert.”","The five of them formed a line and moved forward.","Soon, they heard a rustling sound, and then a giant mutated rat poked its head out.","Seeing this monster up close almost triggered a bout of megalophobia.","Normally, a mutated rat would be about the size of a stray dog—but because of its short legs, it would only seem about twenty or thirty centimeters tall. However, now that Chu Fu and the others had shrunk, the mutated rat looked as tall as a person.","A colossal creature blocked the tunnel.","【Nest Mutated Rat (Common), Level 3, HP: 650.】","The mutated rats outside, at level 2, only had 200 HP. This one was three times tougher.","But a moment later, this nest mutated rat suffered an unprecedented assault.","-62 (Venom Strike)","-180 (Piercing Sky Sword)","-50-50-50 (Gunfire Attack)","-124 (Venom Strike, Layer 2)","-50-50 (Gunfire Attack)","-58 (Heavy Sword Attack)","In just three seconds.","The mutated rat died miserably under their combined attack.","As the rat fell, it crashed like a bull hitting the ground.","It dropped three copper coins.","The coins automatically went into the team loot pool, to be shared equally at the end or distributed by the party leader.","“Can I harvest it? I learned the Gathering skill!” Suture Saint said. “This big of a rat—how much fur can I collect? I can turn it into white-grade gear back in town.”","Chu Fu reminded her, “Have you considered that it only looks big?”","Suture Saint suddenly realized she had shrunk.","“Well, there goes my excitement.”","“If we gather enough, we can craft something. I remember ten rat pelts can make a rat-skin skirt,” Chu Fu recalled from the novel’s description. After the first monster wave, players cleared the Rat Nest dungeon, and all newcomers were decked out in rat-skin sets.","“Thanks! Don’t worry—harvesting only takes five seconds. It won’t waste much time!”","Suture Saint stepped forward, pulled out a harvesting knife, and began skinning the rat. Soon, she collected both fur and meat.","The group continued onward. After advancing about a hundred meters—though it might have been only twenty in actual distance—they ran into twenty rats in succession. They carved through them like chopping vegetables, killing every one.","Prideful Not Fragile joined the attacks too. Though her damage was minimal, it saved Chu Fu from having to cast a second Venom Strike.","Finally, the tunnel opened up into a large hall.","This appeared to be the living room area of the rat nest.","Inside, about fifty rats were densely packed together.","“Don’t rush in. I’m going to plant some Dandelions here at the entrance. Wheelchair Bro, use pulling aggro. Brother Sword Saint, Sister Prideful, hold the entrance.”","Soon, two Dandelions were spurred to growth, also shrunk down five times.","“Bang! Bang!”","Shen Chi fired his gun.","Those two shots stirred up the nest like an explosion. The rats went into a frenzy, triggering what should have been the first party-wipe point of this normal dungeon.","But when the rats charged into the tunnel, the electric saw Dandelions whirred and spun. The rats couldn’t break through and died on the spot.","It was ridiculously easy.","As they pushed deeper, they cleared more monsters from the dungeon. After passing two more rat halls and exterminating over a hundred mutated rats, they finally reached the deepest part of the cave.","A giant blood-red rat revealed its green, glowing eyes.","[Mutant Giant Female Rat (BOSS) Level 3, Health Points: 8500.]"]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Kill the Boss in 3 Seconds, Claim the First Kill","paragraphs":["\"So huge! Even though I've seen videos, it's still different from seeing it in person!\" said Proud but Not Arrogant.","Suture Saint also spoke up: \"I remember the strategy says to survive this boss, you need 100 points of defense, but also about 50 points of healing every 3 seconds, since the boss attacks every 3 seconds. My heals are ready. Which of you two will tank?\"","Chu Fu raised her hand and said, \"I promised to take you through this dungeon. You paid for it, so there's no way I'm letting you do the work! I'll tank this boss!\"","\"Theoretically, it'll only take 3 seconds!\"","Chu Fu confidently made an OK gesture.","Then, she took out 10 dandelion seeds and planted them at the entrance of the cave.","As long as they didn't step inside the cave, the boss wouldn't attack them.","Chu Fu mutated the dandelions one by one. With her current mana, she could only mutate four at a time.","Luckily, she had plenty of mana potions. After drinking five bottles, she finally finished mutating all the dandelions.","\"Spin, little tops!\"","Chu Fu activated all the chainsaw dandelions.","Then, they walked into the cave.","The giant mutated mother rat finally sensed the enemy's presence, raised its head to look at them, and with a puffing sound, gave birth to ten mutated baby rats.","But before those mutated baby rats could get close, Chu Fu's chainsaw dandelions had already spun forward in a charge.","Each dandelion's chainsaw blade dealt 30 damage to the mutated mother rat.","10 blades meant 300 damage.","10 chainsaw dandelions spinning around the mutated mother rat dealt 3000 damage.","At that moment, a dense stream of damage numbers appeared above the mutated mother rat's head.","Chu Fu took a moment to cast a poisons spell, and Shen Chi fired three shots.","No one else even had to lift a finger before the massive boss crashed to the ground.","The next moment, everyone heard the system voice.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Mutated Rat Nest (Normal).]","[Dungeon clear time: 26 minutes 34 seconds.]","[You received first-clear rewards: All stats +1, an Iron-tier Chest.]","[A server-wide announcement is about to be released. Hide ID?]","Chu Fu looked at the group.","\"Is there any point in hiding it?\"","\"There's no need to hide it—everyone will know it's us anyway,\" said Blind Who Calls Me Blind.","Proud but Not Arrogant immediately shook his head. \"Don't hide it! I paid for a spot specifically for this moment.\"","Suture Saint said, \"I'll go along with Proud but Not Arrogant.\"","Shen Chi didn't care either.","Chu Fu selected \"No.\"","The next moment, a golden announcement swept across the entire 0308888 server.","[Server-wide announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plant,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Blind Who Calls Me Blind,\" \"Proud but Not Arrogant,\" and \"Suture Saint\" have cleared the dungeon Mutated Rat Nest (Normal), achieving the first server-wide clear! Rewards have been distributed.] x3.","The entire server echoed with a voice as loud as a bell.","The newbie village once again erupted in heated discussion.","Inside the dungeon.","Chu Fu and the others sorted through the loot.","The Normal difficulty Mutated Rat Nest only dropped white-tier equipment—five pieces in total.","[Mouse Skin Boots (White): Defense +3.]","[Mouse Tooth Dagger (White): Attack +4.]","[Rough Linen Bracers (White): Defense +2.]","[Mouse Skin Skirt (White): Defense +3.]","[Chewed-Up Wooden Shield (White): Defense +5.]","Also, 120 copper coins and several mouse pelts.","These items weren't very appealing to Chu Fu and the others.","But Proud but Not Arrogant bought them all.","\"White-tier gear is still valuable right now. I have a bunch of sisters still wearing newbie cloth robes. Selling them off as a bundle, double the market price.\"","White-tier gear was only worth a few dozen copper coins, and Chu Fu didn't want to rip off Proud but Not Arrogant. The other party offered double, but business was about steady, long-term relationships built on integrity.","Bracers and boots were 30 copper coins each, the skirt 40, the dagger 60, and the shield 80. That totaled 240 copper coins.","Adding the boss drops and the copper coins from mid-level mobs, they had 600 copper coins in total.","According to the team's contribution, Chu Fu took 400, while Shen Chi and Blind Who Calls Me Blind each took 100 copper coins.","Then came everyone's favorite part: opening the chest.","Chu Fu didn't have high expectations, but when she opened it, she was pleasantly surprised.","[You received Mutant Hook-thorn Windvine Seed x5 (Iron-tier).]","\"Wow! I got something good!\"","Primordial Gate was a very considerate game. If you came across special chests, like first-kill or first-clear chests, the chests were practically mind-readers.","If you were missing something, it would give it to you.","After returning from Wild Boar Ridge, Chu Fu had looked at many plants along the way, but none of them could be mutated.","Now, the special chest had given her a mutant seed.","Chu Fu immediately took out one and planted it.","Using Plant Mutation, the seed sprouted and grew into a patch of vine-like weeds.","The leaves were palm-shaped, divided into five or seven lobes, and the vines were covered in dense, sharp thorns.","\"Isn't this catchweed bedstraw?\" said Suture Saint.","Chu Fu actually knew that catchweed bedstraw's scientific name was jaohu, and it matched the name perfectly.","But the Mutant Hook-thorn Windvine seed, after being mutated again, naturally had different effects.","Whether it was because of their conversation or because in Chu Fu's mind it was still catchweed bedstraw, even its description had changed.","[Mutant Catchweed Bedstraw:","Property 1: Rope Catchweed Bedstraw: Covering an area of 2 meters, the bedstraw can extend vines up to 3 meters to bind enemies.","Property 2: Thorn Catchweed Bedstraw: After binding, the thorns on the bedstraw can pierce through the enemy's defense, dealing penetrating damage.]","Area attack, ranged control, defense-ignoring damage.","It was perfect.","Chu Fu was thrilled.","She then checked what others had gotten.","Everyone had some rewards, but they were all equipment. The Iron-tier items weren't particularly exciting, though Suture Saint received a weapon suitable for her—an Iron-tier steel needle.","Her ancient Chinese medical techniques had two methods: one was massage, which restored stamina and provided a random buff, and the other was acupuncture, which restored a small amount of HP and internal energy.","Suture Saint had thought she'd have to keep using her beginner's needles and then find a blacksmith to craft a new weapon. She never expected to get in on a first clear, and the first-clear chest gave her a pleasant surprise.","She would work hard for Proud but Not Arrogant and keep him happy to repay this kindness.","Yeah, she'd treat it like a full-time job!","Working for Proud but Not Arrogant was a better career path than finding a job on her own!","...","Meanwhile, on the other side.","Universal Bully was hiding at a mediocre leveling spot, slowly grinding his way to level 2. By the time he got there, Chu Fu and her team had already secured the first clear!","This made him gnash his teeth in frustration.","\"Boss, don't get too angry. Getting mad won't help. But I've thought of something,\" said one of his companions, named Universal Rage.","\"What is it?\"","\"Primordial Gate assigns newbie villages based on regions. Basically, everyone in our server is from Linjiang City.","And those guys—a plant person, a cripple, and someone in a wheelchair—their traits are pretty obvious, right?","What if we take things offline and settle it in real life?\""]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Struggling in the Game, the Real You in Life","paragraphs":["After hearing this, Universe Overlord's eyes lit up brightly.","He reached out and gave Universe Fury's bald head a rub.","\"Kid, you're quite the talent!\"","Universe Overlord recalled what \"Who Called Who Blind\" had said.","His eyes had been ruined by that very person, Wan Universe.","So this was Wan Universe's enemy!","The target was obvious.","But upon second thought, Universe Overlord didn't ask about Wan Universe's background.","After all, if this person was Wan Universe's enemy and he had lost to them, wouldn't that just embarrass Master Wan Universe?","It would be better for him to find the person, beat them up, and then take the credit to Wan Universe, which might also get him off the hook for losing the workshop's 50 characters.","Luckily, these people had been contacted privately and didn't live in the workshop, so the loss of 50 players at the server launch wouldn't be exposed.","But hiring these people had cost real money.","Thinking of this, Universe Overlord asked, \"Who took a video just now? Let me see. I'll send their photos around.\"","\"No!\"","\"I didn't take one either.\"","\"Brother Ba, forgot about it.\"","After all, they lost. What was there to film?","A lackey hesitated and stammered, \"Brother Ba, that 'Proud and Not Coy' posted a video on the official website.\"","\"Damn it!\"","Universe Overlord cursed in anger.","But he still patiently watched the video.","And it was a waste of time.","Chu Fu was flying in the sky, so you could only see her fluffy skirt, and even underneath was a pair of pumpkin pants. Not even a glimpse of anything more.","Same with Shen Chi.","The only one captured clearly was \"Who Called Who Blind,\" but he had an eye patch covering his eyes, looking very imposing and hiding his face.","Left with no choice, Universe Overlord screenshotted \"Who Called Who Blind,\" sent the photo to his social circle, and asked friends to share it.","Weren't there stories about linking to a stranger in the same city through six people in your social circle?","He wanted to see if he could find this guy.","If he did, he would beat that blind man to death.","\"Brother Ba, are we still leveling up? It's getting dark.\"","\"The wild monsters are too aggressive, and we can't see without vision.\"","\"Maybe we should go back and grab some rabbits?\"","\"If we get to level 3, we can enter the dungeon!\"","In [Primordial Gate], night only lasts four hours, apparently to accommodate workers and students: from 2 PM to 6 PM is night, and the rest is daylight.","After nightfall, wild monsters deal double damage.","Dungeons aren't affected.","\"Stop the nonsense, keep grinding!\"","Universe Overlord barked.","The others pouted. It wasn't that they didn't want to keep fighting, but after Universe Overlord got beaten, he had reflected and decided to improve himself.","His method of improvement was to have a five-person team reduce monsters to critical health while he delivered the final hit.","That way, he could hog all the experience and level up faster.","He had arranged four such teams, all his trusted men.","This way, he could reach level 3 quickly and then tackle the dungeon.","He just prayed that those disabled guys had only cleared on Normal mode and wouldn't touch Hard mode—that way, he still had a slim chance.","Too bad—he wouldn't get that chance.","...","By the wheat field.","Chu Fu and the others emerged from the dungeon and submitted the quest to the old farmer.","Each received 50 copper coins, plus bonus experience.","If not for the experience boost, they'd basically be slaving for the farmer's charity.","But the experience was considerable.","\"15% experience per run. Seven runs, and we'll hit level 3!\" Proud and Not Coy calculated. That's just three hours to level 3.","The forums said players would need at least a day and a half to reach level 3.","Being carried definitely speeds things up.","Proud paid the fee without hesitation.","Chu Fu earned 30 silver coins, bringing her total to a whopping 33 silver coins.","\"Sister Plant, want to keep going? If we do Hard mode, I'll pay 200,000. If we can do Nightmare mode, I'll give 500,000!\"","Proud and Not Coy said.","That amount was just the cost of one of her designer bags.","But this game was utterly captivating.","Besides, being in a top-tier wealthy circle, she had heard whispers.","Right now, military and government sectors across the country were investigating this game, and they had found nothing.","Even national power couldn't shake it.","The game was simply too bizarre, so they had to improve within it.","In fact, many physical industries were already liquidating assets and moving them into the game.","If she could become a top player in the game, she might compete with her younger brothers and illegitimate siblings for the inheritance—instead of being married off and looked down on for being overweight and ugly.","Her father looked like that, and somehow it was her fault?","All thanks to her nouveau riche, misogynistic father!","But at least her dad threw cash her way, and money talked—which won Chu Fu over.","\"Of course, let's keep going!\" Chu Fu agreed.","More in-game currency meant more power for her future.","\"Who Called Who Blind\" said, \"This time, take my share too. I don't deserve it—I barely contributed.\"","\"Keep mine as well. I didn't anticipate the boss issue. You could handle it alone anyway.\"","\"And Brother Wheelchair is level 4; he can pull in one more person.\"","Shen Chi's biggest role was being level 4, which balanced the party's average level. Without him, they could only bring one person.","So his contribution wasn't small either.","\"Alright, 1:9 split. I keep only 10%.\"","\"Fine. I won't stand on ceremony with you!\"","Chu Fu noticed Shen Chi didn't care about money, and \"Who Called Who Blind\" was a bit particular but decent—since he hadn't done the work, he refused the payout.","Proud and Not Coy wired the money directly to Chu Fu, paying upfront.","Suture Saint clung to Proud and Not Coy's arm, teary-eyed.","\"Proud, rest assured! From now on, wherever you point, I'll charge. We just met, and you've already spent so much on me. Mistress, your loyal servant has arrived too late!\"","Proud and Not Coy waved her chubby hand.","\"Small matter. Just the price of a bag. Stick with me, I won't let you down. Work hard, build up the Rose Alliance, crush the Universe Workshop, and I'll buy you a Maserati!\"","Chu Fu overheard and was tempted to work for Proud and Not Coy herself!","\"Alright, let's go! Entering the dungeon!\"","Chu Fu selected Hard mode and applied to enter.","In Hard mode, even the minions had 1,500 HP, 2.5 times the Normal difficulty.","Not only that, but their numbers had tripled.","But under Chu Fu's new mutated creeping vine's onslaught, the dungeon remained trivial.","In fact, thanks to the vine's area attacks, the clear time didn't increase despite the extra monsters.","Twenty minutes later, they reached the boss room.","Inside was a massive, tumor-ridden mutant rat with an enormous belly.","[Twisted Bloody Queen Rat (Boss) Level 3, Health: 15,000.]","The boss's health is only twice that of normal, but its regeneration, defense, and attack power are significantly higher.","\"We can't exploit the terrain in this boss fight. We have to all enter before the boss activates. For the hard-mode dungeon, the boss has an additional skill—Cyst Explosion. Just keep an eye on where the cysts land and dodge them.\"","\"Let's aim to take it down within 10 seconds!\""]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: Attempting a Nightmare Dungeon: Should You Notify Your Family","paragraphs":["Chu Fu began setting up the formation.","Six dandelions.","Four cleavers.","The main issue was that there wasn’t enough space to place more, and the game was incredibly realistic—any extra plants without a proper position couldn’t attack the boss.","Besides, Chu Fu’s current control limit was also ten mutated plants.","Otherwise, her talent would be even more overpowered than an SSS-rank—if she could just keep placing plants endlessly, what boss couldn’t she take down?","Soon, all the traps were fully set.","Everyone entered the cave.","“I’ll go lure the monster. I can’t just take that 10% cut for free!”","Shen Chi said as he moved along the cave wall, then shot the boss.","“Squeak! Squeak!”","The boss roared in fury and chased after Shen Chi.","Shen Chi circled along the wall, making the boss go around, and then led it to the area where the cleavers were placed.","Chu Fu activated plant control.","The four cleavers extended countless vines, wrapping around the boss’s body. The cleavers truly delivered penetrating damage, inflicting an incredibly high 250 points of damage.","With a single wave of attacks, the four cleavers dealt 1,000 points of damage.","Meanwhile, the six chainsaw dandelions kept grinding away. The boss’s defenses were high, so each chainsaw dandelion could only deal 10 points of damage per hit, but six together attacked for 600 health points.","The cleavers’ power was formidable—they even managed to immobilize the boss.","What’s more, the boss stopped chasing Shen Chi and instead bit down on the cleavers.","The mutated plants could also draw the monster’s aggro.","Didn’t that mean Chu Fu essentially had an extra tank standing in the front line?","She immediately cast Poison Art, while Shen Chi, Who’s Calling Me Blind, and Proud But Not Spoiled started attacking from behind the boss.","Ten seconds.","The fearsome hard-mode boss was completely dead.","It was way too easy.","[You have cleared the instance: Mutant Rat Lair (Hard Mode).]","[Instance clear time: 32 minutes, 34 seconds.]","[You have received the first-clear reward: All stats +3, one bronze chest.]","[A global announcement is about to be released. Hide ID?]","“Don’t hide.”","[Global Announcement: Players “Who Wants to Be a Plant Guy,” “Racing in a Wheelchair,” “Who’s Calling Me Blind,” “Proud But Not Spoiled,” and “Suture Saint” have cleared the instance Mutant Rat Lair (Hard Mode), achieving the global first clear! Rewards have been distributed.] ×3","Outside the Novice Village, at the red-eyed rabbit respawn point, the Huanyu Studio members were listlessly grinding monsters.","When they heard the announcement, Huanyu Kuangba nearly chopped his own foot with his blade.","“Damn!”","His underlings nearby stayed silent, afraid to provoke Huanyu Kuangba’s anger.","“Tch, they clearing hard mode is one thing, but there’s no way they can clear nightmare mode!”","In reality, many players in the beginner village might never set foot in a nightmare-mode instance before graduating from it.","This wasn’t an online game where death meant revival.","Here, death meant account deletion.","In nightmare-mode instances, even the minor monsters were like bosses—utterly terrifying.","Plus, the Mutant Rat Lair was a level 5 instance, and once you hit level 6, you couldn’t enter anymore.","Only studios with organization, financial backing, or an S-rank talent leading a team decked out in bronze gear could possibly challenge nightmare mode.","What did the Plant Guy crew have?","No way, absolutely no way!","Sure enough, for the next two hours, he didn’t hear any system announcement about it.","They must have given up by now, right?","In fact, Huanyu Kuangba even thought maliciously, brimming with rage, that perhaps those people had overestimated themselves and tried to challenge a nightmare-level dungeon, only to get themselves killed.","...","Actually.","Chu Fu and the others opened another batch of chests, and this time, everyone got good items.","Chu Fu even obtained an extra skill!","[Slow Spell: Upon release, deals poison damage equal to 120% of magic attack power to the target, and slows their actions for 7 seconds, reducing movement speed, attack frequency, and casting speed by 30%. Not stackable.]","A great skill!","Not only that, but Shen Chi also got a [Explosion Robot] crafting blueprint.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao pulled a tank's key skill [Taunt].","Ma Shui Xia Zi Ne and Suture Saint both acquired bronze-tier gear, specifically for the chest piece—a crucial slot.","After that, Shen Chi bought a batch of materials and crafted a bunch of explosion robots.","A [Mechanist]'s initial skill is [Mechanical Manufacturing], but crafting requires blueprints.","Shen Chi currently had two blueprints, [Mechanical Flight Wings] and [Slingshot], both created out of thin air using his talent.","These two blueprints could be infinitely duplicated using [Mechanical Manufacturing].","He still had one free creation ability left unused.","If he hadn't gotten a silver-tier handgun, Shen Chi's combat effectiveness would have been very poor. In fact, most mechanists starting out can only screw around with basic gadgets and can't fight at all.","Now, the explosion robots made up for his lack of damage.","He had become a swarm-style player like Chu Fu.","\"GOGOGO, nightmare dungeon begins!\" Chu Fu waved her small hand and entered the nightmare-level dungeon.","The passage of the nightmare dungeon was very wide. Not only that, but once inside, the environment changed dramatically.","The cave was extremely neat, with the ground so smooth and level it looked like a finely polished corridor.","As soon as they entered, they ran into a large number of mutated rats.","[Steel-Claw Mutant Rat Guard (Nightmare): Level 5, Health: 3750.]","Such thick health.","Chu Fu immediately released her climbing vine to block the passage, keeping these mutated rat guards from getting through.","\"The nightmare dungeon is different from the other two dungeons. It has two bosses. The first boss is a Mutant Rat Sorcerer, who can keep summoning Mutant Rat Guards. So if your damage output isn't enough, the monsters will just keep piling up.","Of course, if your damage is sufficient, you can just kill them right here. Once you've taken out 1,000 of them, the Mutant Rat Sorcerer runs out of mana to cast the summoning spell!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao looked at Chu Fu in surprise.","\"Plant girl, you know a lot! I remember that there are no publicly available guides for the nightmare dungeon on the forums. Those guides are all passed around privately by guilds. How do you have such detailed information?\"","In other games, guides would be shared with love by countless players.","But [Primordial Gate] was too special. A single clear could directly drop bronze-tier gear, which could sell for around 2,000 to 5,000 in the open market right now.","A single successful run could mean over ten thousand in earnings. Nightmare dungeon guides were tied to a guild's profits, so everyone doing the dungeons signed confidentiality contracts, vowing never to reveal them.","Chu Fu, thin and small, didn't seem like a pro gamer at all.","How did she know so much?","Chu Fu was also taken aback, then said weakly and somewhat shyly, \"I heard it from my brother. He’s a top-tier player and always talks about this stuff in front of me, so I remembered it.\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao and Suture Saint were a bit surprised, but after hesitating for a moment, they didn’t ask further.","They felt they shouldn’t touch on Chu Fu’s sore spot.","She really did look so frail.","Probably truly in a vegetative state.","Just then, Shen Chi suddenly said, \"You’re able to play normally in the game world—your brother would be really happy to know that. Want me to help you notify him, so he can stop worrying?\""]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Nightmare First Kill, Chu Fu Doesn’t Want to Be a Lone Hero","paragraphs":["Chu Fu was a bit troubled.","“I’d like to, but I don’t know how to notify anyone. I don’t even know which hospital I’m staying in now, and I can’t remember my brother’s phone number!","All I know is he arranged a game pod for me and told the nurse to take good care of me and give me nutrient fluids.”","After all, Chu Fu had transmigrated, and the original owner had been in a coma for three years as a vegetable. Besides, even the phone numbers of the closest people are stored in phones—no one necessarily memorizes them.","Thus, she had naturally lost all means of contact.","Suture Saint said cautiously, “A game pod costs one million each, and your brother even arranged for a nurse to look after you? That alone would make any hospital curious. I can ask my senior and junior fellow apprentices if they’ve heard anything about you.”","“Okay! My name is Chu Fu, and my brother’s name is Chu Feng,” Chu Fu replied.","Who’s Calling Who Blind had paused earlier while helping fight monsters up front. Hearing this voice, their figure froze for a moment.","He wanted to take off his blindfold and turn around, but he felt the gesture would be strange.","No wonder...","No wonder she had helped fight against Universe Studio as soon as they met.","But thinking that there were still outsiders around, Who’s Calling Who Blind said nothing more and focused on fighting the monsters.","“I’ll also help get in touch. I have relatives who are doctors,” Shen Chi said softly.","“Great! Once I contact my brother, I’ll ask for more dungeon guides and hidden quests!”","Chu Fu felt there was nothing she couldn’t share.","Whenever she read the book, she always had a strange feeling in her heart.","Chu Feng had chosen a lone wolf path, getting everything himself, becoming incredibly powerful—but that path was too lonely and too helpless.","At the end of the book, he fought the beast tide alone, but countless compatriots died, and cities were frequently destroyed in tragedies.","For guides and quests that didn’t conflict with interests, Chu Fu felt it didn’t hurt to share them. If more humans mastered them, naturally there would be more fresh forces to join this battle.","The ancestors had relied on this kind of spirit—working together to create the prosperous era they now enjoyed—not on a lone hero, to achieve peace.","Chu Fu wouldn’t dare claim that just because she was in the book, she could achieve what Chu Feng had.","But she didn’t want everyone to end up with a tragic fate.","At least now, Chu Fu had met four teammates, and she hoped they would all do well, shine brilliantly in the game, and later, when the game invaded, every one of them could become heroes, holding back the countless invading beasts.","“Then I’ll definitely latch onto your brother’s coattails! Don’t worry, I won’t freeload—I’ll pay for the guides,” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao said.","“Hmph, why not latch onto my coattails? My golden thighs are pretty thick too!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao made a disgusted face, then patted her arm.","“Plant girl, take a look. Are your thighs any thicker than my arms?”","Chu Fu looked down—her arms were like twigs, skin and bones, the flesh hanging loosely, not firm at all.","She really was too scrawny.","“Dammit! I’ll fight you, you well-fed rich girl!” Chu Fu said, deliberately grinding her teeth, but because she was so weak, her voice lacked strength and came out soft and tender.","“Hahaha!” The dungeon echoed with Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s hearty laughter. When you’re weak, even anger looks adorable.","If it weren’t for the fact that Chu Fu was a top-tier player in the game, in real life she would have been seen as a delicate little sister, the kind who’d be pampered and protected.","Chu Fu didn’t feel offended, either. She could tell there was no malice in Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s smile, and she didn’t take it to heart or feel upset.","That was because she knew what the future held.","A year from now—no, nine months—the monsters would descend.","Before Chu Feng’s rebirth, the game’s invasion had indeed happened a year later.","But perhaps because Chu Feng’s presence was like a butterfly flapping its wings, the overall strength of the players had increased far more than in his previous life. This caused the game’s fusion with reality to occur in the tenth month instead.","Now, the servers had been open for thirty days.","In just nine months, every player above level ten would be able to synchronize their stats with the real world.","By then—by then—she, with her super high stats, would finally become healthy.","Before the invasion came, she needed to stack as many attribute points as possible.","At the very least, she couldn’t afford to miss the attribute rewards from nightmare-level dungeons.","While the group chatted, gossiped, and badmouthed Huan Yu Studio, the thousand monsters finally finished respawning.","They walked through the corridor and arrived at the first cavern hall.","A figure appeared, standing upright like a human, wearing a tattered robe and holding a bone staff.","It was a white mouse.","【Mutant Rat Sorcerer (BOSS) Level 5, HP: 12,000.】","It raised its bone staff, ready to strike.","“I’ll tank!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had paid for the run, and Chu Fu was willing to let her coast through the dungeon, but Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao wanted to train herself instead.","She raised her shield and charged forward, blocking the Mutant Rat Sorcerer’s attack.","[Taunt.]","“Roar!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao let out a fierce cry, and the Mutant Rat Sorcerer’s blood-red eyes locked onto her, ignoring everyone else.","But the staff strike barely scratched her.","“It’s out of mana—its combat power’s down by eighty percent! Go all out!” Chu Fu shouted as she started planting dandelions and clematis vines.","“Squeak squeak squeak squeak!”","The Mutant Rat Sorcerer shrieked.","That was its skill for calling in guards.","Too bad—no rats came to save it.","Shen Chi and That Guy Who Called Me Blind went all out, and soon the Mutant Rat Sorcerer collapsed.","Drops scattered across the floor; they picked them up and added them to the team loot panel.","“A skill book and two pieces of Black Iron gear dropped!”","【Summon Rat Minion: Summon a mutated rat minion to fight for you. The rat minion has its own independent XP bar and can level up. It returns to the pet dimension when offline, but its growth resets to zero if it dies.","Class Restriction: Summoner, Beast Tamer, and related professions.】","Finally, a good piece of loot, and no one in the team could use it.","But Chu Fu knew that this was how the Mutant Rat Sorcerer’s loot pool worked. This skill book was its signature skill and a must-have for summoners.","“Do you want to take it, Jiao Jiao?”","“Sure. I remember there’s a Beast Tamer in the party who runs a reptile shop in real life; she’s been trying to contract the village cats. Now she’ll get three big rats instead.”","The skill book had dropped in previous major zones too, with a current price of about 10 silver coins. Since this was the first one on the server, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao added 5 extra silver coins. The two Black Iron items were decent as well.","【Wizard Rat Ring (Black Iron): Magical Attack +5, Spirit +1.】","【Rat Hide Belt (Black Iron): Defense 7, Agility +1.】","Chu Fu unhesitatingly claimed the Rat Spirit Ring. Accessories were relatively rare, priced higher than regular equipment but not as costly as weapons, so she contributed 650 copper coins to the team pool.","Shen Chi also took the Rat Skin Belt, adding 400 copper coins.","Then, as the team leader, Chu Fu distributed the boss’s earnings.","The payout was based on each member’s contribution percentage. Arrogant Yet Full of Charm and Suture Saint held 2% and 1% respectively, earning a few hundred copper coins.","“No need to pay me. I just wanted to join in. Doing this makes it awkward for me to bid later!” Arrogant Yet Full of Charm quickly said.","“Same here. My healing output was just padding. Getting a share feels embarrassing!” Suture Saint said sheepishly.","“Consider it a participation bonus. The real rewards still come from our rich benefactor Arrogant Yet Full of Charm. Don’t fret over small change. Let’s keep going—there’s another boss!” Chu Fu knew that leading a team required fairness. For now, Arrogant Yet Full of Charm was the sponsor, but she could become a teammate in the future.","Just because she contributed money didn’t mean she escaped earning her share based on team contribution.","Similarly, every team member who wanted equipment purchased it at a fair price, after which the earnings were distributed to everyone. That was the only way to ensure fairness.","Not dwelling on these trivial amounts, Chu Fu turned her gaze to the three tunnels ahead.","The nightmare-level dungeon differed from the previous two in one key way: the maze!","With three entrances, Chu Fu recalled that the correct path was the third one. However, the exact route beyond that wasn’t described in detail in the novel.","She had no clue and could only rely on guesswork."]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: Second Bug Exploit, Nightmare Difficulty Raid First Kill","paragraphs":["They fought their way through, groping along the way, and before they knew it, two hours had slipped by. Finally, they found the entrance to the last boss.","Chu Fu wiped her sweat.","\"I feel like even the second time around, I'd still get lost here!\" She had planned to farm the Nightmare dungeon endlessly, but wasting time like this made her think it’d be better to grind mobs out in the wild.","\"312112312.\"","The one called \"Call Me Blind\" spat out a string of numbers.","Chu Fu was stunned.","\"What?\"","\"The route. Start from the main hall, pick tunnel 3, then tunnel 1, then tunnel 2, then tunnel 1 again, and so on.\"","Everyone stared at him in shock.","They couldn’t tell if it was the power of his Insight talent, his blind person’s spatial awareness, or just pure gaming skill.","\"Damn, you’re amazing, bro!\" Chu Fu said admiringly.","Call Me Blind curled his lips slightly, clearly pleased by her praise.","After the group finished marveling, it was time to face the real boss!","They peered into the boss chamber from the tunnel entrance and found it surprisingly vast.","It looked like a royal palace for rats.","The ceiling was very high, studded with gems that emitted a faint, multicolored glow, casting a dreamy light across the hall.","At the entrance stood two hulking mutated rat knights standing guard.","Inside, rows of mutated rat soldiers stood at attention.","At the far end, a crude throne made of branches, bones, and wheat ears was set up.","A bloated female rat lay atop it, a tiny crown perched on its head.","[Bloodthirsty Mutant Rat Queen (Boss), Level 5, HP: 30,000.]","\"There are guards. If we start the fight, will we be dragged into battle immediately? No time to place any plants!\" said Proud But Not Arrogant. Then she patted her chest. \"I’ll tank the boss first!\"","But she was only level 2. Though her gear was decent, her stats were nowhere near enough to hold this boss.","Chu Fu, however, looked up at the hall’s ceiling.","Not just her—even Shen Chi raised his head to look.","Then the two exchanged a knowing smile.","\"No need. This boss is easy!\" Chu Fu said, pulling out some dandelion seeds.","Before, she’d only ever turned dandelions into Chainsaw Dandelions. Making Hot Air Balloon Dandelions consumed twice the mana.","But when she ran out of seeds, she would force-grow more to stock up.","Now, she grew four dandelions and turned them into Hot Air Balloon Dandelions.","\"Grab onto these, everyone. I’ll control the dandelions to fly up to those pillars over there. Each of you stand on a different spot, so the boss can’t hit you. Only me and Wheelchair Bro will fight!\"","The others suddenly understood.","\"That’s practically invincible! We can do this for all future bosses!\" said Proud But Not Arrogant.","She started thinking about getting a flying item for herself.","\"Not every dungeon works like this. Some have terrain restrictions, and in higher-level ones, there are formations that block flight. Those won’t allow this trick.\"","\"Did your brother tell you that too?\"","\"Uh, yeah. My brother’s amazing!\"","Chu Fu pinned everything on her brother.","Soon, four Hot Air Balloon Dandelions were ready, and the group grabbed onto them. Shen Chi equipped his own flying device.","The five of them took off, flying toward the hall’s massive pillars—really just supports for the whole cavern.","But the pillars weren’t perfectly smooth; they showed signs of rat gnawing and had a few spots where someone could stand.","Chu Feng, back then, had used this method to get into a safe spot and kill the boss with crossbow bolts.","For Chu Fu and Shen Chi, there was no need to position themselves precisely—just flying was enough.","Once the three others were in place, Chu Fu dismissed the dandelion parachutes’ control and landed back on the ground, where she resumed forcing more dandelions and vines to grow.","Shen Chi unleashed his explosive mini-robots and started bombarding.","Working together, the Bloodthirsty Mutant Rat Queen could only screech and unleash skills that completely failed to reach them.","But the boss had a very fast health regen and could devour other rats to recover, so it took a full ten minutes before its massive body finally collapsed.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Mutant Rat Nest (Nightmare).]","[Dungeon clear time: 3 hours, 47 minutes, 2 seconds.]","[You have received the first-clear reward: All stats +5, one Silver Chest.]","[A server-wide announcement is about to be broadcast. Hide your ID?]","\"Don’t hide!\" the five said in unison.","The next second, golden text flooded the screens of every player on the server.","[Server Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plant,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Call Me Blind,\" \"Proud But Not Arrogant,\" and \"Suture Saint\" have cleared the dungeon Mutant Rat Nest (Nightmare), achieving the server’s first clear! Rewards have been distributed.] ×3!","Dungeon loot dropped.","[Plague Spread (Skill Book)]","[Rat Queen’s Crown (Bronze)]","[Rat Queen’s Robe (Bronze)]","[Rat Queen’s Boots (Bronze)]","[Rat Queen’s Heart (Bronze Material)]","Three pieces of a set dropped.","Chu Fu already had a Silver-tier robe, so she didn’t need the clothing, but the Rat Queen’s Crown and Boots were usable.","To top it off, the skill book was something she could use too.","[Plague Spread (Skill Book)]: Deals 150% magic attack as poison damage to a target, adding a Blood Cough effect lasting 30 seconds. If there are other hostile targets within 3 meters, the effect automatically spreads, refreshing the Blood Cough each time and reducing movement speed and defense by 30%.","When released, Plague Spread manifests as a pink mist covering a 3-meter diameter. Affected players’ chins swell, and they cough up blood—very realistic animation.","And now, this boss’s skill had dropped for Chu Fu.","She wondered if her hidden Luck stat was particularly high.","\"I’m taking the skill book, the crown, the boots, and the heart!\"","By standard market pricing, Chu Fu offered 20 silver for the skill book, 4 silver for the crown, 3 silver for the boots, and 1 silver for the heart material.","The only left-over gear was the robe, which Proud But Not Arrogant purchased for 5 silver and gave to Suture Saint.","Since Call Me Blind, Proud But Not Arrogant, and Suture Saint hadn’t participated in the fight, the final payout only split between Chu Fu and Shen Chi, with a damage share of 7:3.","Chu Fu spent 30 silver total but earned back 24.5 silver from the split, so she only ended up out 6 silver.","On top of that, she also got her agreed fee from Proud But Not Arrogant for carrying through a Nightmare dungeon.","Adding it all up, she now had a fortune of 675 silver.","Too much to spend—just couldn’t use it all.","\"I leveled up! I’m level 3!\" Proud But Not Arrogant shouted.","Hitting level 3 on the server’s first day meant she was at least a full day ahead of the average player.","One step ahead, every step ahead.","\"Time to open the chest! Time to open the chest! Praying for something useful for me!\" Chu Fu rubbed her hands like a fly.","She clicked on the Silver Chest in her inventory.","A flash of light later.","A staff landed in her bag.","[Malicious Staff (Silver):","Physical Attack: 9-11","Magical Attack: 35-45","Constitution +3","Spirit +4","Toxin Enhancement: All poison-type skill damage increased by 20%.】","Chu Fu has also switched to a Silver-grade weapon!","Within just one day, Chu Fu was already holding two pieces of Silver equipment, which could easily be considered number one on the server.","Afterwards, she traded the [Dandelion Staff] to Proud Yet Not Arrogant. Since the staff had low stats—though it had no level requirement, it was only a level 1 Bronze weapon—Chu Fu only sold it for 2 Silver Coins, leaving her backpack with 677 Silver Coins.","“I’m logging off. I need to eat!” Suture Saint was using a gaming helmet, so after a few hours of play, he had to take a break and eat; otherwise, a health warning would trigger.","“I’m logging off too!” Cursing Blind Man said reluctantly, as he was also using a gaming helmet.","Shen Chi hesitated for a moment, then also said he was logging off, but would be back soon.","“Hey, Plant Girl, you have a gaming pod, right? How about power-leveling me? I’ll pay you by the hour—5 Silver Coins per hour!”"]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: The Happy One Steps Back: Shen Chi Feels Like a Traitor","paragraphs":["Sister Jiaojiao was way too generous!","Chu Fu was genuinely moved.","She even had a feeling that Sister Jiaojiao wouldn’t log off because she was afraid of playing alone and feeling lonely.","When it came to being a good person, Sister Jiaojiao really nailed it.","“No problem, Sister Jiaojiao. The two of us can run the nightmare dungeon one more time. You can also bring a level 2 friend—it’s like buy one, get one free.”","Sister Jiaojiao’s eyes lit up immediately.","“Alright! I’ll call someone!”","She scrolled through her friend list of over a thousand people, searched a bit, and found a candidate.","“You it is, Shafu Liangu.”","She quickly got in touch with the other person, and they were naturally willing to come.","But just then, she noticed a message.","It was from “Sha Huanyu Kuangba.”","“Is the offer you mentioned earlier—the one million for killing me—still valid?”","The sender had already logged off.","She hadn’t seen the message.","After a moment of thought, she left a reply for the other person anyway.","“It’s still valid. Are you trying to get rich behind Plant Girl and the wheelchair user? Or are you short on cash? Just say the word. I’m not short on money. Worst case, you can be my bodyguard later.”","Of course, the other person didn’t respond. Sister Jiaojiao closed the chat window.","Soon, a new player joined the group.","【Shafu Liangu】Level 2, Class: Gu Master.","Seeing this name, Chu Fu couldn’t help but worry about the person’s husband.","“Lian Gu, no rush to come over. Can you help bring some medicine and a few space backpacks?”","“No problem.”","“Alright, do you have enough money on hand? We can list something on the trade site. I’ll sell you 4 silver coins for free.”","Every new player starts with a backpack that has 10 slots and can equip up to 4 extra backpacks.","The general store in the beginner village sells space backpacks—though they’re labeled as crude space backpacks, each one adds 5 more slots, for a total of 20 extra spaces.","“No need to hassle. I’ve got enough money!”","Shafu Liangu refused. She spent 4 silver coins on four backpacks herself, grabbed some extra medicine, and headed to the Wheat Field dungeon entrance.","From a distance, Chu Fu spotted a tall, beautiful woman with short hair cropped at her ears and a high-end, world-weary expression.","What stood out most was a tattoo on her wrist—a spider. But upon closer look, beneath the tattoo was a deep scar.","She looked like a woman with a story.","When Shafu Liangu arrived, she efficiently handed over the backpacks to Chu Fu.","“Lian Gu, here, take these! And this skill book—see if you can learn it.”","Sister Jiaojiao pulled out a Sunflower Staff, a Rat Servant Summon, a Rat Queen Robe, and some other mage-friendly gear, assembling a full set. She handed it all to Shafu Liangu.","Upon seeing this, the woman’s eyes widened in surprise. She gave Sister Jiaojiao a long look and said, “How much is all this worth on the market? I’ll pay you.”","“Are you trying to make me feel bad? I don’t need your money!” Sister Jiaojiao was the richest around.","“Paying is just good sense. But you giving me stuff—that’s kindness. Don’t let money ruin a friendship. Even a little money can turn couples into enemies.” Shafu Liangu’s voice was low, as if her words carried a hidden meaning.","But Sister Jiaojiao said, “It depends on whether you think it’s worth it. If you feel uncomfortable, receiving gifts from me just stresses you out.”","“Don’t worry. I’ve got some money too.”","“Alright then. Plant Girl, help calculate the market price. I didn’t remember.”","Then Sister Jiaojiao gave Chu Fu a wink from the side.","Chu Fu was amused and also saw a private message from Sister Jiaojiao:","“Give her 50% off.”","What a money-blowing rich sister.","Chu Fu had to lower the price a bit from the market value and finally settled on 12 silver coins.","“That’s not enough, is it? Take 20 silver coins. Don’t short yourself! Don’t waste money—did your family’s fortune get blown in by the wind?”","“My family’s money came from my parents working for it. They built their empire. My mom worked herself to death, and my dad got promoted, got rich, and got a new wife. Now they’ve given me a bunch of younger brothers. If I don’t spend this money, my dad will spend it on other people. So I’m going to spend it all carelessly!”","Sister Jiaojiao said it matter-of-factly.","Shafu Liangu fell silent for a moment.","“That money is well spent.”","Chu Fu was speechless and quietly said, “Is everyone ready? Take your potions. Let’s enter the dungeon!”","...","In a high-end apartment complex in Linjiang City.","The nutrient solution in the game pod slowly drained, revealing Shen Chi’s figure.","As the pod opened, a beeping sound went off. In the living room, an elegant, tall woman rushed over.","“A-Chi, how was it? Did you have fun? Did you adapt well inside?”","Shen Chi almost instinctively tried to stand up, like he could in the game—to walk-like, but his lower body had no feeling at all.","For a few seconds, he was disoriented.","“It was great. In the game, it’s really great. Especially great!”","He could run, he could fight, he could even fly.","“That’s good. Too bad your dad and I got placed in Zone 039. We can’t play with you!” The woman sounded regretful.","“Who brings their parents to play games? Go have fun with your retired friends! But I met a girl in the game today.”","Shen Chi’s mother’s eyes lit up, but then dimmed. Her son was like this now, probably unable to find love—let alone settle down. Even if he liked a girl, they wouldn’t be able to be together.","Of course, it might not be what she was thinking. It had only been a day—what did like or dislike mean?","“You found a playmate so quickly?”","“Yeah. We played well together. She said her name was Chu Fu, and she’s in a vegetative state. Her brother is called Chu Feng.”","Shen’s mother was stunned. “That... what a coincidence?”","Shen Chi gave a bitter smile. “Yeah, a bit of a coincidence. Mom, do you have Chu Feng’s contact information? I want to let him know that Chu Fu is doing well in the game.”","“Mom will go find it.”","Shen’s mother hurried off to get her phone.","Shen Chi watched her walk away and raised his head to the ceiling, hiding the moisture in his eyes.","Three years ago, a car accident shattered three families.","He had just been admitted to a military engineering university, majoring in mechanics, and had even dreamed of holding a real gun during military training.","Then, a woman driving dangerously ran onto the crosswalk and hit him on his bicycle.","The pain in his waist had been searing. He couldn’t even crawl up. At the hospital, a spinal nerve injury left him completely paralyzed.","That despair still haunted him.","He had been the last of the three victims, but the first to sign the settlement agreement.","Later, there was a phrase online: “The happy retreat.”","It perfectly masked the cowardice under the shadow of crime.","At the time, the Sun family had offered an astronomical sum. But what truly made him sign the settlement was something else.","His father, a university professor who had worked diligently his whole life, was accused of academic fraud, taking bribes from students, and even having a female student harassing him.","His mother, a music teacher, was followed home from work, harassed by thugs, and twisted her ankle out of fear.","His uncle, a doctor, was attacked during a hospital dispute and even got beaten up.","His eldest uncle, a corporate executive who was only five years away from retirement, had to pay his company three million in compensation because of a major mistake.","His aunt, only eleven years older than Shen Chi, met someone she liked at the age of twenty-nine. It turned out to be a scam, and she lost five hundred thousand yuan—almost all her savings.","The compensation money from the Sun family back then was exactly three million five hundred thousand!","Incident after incident, no evidence, no clues, yet they all seemed to come together.","It felt like an overwhelming net had been cast over the entire family.","They had once been a happy family.","Their relatives and friends had also been doing well, far better than many others.","How did it all come to this?","Just because he had been hit by a car, not only could he not bring the other party to justice, but he was also threatened.","But he was truly scared.","Scared that his father would be framed, scared that his mother would be harmed, scared that his relatives and friends would be dragged down because of him.","In the end, he signed the agreement.","He always felt like he was the betrayer among the three victim families.","Later, Shen Chi heard that Chu Feng had also signed.","Because Chu Fu needed treatment funds, and her parents had just bought a new house with a huge mortgage to pay off.","Chu Feng was only nineteen then, had dropped out of college, and couldn’t afford Chu Fu’s medical expenses even by working odd jobs.","Finally, there was Xie Lin.","He didn’t sign the letter of forgiveness.","But his parents signed it—after all, he couldn’t see.","His parents had long been divorced, and it was said they fought bitterly over the compensation money."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Revenge, Revenge, Revenge: The Will of Xie Lin","paragraphs":["Unexpectedly, the three little wretches tormented by fate would reunite in a game.","And Wan Huanyu was the boyfriend of Sun Jingya, the driver responsible for the accident.","He had been sitting in the passenger seat and was the one who asked Sun Jingya to drive. Aside from him, there were two other people in the car—both top-tier rich second-generation—all of whom had been drinking and were sentenced to three years.","Three years. They had all been released from prison by now!","They had even set up a studio, become big shots with countless underlings, and still acted just as domineeringly.","How could someone as evil as Wan Huanyu still be a man above others, while the victims had been reduced to forming a league of the disabled?","To be honest, many people had described that devastating disaster as an accident over the years.","But if the other party hadn’t been drinking, if they hadn’t treated other people’s lives like they were worthless, none of this would have happened.","Why? Why? Why?!","Shen Chi felt that these three years had been an excruciating torment for him too. But his family was so happy—so happy that he... didn’t deserve to complain.","He was exhausted. Every day, he smiled at his parents, but deep down, he often wished he could just end it all.","Yet Shen Chi didn’t dare.","Now, suddenly, he felt he had a reason to go on.","He would play the game with Chu Fu and Xie Lin. Together, in the game, they would destroy Wan Huanyu.","Revenge. Revenge. Revenge!","...","On the outskirts of Linjiang City, inside an old, rundown house.","Xie Lin took off his gaming helmet and skillfully got up to go to the kitchen, where he boiled himself some instant noodles.","The room was shabby—almost like an unfinished shell.","All unnecessary obstacles had long since been cleared away.","He lived poorly.","But his body was packed with muscle, and he walked with a commanding stride, not at all like a blind man.","At fifteen, he had shown talent in gaming. His parents, however, refused to accept that their child had become an internet addict. Each blamed the other's parenting.","They were just ordinary people but expected their son to become a dragon.","They even tried to send him to a boot camp for internet addiction.","Luckily, he ran away back then.","After he ran, his parents divorced. The love between them had long died in their daily quarrels, and both felt they would be better off without the other.","They discarded him like a failed product.","Xie Lin didn’t care. He was indeed an internet-addicted teen, but with his sharp skills, he became a standout in every game he played.","He streamed. He went pro. He competed on stage.","At twenty, he used the money he earned to buy a sports car.","But maybe fate always strikes when you’re at your peak.","He was too arrogant, too flashy.","And so he was brutally punished.","His car was sent flying in a crash. Glass shards pierced both his eyes, and his eyeballs were removed.","He went blind.","He heard that the driver who caused the accident had also killed a married couple and turned a little girl into a vegetable.","And after crashing into his car, the driver continued onto the crosswalk, hitting a prospective college student, leaving them paralyzed.","Sometimes Xie Lin wondered: If he had swerved out of the way, would that student not be paralyzed?","Had he ended up ruining that person’s life?","But there were no ifs.","It wasn’t his fault.","It was the driver’s fault.","Xie Lin gritted his teeth and refused to sign a letter of leniency. But being blind, he couldn’t make many decisions on his own. His divorced parents showed up again, without a single kind word.","“You had it coming. You had all that money and didn’t think to support your father—why buy a car? A waste raising an ungrateful brat. Now you’re blind,” the man said.","“If you’d listened to me before and just set up a street stall selling sausages, it would’ve been better than playing games. This is your punishment for being unfilial,” the woman said.","“Get out! Both of you, get out! I won’t sign it. Why should I forgive her? She destroyed me! Why doesn’t she just die!” Xie Lin roared.","But he couldn’t decide anything.","His parents signed the contract.","They took the money.","They said it covered the cost of raising him, and that from now on, they wouldn’t bother with him anymore.","In the end, with a lawyer’s help, he got some of it back, but it wasn’t enough for his expenses.","He had to hire someone to take care of him.","He also learned boxing and swordsmanship.","He thought of the game characters he used to play: the blind monk, the blind swordsman, the blind girl.","Why couldn’t he do the same?","Treat the world like a real game world!","Every punch he threw would be punch skill +1.","Every sword swing would be sword skill +1.","He could locate things by sound. His body was strong.","Three years passed. The day he’d been waiting for finally arrived!","But because of his blindness, his operations were slow. He registered late; the game had been open for a month by the time he entered.","Still not too late. Not too late.","“Xiao Dou, find me the server merge news on the [Primordial Gate] forum. Find all information about the Huanyu Studio.”","“Yes, master...”","Xie Lin ate his noodles while listening to the updates.","The server merge rules of [Primordial Gate] were very interesting.","Each server represented a different region, so after leaving the newbie village, players landed in different towns.","Server 8888, which belonged to Linjiang City players, landed in a town called: Fengdu Town Fortress.","After the newbie village expansion monster invasion, even if players defended the village, the survival rate might only be half—meaning about 5,000 players would survive.","The probability of the village being wiped out was 90%.","Maybe only a few hundred or a few dozen people would escape, traveling on foot through the wilderness to reach Fengdu Town, and many would die and delete their accounts along the way.","Then [Primordial Gate] would merge servers. One Fengdu Town could still only hold 10,000 players.","So, [001 Zone 8888 Server] to [007 Zone 8888 Server] were merged.","Only [001 Zone 8888 Server]’s newbie village was preserved, because they had successfully defended it.","At present, [008-013] were merged, and [014-019 Zone] were merged.","[020 Zone] was still holding its village defense battle today.","Xie Lin took a guess: The game likely wanted level 10 players to play together, level 20 players together, and level 30 players together!","So, which zone was Wan Huanyu, the founder of Huanyu Studio, in?","The AI had already answered him.","“Zone 015, Server 8888, Huanyu Studio recruiting. Studio owner Wan Huanyu, backed by Wantu Real Estate’s heir, is running a mega studio. Want to rise in the game and earn a windfall? Join Huanyu and dominate Primordial.”","“Zone 015.”","Xie Lin sneered.","He even hoped Wan Huanyu wouldn’t die too soon.","When they reached level 30, the game might merge again. That was when they could meet on a new map!","He, Xie Lin, would personally kill Wan Huanyu.","Before that, he wanted to slaughter Huanyu Kuangba just to vent.","He also needed 1 million to buy a gaming pod, so he wouldn’t have to log off every day just to eat, wasting time."]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Brother's phone call, save some seeds for me","paragraphs":["0308888 server.","Inside a nightmare-level dungeon.","Chu Fu, along with \"Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao\" and \"Sha Fu Lian Gu,\" was stationed at the entrance, killing monsters.","Even though two people were missing, Chu Fu's team output hadn't decreased.","After all, clearing the nightmare-level dungeon had significantly boosted Chu Fu's equipment and stats. She had upgraded her weapon to a silver staff and gained a new area-of-effect skill.","Now, her character panel was dazzlingly impressive.","[ID: Who Wants to Be a Plant","Level: 4 (89.2% EXP)","Class: Poison Master","Talent: Plant Human (S)","Skills: Poison Art, Slow Art, Plague Spread","Attribute Points:","Constitution: 10 (+7)","Strength: 10","Agility: 10 (+3)","Spirit: 34 (+10)","Equipment: Green Poison Mushroom Skirt (Silver), Malice Staff (Silver), Rat Queen Crown (Bronze), Rat Queen Boots (Bronze), Mana Gloves (Black Iron), Witch Rat Ring (Black Iron)... (White items omitted)","Wealth: 671 silver, 328 copper.]","A single boss first-kill bonus, plus three dungeon first-kills—even though her base stats were slightly lower than others, she had now pulled far ahead.","Under the assault of her Dandelion and Bedstraw attacks, supplemented by the area damage from Plague Spread, waves of monsters fell one after another.","Not only that, but the newly joined Sha Fu Lian Gu had brought Chu Fu both surprise and delight, along with a creeping sense of unease.","Sha Fu Lian Gu's talent was:","[Pig \"Raising\" Expert (A)","Effect 1: Any creature you raise eats excessively; its weight and size far exceed normal forms, with no growth limits.","Effect 2: The size of your summoned contract beast increases by +80%.]","She had chosen the Gu Master class because her username contained the word \"Gu,\" triggering a special job from the system.","When presented with a rare class, who would pick an ordinary one? Sha Fu Lian Gu went for it without hesitation.","The class's first skill was [Contract Gu Insect].","After entering the newbie village, she was harassed by members of the Huan Yu guild. Disgusted by these scumbags, she focused on running quests within the village. She had initially wanted to contract a cat, but her skill wouldn't allow it.","Left with no choice, she contracted a spider instead.","At first, the spider was only the size of a palm. After being fed rabbit meat, rabbit bones, and all sorts of odds and ends, it had grown into a \"pig\" spider.","Now, it was as big as a washbasin.","Sha Fu Lian Gu had also learned Summon Rat Minion.","According to the constraints of a shrinking potion, her rat minion should have been reduced in size, roughly the size of a stray dog.","But when she summoned it, it turned out to be as large as a Samoyed.","Half an hour into the dungeon, the Samoyed-sized rat minion had grown to the size of an Alaskan Malamute.","Truly a Pig-Raising Expert!","This was insane.","If the rat minion and the spider never died, how massive would they become?","Could she eventually ride them?","Sha Fu Lian Gu had great potential.","They continued killing for another half hour, until Chu Fu suddenly heard a sound.","[System Notice: Your device is attempting to connect to a communicator. Accept or reject communication from tail number: 1285.]","What's this?","Wait—could it be that Feng Zhen Sheng Shou had actually found her senior brother and senior sister, then notified her brother to track her down?","She hastily clicked Accept.","\"Accept!\"","[Connection successful!]","[User \"Brother\" is calling you. Answer the call?]","Just as she thought!","Filled with excitement, Chu Fu answered the call.","Under the influence of the \"original host's\" memories, she now felt that Chu Feng truly was her brother.","He was her only family in this world.","“Brother!” Chu Fu answered the phone.","“Fu Fu!” Chu Feng’s voice trembled with excitement. “Are you okay? Is the game going smoothly? Has anyone been bullying you?”","“Brother, I’m fine. No one dares to bully me. Thank you for buying me the game pod.” Chu Fu was fighting while talking on the phone, and the squeaking sounds of the rats reached Chu Feng’s ears as well.","“Good, good, good. As long as you’re awake in the game, that’s what matters. Remember to stay safe, don’t take any risks, and protect your character.","Later, I’ll link a bank card to your account. Buy more equipment. In ten days, when the village defense battle starts, if you can’t win, just run. Head to Fengdu Town Fortress, understand?","Even if you don’t level up, it’s fine. Just wait another year, and I’ll find a way to wake you up.","And even if your character dies, don’t blame yourself. Call me, or have a friend pass a message to me. I’ll apply for a new server for you.”","Chu Feng kept giving instructions.","He hesitated, but didn’t mention the game’s invasion.","When Chu Fu was still in a coma, he dared to talk about it because no one was around.","Now, doctors surrounded him, excited about the plant patient waking up. He could only hint at it subtly.","Chu Fu naturally understood what he meant and nodded repeatedly.","“Brother, don’t worry. I will.”","“Mm. Then give me your friend’s phone number now. And...” Chu Feng said with a hint of jealousy, “You’re still young, so don’t hang out with boys too much. Spend more time with girls, you hear?”","Chu Fu couldn’t help but laugh. “Oh, Brother, you’re so nosy! Fine, fine. I’m playing with a girl right now. I’ll give you a number!”","Then, Chu Fu turned to Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","“Sister Jiao Jiao...”","“I heard. It’s just a phone number. Write this down: 188XXXXX888.”","After that, Chu Fu also noted down the numbers of the doctors and nurses. If there were any emergencies or if she felt unwell, she could call them anytime. Chu Feng couldn’t rush over, but the doctors and nurses would still be on duty.","The doctors wanted to study Chu Fu’s condition as a plant patient in the game, but she was in the middle of a dungeon and really didn’t want to be interrogated.","“Brother, I’m in the middle of a dungeon right now—it’s a bit dangerous, so I have to go.","Oh, by the way, my class ability lets me control plants. Brother, please keep an eye out for some plant seeds for me!”","Why wouldn’t she take advantage of a strong card?","Chu Fu had only read a book and knew the plot.","How could that compare to Chu Feng, who had truly lived a second life and knew the game inside out?","Let him help collect seeds—she planned to leech off him.","“Alright, I’ll save them for you. Later, when the servers merge, I’ll definitely craft the best and most beautiful gear for you.”","Chu Feng’s voice choked up again.","He was far too emotional.","After being reborn, he swore to reclaim everything he had lost, and the thing he cared about most was naturally his sister.","In the previous life, his sister had died in the first year of the game’s invasion.","This time, he had bought her a game pod, and sure enough, Chu Fu had “come alive” again in the game.","She still hadn’t woken up in reality, but as soon as the game descended on the world, she would synchronize her stats into reality and wake up healthy and strong.","Even though he wanted to keep talking to her, he could hear the rat noises through the receiver, so he had to hold back his excitement and let his sister focus on the game.","“I’ll call you again at 2 PM tomorrow. By that time, it should be nighttime in the game, so remember to get some rest in there, got it?”","“Remember not to play with boys too much!”","“Got it, Brother!” Got it, but that doesn’t mean I’ll listen.","Don’t interfere with your little sister’s social life, Brother!","As if sensing Chu Fu’s dismissive tone, Chu Feng felt a pang of heartache.","Sigh, the little cotton-padded jacket had only just woken up—how was it already letting in the wind?","His little sister was so pretty; she was bound to have a bunch of scumbag guys chasing after her in the game.","Just like that guy who called today."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Continuous Clearance, Farewell to the Cosmic Ruler","paragraphs":["Half an hour ago.","Chu Feng received a phone call from a stranger.","What the other party said shocked him from the start.","\"Hello, are you Chu Fu's brother? I'm a gaming friend of Chu Fu's. She asked me to check on you and hopes you can connect a communication device for her so you two can talk!\"","\"What? Chu Fu is awake???\"","\"She's just playing games!\"","\"Okay, okay, okay, thank you, thank you! May I ask how my sister is doing in the game now? Is she alright?\"","\"She's amazing!\" Shen Chi’s voice was warm, as if carrying a relieved smile. \"Her talent is very high—she's S-rank! Her class is Toxicologist.\"","Chu Feng felt something was off.","As a devoted brother, he immediately detected a different tone in Shen Chi's voice.","Not only that, but he was also grumbling inwardly.","[My sister is too naive, telling someone something as important as her talent.]","But of course, Chu Feng couldn't say that out loud.","\"That's good to hear, that's good. Thank you for your help. My sister hasn't played many games. She was only 15 when she became a vegetable, so she probably still has the mindset of a 15-year-old.\"","So no early dating!","Even though the other person's voice sounded young too, he better not get any ideas about my sister, got it?","\"Chu Fu has a strong talent for gaming. We've just taken down a boss and cleared all three difficulty levels of the Rat Lair dungeon!\"","[Oh no, oh no, oh no. Is my sister being carried? Isn't this just like that 'wild king' guy in games? My sister better not be fooled by this man!]","\"I really can't thank you enough. How about I compensate you based on market rates? 10,000 per attribute point?\"","[Take the money and stay away from my sister.]","Shen Chi naturally couldn't accept the money.","\"No need, Brother Chu Feng. Chu Fu contributed a lot to clearing the dungeon. There's no need to pay me. Please hurry to the hospital and set up the device for Chu Fu! I have things to do, I'll hang up now!\"","Shen Chi didn't dare continue the conversation.","He could feel Chu Feng's gratitude for making this call.","But how could Shen Chi deserve to be thanked by Chu Feng?","He hung up, stared blankly at his phone, and lost himself in thought.","\"Ah Chi, dinner is ready. Come eat first! You haven't eaten all day!\"","The game pod didn't require food.","But Shen Chi couldn't refuse.","\"Okay, Mom.\"","Half an hour later.","Shen Chi logged back in.","Xie Lin had also eaten and washed the dishes before logging in.","Chu Fu immediately invited them both.","\"Wheelchair Brother, Sword Saint Brother, hurry up and come do the dungeon!\"","There were still two spots in the dungeon party, which they could fill at any time. Even kicking people or swapping mid-run was possible without affecting progress.","The two quickly drank potions and entered the Nightmare-level dungeon.","Xie Lin had originally planned to go after Huanyu Kuangba but now had to let him off the hook for now.","The stronger the enemy became, the more time it would waste, and when it died, the more painful and costly it would be.","With the two of them joining, the run became much faster.","Two and a half hours later, the dungeon was cleared again.","This time, it only took three hours.","Chu Fu finally leveled up to 5.","\"Once we reach level 5, since each Nightmare-level dungeon run gives about 10% experience, that means ten runs will get Wheelchair Brother and me to level 6, and then we won't be able to enter this dungeon anymore.","How about this: we take down the Mutant Rat Wizard as fast as possible. That way, we save time, and the experience gain won’t be too high. We can run the Nightmare-level dungeon a few more times to accumulate equipment and also raise everyone's levels!","If we all get Bronze-tier equipment, then we'll go fight the Silver Moon Wolf King!\"","\"I'll follow the leader!\" Shen Chi said.","\"Yeah, me too!\"","\"Will you take me too? I'll pay...\"","Chu Fu quickly stopped this spendthrift. \"No need to pay this time, Sister Jiaojiao. Your equipment isn’t bad. Once you have a full set of Bronze-tier gear, you can tank the boss. We’ll probably need a healer, though. Sister Liangu might not be able to keep running with us.\"","Shafu Liangu wasn’t bothered. \"I understand. I'm already satisfied being brought along for leveling now. Once I reach level 3 later, I’ll go level up with the other girls in the alliance. With my current damage output, I can help them clear a Normal-level dungeon!\"","\"Exactly. A guild or alliance can't grow on one person alone,\" Chu Fu shared her insights from her gaming experience. \"Take the Rat Lair dungeon as an example. No matter how strong we are, we can only run the Nightmare-level dungeon a dozen times before we outlevel it and can't enter anymore.","But if a studio or alliance keeps having new players cycle through, the daily influx of Bronze-tier equipment increases naturally.","More Bronze-tier gear has a direct impact on the success rate of the final village defense battle.\"","The worst-case scenario was a village that couldn't form a single S-rank squad. They couldn’t clear Nightmare-level dungeons and thus had no way to get Bronze equipment. Without Bronze gear, they couldn’t beat Nightmare-level dungeons.","It was a vicious cycle!","So as long as dungeons were cleared, equipment was sold, and the top players enjoyed the benefits, subsequent teams could obtain equipment and keep raiding, forming a virtuous cycle.","Not just for the server's overall strength, but for the alliance's strength too—it would naturally rise.","\"Plant Girl, did your brother tell you all this? He's really a top-tier player. I’ll definitely ask him for tips later. By the way, do you want to join our Rose Alliance? I’ll appoint you as our strategist!\"","Chu Fu laughed. \"Sister Jiaojiao, if the boss drops a Guild Order and you establish a guild, I'll definitely join.\"","\"It's a deal then!\"","Chu Fu's strength was obvious to everyone. Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was already thinking about offering Chu Fu an annual salary of several million.","No, wait—several million wasn’t enough. If Chu Fu joined, she should give her shares in the studio instead.","After all, this was someone who could endlessly carry teams to first kills!","And so, the team ran dungeons like clockwork.","Apart from Chu Fu, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Jiaojiao Bu Jiao as permanent members, the last slot was always given to someone from the Rose Alliance. Once Shen Chi reached level 5, they could even bring level 1 characters to run dungeons.","Those with strong talents who were willing to join the Rose Alliance—all of them were power-leveled.","This was far better than Huanyu Kuangba's empty promises.","Combined with Sister Jiaojiao's big-sister, take-charge personality, a crowd quickly gathered around her.","The team’s overall equipment kept improving.","Clear times also got faster—from the initial three hours down to two hours, and finally settling at a limit of one hour and thirty minutes. They couldn’t go faster due to map navigation constraints.","The group ran the dungeon a full eight times.","You might ask: was running the dungeon really that addictive?","Yes—every time, different equipment dropped, and every run felt fresh.","The four of them played straight through the night and into the next day.","By 1:30 PM the next afternoon, Chu Fu also received a health warning.","[You have been fighting continuously for 30 hours. Please rest. The game pod cannot alleviate mental fatigue.]","You can rest inside an inn or tent in the game—doing so will put you into a deep sleep. Four hours of sleep can fully restore your mental state.","You currently have a DEBUFF: Mental Fatigue—mental attributes reduced by 50%.","“Ah, I’ve finally gotten a health warning too!” Chu Fu said regretfully.","Because Chu Fu logged into the game later than the others, her health warning came later than everyone else’s. She was the only one still leading the charge, like a workaholic.","“Let’s rest up. Plant Girl, I’ve prepared a tent for you. You can sleep in the tent later, and I’ll have someone watch over you outside!”","Sister Jiaojiao said.","The tent was naturally bought in the beginner’s village. Folded up, it took up one backpack slot, but it was affordable—only 100 copper coins—and allowed you the freedom to sleep in the wild.","However, the tent had durability. If it was attacked by monsters, its health would drop, and you yourself could be attacked while asleep.","Of course, the player would wake up if attacked.","The most terrifying scenario was if a powerful boss suddenly appeared and you got one-shotted—well, there’d be no one to complain to about that.","“Alright! I’ll go sleep now!”","Chu Fu agreed. She finally left the area of the Mutant Rat Nest and then canceled the effect of the shrinking potion.","Instantly, she grew back to her normal size.","Just as she was finding a spot to set up the tent, she saw a group of people swaggering over in the distance.","She looked closely—it was none other than Huanyu Kuangba!","At that moment, Huanyu Kuangba was also staring nervously at Chu Fu.","“Get ready!”","Huanyu Kuangba bellowed."]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: How to Eat Mutant Rabbits Braised or Spicy","paragraphs":["Chu Fu instantly tensed up.","Her fingers tightened around the seeds of dandelions and cleavers, ready to summon an army of plants and give these players from Huanyu Studio a taste of a new \"bundled package.\"","But the next second,","after Huanyu Kuangba shouted those two words, he suddenly lurched backward and smoothly slipped into the very center of the group.","The team of over fifty people formed layers to encircle Huanyu Kuangba, then sprinted at top speed toward the dungeon entrance.","After quickly taking a shrinking potion, the person at the core of the team vanished into the light of the ordinary dungeon portal.","\"Escort successful! Run for it!\"","The Huanyu Studio players fled like scared dogs, even faster than when they arrived, scrambling into the wheat field, accompanied by a scream.","One of them was attacked by a mutated rat.","\"Well, this...\"","It was hard to judge.","Chu Fu was speechless.","She thought they were about to make a big move, but instead, they pulled a lame stunt.","\"Seriously? That whole tough-guy act, and I thought they were ready to fight to the death. And this is what we get?\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiaqi laughed.","With a guild like that, how could they even compete for the top spot in the newbie village?","\"Total waste of energy!\"","Chu Fu found a spot and pulled out a tent.","She set up the tent, which took up about four square meters, and was about to crawl inside.","\"Plant Sister!\"","A polite voice called out.","Chu Fu looked over and saw a female player with a pretty face, her ID hovering above her head: Zhimengzhe.","\"Plant Sister, thanks for driving off those Huanyu Studio people earlier. You don't know me, but I'm really grateful. Here, I made this little something for you!\"","Zhimengzhe held out a pile of items, dropped them next to Chu Fu, and ran off before she could react.","\"System notification: You have received a gift from Zhimengzhe: Bunny Sleep Three-Piece Set.\"","\"Oh! Thank you! Hey, sis, add me as a friend! I'll give you some useful gear when I get the chance!\"","But the other player refused the friend request and truly hurried away.","Jiaojiao smiled and said, \"Zhimengzhe is socially anxious, but she makes knitted toys in real life. She's incredibly skilled! She handmade all of these.\"","Chu Fu opened the bundle and her eyes lit up.","A bunny-shaped pillow, complete with long ears, made of rabbit leather (without fur).","A thick mattress pad, covered in rabbit fur, stuffed with bundled straw.","And finally, a rabbit-fur blanket, where the fur had been twisted into yarn and crocheted into a loose, breathable fabric.","\"This... She's amazing!\"","Chu Fu had the utmost respect for handmade craft masters!","\"Rabbit Leather Pillow (White Grade): A pillow to sleep on, maybe with sweet dreams!\"","\"Rabbit Fur Mattress Pad (White Grade): A thick mattress pad for added sleeping comfort. Spread it out when the ground's too hard.\"","\"Handmade Crochet Rabbit-Fur Blanket (White Grade): Soft and warm, cuddly to the touch.\"","Although the items had no stats, they were recognized by the system.","Everything was made from the pelts of Red-Eye Rabbits.","Chu Fu thought that if the quality of the pelts were higher, Zhimengzhe could probably craft items that boosted comfort or added attributes.","\"Sister Jiaojiao, make sure she accepts my friend request. I'll want her to make things for me in the future!\"","\"Got it!\"","Jiaojiao agreed.","Soon, Chu Fu got her sixth friend.","\"Plant Sister, please don't give me money. If you do, people might start sending you things just to ask for good gear, and I don't want to start that trend. Plus, I genuinely wanted to thank you.\"","Zhimengzhe’s message showed her sincerity.","Chu Fu felt a warmth inside—this socially anxious girl had a really kind heart!","\"Alright, I'll accept your gift. But if I want to commission something from you in the future, don't refuse. Charge me a fair price.\"","\"Okay~ I'll do my best!\"","Chu Fu ended the pleasant private chat and lay down in the tent, resting her head on the bunny pillow, sleeping on the mat, and covered with the blanket.","It was so comfortable!","She could even roll around inside the tent!","When reading a novel, you never got these details. The game \"Primordial Gate\" was just too realistic. She wondered what lay behind that gate, anyway.","After all, this novel had been abandoned!","Chu Fu had no idea how it ended.","But based on discussions about game novels, she figured the most likely outcome was that whoever passed through the gate became a god.","Sigh. Her dear brother Chu Feng was about to become a god and still hadn't remembered his comatose sister.","Luckily, she had transmigrated.","This powerful ally wasn't going anywhere.","With that thought, Chu Fu opened her communications to call Chu Feng first.","The other side picked up quickly.","\"Fufu, what's wrong? How's the game going? Has anyone been bullying you?\"","Why did her brother always think she'd be bullied?","Chu Fu glanced at her over 3,000 PK points and felt terrifyingly villainous.","\"No, bro, it's fine. You said we'd call every day at 2 PM, but since I'm in the tent now and planning to sleep soon, I'm calling early.\"","\"Good. If anything happens, let me know. I'll link your bank card this afternoon and transfer some money to you later.\"","\"Bro, I don't need money!\"","She was actually loaded!","Chu Feng naturally wouldn't take no for an answer. They chatted a bit more, and Chu Feng told her to get some rest before hanging up.","After hanging up, Chu Fu was physically exhausted, but her mind wasn't quite ready to settle down.","She decided to open the game's official forum to see what was new today.","There were general boards and server-specific boards. Chu Fu clicked on the general board and picked one of the hottest threads.","She was immediately drawn in.","\"Folks, is this game real? My rabbit grew this big in one month—isn't this just a Red-Eye Rabbit?\" [Image] [Replies: 230,000+] [Viral!]","Chu Fu's eyes narrowed.","Before this world mutated under the influence of the game, some changes were already starting.","Did the players already know at this point?","She clicked in immediately.","There, she saw a giant rabbit picture.","The OP wrote in an extremely cheerful tone:","\"Folks, you won't believe it. In just one month, my rabbit went berserk—huge as a pig.\"","\"Its eyes are red like searchlights, it kicked the iron cage clean off with its hind legs, and it bared its teeth trying to bite me!\"","\"Isn't this exactly a Red-Eye Rabbit?\"","\"So, in a fit of anger, I went ahead and...\"","[Image] [Image] [Image] [Image]","Chu Fu couldn't help but burst out laughing.","The pictures were of food.","Spicy rabbit head, cold rabbit meat, braised rabbit, charcoal-grilled rabbit ribs.","The comments were all in on the fun.","\"Respect to you, madman, poisoning late-night readers like this.\"","\"Serious question: if game rabbits invade reality, would they replace pork? Because those giant rabbits are huge!\"","\"Then should we eat mutant rats? Fatter than bamboo rats.\"","\"No! (vomit)\"","\"Agreed! Bunny wunnies are so cute—better eat the mice!\"","\"Are the people who agree with this just newbies who have never played through a dungeon? Have you ever seen what a mutated rat looks like? Covered in lumps!\"","\"Watch out for plague transmission!\"","\"In our China, as long as it dares to show a health bar—even if it's a mutant Tyrannosaurus Rex—we'll still figure out whether it's better suited for steaming or braising!\""]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Jiao Jiao Encounters an Extreme Couple","paragraphs":["Chu Fu laughed for a moment, then let out a sigh.","The players optimistically thought that after the invasion, the monsters would all become delicious food on their tables.","In reality, Red-Eyed Rabbits were extremely dangerous. Their kicks were powerful enough to shatter bones instantly if they bit down on a neck.","Nine months later, when the game invaded reality, many elderly people hadn't entered the game and failed to synch their characters in time.","They would have their throats crushed by the descending Red-Eyed Rabbits.","Chu Fu stopped laughing.","\"All I can do now is protect the newbie village—and then guard Fengdu Town!\"","Every newbie village protected would mean one more safe zone on Earth when the game invaded.","The more safe spots, the more survivors.","Thinking about it,","sleep washed over her like a tide.","Chu Fu shut down the forum panel, let out a big yawn, tugged at her blanket, and fell into a deep sleep inside her cozy tent.","And as she sank into deep sleep,","she had no idea what was happening in the real world.","In her hospital room.","Inside Chu Fu's nutrient pod, the nutrient fluid was being continuously infused, nourishing her body.","High-concentration life-active substances began seeping into her body through her pores at several times the usual rate.","The muscles that had atrophied after three years of lying in bed began to regenerate, cells splitting and swelling under the nourishment.","Her once-withered, pale skin regained some elasticity.","But these changes were barely visible to the naked eye.","...","Inside the game.","As Chu Fu rested in her tent, night fell across the world.","But across the server, the top-tier players had all reached level 3.","In the Rose Alliance, thanks to Chu Fu's top-tier team leading the way and Jiao Jiao's whale-level spending on gear, eight teams were already farming normal dungeons.","Since Chu Fu was asleep and Jiao Jiao wasn't tired—having rested earlier—she was bored and wanted to keep running dungeons.","Games only get more addictive the longer you play.","【Friend Channel】: Anyone want to run a dungeon? Level 5 Shield Warrior, can carry two level 2 alts through normal mode.","【Friend Channel】 worked differently from 【Map Channel】—only friends could see the messages, and with over 1,000 friends on her list, Jiao Jiao was never short of action.","【Restrained Handsome】: Jiao Jiao, can you take me and my girlfriend? I'm an Archer, she's a Priest.","【Jiao Jiao】: Come on in.","Both were level 2. To be safe, Jiao Jiao added two more level 3 players to the team.","Team Leader: 【Jiao Jiao】: Shield Warrior, Level 5.","Members:","【Restrained Handsome】: Archer, Level 2.","【Radiating Charm】: Priest, Level 2.","【Sweetheart Pope's Disciple】: Mage, Level 3.","【Sea Pearl】: Mage, Level 3.","The dungeon began.","Jiao Jiao thought back to when Chu Fu had first led her through a dungeon and said, \"Positions—I'll be upfront drawing aggro. Handsome, Sweetheart, and Sea Pearl in the middle. Charm at the back.\"","Everyone nodded, but Radiating Charm suddenly whined, \"My boyfriend doesn't stand with other girls. You come stand with me.\"","\"Fine, fine!\" Restrained Handsome hurriedly agreed, moving to stand beside her.","Jiao Jiao was taken aback but figured an Archer's range was long enough that positioning didn't matter much.","\"Fine, fine, go stand with your girlfriend.\"","Then the dungeon run started. But once the fighting began, Jiao Jiao realized just how spoiled she'd been before.","Each mob took ten whole seconds to kill.","At least they were just normal monsters. Jiao Jiao, though a Shield Warrior, had enough damage to push through.","When they reached the main hall with over thirty mobs, Restrained Handsome went to pull aggro—but his hand slipped, and he pulled ten at once.","Luckily, Jiao Jiao's taunt was strong enough. She drew seven of them, leaving three for the others to handle.","Then Radiating Charm, instead of healing Jiao Jiao—who was tanking seven mobs—cast her spells on Restrained Handsome instead.","Jiao Jiao felt a knot tighten in her stomach. She had a vague, terrible feeling, but brushed it off as unimportant.","Damn lovebirds.","Fortunately, her gear was so good that she cleared the mobs quickly, and they reached the boss.","Things got even messier.","\" Healer! Heal me!\"","\" My boyfriend's hurt. I need to heal him first. Your gear is so good, just drink a potion!\" Radiating Charm retorted.","Jiao Jiao was speechless. \"Then why did I bring you as a healer? And you! What have you been doing back there? Your damage contribution is only 4%! What the hell?\"","Restrained Handsome said, \"I have to stand next to my girlfriend. You two mages, move over—I can't see my target!\"","Radiating Charm suddenly flared up: \"They're blocking your view? Or are you just trying to stare at their backs? Getting addicted to eye candy, are you?!\"","\"Honey, I'm not!\"","\"Yes, you are! I knew something was off from the start. Calling her 'Jiao Jiao' all sweetly—are you trying to hit on a sugar mommy? Or just looking at other girls?!\"","Jiao Jiao had to chug potions herself. Her gear was just too good.","\"Team leader, ignore that crazy couple! Let's DPS ourselves!\" Sweetheart Pope's Disciple shouted, speeding up her attacks.","\"Team leader, start kiting! You can dodge boss attacks with your movement speed—you're way faster than the boss,\" Sea Pearl added.","Jiao Jiao started moving, kiting the boss around. The three of them circled the lair, attacking in unison, while the couple kept arguing in the background.","They bickered for ten full minutes before the boss finally collapsed.","Then they finally shut up.","The dungeon dropped three pieces of gray gear: a bow, leather armor, and a robe.","Restrained Handsome quickly apologized: \"Jiao Jiao, my girlfriend has a temper and a bit of insecurity. Sorry about that.\"","\"Spare me the excuses! Hand over the gear to us. And don't team up with other girls ever again, got it?\"","Jiao Jiao finally lost it. \"You want the gear? Get lost!\"","She used her party leader authority and instantly kicked both of them out of the dungeon.","She'd only offered to carry them out of kindness.","And she got stuck with a pile of crap.","Jiao Jiao was furious.","...","When Chu Fu next woke up, she felt like she'd had the best sleep of her life.","Her whole body brimmed with energy.","It wasn't a feeling of power in her muscles, but a sense of thriving vitality—like her life force was overflowing.","It felt amazing.","She stepped out of the tent, stored it in her backpack, and immediately heard heated shouting nearby.","\"Jiao Jiao of the Rose Alliance scammed us out of our loot! She kicked us from the dungeon! Don't join the Rose Alliance!\"","By now, the dungeon entrance was bustling, with quite a crowd gathered to watch the drama and ask what happened.","\"We cleared the dungeon boss, but the gear that dropped was ours. Jiao Jiao kicked us so she could keep it all!\"","\"Bullshit! You two lovebirds were arguing the whole time and wouldn't even heal me. You argued for ten minutes after the boss died, and you're surprised I kicked you?\"","\"Isn't that you rushing to take my boyfriend through the dungeon? You just think my boyfriend is handsome, has a nice voice, and good skills, so you want to flirt with him.","Otherwise, why would someone from Rosy Alliance bring a guy into the dungeon? Have you even looked at yourself in the mirror...\"","As Radiating Charm was about to say more, a sickly green light landed on her.","-350.","Instant kill!","It was a poison spell!","Everyone turned to look in the direction from which the green magical attack had come.","A young girl in a green dress, looking very frail and sickly—but dressed completely differently from those around her—raised her staff.","She was gathering her skill again!","Poison spell!","\"Don't! Don't kill me!\" Restrained Handsome shouted in terror."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: What reasoning Go tell it to my sin value","paragraphs":["The response was a lethal poison.","-350!","Instant kill!","Chu Fu swiftly eliminated the two.","Fate was truly remarkable. When she read the book back then, there were no characters like Suture Saint or Shafu Liangu around Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","Instead, the ones who appeared in the story were the couple Restrained Handsome and Radiating Charm.","These two were nothing but leeches and parasites, and on top of that, they betrayed Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao at the critical moment.","As the book put it:","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s loyalty was both her making and her undoing.","She died because of her loyalty.","Unexpectedly, after Chu Fu’s transmigration, her presence—like the flap of a butterfly’s wings—had caused such drastic changes.","In the original plot, Restrained Handsome had always coaxed Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, while Radiating Charm gaslighted her.","Now, having encountered good teammates, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao naturally refused to tolerate such drama any longer.","Still, their way of handling things was a bit naive.","“Why are you all staring at me? Do we need to go to court to decide who’s right or wrong? It’s clearly their fault—why not just send them straight to reincarnation?","Are you planning to argue with these two?","Fine, I’ll reason with them now!","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao is one of the top tycoons on our server. She wouldn’t scam someone over a few dozen copper coins worth of gear. She’s spent millions with me in just two days.","Some people might think she has money to burn, or that she’s so rich she can just let a few small change slip through her fingers to keep you all well-fed.","You might think, “What’s the big deal about a few pieces of gear? Why make a fuss?”","But no.","Scamming Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao is scamming my customer. First, you’ll have to ask my sin points if they agree.”","She looked frail, but her words carried a sick, murderous intent.","The name above her head was stained a dark red.","It marked her as a ferocious killer, someone who had slaughtered over thirty players since the server launched.","Don’t let her delicate appearance fool you into overlooking her ruthlessness.","For a moment, the surrounding players quickly chimed in.","“Plant Master, we know what’s going on. We’re just here watching the spectacle.”","“That’s right, that’s right. We know Jiao Jiao is not in the wrong.”","“Jiao Jiao gave them too much face. They’re just shameless and trying to extort her.”","Chu Fu nodded in satisfaction.","“Everyone, disperse. Get back to your own business!”","Once everyone had left to do their own tasks, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao threw her arm around Chu Fu’s shoulders.","“Wah, thank you, Plant Girl. From now on, you’re my ride-or-die bestie!”","If before they had only been teammates—with Chu Fu charging a fee like a pro-player for hire—now, after Chu Fu had stepped in, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao truly considered her a friend.","“It’s no big deal, but why didn’t you just strike them down instead of trying to reason with them?”","“I was stupid. I thought I needed to let everyone know it wasn’t our fault.”","Chu Fu understood. The Original Gate was a relatively old-school game novel, back when people were still simple-minded, believing that whoever cried the loudest had the right to demand justice.","“You fell into the trap of self-justification. The more you try to prove you’re right, the more they’ll take advantage of you.”","“Wow! Plant Girl, you’re more insightful than me, someone in my twenties. You’re my guiding light from now on!”","“Alright, your guiding light is taking you to farm some dungeons!”","Since Chu Fu needed rest, Shen Chi logged off to spend time with his family. Meanwhile, Xie Lin, using a game helmet that required eight hours of forced offline rest each day, timed his logout to happen four hours before Chu Fu went to sleep.","Chu Fu messaged them, and they logged back in to continue grinding the Nightmare-level dungeon.","They farmed it relentlessly for nine more hours until Chu Fu finally reached level 6!","She had fully completed the first dungeon in the starting village.","By then, the bulk of players were just hitting level 3, and the dungeon entrance was swarming with people shouting for groups.","But Chu Fu’s team was already heading elsewhere.","“Let’s move out—Wild Wolf Valley!” Chu Fu shouted.","Shen Chi pulled out several larger mechanical wings, this time made from bone instead of wood.","Those bones, it turned out, were crafted from the remains of the Mutant Rat Queen, making the equipment Bronze grade.","“One for each of us. We’ll fly over!”","The materials had been collected by the whole team, and Shen Chi received one piece of Bronze gear as a crafting fee for his work.","It was definitely a friendly price.","[Mutant Rat Queen Exoskeleton Mechanical Wings (Bronze): Grants flight, +150% movement speed, +5 Agility.]","A fantastic item.","As the five of them took off together, it sparked exclamations from onlookers.","Moreover, three of them had deeply red names, marking them as notorious killers. Had it not been for the names making their identities clear, other players might have taken a shot at them to steal their gear.","But everyone knew the strongest team in the starting village was that oddly named group of misfits.","Their departure quickly caught the attention of those watching.","“Boss, Plantman and their group flew off. They’ve stopped grinding the dungeon. I saw Plantman hit level 6!”","In the dungeon, Huanyu Kuangba let out a sigh of relief after hearing the news.","He had been nervous about entering that dungeon!","Luckily, he had people keeping tabs on Chu Fu’s group. Every time they left the dungeon, he made sure to steer clear.","That way, he avoided getting killed!","But just as he relaxed, his heart tightened.","“Did you hear where they were going?”","“They said Wild Wolf Valley!”","Huanyu Kuangba’s mood sank immediately.","Damn it.","Wild Wolf Valley housed the second field boss of the starting village: the Silver Moon Wolf King.","If they took it down, they’d net another wave of stat points.","That would be another loss for him.","With that thought, he abandoned the dungeon.","“Quickly, gather all the brothers. We’re heading to Wild Wolf Valley!”","“Boss, will we make it in time? They can fly, so they’ll be faster, and their damage output won’t be low either. Even if we manage to snatch the boss, we might not come back alive!”","Huanyu Kuangba hesitated.","Then, gritting his teeth, he said, “Do you think, after killing the wolf boss, they’ll go after another boss?”","The starting village had four field bosses: the Wild Boar King, the Silver Moon Wolf King, the Bear King, and the Tiger King.","The Silver Moon Wolf King lived in Wild Wolf Valley, a level 4 zone.","The Bear King appeared alone in the Desolate Forest, with no minion groups, though some beast monsters roamed nearby.","The Bear King’s lair was a cave.","There was a known strategy for the Bear King: lure it out of the cave to a hive in the area, where it would get entangled with the bees and the hive itself, leaving it open for attacks.","What Huanyu Kuangba needed to do was hide near the hive. Not only could he ambush Chu Fu’s team, but he could also steal the Bear King.","As for whether they’d be hunted down by Chu Fu afterward, Huanyu Kuangba looked at the town-return scroll in his inventory and felt reassured.","As long as his teammates could hold them off for ten seconds..."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Silver Moon Wolf King's First Kill, Journey to Bear Valley","paragraphs":["Wild Wolf Valley and Wild Boar Ridge were in different directions, the only difference being that the route didn’t require crossing mountains, but it was a longer distance.","However, the flight wings were incredibly fast, and in just one hour, they reached Wild Wolf Valley.","Wild Wolf Valley spawned Level 4 wolves that roamed in packs—some as small as three, others as large as over a dozen.","If someone came alone to farm these monsters, it would be quite tough, but once players generally reached Level 4, not a blade of grass would remain in Wild Wolf Valley.","Such was the power of players.","Everyone flew over the wolves’ heads, heading to a wind-sheltered slope deep within Wild Wolf Valley. There, on a massive black rock, lay a wolf king with a silvery-white coat.","Its fur gleamed like cold metallic light under the sun, and on its forehead was the imprint of a crescent moon, faintly glowing white.","【Silvermoon Wolf King (BOSS) Level 6, HP: 250,000.】","“Land on the open ground. The Silvermoon Wolf King has a Howling Moon skill that attacks players in the air, causing dizziness. If you fall from 20 meters high, you’ll die from the impact!”","Everyone nodded and began to descend.","As they landed, the surrounding wolf packs swarmed toward them, but they were quickly cleared out.","Next, Chu Fu began planting seeds.","Now that she had reached Level 6, even though she couldn’t enter the newbie village to learn skills, Chu Fu realized she could control more plants.","At present, it was 15 plants, and the range had expanded from the initial 5 meters to 10 meters.","So, she planted 10 Dandelions and 5 Clinging Vines on the ground, creating a massive trap area.","Once the ambush was set,","Shen Chi, who had the highest agility, fired the first shot.","\"Bang!\"","The Silvermoon Wolf King was struck and immediately stood up, entering attack mode. It glared at Shen Chi, opened its mouth, and spat out a crescent-shaped projectile aimed at him.","Shen Chi rolled on the ground just in time to narrowly dodge the attack.","The Silvermoon Wolf King charged after him.","\"Beast! Your opponent is me! Look at me, you little wolf cub!\" — Taunt!","In an instant, the Silvermoon Wolf King found the woman holding the shield in front of it utterly infuriating and immediately lunged to bite her.","Jiao Jiao raised her shield to block the attack, but a red damage number still appeared above her head.","-320!","Such high damage!","But Jiao Jiao’s current HP was a full 1,050 points, so losing one-third of her health wasn’t fatal.","Moreover, having entered the village, Jiao Jiao had already unlocked her second skill.","【Shield Guard: Summons a shield to defend oneself or team members, granting a 20% HP shield and increasing defense by 150% for 30 seconds.】","A protective shield appeared around everyone.","At the same time, Suture Saint flicked a flying needle toward Jiao Jiao.","【Healing Flying Needle: Throws a silver needle, granting healing equal to 120% of the caster’s magical attack power.】","With the combination of 【Acupuncture】 and 【Healing Flying Needle】, Jiao Jiao’s health was pulled back up.","They had it under control!","Then, Jiao Jiao gradually led the Silvermoon Wolf King toward the trap.","But in the next moment, the Silvermoon Wolf King flashed a cunning smile and leaped back out of range.","“Damn, is this boss really this smart?”","“The AI is too good—did it see us setting the trap?”","Chu Fu wasn’t surprised.","Because these bosses would later invade reality, and the Silvermoon Wolf King was a boss of very high intelligence.","Moreover, among the newbie village bosses, this one was actually the hardest to kill, holding the record for wiping out a 2,000-player team.","\"Don't be afraid, keep using Taunt. I'm moving the plants!\"","Bet you didn't see that coming? Her traps could move!","Then, Chu Fu manipulated the plants to start moving, chasing down the Silvermoon Wolf King.","Jiao Jiao used Taunt!","The Silvermoon Wolf King once again felt an abnormal hatred toward Jiao Jiao.","And just then, Chu Fu commanded the Clinging Vine to bind the target, while the Electric Saw Dandelion began spinning wildly.","\"┗|`O′|┛ Roar~~!\"","The Silvermoon Wolf King let out a piercing howl in pain.","No use crying now!","Chu Fu started applying poison.","Deadly Venom, Slow, Plague Spread!","Shen Chi began releasing explosive mini-robots, and Xie Lin charged to the wolf king's flank, slashing at its waist with a flurry of sword strikes, each hit a critical blow dealing massive damage.","An hour later!","The bound and tangled Silvermoon Wolf King let out a reluctant, angry howl before collapsing to the ground.","【Congratulations! Your team has achieved the first kill of the Silvermoon Wolf King on server 0308888. As the first-kill reward, you receive: All stats +2, one Silver Treasure Chest.】","【A global announcement is about to be released. Hide ID?】","\"Don't hide!\"","【Global Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plant Person\", \"Rocket on a Wheelchair\", \"Who Called Me Blind\", \"Jiao Jiao Not Spoiled\", \"Suture Saint\" have killed the field boss Silvermoon Wolf King, achieving the server's first kill! Rewards have been distributed.】×3","The entire server was shocked!","It had only been the third day since the game launched.","The strongest players had already taken down a level 6 boss, while they were still struggling through mutant rat nests at level 3.","How could the gap be this huge?","And Huanyu Kuangba, who was still halfway to his destination, suddenly panicked.","\"Hurry up, move faster!\"","\"Bro Ba, we can't go any faster. There are too many monsters.\"","Huanyu Kuangba had no choice and said, \"Fine, leave the assassins behind to lure the monsters away. Stop fighting. Just charge straight toward the beehive!\"","\"That'll cost us a lot of people!\"","\"Let them die. Don't forget you signed contracts with the studio. Your characters aren't yours—they belong to the studio. You still want your wages, don't you? Why be so scared of losing a game character?\"","Huanyu Kuangba yelled angrily.","But the scolding actually worked. As the assassins kept luring monsters away, the team made good progress.","...","Inside Wolf Valley.","The five people cheered and all started rubbing their hands together like flies, eager to open the chest.","\"Give me some seeds, seeds, seeds!\" Chu Fu's eyes sparkled as she looked at the Silver Treasure Chest expectantly.","After a flash of silver light, a crystal-like stone appeared in her inventory.","Chu Fu was stunned.","What's this?","She focused on it, and the system automatically displayed text.","【Skill Enhancement Stone: Can be used to enhance a skill, improving its effect.】","Holy cow!","This was the legendary Skill Enhancement Stone?","Chu Fu remembered from the novel that there was an archer named \"One Arrow Pierces the Sky\" who upgraded his Multi-Shot skill to level 11 enhancement.","Every arrow he fired unleashed a thousand arrows at once!","Incredibly terrifying.","Chu Fu looked at her three current skills.","Without hesitation, Chu Fu applied it to her only area-of-effect skill.","[Plague Transmission (Strengthened +1)]: Damage +30%, Blood-Coughing Effect +15 seconds, Auto-Contagion within 5 meters, reduces Movement Speed and Defense by 50%. Under mutual contagion, can stack an additional 3 layers.","Increased damage and range. Not only that, but stacking 3 layers of poison instantly boosts this skill by over three times!","Chu Fu couldn't even imagine how satisfying it would be to have such a skill during the village defense battle.","The others weren't as lucky as Chu Fu, but they still unlocked Silver-tier equipment. Shen Chi found it both amusing and frustrating—he had drawn another weapon, as if he were supposed to become a dual-wielding gunslinger?","As for the boss drop equipment, it was all Bronze-tier. However, having run the Nightmare-level dungeon so many times, everyone was already fully decked out in Bronze gear.","All equipment was collected by Jiao Jiao who didn't act spoiled and contributed 30 silver coins to the team. Chu Fu took the Wolf King's Heart.","[Wages have been distributed. Your contribution in this battle is 42%, earning you 12 silver coins and 600 copper coins.]","After wrapping things up, Chu Fu was still craving more action!","\"Since we're already here, how about we take down the Bear King too?\""]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Provoking the Bear into Action: The Instant Annihilation of the Cosmic Tyrant","paragraphs":["Inside the Silent Forest.","Huanyu Kuangba and his group finally reached the location of the beehive.","The bees in the hive were only level 1, but each one was the size of a fist, and their buzzing could be heard from a hundred meters away.","Huanyu Kuangba led his people to ambush nearby, hiding in the grass.","Just like in certain games where entering grass provides cover and stealth effects, 【Primordial Gate】 had very thoughtfully implemented the same feature.","So, over a hundred people scattered and hid in the grass, leaving almost no trace when viewed from the sky.","They had only been lying there for ten minutes.","Five mechanical bone wings flew across the sky.","Huanyu Kuangba communicated with his team via text: “Pay attention, they’re coming. They’re definitely going to lure the Bear King near the beehive later.","You can’t fly near the beehive, or you’ll be swarmed by countless bees.","Once they wear the Bear King’s health down to 10%, we come out.","Oh, and kill that plant lady first!”","“Got it, Bro Ba!”","“Avenge the brothers!”","“Tear that little witch apart!”","They communicated through text in the team chat, not even daring to breathe loudly for fear that Chu Fu might discover them.","Chu Fu indeed didn’t notice them, and instead had Shen Chi lure the monster.","The Bear King also had a Roar skill, preventing air attacks, but its movement speed wasn’t high. With Chu Fu casting Slow and Plague Spread, the Bear King became even slower.","The only concern was that Chu Fu’s damage output was too high, and Shen Chi might not hold the Bear King’s aggro.","Fortunately, he was now a Dual Pistol God of War, with significantly increased damage, as he led the Bear King ahead.","Soon, Shen Chi reached the area near the beehive.","The massive beehive stood five meters tall, covered in dense layers of bees. Shen Chi sped past and even fired a shot at the beehive.","In an instant, the beehive was pierced, and sweet honey began to flow out.","The Bear King sniffed the air, abandoned Shen Chi, and turned to attack the beehive.","“Start attacking!”","Chu Fu released 15 Dandelions, along with Poison and Slow spells.","However, she didn’t dare cast Plague Spread, fearing it would kill the bees, leaving no monsters to hold the Bear King in place.","“We need to be fast! The Bear King healing by eating honey will restore its health and gradually increase its attack power. If we don’t kill it before it finishes the honey, we’re the ones who die!”","Chu Fu reminded the group.","Everyone nodded in agreement.","Chu Fu had a deep understanding of the game’s mechanics—perhaps thanks to her “big brother.”","What kind of top-tier player he must be! They grew more curious by the moment.","Meanwhile, a hundred meters away, inside the Huanyu Workshop, a Hunter with the “Eagle Eye” talent exclaimed in shock.","“Bro Ba! Their damage output is insane! The Bear King had 500,000 HP, and now it’s down to 450,000!”","“And it’s only been five minutes!”","“400,000 now!”","“300,000!”","“100,000, Bro Ba!”","Originally planning to act at 50,000 HP, Huanyu Kuangba couldn’t wait any longer.","“Move early! Hurry!”","In an instant, everyone jumped out from the grass and charged forward.","“Kill!”","“Banzai!”","“Damn, who yelled that? Can’t you keep quiet during an ambush?”","But the game was too realistic. As they thought about cornering the plant lady and her group, they got blood pumping and couldn’t help shouting.","Chu Fu immediately spotted the enemies—a horde of Huanyu Workshop members charging in.","Too many!","Crowded, at least a hundred.","If she retreated now, she’d be handing over the Bear King.","No way!","Chu Fu’s small face tightened, her cheeks puffed out, and her wide, round eyes glared furiously. As she saw the assassins in the front, she raised her Malevolent Staff.","“You’re standing pretty close together.”","A pink poisonous mist fell into the crowd.","【Plague Spread】.","What happened next was terrifying.","Chu Fu had never experienced 【Plague Spread】, but as the pink mist spread, players who inhaled it suddenly felt feverish, with swollen lymph nodes.","“Cough, cough, cough!”","They coughed up blood and their speed plummeted.","What’s more, the Plague Spread had a five-meter radius, instantly causing a chain reaction.","One, two, three.","It spread like a plague.","In a flash, players fell like cut wheat, row after row.","Huanyu Kuangba, standing at the back with two teams of healers and four archers, stared in disbelief.","His over a hundred workshop members—","Caught in the pink mist, they all died in under ten seconds?!","Is this even a game a human can play?","“Damn, are you cheating? How is this possible? How?!”","Huanyu Kuangba roared.","At that moment, a figure suddenly appeared.","Three shadows formed a triangle around Huanyu Kuangba.","His pupils shrank.","The next moment, three greatswords slammed into him.","-265","-218","-232","“Heal!” The healers’ spells landed on him instantly.","But the danger wasn’t over. The three shadows merged into one.","The face with a blindfold, sharp jawline, appeared in Huanyu Kuangba’s sight.","【Sky Piercing Strike】","-850! (Critical damage)","Huanyu Kuangba was only level 3, and his gear couldn’t compare to Jiao Jiao’s.","This strike sent Huanyu Kuangba crashing to the ground.","Dead!","“I told you, I’d collect some interest first,” Xie Lin said coldly.","Chu Fu sincerely praised, “Sword Saint Brother, you’re really handsome!”","Then she casually cast 【Plague Spread】 on the group of healers.","The last fifteen people didn’t escape death either.","Chu Fu’s name was now so red it was almost black.","In fact, the black name even seemed to radiate a mist, like an evil aura of death pulsing.","Terrifying.","Paired with her frail body, it looked full of dissonance.","“Wow, your red name is so cool!” Jiao Jiao exclaimed.","“Wow, wow, wow! We hit the jackpot!” Chu Fu ignored the red name above her head and focused on the ground—over a hundred bodies.","In 【Primordial Gate】, death meant account deletion.","All these people were around level 3, each carrying four or five pieces of equipment—that’s four or five hundred pieces!","And that wasn’t even counting the copper coins, potions, materials, etc.","How was that not a jackpot?","There was too much to pick up—impossible to collect it all!","Chu Fu’s eyes sparkled, eager to loot the bodies now. Luckily, the corpses had a one-hour respawn time, so there was still time.","“Quick, quick! Kill the Bear King first! Then we all loot together—everyone gets a share!”","Chu Fu glared fiercely at the Bear King, as if it were delaying her looting spree.","Xie Lin walked back from a distance and looked at Jiao Jiao.","“Don’t forget that bounty. Just because I’m your teammate now doesn’t mean you don’t have to pay up. I need to buy a gaming pod!”","“Why didn’t you say so earlier? I could’ve lent you some to pay back slowly, and you still waited two days?” Jiao Jiao immediately transferred one million to him."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: The Traitor of Humanity, the Werewolf Turg","paragraphs":["Ten minutes later.","[Congratulations! Your team achieved the first server kill of the Roaring Bear King on server 0308888. As the first server kill, you receive a first-kill reward: All attributes +3, one Silver Treasure Chest.]","[A global announcement is about to be released. Do you want to hide your ID?]","“Do not hide!”","[Global Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Vegetable,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Who Are You Calling Blind,\" \"King Jiao Jiao,\" and \"Suture Saint\" have defeated the field boss Roaring Bear King, achieving the first server kill! Rewards have been distributed.] x3.","Without even bothering to open the silver treasure chest,","Chu Fu immediately ran over to loot the corpse.","Naturally, the others followed to help.","Like opening blind boxes,","they all stuffed whatever they picked up into their backpacks first. Finally, when they could carry no more, they piled the rest in an empty clearing.","There was no end to the picking up,","absolutely no end.","“Sword Saint Brother, why didn’t you loot Huanyu Kuangba’s pack? He was pretty loaded!”","Xie Lin smirked slightly.","“If you want to loot him, go ahead. I just took the kill.”","Without him, Chu Fu could still have taken down Huanyu Kuangba!","They were no longer even in the same league.","“You might not be so sure about that. Look at this.”","Chu Fu pulled out a scroll.","[Teleport Scroll]: Upon activation, returns to the newbie village after 10 seconds.","“With my poison, if he had a dozen healers on him, he probably could have escaped.”","“But he’s too poor. Only 50 silver coins?”","“He did have a full set of Black Iron gear—10 pieces in total—and 4 backpacks. I’ll give it all to Sword Saint Brother!”","Since she hadn’t killed Huanyu Kuangba herself, Chu Fu wouldn’t take his loot.","There were 152 corpses remaining. The tragic part was that not one of them had enough to make a single silver coin. But adding it all up, piece by piece, they scraped together 5 silver coins—an average of a little over 30 copper coins per person.","Chu Fu suspected those guys had been completely cleaned out by Huanyu Kuangba, who had then sold off all the silver coins, leaving only a little for emergencies.","Chu Fu decided to distribute the silver coins as a bonus, giving one silver coin to each person.","Unexpectedly, Xie Lin also handed out his silver coins, giving each person 10 silver coins.","“I feel bad always making money off you guys. This is unexpected loot, let’s share it,” Xie Lin said.","King Jiao Jiao immediately gave away 100 silver coins on the spot.","“Today we wiped out the Huanyu studio. Lord Jiao Jiao is rewarding everyone—each person gets a share!”","“Thank you, King Jiao Jiao!” Suture Saint called out obediently.","Chu Fu quickly chimed in with a smile, “Thank you, King Jiao Jiao!”","It was so wonderful, the team getting along so harmoniously.","In just a few days, Chu Fu had fully integrated into this game and found some friends to play with.","Unfortunately, they wouldn’t be leveling up together for much longer.","That’s right—after this boss fight, Chu Fu planned to go level up on her own.","Because she needed to reduce the sin points over her head.","Not only that, but some of the achievements for the [Primal Gate] required her to do them alone.","But the problem right now was this huge pile of equipment in front of her.","“How are we supposed to transport this all back? We don’t have enough backpack space. Should we call someone to help?” King Jiao Jiao said.","Chu Fu also felt frustrated.","A piece of Plain White gear was worth about 30 copper coins. Five or six hundred pieces would barely fetch 15 silver coins.","It wasn’t worth the trouble of rounding up a large group just for that.","But just taking the Black Iron gear and leaving the rest felt too wasteful.","As someone from a farming civilization, she hated waste above all else.","She wanted to take even the junk back.","“Wait, let me try tying them up with some Twisting Vine!” Chu Fu said, unwilling to give up.","Right then, Shen Chi spoke up.","“No need to go to all that trouble. I’ll take them all, use them to synthesize equipment.”","He pulled out a blue-colored piece of equipment and tossed it in the air, a smug look on his face: “I got a mechanical core from my silver treasure chest. I can build a mech with it. These equipment pieces will be dismantled, fused, and become parts of my mech!”","He directly traded 20 silver coins to Chu Fu, covering the five to six hundred Plain White items as well as 15 Black Iron pieces.","He also bought all the Bronze-tier gear dropped by the Bear King that no one wanted.","Xie Lin promptly contributed the 10 pieces of Black Iron gear that Huanyu Kuangba had dropped.","King Jiao Jiao also sold to Shen Chi all the Silver Moon Wolf King equipment she had bought earlier, at the same price.","Countless pieces of equipment gathered together—their white, black, and green glows seemed to intensify.","Shen Chi tossed the [Mechanical Core] onto the pile of gear, then added his own two guns on top.","Following that, he unleashed his special ability.","The mountain of equipment was instantly smashed, broken down into individual parts. Then, based on the design in Shen Chi’s mind, they gradually formed a massive four-meter-tall structure.","It took a humanoid shape, with a core in the chest, two cannon barrels on the metal arms, and a pair of metal flight wings on its back.","[Synthesized Double-Cannon Mech (Silver Grade)","Special Equipment: When used, ignores the user’s own stats and relies on the mech’s combat capabilities.","Health: 50,000, Defense: 5,000, Durability: 5,000, Attack: 1,000.","Usage requirements: Mechanic, Mech Pilot.]","It was incredibly strong!","Even though two silver-grade items and one silver-grade material hadn’t produced a Gold-grade mech, the attack power was more than enough.","For context, Chu Fu’s current magic attack power was only 382 points—though her poison skills and plant skills had various bonuses that made her effective.","But compared to this, the enemy’s defense and health didn’t stand a chance.","“Wow!!!”","Everyone gasped.","“I feel like I’m going to be out of a job. Can’t warriors use this mech too? I could drive it!” King Jiao Jiao exclaimed.","Chu Fu, however, was thinking about something else.","With this kind of defense and health,","they might be able to challenge the newbie village’s final boss!","But before she could speak, a strange, oddly-toned voice rang out.","A very tall figure, cloaked in a robe, emerged from behind the trees.","“I seem to smell... the sweet aroma of rotting human flesh.”","Chu Fu looked up, squinting at the figure for a moment. A flicker of confusion crossed her face before something clicked, and her eyes lit up.","How could she have forgotten this person?","This NPC,","“Who are you? Wow, you’re not a special NPC, are you? Is there anything we can do to help you?” On her very first day, King Jiao Jiao had run tons of quests and learned how to deal with NPCs, so she spoke very politely.","But the other let out a cold snort. “You are not worthy to speak with me.”","Chu Fu smiled. “Then who is worthy?”","Her hand was hidden behind her back, where she quietly tossed a dandelion seed onto the ground.","The team had long since become a well-coordinated group. Their initially loose stance turned upright, and they began to go on high alert.","“That would be you, of course—the butcher of humanity, the killer, the lover of bloodshed and war... the sinner!”","“Would you like to join the chaotic faction? Sever ties with those foolish humans, throw yourself into the embrace of the evil god, and the god will grant you power!”","[System Notification: Your sin points are too high, attracting the attention of Tu Ge, the wolf-man of the evil faction.]","It invites you to join the evil god’s faction. Choose to join or refuse. Please note: refusal will provoke the wrath of Werewolf Tu Ge, and he will launch an attack against you!","Tu Ge is a Level 10 Epic Divine Servant, extremely dangerous!"]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Wolfman Turg, the Terrifying Divine Servant Boss","paragraphs":["Chu Fu neither clicked accept nor declined.","The team’s text channel was already scrolling wildly.","[Jiao Jiao Isn’t Fragile]: Holy crap, what is this? A hidden quest? Hidden storyline?","[Shen Chi]: Doesn’t seem trustworthy.","[Xie Lin]: This isn’t good.","[Suture Saint]: Needles prepped and ready.","[Chu Fu]: It’s a bad quest. Can’t accept it. I’ll attack first in a bit—get ready.","Chu Fu looked at the werewolf Tu Ge and said, “What kind of power can the Evil God grant? If you’re just telling me with your mouth, there’s no way I’m agreeing!”","The werewolf Tu Ge wasn’t surprised.","He knew humans were a greedy race who wouldn’t do anything without benefits.","Especially inside the [Primordial Gate].","So the werewolf Tu Ge pulled out a mask.","The mask was dazzling gold.","Its stats were displayed directly, making everyone gasp.","[Disguiser’s Mask (Gold Tier)","Physical & Magical Attack +50","All Stats +10","Special Trait 1: Allows the wearer to change their ID and hide their Sin Value.","Special Trait 2: Allows adjustment of facial features by 50%.","Special Item, Soulbound, Scaling Equipment","Next upgrade: Kill count: 1000.]","Except for Chu Fu, everyone else sucked in a sharp breath, contributing to global warming.","The stats were simply monstrous.","Only Chu Fu knew that the better the reward, the more terrible the price.","In the game, turning to the evil faction wasn’t a big deal.","But when the game invaded reality and monsters ran rampant in your homeland—and you were no longer on humanity’s side but had to complete missions that destroyed them?","Refuse, and you’d suffer worse than death.","Evil God loot was never a free lunch.","Chu Fu naturally refused.","She was just stalling.","She’d already decided to fight. Dragging it out earlier let her open the Silver Chest, hoping for new gear to improve her odds of killing the werewolf Tu Ge.","The Silver Chest finally surprised her.","[Mutated Watermelon Seed (Silver Tier): Can be mutated. When forced to grow, yields a Watermelon Bomb with a blast radius of 5 meters.]","Chu Fu’s eyes lit up.","Then she said, “Everyone, fall back five meters. I need a private chat with this Lord Divine Servant!”","The others understood Chu Fu’s intent and stepped back.","The werewolf Tu Ge was very satisfied.","“Human butcher, put it on.”","“Savor the blood.”","“You were born to stand on the side of chaos.”","“Your two companions have potential too—both seeds of evil.”","“These two won’t do it.”","“Later, you can kill them. Inherit their wealth.”","“Let their blood stain the mask, become the Disguiser’s dye.”","Chu Fu didn’t agree or disagree.","Her grape-like eyes narrowed into a smile.","“Lord Divine Servant, since you gave me such a big gift, let me give you something too—a specialty from our land of flowers.","This is a watermelon I just cultivated!","Have a taste!”","As she spoke, Chu Fu planted the silver-glowing seed into the ground and forced it to grow.","Instantly, watermelon vines appeared. Chu Fu stepped back a few paces to create distance.","On the vines, flowers bloomed and fruits formed. The watermelons grew visibly until they were the size of washbasins.","Huge watermelons.","Using her plant manipulation, Chu Fu made the vines lift a watermelon and place it into the werewolf Tu Ge’s hands.","Chu Fu’s plant mutations weren’t considered attack skills. They only counted as attacking when she used plant manipulation to command them to strike.","Right now, the werewolf Tu Ge had no idea danger was near. Seeing the giant watermelon, he nodded approvingly.","“Is this your offering?”","“Then I’ll reluctantly accept it.”","“But you should know, the best offering to the Evil God is actually humans—bloody meat.”","While he was speaking smugly, the watermelon in his arms suddenly swelled and cracked. The next moment, a terrifying shockwave erupted.","“Boom!”","Rinds, seeds, and flesh exploded in all directions. Everything within five meters was flattened, the grass dissolving relentlessly.","The attack on the werewolf Tu Ge revealed his health bar.","[Werewolf Tu Ge (Epic Tier Divine Servant) Level: 10 HP: 900,000 / 1,000,000]","Chu Fu had blasted away a full 100,000 HP.","Sure enough, that Silver Tier mutated seed was something special.","“Boss is aggro! Boss is aggro!”","Chu Fu swung her Malice Staff.","[Slow]","Against a boss with high attack and high agility, slow it down first.","By now, the werewolf Tu Ge was a mess. His ruined hood had torn apart from the blast, hanging off him like strips of cloth. It revealed his black fur, terrifyingly muscular physique, and the reverse-jointed dog legs.","His hands were furry, with claws 30 centimeters long like ten steel blades.","He lunged at Chu Fu.","“Shield Guard!”","A shield-like barrier appeared in front of Chu Fu, boosting her defense. The werewolf Tu Ge’s attack landed on her, shattering the shield instantly and triggering the rebound effect of her Green Mushroom Skirt.","Chu Fu backed away while chugging health potions as Suture Saint’s flying needles hit her body.","“Get lost, you wolf pup! Your opponent is me! Roar, roar, roar!” Jiao Jiao Isn’t Fragile bellowed.","Taunt skill!","The werewolf Tu Ge’s gaze shifted to Jiao Jiao Isn’t Fragile. He leaped again and swiped his claws at her.","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Fragile raised her shield to block!","-500!","The damage was horrifying!","Suture Saint switched targets to heal, while Jiao Jiao Isn’t Fragile downed her own red potions.","Chu Fu shouted again, “Humanoid bosses don’t have a beast’s size advantage! They can be controlled! Sword Saint Brother, hit him!”","As she spoke, she frantically tossed Clinging Vines.","But growing them took time.","Xie Lin hoisted his greatsword and appeared to the right of Tu Ge. The heavy blade smashed down on the werewolf’s head.","Instantly, a [Stun] icon appeared above the werewolf Tu Ge’s head.","But the stun only lasted about 0.5 seconds before he snapped out of it.","His hatred immediately shifted to Xie Lin.","As a high-intelligence NPC, even Taunt only lasted about a second, and its cooldown made continuous use impossible.","Xie Lin wasn’t flustered. He pressed on.","In that moment, his masterful swordsmanship unleashed a devastating combo.","Knee! Hit!","The werewolf Tu Ge stumbled!","Waist! Weak point!","Tu Ge’s body bent backward uncontrollably, letting out a pained cry.","Shoulder! Another weak point!","Xie Lin struck hard, forcing the wolf to one knee.","Xie Lin’s combat prowess showed perfectly here.","He locked the boss down for a full 3 seconds.","Chu Fu’s Clinging Vines finally matured.","Countless vines surged forward.","His time was up!","“ROOOAR!”","The werewolf Tu Ge bellowed. His body expanded until he became a 3-meter-tall giant wolf. He had transformed!","He burst free from the vines and became immune to Xie Lin’s controls.","At this moment, the heavy sword could barely suppress Werewolf Tuge. With a wave of his hand, he moved to slash Xie Lin's throat.","【Illusory Sword Shadow】","Xie Lin left behind only three afterimages where he stood, having already fled far away!","\"Trying to escape? You think I'd let you get away with that? Die!\"","Werewolf Tuge roared in fury. At the same time, a claw strike shot through the air, actually hitting the spot where Xie Lin had been."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Golden Equipment, Sharing a Guide with Everyone","paragraphs":["Xie Lin’s body dodged in a flash.","His talent [Heart’s Eye] activated: Blind Dodge!","He evaded it.","But the shockwave still sent Xie Lin flying, dealing 450 damage as he crashed through the air.","+300!","Suture Saint’s healing needle struck Xie Lin.","He slammed into a massive tree, taking another 200 damage. If Suture Saint hadn’t healed him, Xie Lin would have already deleted his character.","Chu Fu’s heart clenched as if a giant hand had squeezed it. Thankfully, the danger passed.","[Taunt]","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao took the aggro again.","But the werewolf had grown even larger. She could only take two hits before dying!","Just then, another giant appeared.","“Leave it to me!”","Shen Chi’s massive mech was finally fully assembled, charging forward.","“Boom!”","The mech’s fist slammed into the enemy, and the arm-mounted guns began to glow blue.","“Rat-tat-tat-tat-tat-tat!”","Like a Gatling gun firing.","It all seemed to stretch on forever—","But only five seconds had passed since the watermelon bomb exploded.","Nerve-wracking!","Still, the situation stabilized.","“Crush him!” roared Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, charging in with her shield to attack.","Countless creeping vines crawled up Weredog Tuge, binding him.","Poison Art!","Slow Art!","Plague Spread!","As the toxins stacked, Weredog Tuge’s movements grew slower and more clumsy, fear flickering in his eyes like a human’s.","Chu Fu’s Poison Master wasn’t a burst class. But the longer the fight lasted, the deadlier the poison grew, and the stronger her damage became.","Three minutes later, Weredog Tuge’s giant mutation ended, shrinking him down to just two meters tall!","Shen Chi’s mech struck him like a father beating his son.","The mech only had 50,000 HP, and Weredog Tuge could still tear it apart. But Shen Chi was a Mechanic; he could repair machines.","So the mech’s HP recovered again.","Add in Jiaojiao Bu Jiao’s taunts, Xie Lin’s forced knockback control, and Chu Fu’s vine binds, Slow Art, and Plague—","This werewolf was already dead!","And though Weredog Tuge had a massive HP pool of one million, being a humanoid boss, his defense was very low.","In just twenty minutes!","This epic boss’s health bar was emptied!","But even with his HP gone, the boss still rambled on.","“Don’t think I’m dead! This body is just one of my avatars. Who wants to be a Plant Girl? I’ll remember that name!","The evil god lives forever!","Humanity will fall!","When the gods descend, you’ll only wail, scream, and become blood food.","Then you’ll regret today’s choice.”","Chu Fu stomped her foot onto the boss’s head.","“Then bring it on! I’m waiting. My brother and I will cross the Primordial Gate and wipe out every monster invading Earth.”","Chu Fu pressed down hard, stepping on him. Her pale, sickly face held a hint of fierceness as Weredog Tuge turned into black ash burned to nothing.","[You have slain Weredog Tuge!]","[Your level has increased to 8!]","On the ground, only a golden mask remained.","Mask of the Impostor (Gold).","That Golden-tier equipment had finally dropped for Chu Fu.","Or rather, this was simply the reward for killing the Werewolf Tuge.","\"Wow, Plant Girl, you were really into it back there! The immersion was strong, like something a member of the protagonist team would say. But why did it have to be you and your brother, instead of you and the rest of us?\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao asked.","Chu Fu couldn't help but feel a bit awkward. Ah, she had just been thinking about the original storyline and felt genuine anger toward the boastful Tuge, so the words came out naturally. Now that she thought back, it felt like she had acted like a chuunibyou girl.","Her toes were practically digging a three-bedroom, one-living-room apartment inside her boots!","\"Ha! I didn't mean to do that! It's definitely because this NPC is too lifelike—I just got caught up in the act!\"","Shen Chi pursed his lips and smiled, saying, \"Plant Girl is still young. Hmm, maybe her mental age is only fifteen—right in the chuunibyou phase!\"","Xie Lin raised an eyebrow. \"Is that what you call chuunibyou? I've had chuunibyou for over twenty years, because the Blind Monk is my faith!","But,","what this so-called Werewolf Tuge said is probably part of the main storyline of the Origin Gate. Maybe through this information, we can pick up a main quest in areas with lots of NPCs.\"","\"Am I the only one concerned that we only got one piece of gold equipment? My hands are sore from all the healing!\"","The twenty minutes she spent casting healing skills were more than what she'd used in three days of gaming—thrilling and dangerous, a real test of her nerve. If she hadn't studied medicine, she would've been totally flustered.","\"Sister Suture, you were amazing!\" Chu Fu gave a thumbs-up, then said, \"That's because this boss isn't a regular boss. It only drops this one piece of equipment, and it's bound, so I have to take it myself.\"","[Equipment Binding: Who Wants to Be a Plant Girl!]","Chu Fu didn't want her friends to help for free, so she said:","\"How about I put in some money to give everyone bonuses.","Also, I'll share this information. If you ever need it in the future, just call me, and we can kill Werewolf Tuge again.\"","Chu Fu directly contributed 100 silver. If a gold piece of equipment actually dropped, it might be worth more than that, but Tuge's difficulty was a bit lower than what a gold boss would require.","Chu Fu made sure no one took a loss, but she didn't want to put herself at too much of a disadvantage either.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, however, lit up and asked, \"So this gold equipment can be farmed infinitely?\"","\"Obviously, the NPC was attracted because Plant Girl had 10,000 sin points. It's just not easy to pull off—did everyone from the Universal Studio die off?\" Xie Lin frowned.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao slapped her thigh.","\"Forget about the Universal Studio—just shout it out loud. Someone will eventually sell a character for 10,000 blocks. At worst, she can start playing later.\"","Chu Fu smirked.","Even with her blindfold covering it, Xie Lin's face showed a look of utter despair, as if he wanted to fight Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","Chu Fu quickly eased the tension, saying:","\"Alright, since everyone has figured out this strategy, let me share another one!\"","Chu Fu pointed mysteriously at the beehive.","\"In the Origin Gate, besides the first-kill system, there's also an achievement system.","If you kill 100,000 of the same monster, you get 1 achievement point, plus 1 extra point to all attributes.\"","At the moment, the easiest task in the entire novice village is this honeycomb bee quest. All you have to do is go to the novice village, find an NPC, buy some bombs, and blow up the beehive to complete the mission.","The beehive respawns every 24 hours. I’m taking this wave first!","But since achievements require you to do them solo, I’ll have to leave the group."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: The Furious Cosmic Overlord Comes to Attack","paragraphs":["Chu Fu left the team and then used \"Plague Transmission\" on the beehive.","In an instant, the entire beehive was enveloped in a pink mist, and the infection spread rapidly.","The buzzing sound gradually diminished, and all the fist - sized bees inside the beehive died.","Soon, Chu Fu heard the system prompt.","\"Congratulations! You have completed the achievement 'Bee Swarm Killer!' You have accumulated 100,000 bee kills. Reward: +1 to all attributes. Your damage to bee - type monsters is increased by 10%, and the hatred value of bee - type monsters towards you is increased by 10%.\"","It's done!","Her physical strength, agility, and spirit each increased by 1 point again.","Chu Fu cultivated a huge watermelon and threw it under the beehive, shattering the two - story - high beehive.","Suddenly, royal jelly and honeycomb honey were scattered everywhere.","\"Honey (Black - iron - grade material): After use, it restores 100 points of physical strength and 100 points of magic power. It can also be used as a material for alchemy, medicine - refining, cooking, etc.\"","\"If a bee nest is discovered, many people will come for these materials. It'll be difficult to complete this achievement later!\" Chu Fu reminded.","\"This strategy is really valuable! Netizens are really tight - lipped. They don't say a word about it!\" Jiaojiao Bugujiao quickly took notes.","\"Where are you going next?\" Shen Chi seemed to have a premonition and looked at Chu Fu.","Chu Fu naturally still had a lot of things to do.","\"I have a Disguiser Mask. I'm going to go back to the village to learn some life skills and level - 5 skills!\"","Jiaojiao Bugujiao said, \"I'm going to find someone to buy sin points.\"","Xie Lin said, \"Someone is knocking on the door. Maybe it's the delivery of the game pod!\"","\"Then shall we disperse? Wuwu, without you guys, I don't know how to level up!\" Suture Saint said. After killing three bosses in a row, her level had directly jumped to level 7, so she couldn't play the dungeon anymore.","Jiaojiao Bugujiao said, \"I'll buy you some kills. The mask also gives an additional +10 to all attributes. You must get it!\"","\"Thank you, Queen Jiaojiao!\"","Seeing this situation, Shen Chi also sighed helplessly and finally said, \"Okay, then I'll go with you guys to buy them too.\"","Xie Lin: I'm logging off. I'm not feeling well.","\"You're going back to the village. Use this return - to - town scroll. I can't use it anyway.\" Xie Lin gave the return - to - town scroll he got from Huanyu Kuangba to Chu Fu and then logged off.","And Chu Fu didn't want to waste more than an hour, so she naturally chose to use it.","Items are meant to be used.","Chu Fu put on the Disguiser Mask without changing her face, and she also left her ID as it was.","She could change her ID when doing bad things. There was no need to do it now.","After wearing it, in an instant, her black - and - red name like blood turned into a white one!","Chu Fu took out the return - to - town scroll that dropped from Huanyu Kuangba. The scroll unfolded, and magic runes circled around her, forming a teleportation array under her feet.","The next moment, her vision changed.","Great! After so many days in the game, she finally returned to the safe zone.","...","An hour ago.","Inside the Wantu Group Building in Linjiang City, Huanyu Kuangba took off his game helmet and let out a roar!","\"Damn it! God - damned Blind Man, don't ever let me see you again!\"","Huanyu Kuangba's eyes were filled with madness, and he was completely enraged.","His behavior immediately caught the attention of those around him.","\"Team Leader Guan, what's wrong? Are you so angry? Did your character die again?\"","A secretary in a neat suit immediately walked over, looked down at him condescendingly, and there was scrutiny in her eyes.","In his rage, Guan Liqiang gradually calmed down.","The woman in front of him was Feng Huimin, a secretary sent by Wan Huanyu to assist them in their daily lives.","Previously, he had flirted with Feng Huimin, thinking that a woman like her would never have looked at him before, but now she was his secretary. He even thought he might be able to take liberties with her.","But then she showed him her Taekwondo black - belt certificate and told him to stop his petty actions and work honestly.","At that time, Guan Liqiang felt extremely uncomfortable.","However, Wan Huanyu did give him money and invest in him, so Guan Liqiang ignored those arrogant looks.","Now it seemed that Feng Huimin had long looked down on him!","She had long wanted to kick him out of the studio.","\"Stay out of my business. You don't need to worry about it. I'll report directly to Master Wan.\"","As Guan Liqiang was speaking, his phone started vibrating wildly.","There were constant messages on the phone, and people were leaving messages on various apps.","He was able to gather more than a hundred brothers, and he did have some influence. But now that all the characters were dead, they had to re - apply.","His scalp went numb.","Most importantly, Feng Huimin was also in the work group that Guan Liqiang had created.","Feng Huimin also noticed this situation. She opened her tablet and quickly learned the whole story.","She looked at Guan Liqiang coldly and curled her lips.","\"Guan Liqiang, your wrong decision has led to the death of all the more than 200 players in the studio.","I think you're not suitable to be the team leader. From now on, I'll take over the 200 people in your studio.","Write a self - criticism report and send it to Master Wan. Otherwise, you'll be responsible for the losses you've caused to the studio.","I'm afraid you've invested more than 20 million in Area 030 this time!\"","Twenty million. He would never earn that much money in his whole life.","Thinking of this, Guan Liqiang grabbed his balding head in a state of collapse.","Just then, his phone pinged.","A picture appeared on Guan Liqiang's phone.","\"[Picture]. Brother Qiang, did you look for the Blind Man before? Does this look like him? But this blind man is wearing sunglasses, and the one you were looking for had a cloth over his eyes.\"","Guan Liqiang grabbed his phone as if he had caught a life - saving straw.","\"Yes! It's him. Where is he? I'm going to kill him.\"","Regardless of what Feng Huimin was about to say, Guan Liqiang grabbed his phone and ran!","He made phone calls, only thinking about crazy revenge.","\"Brother Qiang, this Blind Man had a conflict with a friend of mine. About two months ago, my friend drank some wine and wanted to make friends with a girl. Then this Blind Man saw it and meddled in other people's business. He even beat up my friend.","My friend said he lives in Tianhui Community on Xiangnan Street, near the shabby market. I'll send you the specific house number. If you want to cause trouble for him, I'll tell my friend, and he'll definitely be willing to go with you.\"","\"Okay, call as many people as you can. I'll make this Blind Man know what it means to mess with me!\"","Guan Liqiang gathered his men and then took a taxi to Xie Lin's home.","An hour later, Guan Liqiang brought twelve people to Xie Lin's door and started knocking.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","...","[System Prompt: The external noise is too loud. It seems to be a knocking sound. Do you want to log off?]","After Xie Lin got the reward from Jiaojiao Bugujiao, he immediately placed an order for a game pod. He thought it was the delivery of the game pod.","Considering that there were outsiders coming to his home, he picked up his blind stick and put on sunglasses to avoid scaring others before going to open the door.","His ears twitched. The door of the old - fashioned residential building was not sound - proof. Since he went blind, his hearing had become sharper, and he could even distinguish people by their breathing and footsteps.","It must be the delivery of the game pod.","Is it necessary to have more than a dozen people?","Xie Lin opened the door with a puzzled look on his face."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: Blind Monk vs. Twelve Gangsters: Full-Health Counterkill","paragraphs":["With the click of the door lock, the door was slammed open.","\"You're the one calling me blind, huh? I'll say it to your face—blind man, you damn blind man, acting all cocky in the game, right? Let's see how cocky you are now!\"","Guan Liqiang's roar came through.","Xie Lin stepped back, guarding against the first wave of attack.","Guan Liqiang and his crew immediately pushed into Xie Lin's home.","\"Huanyu Kuangba?\" Xie Lin, cornered, asked in response.","\"You know who I am. Calling me 'Daddy' won't save you now. Get on your knees!\"","Guan Liqiang stepped forward, swinging his palm.","Xie Lin raised his arm to block it.","Slap!","Hidden behind his arm, Xie Lin revealed an eerie smile.","\"You struck first.\"","The next moment, Xie Lin swung his blind cane.","Fight!","In an instant, Xie Lin moved like a blind monk possessed, wielding the cane as if it were a Shaolin temple's staff, making Guan Liqiang scream in pain.","\"Damn it, hit him, everyone together!\"","A group of people swarmed Xie Lin.","Xie Lin didn't act like a blind man at all—what was more terrifying was that he even knew what the people behind him were doing, striking them all in a flurry of blows.","Finally, someone grabbed Xie Lin's cane, but Xie Lin let go and launched a storm of fist attacks.","\"Run! Hurry!\"","\"Ah, he's not blind at all!\"","The group fled out of Xie Lin's door.","Xie Lin chased after them, all the way to the stairwell before stopping.","At the door, Xie Lin heard the sound of heavy objects being moved and halted his footsteps.","\"Is this the game pod for Room 442?\"","\"Yeah, that's right!\"","Two installation workers quickly replied, casting a curious glance at Xie Lin. He was wearing sunglasses in broad daylight—what a poser!","\"Follow me.\"","Inside the house, the workers looked at the empty living room and blinked in confusion, before one exclaimed, \"What's with all the blood on your floor?\"","Xie Lin looked disgusted.","\"A few rabid dogs came in to bite just now. I chased them off.\"","Really?","The two workers looked at each other, a hint of fear in their eyes.","Considering the group of thugs that had just run out, they wondered: Had they stumbled onto a gangster fight scene?","Living in a dump like this but buying a million-dollar game pod?","Was this guy some kind of crime lord?","And with blood all over the floor, had they just walked into a murder scene?","They hurried to install the game pod. Luckily, it was solar-powered, so no plugging in was needed, but the workers still had to show him how to fill the nutrient fluid.","\"Excuse me, I have trouble with my eyes. Could you tell me where the switches are?\"","\"Huh?\"","The two installers were stunned.","After confirming that Xie Lin really was blind, they finished the setup, even wiped the floor clean for him, and then left.","Thinking back to what had happened, they felt uneasy for Xie Lin, so they simply called the police.","No one should be bullying a disabled person with money. Protecting people's property was everyone's duty.","[0308888 Newbie Village]","\"Wow, so this is the newbie village for District 030. Let's check the village name first.\"","Chu Fu glanced at the entrance sign and finally learned the name of her starter village.","Wangxi Village.","Chu Fu thought for a moment, confirming that this village probably corresponded to the Wangxi scenic area northeast of Linjiang City.","If it were defended successfully, a new safe zone would appear in that location in the real world.","Before the game invaded reality, all players would receive a quest to transfer here.","Of course, if the village wasn't defended in the game, no safe zone would appear in reality.","Chu Fu roamed around excitedly, feeling as if she had stepped into a steam-age world all over again.","The village was fully designed and quite large—not some crude collection of a few huts. The buildings were dense, with a market, NPC homes, and an inn.","It looked very much like a real village, except there were no guns around; instead, wooden barricades kept out large beasts.","Chu Fu was excited by everything she saw, like a farmer visiting a big city for the first time.","Previously, she hadn't entered the village and had gone straight to the wilderness, because most tasks in the village were errands. Her high damage output naturally made fighting monsters a better choice.","Errand tasks were for players with C-rank talents or below.","Now, with players leveling up, there were still plenty of people in the village—not everyone was a combat player. Besides, the game had been open for thirty days, and many middle-aged and elderly people were logging in as casual or lifestyle players.","Given that, the chances of successfully defending the village seemed pretty low.","As Chu Fu observed her surroundings, she headed toward the skill instructor.","The skill instructor was easy to find. In front of him stood a huge, obvious crystal ball.","Currently, the average player level in the village was 3, and players at level 5 were extremely rare. Chu Fu hadn't seen any yet.","She walked over.","\"Hello, instructor. I'm here to learn a skill.\"","The skill instructor nodded at her.","\"Hello, Awakened. You should call it Awakening a Skill. Pay 50 silver coins and place your hand on the crystal ball.","This is the Orb of Wisdom. It can guide you to awaken a new skill.","If your class is recorded here, it will give you further guidance.","If your class is special, don't worry—the orb can guide you to create a new skill.","Now, pay up.\"","Chu Fu handed over 50 silver coins.","She placed both hands on the crystal ball and closed her eyes. An image of a person in a green robe appeared in her mind, showing their hands. Their hands were as white as jade with slender fingers, and then they gave a gentle toss.","A cloud of poison mist spread out.","[Plague Spread] was also a poison mist.","It felt a bit redundant, she thought, frowning.","The next moment, she felt that she had learned something.","[System Notification: You have learned the skill Poison Sowing: Use mental energy to scatter poison powder in a target direction, dealing 110% poison attack damage. The effect depends on the poison powder's quality.","Note: If you don't have poison powder, you might use the most down-to-earth items. The general store sells lime powder.","Lime powder effect: Blindness, eye irritation.]","Chu Fu's eyes widened.","This... was this not underhanded?","Throwing lime powder.","But, to be fair, lime powder was a must-buy for thieves and assassins, and players in those classes often learned poison crafting too.","Her brother Chu Feng could do it.","But they had to throw lime powder by hand during close combat.","She, however, could use mental energy to assist, hitting targets even from ten meters away.","This was... incredible.","Chu Fu rushed off to the general store to buy lime powder.","Then she went to learn Gathering, Medicine Making, and Poison Crafting. After thinking it over, she also learned Farming.","These would be useful for her Poison Master class and her talents.","But she couldn't take too many life skills—it would spread her too thin, even though they were profitable.","She didn't need that much money, though. She could just rely on her big brother.","If worse came to worst, she could sell some of her guides to Jiao Jiao and Jiao to make cash.","She was still daydreaming about all this.","Suddenly, a team invitation appeared.","[Who Are You Calling Blind has invited you to enter team mode.]","Chu Fu accepted it.","Sword Saint Brother might have switched to a new game pod and didn't know what to play, so he was asking her.","Just as she thought that, she noticed the team was gathering again.","Xie Lin typed in the team channel; even if they weren't together, everyone could see it.","[Who Are You Calling Blind]: That moron Huanyu Kuangba logged off and came to find me in real life. I beat him back—what a loser.","[Who Are You Calling Blind]: But I don't know how they found out my real identity. I have a feud with Wan Huanyu. He probably tracked me down and wants to mess with me.","[Who Are You Calling Blind]: Do you think I'm afraid of him? If he's got the guts, come kill me in real life. But I've got nothing to lose—just a worthless life. You all should watch your safety, especially Jiao Jiao and Fengzhen, you two girls. Don't leave campus or your homes recently.","[Who Are You Calling Blind]: @Plant Girl, you said before that you were in a coma three years ago, and your brother's name is Chu Feng. Do you know who hit your family back then?"]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Truth Hour: You Have No Idea How Terrifying Wan Huanyu Is","paragraphs":["Of course, Chu Fu knew who had hit her.","After all, it was clearly written in the book.","But when Xie Lin said this, Chu Fu’s mind suddenly exploded. The blurry points that had been hazy when she inherited the memories abruptly became crystal clear in her mind.","She remembered.","That day was the summer vacation after junior high graduation. There was a great animated movie showing during the summer break, and she really wanted to watch it. But every showing was packed, so her mom and dad chose the late-night session.","When it ended, it was already 11:47.","They came out of the cinema and got into the car. Her mom was supposed to sit in the front, but she insisted on clinging to her mom, so they both sat in the back together.","Her dad sat in the driver’s seat.","Her mom sat on the left side in the back, while she sat on the right.","A sports car crashed into them from behind, smashing their car to pieces!","With the roar of the impact, her mom and dad, along with the scattered fragments of the wrecked car, vanished.","If only she had let her mom sit in the passenger seat, maybe one more person would have survived.","If only she hadn’t insisted on seeing that movie.","If only...","Chu Fu gritted her teeth. Her forehead was covered in cold sweat, and her face was deathly pale. She clenched her jaw to control herself, even pulling out some honey from her backpack and eating it.","The sweet taste made the tears she shed less bitter.","She typed a message in the team chat.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: Sun Jingya, Wan Huanyu, Guan Youlong, Wang Silu.","Of course she knew the names of her enemies!","On the other side, Xie Lin understood.","He had actually recognized Chu Fu already—back when she had asked others to help contact her brother, he knew.","But as a blind man, he couldn’t help, and he didn’t remember her brother’s phone number either.","So who was it that actually helped make the contact?","And what a coincidence it was.","“Who You Calling Blind Man”: @Rocket on a Wheelchair, so you are Shen Chi, right?","“Who You Calling Blind Man”: I’ve never said this before, but I’ve always felt really guilty toward you. At that time, Sun Jingya’s car hit me and then changed direction to hit you. If I had dodged back then, maybe you wouldn’t have gotten hurt.","“Who You Calling Blind Man”: I heard you had been accepted to a great school, but had to drop out because of this.","“Who You Calling Blind Man”: But it’s different now. I heard that the Wan, Sun, Guan, and Wang families have poured a ton of money into the game and are developing studios. As long as we take out their studios, we can bankrupt their families.","“Who You Calling Blind Man”: Yeah, the law has already punished them. But I don’t think that’s enough. I just want revenge. I can’t stand the sight of them. And now they can’t hurt us anymore.","“Who You Calling Blind Man”: Because the game pods are bulletproof. If we can’t fight, we just hide inside the pods, and they can’t do a thing. If they block us in our pods, we’ll just call the cops.","Xie Lin’s words spilled out in the team chat, carrying the desperation of someone throwing everything to the wind.","But the next moment, Shen Chi, the one he had tagged, typed back.","“Rocket on a Wheelchair”: No, you don’t owe me anything. I’m the one who owes both of you.","“Rocket on a Wheelchair”: You two don’t know Wan Huanyu’s methods at all. Your plan might work against one person, but what do you do when schemes are everywhere?","“Rocket on a Wheelchair”: @King Jiao Jiao, @Suture Saint, sorry to drag you into this. But now that things have come this far, I’m not sure Wan Huanyu won’t retaliate. The two of you need to be careful—not just yourselves, but your families too.","“Rocket on a Wheelchair”: You don’t know what Wan Huanyu did to me. I...","Outside the village, in the Red-Eyed Rabbit zone.","King Jiao Jiao and Suture Saint looked at Shen Chi with worry, watching him cry in silence. The light visibly faded from his eyes, as if he had lost all his vitality. A shadow of despair spread across him.","And reading those words made them feel suffocated.","His father was framed for academic fraud.","His mother was followed.","His uncle-in-law faced a medical dispute.","His eldest uncle took the fall and had to pay damages.","His aunt was tricked out of her entire savings.","It was like a strangling net.","All for a single letter of forgiveness.","“Wheelchair! Don’t give up. I don’t believe there’s no justice in the world. Don’t worry, this time Wan Huanyu isn’t going to have everything his way. You’re my friend, and I won’t let this happen to you again!”","King Jiao Jiao’s strong hand landed on Shen Chi’s shoulder—though he had to reach down since he couldn’t quite get his shoulders from above.","“Saint, don’t be scared either!” King Jiao Jiao threw an arm around Suture Saint’s shoulders.","Suture Saint thought, I’ve accidentally offended heaven’s elite! QAQ.","How could she not be afraid?","Just looking at what Little Brother Wheelchair had said was terrifying. In her heart, worry was already blossoming.","And just then,","Chu Fu’s words appeared in the team chat.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: Wheelchair Brother, don’t be afraid.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: You’re not the one at fault. Don’t carry so much pressure. Things are different now.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: Look, three years ago, we had no power or influence. But now, this is our best chance to turn things around.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: Your relatives and friends have achieved something in real life. In the game, they’re sure to awaken amazing talents.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: As long as we’re strong enough, we can kick the Sun, Wan, Wang, and Guan families out of the game before they even know what hit them. We can make them lose everything, bankrupt them! And we can reshuffle the cards in Linjiang City.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: 【Primordial Gate】 is a very, very special game. What if I told you that one day, everything in the game could change the real-world balance? Or even that everything in the game could become reality?","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: If you don’t risk it all now, you’ll end up watching scum like Wan Huanyu—people who bully the weak and abuse their power—rise to the top. For every one of you, there will be countless others like you.","“Who Wants to Be a Plant”: Don’t you want to fight back? Brothers in arms, family in battle. Lead your whole family into the game!","“Rocket on a Wheelchair”: Is what you’re saying... true or false?","Watching Shen Chi nearby, King Jiao Jiao patted him hard again.","“Plant Girl is telling the truth. This game has already caught the attention of the top brass in the Chinese government. Every country is searching for the game company’s headquarters, but there’s no news at all. It’s like a second world that appeared out of nowhere!”","“At this point, no one knows what will happen. Either way, we have to get ahead in the game!”","“Plant Girl’s brother is a big shot in Zone 001. He must know some insider info! You have to trust her!”","“What’s Wan Huanyu? From Huan Yu Studio? Plant Girl killed 200 with one skill. In this game, you guys with S-rank talents are the kings of kings. When the servers merge later, we’ll crush them and easily bankrupt their families!”","\"If you're worried about your family, I'm running a studio right now. Bring everyone to work for me at the studio—I'll pay you all a salary that's sure to beat your current jobs!\"","King Jiao Jiao vowed with confidence.","Suture Saint immediately looked at King Jiao Jiao as if she were a deity.","\"King Jiao Jiao, I... I'll bring my family to work for you.\"","The light finally returned to Shen Chi's eyes, and even more so, a sharp edge and hatred began to emerge.","The past grievances, anger, and endurance all turned into a blaze of fury.","\"I understand.\"","Chu Fu and Xie Lin couldn't see it, but Shen Chi typed out another message.","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]: I'll gather my family together. I won't let the tragedy of before repeat.","[Who Wants to Be a Plant Girl]: Not so fast. First, we need to do something else."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: The fact that Flower Family knows kung fu can't be explained clearly, Tiger-Beater King","paragraphs":["[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: Kill the Tiger King.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: Actually, our strength is enough now, but I want to wait a bit longer. Don't want to take too big a risk.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: But the Tiger King is the final boss in the newbie village. It drops silver-tier equipment and a guild token. If we start today, we have six more chances before the village defense battle.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: If we snag the guild token and establish a real guild, we can stand up to those four big shots.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: So how about it? Want to take the risk?","[Call Me Blind?]: Of course!!!","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]: Of course.","[Proud and Not Spoiled]: Of course!","[Suture Saint]: Of course QAQ!","Just as Chu Fu was about to say they should set out, another message popped up in the team chat.","[Call Me Blind?]: Hey, wait. Someone called the cops, not sure who. I'll go handle it.","...","Xie Lin drained the nutrient solution, climbed out of the game pod, and opened the door.","Outside, two uncles in caps (police officers) and a community worker were waiting.","As soon as the door opened, the worker's loud voice rang out.","\"Little Lin, are you okay? How are you? Don't be scared. We have cameras at the entrance; we'll catch any bad guys who come!\"","Xie Lin smiled. \"Sister Yun, I'm fine. Who called the police? I didn't. Could it be from across the way? They break into my place and then dare to call the cops!\"","The officers immediately turned serious upon hearing this.","\"Tell us exactly what happened. Give us the details.\"","\"I don't want to make a big deal out of this. It's all personal grudges. Oh, and I'm in a hurry to get the first kill in my game. Can I come find you at the station later?\"","The two officers noticed the gaming pod inside and looked surprised. That was top-tier equipment, costing at least a million.","This kid... could he be a pro gamer?","Remembering instructions from higher-ups, they exchanged a glance and changed their tone.","\"That sounds pretty important. Alright, go get that first kill! We'll start checking the surveillance footage. Comrade, you come with us and tell us what you know while we pull up the recordings.\"","\"Officers, let me tell you, Little Lin's had it rough. Three years ago, he was in a car accident and lost both eyeballs. His parents divorced and took all the compensation money. He had to hire a lawyer just to get some of it back, but they still won't take care of him.","He bought a place in our community and registered with us. We check in on him by phone regularly and visit him at home. The kid's tough—he's not even 20 yet, only 19, but he can take care of himself now.","We were worried something might happen, so we installed a camera at his door and one inside the apartment, with his permission. If any thugs came to bother him, we'd see it clearly. The camera even records audio!","I don't know which bastard is bullying our Little Lin.\"","Wang Yun chattered on as she guided everyone to pull up the surveillance footage.","Soon, the video played clearly.","Then...","Officer 1: \"Kid's got some serious fighting skills!\"","Officer 2: \"This just makes it even harder to explain that kung fu isn't a Chinese thing!\"","Still, this was a serious crime.","Illegal entry. Causing trouble.","The video couldn't tell if the intruders were carrying weapons.","But if they had weapons or knives, that would mean at least three years in prison.","\"Go make the arrest first! We'll have him identify them when they're picked up... Actually, no need for identification.\"","How could a blind person identify anyone?","Just scumbags, picking on a disabled person.","...","[Call Me Blind?]: I'm back!","As soon as Xie Lin logged back in, he sent a message in the team chat.","[Proud and Not Spoiled]: Sword Saint, your typing style is pretty cute. But Plant Girl, your texts give off a real mature vibe!","Xie Lin looked like a tough guy, but back when he was a streamer and a paid carry, there was a saying: the better your skills, the cuter your typing. Especially the way you typed.","On the other hand, Chu Fu's earlier message had been enough to make someone like Shen Chi, who lived in the shadows, regain his confidence.","Most importantly, she seemed to know a lot. She really came across like a top-tier player.","Chu Fu felt a little embarrassed seeing the message from Proud and Not Spoiled.","She'd accidentally revealed a bit too much!","But in her past life, she really had been a mature person.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: I'll call Wheelchair Brother to log in now. He thought you'd be gone a while, so he went to convince his family. Let's start flying toward the Tiger King's area. Are you still in the Forest of Silence? You'll get there first. But Wheelchair Brother's mech is faster, so don't wait for him.","[Call Me Blind?]: Let's move!","Everyone set off from different directions.","Soon, Shen Chi logged in.","Thinking about how his father and mother had agreed without any hesitation, Shen Chi's gaze grew even more determined.","He checked the map to see everyone's positions, then piloted his mech at 300% speed straight to the Tiger King's territory.","Soon, the five of them were gathered again.","Sharpening their blades, ready to take on the Tiger King.","[Blazing Tiger King (BOSS) Level: 10, HP: 850,000]","The Blazing Tiger King's HP might seem lower than the Wolfman Turg's, but its defense was much stronger.","But Chu Fu was no longer the same Chu Fu as before.","She had now learned two skills.","And she had a very unconventional idea.","First, she catalyzed a Watermelon Bomb.","Then she tried putting the Watermelon Bomb into her inventory.","It worked!","Next, she took the Watermelon Bomb back out, held it in both hands, and activated her newly learned skill.","Poison Spray!","Was a Watermelon Bomb not poison?","What did it matter? Both required mental focus to assist in throwing the attack, right? Her \"poison\" was just a little bigger, a little heavier, and a little denser.","Besides, this game was 100% realistic. It had removed auto-casting and switched to true manual control. So why couldn't she do this?","Soon, Chu Fu became skilled at launching Watermelon Bombs.","Then she kept ripening more watermelons.","She chugged potions while speeding up the ripening process. Within moments, she had 15 Watermelon Bombs stored in her inventory.","She couldn't carry any more.","No matter. Fifteen was enough.","If each bomb could deal 100,000 damage, she'd only need nine to finish the Tiger King.","The five of them set off toward the Tiger King's location.","Deep in the Forest of Silence, beneath a waterfall, the Tiger King was sprawled on a large rock. In the sunlight, its orange-red fur glowed with fiery light.","It was full ten meters long—three times the size of the largest Siberian tiger in the real world.","TigerKing, the size of a truck.","Chu Fu spoke up: \"The Blazing Tiger King has five skills. First is the 'Blaze' in its name.\"","[Blaze]: If you catch fire, you take continuous damage. Jump into water to put it out. And remember—if you can't swim in real life, don't jump into deep water. So we need to lure the Tiger King here.\"","Chu Fu pointed at a shallow area of the stream.","\"Next is [Hungry Tiger Pounce], which deals massive single-target damage.\"","\"Then there's [Tiger Roar of the Mountain], a sonic attack that disables flying. That's its ultimate move.\"","\"[Like a Tiger with Wings] The Blazing Tiger also possesses wind-based powers, allowing it to fly into the sky. However, at this moment, it won't use its Forest-Shaking Roar, and since we can all fly, we can continue to attack it.\"","\"[Eyeing Like a Tiger] A pupil technique; anyone it stares at will be immobilized.\"","\"Alright, that's all. Sister Jiaojiao, you go first!\"","Jiaojiao Not Fragile immediately stepped forward. Bear King was surprisingly generous, dropping a silver-grade shield for her — and it was a cartoon-style teddy bear head shield, complete with two little ears. Jiaojiao Not Fragile loved it.","\"Starting the fight, little kitty. Come play with Queen Jiaojiao!\""]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: The Guild Order Drops, I'm Digging Up the Roots of Wantu Real Estate","paragraphs":["Two hours later.","As expected, the powerful team had already managed to sweep through all the monsters in the novice village.","With the massive body of the Tiger King crashing to the ground, the entire team erupted in cheers.","[Server Announcement: Players \"Plant Sister,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Who You Calling Blind,\" \"Jiao Jiao Not Spoiled,\" and \"Suture Saint\" have achieved the first kill of the level 10 field boss \"Blazing Tiger King\"! Reward: All stats +4, Silver Chest x1!] x3.","Server 0308888 was shaken once again.","\"Oh my god, they did it again. Are they all S-rank talents or something?\"","\"Isn't this a record? Taking down the level 10 Tiger King on the third day—how did they even pull that off?\"","\"This is insane. Our server is set. When the merger happens later, we're definitely guarding at least one village!\"","\"Big shots, do you need any hangers-on? I can read, I know my way around, and I take shelter when it rains.\"","\"I don't want to work hard anymore. I just want to be the little husband of Plant Sister.\"","The world chat was flooding so fast it was impossible to keep up.","In the Silent Forest,","Chu Fu and the others stared at the equipment scattered all over the ground, and one particularly special item.","Field boss loot dropped randomly around the area. Players had to pick it up manually, and it would then appear in the team panel.","If a solo player landed the final hit on a monster but couldn't reach the loot, they could easily get bombarded and killed by others swooping in to steal the gear.","Now, everyone scrambled to pick up items. Chu Fu was quick—her hand shot out and grabbed a gleaming silver token.","It was cold to the touch, but her heart burned with excitement.","It actually dropped!!!","\"Ahhh! It's a guild token!\" Chu Fu let out a scream.","\"Really? For real?\" Shen Chi jumped out of his mech, his eyes wide with excitement.","\"Hell yeah! We're the best! We're champions! Woohoo!\" Xie Lin yanked off his blindfold in excitement, waving his arms wildly. His clenched fists made the muscle lines on his arms stand out sharply.","\"Ahhhhhh! This is too amazing! Plant Girl, you're incredible! Let me tell you something—I'm about to turn my life around! My dad gave each of my little brothers a hundred million to play games and build guilds. None of them could do it. Not a single one. But me? I'm the Eldest Princess!\" Jiao Jiao not Spoiled roared.","\"We're rich! We're rich! Oh my god, how much could this sell for?\" Suture Saint chimed in.","\"One hundred million!!!\" Jiao Jiao not Spoiled shouted. \"It's worth a hundred million!\"","Suture Saint felt like she was about to faint.","She quietly glanced at her contribution share in the team: 5%.","Five percent of a hundred million? That's five million!","Compared to a hundred million, five million might seem small.","But if someone told you you'd won a five-million lottery jackpot, anyone would be jumping for joy!","Suture Saint instantly turned into a screaming chicken: \"Ahhhhhhh!\"","The group was hyped for a full five minutes.","Then Chu Fu coughed and called out, \"Okay, calm down, calm down. Now, now—about this guild token: how should we handle it?\"","Building a guild was a given,","but how to go about it, and who would take the lead, was something worth careful discussion.","Jiao Jiao not Spoiled immediately spoke up: \"Plant Girl, I'll buy it. I'll buy it outright. And don't worry—the Rosary Alliance I'm building will definitely help you take down Wan Tu Properties and the Sun, Wang, and Guan families.\"","She took a breath, steadied herself, and finally revealed the business acumen she'd honed as a finance major.","\"Those families are too powerful. You guys are just ordinary people—hell, your real-world situations aren't even great. If you became the guild leader, I'd be afraid some corporate group might come after you with an assassination attempt.","But I'm different. My dad might be unreliable, but I'm still his daughter. With that identity, those families can't touch me.","Still, the guild token is worth a hundred million.","I'll buy it as a cash investment, but I'll give you all a 50% stake as a technology investment. This way, the guild won't be totally under my control. You'll all be shareholders. I won't exploit you—I'll be begging you to carry me to more first-kills!\"","Hearing this, Chu Fu couldn't help but admire her.","Jiao Jiao was putting in both money and effort.","Maybe influenced by years of game novels, where most protagonists were lone wolves or absentee guild leaders,","Chu Fu naturally thought about taking the money, doing nothing, and coasting as a big boss.","But the truth was, in her past life, Chu Fu had been a low-level working girl. Compared to the people in front of her, her biggest advantage was knowing the plot!","People don't suddenly become geniuses just because they get a second chance. She wouldn't magically know how to manage a company worth a hundred million.","And right now, the most important thing was improving strength!","Jiao Jiao not Spoiled's proposal was the best option available.","Chu Fu spoke up. Her voice was weak, but full of confidence: \"I agree!\"","\"I agree too!\" Shen Chi and Xie Lin nodded.","\"Do I even need to agree?\" Suture Saint said weakly.","Everyone laughed.","Next came the share allocation.","The guild token was valued at a hundred million. It would be distributed according to team contribution:","\"Plant Sister\": 49%","\"Rocket on a Wheelchair\": 23%","\"Who You Calling Blind\": 13%","\"Jiao Jiao not Spoiled\": 10%","\"Suture Saint\": 5%","Divided by contribution, Chu Fu could get 49 million.","Jiao Jiao said, \"I don't have that much liquid cash on hand.","But we're all in Linjiang City, and I still have some real estate my mom left me—shops, villas, stuff like that.","Or if you want to buy any property, I can use the funds directly to make it easier.\"","Chu Fu's mind stirred.","\"I remember there's a luxury villa complex in Wangxi Scenic Area. I want one of those villas.\"","Jiao Jiao not Spoiled blurted out, \"Isn't that the unfinished project of Wan Tu Group?\"","Chu Fu tilted her head, looking confused.","She honestly didn't know it was an unfinished project.","But in the original plot, Wan Tu Group had set up their main base there.","Based on her knowledge of the story and the clues now available, it was easy to piece things together.","In Server 0308888, with Universal Studio's involvement and the backing of a big spender like Jiao Jiao not Spoiled, a novice village was established.","Wangxi Village corresponded to the land in Wangxi Scenic Area.","Coincidentally, Wan Tu Group had developed a villa complex there through shady deals, which later became their stronghold after the game invaded reality.","Jiao Jiao not Spoiled seemed to sense her confusion and explained, \"The scenery around Wangxi Scenic Area is really nice. Wan Tu Properties got that land cheap through some tricks.","They developed Tianxi Manor—only 100 units, each one a massive standalone villa, almost estate-sized.","The prices were sky-high.","But the thing is, these villas weren't built for people to actually live in. They were meant to be sold to their downstream companies as a way of paying tribute.\"","This makes a perfect setup for extortion—or bribery!","So don’t be fooled by the hundred households—no one actually lives there, and the surrounding area is just scenic spots where wild boars could show up. It’s extremely dangerous. Why would you even think of buying a house here?","What’s more, buying here is just handing money to Wantu Real Estate, isn’t it?”","“No, I’m pulling the rug out from under Wantu Real Estate.”"]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Purchasing a Villa, Share Dividends","paragraphs":["But of course, Chu Fu couldn’t say it outright.","She had already been quite bold when she advised Shen Chi earlier.","But getting into specifics like this—unless her talent was \"prophecy\"—how else could she explain it?","So Chu Fu put on a serious face, pretending to be profound, while inside she felt like a sly little fox.","\"I have some insider information. It’s best to buy a villa there. Wheelchair Brother, Blind Brother, I suggest you buy one there too. Jiao Jiao, if you have extra money, you can even snap up a few! And the bigger, the better!\"","Jiao Jiao understood instantly.","It must be a tip from Chu Fu’s \"brother.\"","\"Then I’ll convert my funds into a villa too,\" Shen Chi said.","\"How much are the villas there? Do I have enough contributions to buy one? I’ll also need one million in cash.\"","Jiao Jiao actually had some recollection. \"How expensive can a villa in a remote scenic area be? The best one costs 50 million, other properties are around 20 million, and there are some around 10 million.\"","Suture Saint: \"Re-evaluating ‘how expensive.’\"","She raised her hand. \"King Jiao Jiao, I want all cash!\"","Five million! She definitely didn’t want a villa—she just couldn’t afford it.","\"Alright, leave it all to me,\" Jiao Jiao agreed.","Oral agreements weren’t reliable, so Jiao Jiao immediately called her secretary to work late into the night, found a lawyer to draft a simple purchase contract, and handled a property exchange agreement.","Fortunately, with modern technology, contracts signed online were legally binding.","Once the contract was generated, Chu Fu handed the guild token to Jiao Jiao.","Jiao Jiao was ecstatic.","She didn’t immediately establish the guild but instead discussed with the group before finalizing the initial share split.","\"Plant Girl has to get the biggest share. Without her, there wouldn’t be this team, and without this team, there wouldn’t be a guild token.","Plant Girl knows the boss’s skills like the back of her hand. So much of that information is impossible to buy right now.","For future strategies, she’ll probably be essential, not to mention all her invaluable knowledge.\"","Jiao Jiao spoke up for Chu Fu first.","Chu Fu understood her good intentions and added, \"Jiao Jiao is putting in the money and effort, and handling management.","Plus, it’s undeniable that she’s a money-powered warrior.","Her personal skills might not be the strongest right now,","but she’ll definitely have the best gear later on.","That’s a kind of strength too.\"","Shen Chi and Xie Lin both nodded.","\"I have no objections.","Honestly, I feel a bit undeserving of even having shares.","So from now on, I’ll use my three daily enhancements to upgrade the guild’s equipment","and provide mechanical support.\"","Xie Lin, upon hearing this, suddenly felt he had little to contribute to the guild.","\"Well, leave all the PvP stuff to me? I’m still pretty good at fighting.\"","Chu Fu smiled lightly. \"Sword Saint Brother, don’t sell yourself short.","In terms of technique, you’re the best among us. You can provide skill guidance.","Plus, as a top-tier player, you have your own circle. Maybe in the future, you can invite some highly skilled players to join our guild!","So, you’ve got skill and connections!\"","Xie Lin thought it over and found it reasonable.","He could teach players techniques, help analyze skills, and offer battle strategies.","He could even invite his old teammates, or at least collaborate with them.","As for Suture Saint,","she originally didn’t want to get involved in matters that felt too grand for her, and she felt her role in the team was replaceable.","But while everyone was heatedly discussing, she secretly opened the Tiger King’s Silver-grade treasure chest!","And it gave her a huge surprise.","\"I—I don’t know if this skill is any good, or if it’s something all healers get later or just me. Can I use this to buy in?\"","She revealed a skill.","[Suture Corpse Art]: You can stitch together a dead body to revive it. The corpse must have died no more than 3 days ago.","A resurrection skill—we’re saved!","Chu Fu was overjoyed.","\"Saint, you hit the jackpot. Resurrection skills aren’t something every class gets.","From what I know of the game, players have to reach level 60 to learn it from a skill instructor.","So in the early game, your Suture Corpse Art is incredibly rare.","In the old servers, a healer with a resurrection skill could charge 10 silver coins for a public resurrection—and it was still in high demand!\"","10 silver coins?","Ten thousand per resurrection?","But considering that a character’s talent would drop if they died, and they couldn’t play the game temporarily,","ten thousand was something people would pay.","Suture Saint stared at the skill description until her eyes hurt, but she didn’t see any time limit on Suture Corpse Art.","That meant she could use it whenever she wanted, earning ten thousand each time. If she had 100 customers a day, that was a million!","She was about to get rich.","\"Then—then can I buy in now? I only want 1%!\"","\"Of course!\"","Chu Fu nodded.","After the discussion, they consolidated all the information and finalized the split. The five core founding shareholders would hold 85% of the shares, leaving a 15% reserve pool for recruiting stronger members later.","ID: “Who Wants to Be a Plant Girl” — Real Name: Chu Fu — 30% shares","(Combat effectiveness 20%, Information sharing 5%, Game knowledge 5%)","ID: “Jiao Jiao’s No Brat” — Real Name: Huang Jiaojiao — 25% shares","(Game investment 20%, Management and operations 5%, Money-powered warrior 2%)","ID: “Rocket on a Wheelchair” — Real Name: Shen Chi — 16% shares","(Combat effectiveness 10%, Talent-enhancing 6%: Future upgrades to be used within the guild)","ID: “Who Called Me Blind” — Real Name: Xie Lin — 11% shares","(Combat effectiveness 5%, Top-tier gameplay 4%, Elite connections 2%: Will attract more master players as the guild grows)","ID: “Suture Saint” — Real Name: Li Zhenzhen — 3% shares","(Free resurrection for the guild 3%)","Everyone was satisfied.","\"Ahem, don’t forget—there’s still a Tiger King item, Silver grade! Let’s auction it off now. If you want it, don’t miss out! This is a rare piece of equipment!\"","[Tiger King Cloak (Silver Grade)]: Defense +80, All Stats +3, Tiger’s Presence: Intimidates enemies, reduces their defense by 10%.","All classes could wear it!","Cloaks were an extremely rare gear slot. Miss this one, and you might never see another in the entire game.","Of course, whales always found a way.","Chu Fu spoke up. \"Our team has always distributed items based on need and market value. Everyone here can use this item, so we’ll go with an auction.","We’re all friends here, but don’t hold back.","Starting bid: 10 silver coins.\"","Jiao Jiao shouted, \"100 silver coins!\"","That was worth it—it was a cloak!","Chu Fu immediately raised the bid. \"All’s fair, Sister Jiaojiao! 200 silver coins!\"","Jiao Jiao, Not Spoiled: \"Since you call me the 'Money Power Warrior,' I won't go easy on your Plant Girl. 300 silver coins.\"","\"It's my turn to spend a little for once. Can't keep making money off you guys. 400 silver coins!\"","Shen Chi: Now that I've mastered the mech, I've lost all interest in gear.","Xie Lin: I'm broke.","Suture Saint: Sitting here quietly, waiting for my share of the loot.","Chu Fu and Jiao Jiao, Not Spoiled ended up bidding all the way to 1 gold, which is 1,000 silver.","Chu Fu checked her wallet—972 silver coins—and lost by a hair.","But honestly, the price was worth it. If they held an auction, a cloak like this could easily be hyped to a hundred times its value.","After all, rarity makes things precious.","The only consolation was that, since she contributed 49% to the team, Chu Fu got 490 silver coins, making a nice profit off Jiao Jiao, Not Spoiled again.","The remaining equipment was all bronze-level. The Tiger King Cloak was the only silver-tier item.","And since these bronze items were level 10 gear, far above their current stats, anyone who needed an upgrade snapped them up.","As usual, Chu Fu purchased the Tiger King's Heart.","With that, all the available resources in the newbie village had been fully exhausted.","\"Let's move, move, move! Back to the village! Find the village chief! Form the guild!\"","Chu Fu nodded.","She tidied up her backpack and suddenly realized she hadn't opened her Tiger King Silver Treasure Chest yet!","She tapped it casually.","\"Whaaaat??????\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Guild Established – You Have Additional Village Chief Tasks to Collect","paragraphs":["[System Notification: You have obtained the Toxic Moth Cloak (Silver Grade)]","[Toxic Moth Cloak (Silver Grade):","Defense +80","Constitution +6","Spirit +6","Toxic Powder: Leaves a trail of toxic powder wherever you pass; enemies chasing behind you will be poisoned, lasting 3 seconds.]","What a twist of fate.","Chu Fu felt a bit embarrassed. \"Jiao Jiao, I got a cloak. Awkward!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao wasn't angry at all. Instead, she laughed and said, \"You must have wanted it so badly the system rewarded you. Look at my cloak—isn't it impressive? What does yours look like?\"","The tiger-skin cloak was naturally a huge tiger pelt, draped over Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao's shoulders. Coupled with her one-meter-eighty height and her healthy, powerful physique, she gave off an imposing vibe.","Chu Fu clicked on the Toxic Moth Cloak in her inventory and found it shaped like a paper airplane, in a pinkish-green color, appearing as a semi-transparent, sheer fabric.","The wings had veins and markings that looked like eyes.","Beneath the two wings, there were two trailing tails.","It looked a bit like the wings of a green-tailed giant silkworm moth.","The cloak was also covered in a layer of reflective powder, glittering with a green glow, clearly radiating \"toxicity.\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao immediately exclaimed, \"Wow, yours looks amazing! It's even adorable. Plant Girl, with this look, you're like a little figurine!\"","Chu Fu squinted with a smile. This cloak was indeed beautiful!","If it were in the real world, it would definitely be labeled \"bizarre attire.\"","But in the game, it immediately drew exclamations of admiration.","This was one of only two cloaks on the entire server.","She really had lucky hands—getting exactly what she wanted.","Xie Lin: \"Done admiring yourselves? Let's head back to establish the guild!\"","Xie Lin was jealous! They'd agreed to go set up the guild, but instead, they'd spent five minutes admiring the cloak. How annoying—why didn't he have one!","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao smacked her forehead. \"Forgot, forgot! Let's hurry!\"","She pulled out a scroll of recall and used it directly.","Chu Fu also took out a recall scroll—she'd stocked up on them during her last trip to the village. Money was meant to be spent; saving the remaining one-hour travel time seemed like a great deal to Chu Fu.","Xie Lin watched the two disappear on the spot and felt like he had reminded them for nothing!","He had to fly back himself.","Xie Lin had kept 1 million copper coins and planned to do the same as Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao—buy up player characters!","......","At the Newbie Village Chief's house.","Many players were around taking quests, either fertilizing the chief's vegetable garden, catching bugs, or chopping firewood.","In short, it was all trivial busywork, but it gave some experience.","Oh, and no copper coins.","Essentially free labor.","As Chu Fu and Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao walked into the yard, everyone else turned to stare at them.","[Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao]","Wasn't she the whale in their server?","Loud discussions erupted around them.","\"Whoa, we're gawking at a rich woman here! Photo with the whale! Oh my god, her gear is so exquisite—the little bear shield, the black-gold armor, and what's that? A tiger-skin cloak? This game has cloak gear?\"","\"Beside her is the Plant Expert! Oh my gosh! Her little skirt is so pretty, and she's got wings?\"","\"The First Kill Squad is way too loaded. I've got to grind harder just to wear nicer skirts!\"","Because Chu Fu's team had secured multiple first-kill rewards, players had started calling them the First Kill Squad.","Players were intensely curious about those far stronger and famous in the game, often asking around for news about them.","In the game, such players were called experts.","When the game's popularity grew larger, these players were also called star players.","Some star players even had fan groups, with players crowdfunding copper coins for them.","A copper here, a copper there—with united force, victory was in the air.","This was more intense than chasing celebrities. Many players were far more enthusiastic about this than official gaming guild laborers.","This trend hadn't fully emerged yet, but the crowd present was already full of curiosity.","\"Wait, how did she change her ID?\"","\"I want to know too. Plus, wasn't she red-named from killing so many people? I heard she'd have to kill over 300,000 monsters to clear that.\"","\"They're already that high-level and well-equipped—are they here to steal quests from the village chief?\"","Amid all the confusion.","They watched Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao hand a silver token to the village chief. Then she scratched her head and looked down at the Plant Expert beside her.","\"The chief told me to name the guild. I originally wanted to call it the Rose Alliance, but Wheelchair and Sword Saint have also joined. Does that make the name a bad fit?\"","Chu Fu shrugged. \"I'm terrible at naming things, don't ask me!\"","Seeing Chu Fu had no opinion, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao's eyes lit up.","\"If you can't come up with something, then let me think. If Rose doesn't work, how about Thorn? That's also a plant, and it matches your bedstraw well.","Let’s go with that!","The Thorn Guild.\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao didn't hesitate and swiftly submitted the application.","The next moment, a server-wide announcement echoed in the ears of all players on Server 0308888.","[System Announcement: Congratulations to player Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao for founding the server's first guild: the Thorn Guild.]","[System Announcement: Permanent bonus for being the first guild: All guild members gain +10 to all attributes, +200 health, +100 defense, +100 attack.]","Chu Fu immediately received a system notification.","[System Notification: Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao has invited you to join the Thorn Guild. Accept or Decline.]","\"Accept!\"","Chu Fu joined.","Then came a series of system notifications.","[System Notification: You have joined the Thorn Guild and received a special state: Guild Honor (Exclusive to first guilds).]","[You have gained Level 1 Guild Buff: +5% Defense, +5% Attack, +5% Bonus EXP.]","[You have gained a Level 1 Guild Skill: Double EXP — Active manually for 1 hour of double experience gain.]","With these buffs alone, there was no worry about people not joining the guild, especially since they were the first.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was still excitedly saying, \"Wow, we can even buy a plot of land as the guild headquarters. We can only choose spots outside the village, and we can build defensive structures and lodgings. The lodgings allow rest and faster fatigue recovery.\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was overwhelmed, taking in all the guild content.","Chu Fu, however, didn't discuss it with her. Instead, she turned to the village chief.","\"Village Chief, while hunting outside, I encountered a giant boar and got a boar heart from its drop. I heard you were collecting such items. Is this the one you need?\"","Chu Fu took out the [Wild Boar King's Heart (Bronze Material)].","This material dropped by the boss would normally give players a quest clue if sold to the village chef.","\"A heart this terrifying is filled with violent energy—hard for common folks to digest. But I heard the chief is collecting them. Why not ask the chief's family?\"","But Chu Fu already knew the quest story, so she skipped the initial steps and came directly to the chief."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Heart of the Beast Hunter Badge, Myriad Universes","paragraphs":["The village chief looked at the wild boar king’s heart and furrowed his brow tightly.","“The boars in Wild Boar Ridge are becoming more rampant. When their numbers grow too large, a king is inevitably born. It’s a good thing you eliminated the wild boar king!”","“With your strength, you might be able to protect the village. If you collect any other beast king’s hearts, you can hand them over to me. On behalf of the village, I will reward you handsomely!”","[You have completed the quest: Hunt the Beast King, collect the Beast King’s Heart. Reward: 800 copper coins, massive experience.]","[Your level has reached Level 9!]","Chu Fu’s heart leaped with joy.","Then, calm and composed, she started rummaging through her bag.","Damn hearts. Each one took up an inventory slot—she had been dying to get rid of them!","She pulled out the Rat King’s Heart.","Then, the Wolf King’s Heart.","Again, the Bear King’s Heart.","And once more, the Tiger King’s Heart.","The next moment, the system notifications kept popping up.","[You have completed the quest: Hunt the Beast King...] ×4.","Chu Fu’s experience skyrocketed. She needed just 20% more to reach Level 10.","The village chief stared at Chu Fu in utter shock.","“The village hasn’t seen a powerhouse like you in years!”","He spoke with excitement, his eyebrows lifting in delight.","“Wait for me. A hero deserves glory and a medal.”","He went inside and quickly came back with a silvery box, slightly larger than a palm.","When he opened it, a silver-white radiance shone forth.","Inside the box lay a heart-shaped silver-white badge.","Chu Fu heard a pleasant chime in her ears.","[System Notification: You have completed the hidden quest—The Village Chief’s Recognition. Collected the hearts of five beast kings. Reward: Beast Hunter’s Heart Badge!]","[Beast Hunter’s Heart Badge (Silver Tier):","When equipped, all attributes +5.","Increases damage dealt to beast-type monsters by 10%. At the same time, beast-type monsters' threat (aggro) toward you increases by 10%.","This was exactly why Chu Fu had been collecting the hearts all along.","She took the Beast Hunter’s Heart and pinned it to her chest.","Players could equip multiple badges. According to the novel’s storyline, what many star players loved to show off was how many badges they had earned.","After all, it was a solid testament to their achievements.","Beside her, Proud and Petty was utterly stunned.","“W-what kind of quest is that? Can you give me the details?”","Proud and Petty’s eyes burned with a thirst for knowledge, and she kept glancing longingly at the silver badge.","Chu Fu smiled. “Check your private messages. Let’s talk quietly.”","Then she sent the details of the hidden quest over to her.","Finally, she added a reminder:","“But keep in mind: the boss only drops the Beast King’s Heart guaranteed on the first kill. Also, the boss has to be killed by you personally. Buying one won’t activate this hidden quest—it’ll only give you the experience reward.”","“Ah! Only on the first kill? So that means only one badge per village?”","“That’s right, but you can still use it later in other servers, when you set up a studio or build a guild.”","Proud and Petty immediately lost interest.","For now, given her current bank balance and the connections she had in hand, there was no way she could set up multiple studios like Wan Huanyu.","Don’t get her wrong—Wan Huanyu was also a rich second-generation, but his father supported him, and he had international graduates from prestigious business and management schools helping him out.","As for herself... did ‘Husband-Killing Poison Maker’ and ‘Needle-Wielding Saint’ count?","Well, she still had Chu Fu as her anchor, plus Shen Chi and Xie Lin as her two trusty sidekicks.","Hmph. She wasn’t lacking either.","“Forget the hidden quest for now. I’m going to recruit some people and collect some kills!”","[Server 0308888][Proud and Petty]: Thorn Alliance is recruiting! Join now and get +10 to all attributes, 10% experience bonus, and double experience skills—plenty of perks!","[Server 0308888][Proud and Petty]: Also offering 10,000 per character death. Let me kill you, and I’ll wire 10,000 on the spot. F-grade players unhappy with their current talent can take the 10,000 to respawn for free. Don’t miss out—you won’t regret it!","Proud and Petty was instantly flooded with messages.","Chu Fu quickly made a run for it—she didn’t want to get roped into the chaos.","Still, she didn’t forget to remind her:","“I’m going to grind achievements. Remember to stop when your Karma hits 99,900. Then we’ll go fight the werewolf Turg together!”","“Got it, got it!” Proud and Petty replied amidst the flurry.","Chu Fu was just 20% short of leveling up. She could head to the Level 10 monster zone—Sword Forest where the Tiger King roamed—and grind on regular tigers. She could also tackle the Level 8 dungeon: Beast Temple.","But Chu Fu wanted to get the first kill alongside her teammates, so she wasn’t in a rush.","Proud and Petty had work to do.","Shen Chi had gone offline to talk with his family.","Xie Lin had an appointment at the police station at 7 a.m. to give a statement.","So Chu Fu decided to work on her achievement of killing 100,000 Red-Eyed Rabbits in the Level 1 monster area.","She walked out of the newbie village gate and looked at the distant grass where Red-Eyed Rabbits hopped around, fixing their blood-red eyes on every passerby.","It had been three days since the game launched. Even the laziest player had already leveled up and moved on to the Level 2 monster zone—Stray Dog Fields.","The newbie village had gone from bustling to desolate in just a few days.","Chu Fu searched around and soon found three rabbit holes forming a triangle.","This was a respawn point in the Red-Eyed Rabbit zone, and there were more such points nearby.","A Red-Eyed Rabbit charged at Chu Fu, trying to attack her.","She swung her Cursed Staff and smashed it hard on the rabbit’s head.","-120! (Headshot Critical!)","Hmph,","she was actually pretty strong now!","After taking down three rabbits, new ones immediately appeared. Chu Fu tossed out three dandelion seeds and planted them at the rabbit holes.","“Buzz buzz buzz!”","The three dandelions spun in place!","As soon as a rabbit popped out of its hole, it was killed instantly.","It would take just over nine hours to kill 100,000.","Chu Fu’s plant control range covered 20 meters. She headed to another “Cunning Rabbit Three Burrows” spot and planted new dandelions.","This time cut the achievement grind time in half!","She didn’t even need to stay active—the dandelions would work on their own.","She simply took out a tent, crawled inside, and lay down comfortably. Then she opened the forum.","Oh, if only she had a milk tea in hand right now!","Hmm, what about a little honey water? Would that be a bit of a waste...","......","At 7 a.m.,","Xie Lin, accompanied by the neighborhood’s warm-hearted aunt Wang Yun, went to the police station to give his statement.","Later, under the guide’s lead, he entered a mediation room.","“The people who came to your door to attack you are all unemployed drifters. But their boss wants to talk to you about compensation—he wants to get your forgiveness and is willing to pay some money.”","Wang Yun kindly added, “Xiao Xie, you’re short on money now, and you weren’t injured. If they agree to pay compensation, that wouldn’t be a bad deal.”","But Xie Lin’s voice was cold. “I refuse the settlement. I don’t need the money.”","Suddenly, a mocking laugh came from behind.","“So it really is you!”","“You’ve got guts, but your parents don’t. How about I get in touch with them? Their hope might be that you’d get a few more beatings!”","“You’re Xie Lin, right? In-game name ‘Who Called the Blind Guy a Liar’?”","“Your teammates—don’t tell me they’re that vegetable sister and that cripple?”","“Hahahaha, you guys crack me up. What is this, the Avengers of misfits?”","The taunts hit full force, veins bulging on Xie Lin’s forehead as he gritted his teeth and growled, “Wan Huanyu!”"]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: The Threat of the Universe, Settle It in the Game","paragraphs":["If this wasn't a mediation room, if he wasn't familiar with the surroundings, Xie Lin would have really wanted to beat the guy senseless.","The officer tapped the table and said, \"Is this your attitude toward mediation? Not only do you refuse to apologize to the party involved, but you're also provoking him! Do you even want to mediate? If not, we're done here.\"","Across the mediation table sat a man dressed head to toe in luxury brands, wearing a watch worth millions, looking like he'd never known hardship. He sat with his legs crossed, exuding privilege.","\"I do, of course I do!\"","\"But look, there's bad blood between us. That was really just an accident. With so many car accidents every year, things happen. We paid a ton in compensation, so this should be water under the bridge.\"","\"I even did three years in prison! I've turned over a new leaf!\"","Wan Huanyu spread his hands, a mocking grin on his face as he glanced at Xie Lin.","\"And you're still holding a grudge. So I have every reason to believe this blind man wants to get back at me.\"","\"Officer, how do we settle the losses I took in the game?\"","\"Over 200 accounts, losses totaling more than three million.\"","\"Can I sue him for willfully destroying my property?\"","The officer looked sternly at Wan Huanyu.","\"Losses from virtual accounts, unless it involves theft, fraud, or similar crimes, are your own responsibility. Damage in a game does not count as willful destruction of someone else's property.\"","\"Handle your game matters in the game itself.\"","\"That's absolutely no excuse for taking things offline-beating people up or breaking into homes.\"","\"Fine, fine,\" Wan Huanyu said dismissively, then turned to Xie Lin. \"You didn't get hurt anyway. My employees were the ones beaten black and blue. Here's 200 bucks as compensation. Sign the waiver.\"","\"Otherwise, you might want to ask that cripple what my real methods are like.\"","Xie Lin clenched his fist so hard his knuckles went white.","\"What methods? Underhanded tricks? If you've got the guts, come at me. Watch if I flinch.\"","\"Watch your language. You're the one in the wrong here. How dare you threaten the victim and bully someone with a disability? If you keep this up, I'll start looking into whether you're inciting violence.\"","The officer also sternly reprimanded Wan Huanyu.","Xie Lin forced down his anger, knowing he had no chance in the real world.","Chu Fu was right.","Hitting Wan Huanyu where it hurt-in the game-was the real way to make him suffer.","Taking out two hundred of his game accounts had already cost Wan Huanyu two million.","Next time, it would be three million. Four million.","\"Wan Huanyu, listen up. As long as I'm around, you're never going to have a good day in that game.\"","\"Your main base is in Zone 15, right? What's your level? 20? Not even close, is it?\"","\"Just you wait. When the level 30 expansion drops and servers merge again, we'll settle this in-game!\"","\"I'll grind you down to a bottom-tier F-grade nobody.\"","Wan Huanyu's smile faded. \"I'll be looking forward to it.\"","\"Are you two going to mediate or not?\" The officer was exasperated.","Clearly, neither side had any intention of settling. The officer drew up a mediation refusal form and had Xie Lin sign it.","Xie Lin asked Wang Yun to carefully check it, had photos taken, and used text-to-speech to confirm there were no issues before signing.","Wan Huanyu left first.","His senior secretary, Feng Minhui, said beside him, \"Master Wan, Guan Liqiang has been arrested. I consulted a lawyer, and it looks like he'll get over a year. I've taken over his team.\"","\"Though some talents have degraded, we still have some decent B-rank and C-rank players. We can assign them to a new server to compete for the first-kill achievement.\"","\"As for those with poor talents or no discipline-just drifters-I've already let them go.\"","Wan Huanyu glanced at Feng Minhui. Dressed in a formal suit, with black-rimmed glasses and a face as stern as an old nun in a convent, she immediately soured his mood.","But he knew she'd been sent by his father and had some skills.","\"That's fine. Even drifters have their uses. If they're useless in the game, they can be useful in real life. Keep them all. And find me the current leader of their group. Get me their contact info.\"","Feng Minhui's eyes grew serious, as if she sensed trouble.","But in this line of work, with a sky-high salary, you had to bow respectfully even if you disapproved of your boss's actions.","So she immediately bent at the waist, leaning forward in a deferential pose.","\"Yes, Master Wan.\"","Soon, Feng Minhui was back at the company. She notified everyone to submit applications together at exactly noon.","The game was just too popular.","By the time their applications went through, it was already half a month later.","This group ended up assigned to Server 048.","Meanwhile, at the Shen family residence.","Shen Chi grabbed his phone and sent out an urgent notice in the group chat.","The group had 65 members.","Ranging from his 85-year-old grandmother and grandfather","Down to his 12-year-old niece and nephew-everyone was included.","At exactly noon, they all applied together.","\"Primordial Gate reminds you: Your region has been assigned to Server 8888. Current character creation options for old servers are Server 001, Server 009, and Server 017.\"","\"Choosing an old server allows you to create a character at any time. If you don't log in within three hours after notification, your spot will be canceled and you'll enter the queue.\"","\"Choosing a new server means you must create your character on time. You have a three-day window to create the character.\"","\"Old servers cannot participate in the first-kill event.\"","\"New server expansions start from scratch.\"","\"Please choose the server you wish to queue for.\"","Everyone in the group chose the new server.","Shen Chi was a veteran of the first-kill race. He knew this game was all about snowballing.","If even one relative could fly, they'd have a faster path to leveling up.","Start by hunting rabbits for copper coins, buy copper coins, buy bombs, fly to beehives and bomb them to reach at least level three.","Then take down the wild boar king for its first kill.","Then lead the team to secure the first kill in the three-player dungeon.","He had rehearsed every step in his mind.","\"Xiao Chi, the application went through! It's Server 048!\"","Primordial Gate was just too popular. Server 048 was already half a month out.","But that was fine. They had half a month to liquidate assets, wrap up jobs and school, and stock up on supplies.","Shen Chi even had everyone move into the luxury villa in Wangxi Village that Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had bought for them.","He was going all in. He was building his own team.","What moved him, even shook him, was this:","All his relatives, after his parents talked to them, really did give up everything to follow Shen Chi.","Shen Chi felt that maybe his greatest talent wasn't mechanical modification.","It was Bloodline Clan (SSS)!","Server 0308888","Outside the newbie village, it was a chaotic scene.","\"Grandma, it's so hard to create a character these days. You're a B-rank professional. You could work for a guild and make decent money. Even just grinding mobs gets you 200 bucks a day. You don't need to get yourself killed for this.\"","The old woman, who looked to be in her sixties or seventies, didn't want to hear it.","\"Die once and get ten grand. After half a month, you can make a new account. Half a month for ten grand-that's over 600 bucks a day! Who's bad at math here?\"","\"And what's this '200 a day'? You're always telling me to buy this or that with the 200 copper coins I farm. When do I ever actually see any cash?\"","I've been lying around playing video games every day, and now my back is killing me. My girlfriends have been asking me to join them for mahjong and square dancing, but I've been putting them off for days.","\"I can't be bothered to play these kiddie games with you guys.\""]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Our Good Friend Werewolf · Experience Pack · Turgenev","paragraphs":["An old woman walked up to Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was conducting an on - the - spot transaction. If the old woman had an A - grade or S - grade talent, she would have wanted to persuade her.","However, with a B - grade talent and not really interested in the game, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao could only respect the old woman's choice.","After the transaction was completed, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao chopped the old woman down with a single blow.","Moreover, since there were so many people coming, Xie Lin was also nearby, collecting heads for free and piggy - backing on Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao's \"advertisement\".","\"Big shot, is there any rule about increasing the sin value? Why do you collect heads?\"","\"Don't ask. You can't handle it!\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao replied.","\"What's wrong with telling me?\"","\"What to tell? Look at those old areas in front. Which strategy doesn't sell for hundreds of thousands? Information is valuable!\"","After saying that, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao sent a message in the team.","[Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao]: I'm almost at 99 heads. Plant Girl, come quickly.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: I'm coming. Call Wheelchair Brother to log in.","[Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao]: I've called him!","Soon, Shen Chi also logged into the game, and everyone gathered together.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao killed the last person with a single blow, then activated the mechanical wings given by Shen Chi and flew to a less crowded place.","Chu Fu started to set up bombs.","Fifteen watermelons were \"ripened\" and piled up together.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao stood beside the watermelons.","After waiting for a while, a burly figure in a black robe appeared.","\"I smell the stench of blood and slaughter.","Your sin is as red as a blooming and delicate flower.","You shouldn't be with these cowardly sheep of humans.","Do you want to join the chaotic camp, cut ties with those stupid humans, and embrace the evil god?\"","As he spoke, he walked closer to Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","\"Who are you!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao immediately stepped back and adjusted her position.","In just three days, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had already mastered how a shield warrior could lure the boss to a designated position.","Her little plan didn't arouse the suspicion of Werewolf Tuge.","Because it was normal for humans to be afraid and terrified when they encountered it.","But the next moment.","When he got close to the \"watermelon team\".","A terrifying explosion swept him up.","\"Boom!!!\"","- 50,000 × 15.","In an instant, Werewolf Tuge fell to the ground.","In the game \"The Primordial Gate\", if a large amount of damage is dealt in a short period of time, it will cause states such as severe injury and critical injury. Werewolf Tuge was obviously in such a state.","Moreover, this time, Chu Fu had set up an ambush first.","Werewolf Tuge was lying on the ground. Before he could get up, he was faced with a huge mechanical foot!","Shen Chi controlled the mech and descended from the sky, stepping on Werewolf Tuge's head with one foot.","\"Penetrating Rainbow Sword!\"","Xie Lin stabbed his sword into the werewolf's heart, causing a fatal injury.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao immediately stepped forward to taunt and used the skill on her cloak!","Chu Fu also started to apply poison.","This time, they completely defeated Werewolf Tuge in just one minute!","The experience from the level 10 boss immediately nourished everyone in the team.","Chu Fu's level was raised again!","[System prompt: Congratulations! You have reached level 10!]","[System prompt: You are the first player in this novice village to reach level 10. You will be rewarded with 10 points in all attributes. The system will make an announcement. Do you want to hide your name?]","\"No!\"","[System announcement: Congratulations to player \"Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?\" for being the first player in Wangxi District to reach level 10. The reward has been issued!]","[System announcement: Since a player in Wangxi Village has reached level 10, the leaderboard is now open. When the 1000th player on the leaderboard reaches level 10, the village - guarding battle will be opened in advance.]","Soon, a leaderboard appeared on Chu Fu's game system panel.","She clicked on it to take a look.","1st place: [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?] Level 10.","2nd place: [Rocket on a Wheelchair] Level 9.","3rd place: [Who Are You Calling Blind?] Level 8, 89%.","4th place: [Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao] Level 8, 72%.","5th place: [Suture Saint] Level 8, 26%.","6th place: [Shafu Liangu] Level 5, 02%.","7th place: ...","1000th place: [Yuchi Wei] Level 3, 98%.","As soon as the leaderboard came out, the huge gap in levels was obvious.","Chu Fu's five - person team was far ahead, and even so, Chu Fu was the absolute first.","Because she had submitted five beast - king hearts and completed the task.","However, since all five of them were level 8, they could go to the Beast Temple to play the dungeon.","To be on the safe side, they planned to go after Shen Chi and Xie Lin had finished collecting sin values and killed Tuge.","Just then, Chu Fu went back to the novice village and spent 100 silver coins to learn a level 10 skill.","[Poison Pulse Awakening:","Passive: Your poison - type skills will have an additional 3 - second extended poisoning time.","Active: All poison - type damage is doubled. You are immune to all control - type skills and ignore pain for 30 seconds. The cooldown time is 5 minutes.]","This was an \"explosive skill\".","When fighting a boss at a critical moment, one had to use this kind of explosive skill to defeat the boss, and ignoring pain was also a very useful skill.","Especially after the game invaded the real world.","After learning the skill, Xie Lin and Shen Chi had also finished collecting heads.","Everyone took turns to defeat the two Werewolf Tuges. Although they didn't drop other items, the experience was really great!","Our best friend: Werewolf · Experience Package · Tuge.","Xie Lin and Jiao Jiao also reached level 9.","\"Let's go! Let's go to the dungeon for the first clear.\"","Chu Fu shouted.","Everyone responded one after another.","The Beast Temple was on a small mountain behind the novice village, not far from the village.","This time, there was no NPC to guide them. They walked in front of a dilapidated temple.","There was a blue film on the temple's door, which was the entrance to the dungeon.","[Dungeon: Beast Temple]","[Level: 8 - 10]","[Number of people: 3 - 5]","[Normal difficulty, Hard difficulty, Nightmare difficulty]","[Dungeon introduction: This is a dilapidated temple. It is said that it used to worship a demon god, but the villagers soon discovered that it was a man - eating monster, not a god at all.","The statue was toppled.","But there seems to be something hidden.]","[Please select the difficulty!]","As the team leader, Chu Fu chose the normal difficulty.","Soon, the five of them entered together.","Everyone felt as if something \"sucked\" them, and they all took a step inside and entered the dilapidated temple.","The dilapidated temple had nothing to do with a real temple, but everyone knew where to find the clues.","\"First, go to the side halls on the left and right to get oil lamps and torches, then meet in the central hall.\"","There were only three rooms in total, and everyone quickly rummaged through and found the items.","In the central hall.","There was a broken stone statue, and there was also a sacrificial table in front of the statue. They moved the large sacrificial table away, and a dark hole appeared.","This was the real entrance to the Beast Temple.","Just as Chu Fu was about to jump down, suddenly her communication device rang.","Chu Fu was stunned and found that it was the phone number of the little nurse.","\"Hello!\"","\"Hello, is this Chu Fu? You've been in the game for the past few days. We want to check your physical data to see how you're recovering. Can you log out of the game and open the game pod?\""]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Extreme Vigilance: I Refuse to Leave the Game Pod","paragraphs":["Chu Fu was taken aback.","The little nurse's phone number—why was a man answering?","\"Who is this?\"","\"I'm the doctor in charge of monitoring your condition. I need your cooperation.\"","Chu Fu frowned immediately, finding it suspicious.","\"Doctor, I think I'm in good shape right now. I don't need a checkup.\"","\"That's not acceptable. You've been in the game for a long time, which might blur your sense of reality. Have you seen the news? Recently, someone started shouting that the game could descend into reality—end of the world nonsense. We're worried about your mental state, so we want to run a check!\"","Chu Fu thought: That person isn't wrong at all.","But she couldn't say that.","\"However, I'm in the middle of a dungeon right now; I can't log off. How about this: in two hours, I'll come out for the check. Is that okay?\"","\"The check won't take long. As a patient, if you want to recover quickly, you need to cooperate with the doctor!\"","Chu Fu: Wasn't lying in a vegetative state for three years enough cooperation? I was at everyone's mercy!","\"No can do. This dungeon is a must. I'm not coming out. Busy now, gotta go. Talk later.\"","Chu Fu hung up, but the caller immediately dialed again.","Chu Fu grew more uneasy.","She hung up again, and before the other party could call back, she quickly dialed Chu Feng.","\"Brother, some doctor wants to give me a checkup today and wants me to get out of the game pod, but I'm in the middle of a dungeon. Tell them I don't want the checkup. I'm aiming for the first kill!\"","Chu Feng naturally knew the importance of the first kill, but he was also worried about his sister's health.","\"Maybe you should get checked?\"","\"Brother, once I leave the game, I'm locked in a dark room. I can't speak, I can't move—it's unbearable. I don't want to go back.\"","Hearing that, Chu Feng's heart ached instantly.","\"Alright, Fufu, no checkup. I'll call them right away.\"","\"Mm. Oh, and Brother, today Wan Huanyu met with Sword Saint Brother—that is, Xie Lin—and threatened him, saying he'd come after us. Be careful when you go out. Better yet, don't go out at all.\"","Chu Feng's ears perked up instantly.","What Sword Saint Brother?","What Brother Xie Lin?","She said that so smoothly.","Damn it, why was the selection process for [Primordial Gate] so slow? Why hadn't the servers merged so my little sister could come over?","Otherwise, some blind bastard would be trying to steal her away.","First that Shen Chi, and now another Xie Lin.","He grumbled internally.","But out loud, he replied, \"Alright, I won't go out. Don't worry about me. Just enjoy yourself in the game!\"","\"Alright, Brother. I'm off to raiding. I'm already fighting in the Beast God Temple!\"","With that, Chu Fu hung up.","Whether it was the suspicious outside situation or the overly eager doctor, as long as Chu Feng handled it, it should be fine.","It wasn't like they could pry open her game pod, could they?","After all, back when the country researched game pods, they used the most terrifying technology to bombard them—nothing worked. The pod could even withstand a nuclear blast. No one could touch her.","\"I'm here! I'm here!\"","Chu Fu rejoined the team.","\"We can quit and leave if the hospital thing is serious,\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao said.","\"No need, no need. Let's keep fighting! Besides, who wants to be locked in a dark room?\"","Shen Chi frowned and said, \"You've been in the game pod for days, and your condition has been stable. Why would the hospital suddenly want a checkup? Could it be related to Wan Huanyu meeting Xie Lin this morning? Maybe he's plotting something against you?\"","Hearing this, the others felt a chill run down their spines.","In fact, Chu Fu had a similar suspicion too, but no proof.","\"It's fine. We'll handle things as they come. My brother called them. Let's hope it's just a misunderstanding.\"","But Shen Chi frowned again.","\"Plant Girl, call your brother back. If it really wasn't a doctor, tell him not to go out. If he has to leave, he should take people—a lot of people.\"","Chu Fu realized the implication belatedly and felt a flicker of fear.","If the call hadn't been from a doctor,","then Chu Feng might worry about her,","and after worrying, he might rush straight to the hospital.","And if Wan Huanyu seized that moment...","Chu Fu was about to call Chu Feng.","But just then, her game pod's phone rang.","Chu Feng said, \"Fufu, I've already coordinated with the hospital. They reported your condition, saying monitoring shows you're doing fine. Apparently, a recent heavy-suffering patient using the game pod gained weight afterward, so the hospital wanted to check you too. But I've already declined on your behalf! Focus on your dungeon!\"","Chu Fu felt relieved.","Alright!","Just me freaking myself out.","\"Okay, Brother. I'll get back to the dungeon.\"","Chu Fu hung up and gave everyone an OK sign.","\"It was just the doctor suddenly concerned about me. Let's continue the dungeon!\"","Everyone relaxed.","Although official guides existed, Chu Fu was afraid their levels had risen too fast and they hadn't read them yet. So she gave a brief rundown.","\"Time with the oil lamp is limited. We need to clear this dungeon quickly. The challenge here is time—the oil lamp only burns for an hour. Once it runs out, darkness will engulf us, and hidden monsters will attack.\"","Xie Lin said, \"Does that mean I saved time again?\"","Chu Fu smiled. \"A darkness debuff will stack up. Once it hits 20 stacks, instant death.\"","\"So, not only do we need to finish within the oil lamp's time limit, but we also have to watch out for monsters that might extinguish the lamp.\"","The team also had night vision potions, so they could see their surroundings, but the lamp was still a must-have.","Chu Fu handed the lamp to Suture Saint.","He took the back position to protect the lamp, where it was less likely to be attacked.","Everyone then moved into the dark passageway.","Unlike Rat Rat Palace, which tried to imitate human architecture, this underground passage was a true palace, built with bricks and stones, grand and luxurious.","Within ten meters, figures crouching on the ground appeared under the lamp's glow.","\"Meow!\"","\"Light! Humans. You're not from the Beast God Temple.\"","\"This is blasphemy against the gods!\"","Two monsters—they were cat-human hybrids.","Human heads, cat bodies, with ears sticking out.","But on closer inspection, it looked like the heads and spines of humans had been sewn onto cat bodies.","The wounds were grotesque but had healed, leaving scars.","However, before the two cat-humans could pounce, Chu Fu hurled a huge watermelon at them.","\"Boom!\"","Instant kill!","The team pushed forward effortlessly.","\"Man, these monsters are disgusting! Cat-humans, dog-humans, wolf-humans, frog-humans—all stitched together.\"","\"Come to think of it, that werewolf Tuge's faith—could it be some Beast God too?\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: I believed, but I'm in a dungeon run","paragraphs":["\"This copy should have game storyline, right?\"","Many games have their own backstories.","Some people who like to explore the backstory are called lore enthusiasts, and they know the game's background inside and out.","Chu Fu wasn't a lore enthusiast, but she knew the story!","\"The Beast God Temple enshrines a deity that can grant ordinary people magical abilities. Some have gained a cat's hunting prowess, a dog's sense of smell, a wolf's keenness, and a frogman's diving ability.\"","\"But soon, they discovered they were gradually transforming into animal forms.\"","\"Not only that, but they also needed to spread the doctrine; if they didn't, their animalization would progressively increase.\"","\"And the way to spread the doctrine was to make more villagers believe in the Beast God and become its subjects.\"","\"But the Beast God wouldn't grant more power, so how could the believers turn villagers into the Beast God's subjects?\"","\"So they came up with a very twisted method: merging humans with animals and brainwashing them.\"","\"These little monsters are all persecuted villagers.\"","As Chu Fu spoke, the group rolled through without resistance.","Their equipment was so good that they might not even hit a monster if they were too slow to act.","They bulldozed forward for 20 minutes, mainly because of the walking.","Finally, they reached the innermost part of the Beast God Temple, at an altar.","A robed figure with a lion's face appeared before them.","[Beast Priest (BOSS) Level 8, Health: 90,000.]","\"Who dares trespass into the Beast God Temple...\"","Before the words finished,","Two huge, round, massive objects fell from the sky!","\"Boom!\"","\"Boom!\"","Crimson watermelon seeds splattered across the entire altar.","-73,000!","-73,000!","Overkill damage.","[You have cleared instance: Beast God Temple (Normal).]","[Instance Time: 22 minutes 34 seconds.]","[You have received first-clear rewards: All Attributes +1, one Bronze Chest.]","[A global announcement is about to be released. Hide ID?]","Chu Fu casually clicked NO.","Hiding it was pointless anyway; the leaderboard was already out. There were only five Level 8 players total, so who wouldn't know it was them?","The next moment, a golden announcement scrolled across the 0308888 server.","[Global Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plant,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Who Said Blind,\" \"Proud and Unyielding,\" and \"Suture Saint\" have cleared instance Beast God Temple (Normal), achieving the global first-clear! Rewards have been distributed.] ×3.","Normal copies only dropped common gear, but the white-tier equipment dropped by these Level 8 monsters was naturally better than the white-tier gear from Level 3 Mutant Rats.","Nobody had much need for it.","Proud and Unyielding bought it all at a low price, planning to put it into the guild warehouse later, where guild members could exchange it using guild contribution points.","This was part of her role as the finance minister.","\"Keep going, keep going!\"","Chu Fu left the copy and clicked Hard Mode again.","It wasn't difficult either; the group crushed it easily.","[Global Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plant,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Who Said Blind,\" \"Proud and Unyielding,\" and \"Suture Saint\" have cleared instance Beast God Temple (Hard), achieving the global first-clear! Rewards have been distributed.] ×3.","The newbie village had already become numb.","\"Goddess Plant is just too strong, always leading the team to clear copies.\"","\"Have we already taken every first kill available on our server?\"","\"Actually, this isn't bad. Whenever a top-level copy is cleared, new equipment flows out. Players' gear gets better and better, making future copies easier. The pioneers pave the way for those who come after.\"","\"Did you see the newbie village defense battle in Zone 023 yesterday?","I heard a server's S-rank talent player wiped in a Nightmare copy.","As a result, everyone was Level 10 without a single piece of Bronze equipment.","They lost three to four thousand people fighting over the boss, and five thousand defended the village in the end—and lost.","Compared to that, our village is much more peaceful.\"","\"Didn't our village have that Universal Studio guild clearing the field? Haven't seen them in the last couple of days.\"","\"No idea!\"","\"Need to ask? They definitely got killed.\"","\"Buying heads! Five thousand yuan per head. Meet at the Red-Eyed Rabit spawn at the village entrance!\"","There was also someone buying heads, with an ID called ImmobileKing.","If Chu Fu had glanced at the region chat, she would have spotted another familiar ID.","But right now, she was inside a Nightmare-difficulty copy.","The Level 10 Nightmare copy was also where Silver-tier gear dropped.","And it was very important.","There were also a huge number of monsters, so Chu Fu focused on the copy.","Just then, her phone rang again.","It was a new number.","Chu Fu was puzzled but still answered, releasing skills as she did.","Her teammates were reliable enough; she could slack off a little while taking a call.","\"Hello, you've reached Chu Fu,\" she said.","\"Hello, I'm the doctor who called you earlier. It's been two hours now. Can you come out and get a checkup?\"","Chu Fu frowned.","\"Didn't my brother say we didn't need a checkup?\"","The doctor immediately replied, \"Oh, but you promised me, didn't you? Young lady, you can't go back on your word! And you're way too addicted to this game. That won't do. You need to find a way to recover. You're conscious now—maybe with some external help, you can wake up. Coincidentally, a major conglomerate is developing a kind of medication that can help people who are conscious in games but suffering from elderly dementia, or patients in vegetative states. They're offering it for free. But they need some data. If you submit a file, you can try the medication for free. These newly developed drugs can cost millions per treatment course, saving you a lot of money as a patient.\"","As Chu Fu listened, it felt more and more wrong.","She finally gritted her teeth.","\"This conglomerate you're talking about—is it Saint Hall Medical Group by any chance?\"","\"You've heard of them in the game? They're a really good company.\"","Chu Fu let out a cold laugh.","Really good?","The chairman of Saint Hall Medical Group was surnamed Guan, and he was Guan Youlong's grandfather.","It was the Guan family who came back then, persuading Chu Feng that if he signed a letter of forgiveness, the Guan family would do everything in their power to save Chu Fu.","Not only that—they would provide the best medical treatment, striving to wake her up.","If Chu Feng refused, they would stop covering medical expenses and let Chu Feng sue.","Chu Feng could afford to wait, but Chu Fu couldn't.","After she was reborn, the first thing Chu Feng did was to transfer Chu Fu out of the Guan family's private hospital and switch to another one.","And yet, this hospital had still been infiltrated.","However, this doctor probably didn't know; otherwise, he would have realized when she mentioned Saint Hall Medical Group.","This doctor was just trying to trick her into logging off.","Trying to keep her temper in check, Chu Fu asked, \"Doctor, what's your name? You said you're a new doctor, and I don't really trust you. You need to show me your credentials.\"","\"I am a real doctor. You're quite cautious, young lady. Alright, I'll send you my credentials.\"","\"Yeah, and take a picture of yourself for me. Oh, and make sure it's in my hospital room!\"","\"Alright, alright, I'm in your room right now!\"","Dr. Zhao was surprisingly cooperative.","He quickly snapped a photo and sent it to Chu Fu.","This was a doctor in his fifties, with a bloated figure and thinning hair. The credentials were real, and his name was Zhao Deyu.","You old bastard, once the game invades, I'll sneakily assassinate you for sure!","Chu Fu thought to herself.","\"Are you convinced now?\"","\"I am, but I'm in the middle of a dungeon run!\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Warning Your Game Pod Is Being Moved","paragraphs":["\"......You can play the dungeon anytime. You're really too addicted to the game. This won't do.\"","\"Stop talking. I'm about to fight the boss. Goodbye, Dr. Zhao.\"","Chu Fu hung up the phone directly. Moreover, she set her phone to block calls from strangers and deleted the numbers of the little nurse and the nurse station.","In this way, those people couldn't call her anymore.","\"What's going on? Are they still trying to persuade you to log off? This isn't right!\" Shen Chi immediately became nervous.","He knew exactly what Wan Huanyu was capable of.","Chu Fu said, \"Don't worry. There's no way they can trick me into logging off. Later, I'll ask my brother to send someone to carry me away. I feel that as long as I play the game, my body will be fine. Why do I have to stay in the hospital?\"","\"Okay. After you finish the dungeon, I'll send bodyguards to pick you up.\"","\"Okay!\"","Chu Fu nodded.","Everyone continued to play the dungeon.","...","In the hospital ward, several people stood beside Zhao Deyu.","One of the men was wearing a white shirt and suit pants. He was a full 1.9 meters tall, with his hair standing on end, and there was a scar at the corner of his eye.","Chu Fu had never seen this man before.","But if Chu Feng were here, he would definitely recognize this man.","Guan Youlong.","The one who fawned over Sun Jingya, Wan Huanyu's brother, but they also maintained an open relationship.","Compared with Wan Huanyu, who was two - faced, Guan Youlong was like a mad dog.","After hearing the news from Wan Huanyu, he immediately wanted to take revenge.","They could have just paid the money. Why did she keep pestering them, causing Sun Jingya to be sentenced to life imprisonment and himself to spend two years in jail?","Why?","\"It's okay, Dr. Zhao. Don't try to persuade her anymore!\"","Guan Youlong said, then took out a card and gave it to Zhao Deyu, gesturing five and seven.","Five million!","\"This patient, Chu Fu, has been receiving treatment in our hospital and has always had cooperation with us.","If patient Chu Fu suffers brain death during the treatment, her body and organs are to be donated.","Here is the contract.","Her brother transferred her to another hospital without permission, which violates the regulations. So now we're going to take her away.","Don't worry. We have all the legal procedures.","By the way, Dr. Zhao has good medical skills. Go abroad for further study later, and when you come back, you can be the dean of a hospital under our group!\"","Guan Youlong took out the contract.","Of course, this contract was forged.","But there were several contracts that Chu Feng had signed at that time to save Chu Fu. The handwriting was copied and pasted onto the new contract.","Zhao Deyu immediately understood.","If the matter broke out, he could say that he saw the contract and that it was Chu Feng who voluntarily donated.","As for Chu Fu, it could be ruled as a non - accidental death.","For example, death during transportation!","\"Okay, I understand! After all, this is a newly developed game, and many people are so addicted that they're going crazy. Maybe it's very harmful.","It's normal for you not to let the patient play the game.","You're thinking about the patient!","If my son were like this, I would have sent him to an internet addiction rehabilitation center long ago.\"","Guan Youlong thought for a moment and then nodded.","Then, he waved his hand, signaling the people outside to come in and start moving the game pod.","The game pods were designed for comfort and were for lying down. Perhaps to distinguish them from coffins, they were shaped like an enlarged cherry tomato.","In this way, only two people were needed to carry it and they could leave.","The people who came started to move the game pod and put a body bag on it.","...","In the game, Chu Fu suddenly heard the system prompt.","[System Prompt: Your game pod is being moved. To protect the safety of the player, the anti - collision system has been activated, and the nutrient solution inlet has been sealed.]","Damn it! These people are so crazy!","Since she wouldn't come out, these people actually started moving the game pod.","Don't they want to push her downstairs?","However, these people definitely didn't expect that the game pod was almost as sturdy as an escape pod and even had an anti - collision system.","She couldn't let them do this anymore.","\"These people are moving my game pod. Jiao Jiao, send bodyguards to save me. I'll inform my brother.\"","At this time, Chu Fu didn't stand on ceremony with Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","They had just signed a contract and were a community of interests. If something happened to Chu Fu, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao would suffer great losses.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was extremely shocked.","\"I'll call right away. I'll log off immediately!\"","\"Don't log off. You can just call and inform them. We've already gotten this far in the dungeon. If we give up, we'll fall into their trick. They're just trying to interfere with us!\"","Suture Saint was so scared that she was trembling.","Before, when Shen Chi said so, she was a bit skeptical that those people would be so brazen.","Now she really believed it.","She said weakly, \"Is playing the game more important or your life more important? Otherwise, Jiao Jiao and I will go and take a look!\"","Chu Fu waved her hand. \"If there's an earthquake, maybe it's more important to stay in the game pod. The problem is, what can I do if I don't play the game?\"","She was a vegetative!","At this time, not only her, but even Shen Chi and Xie Lin couldn't say a word.","They knew that Chu Fu was in danger, but they actually felt extremely powerless.","Their disabled bodies were of no use at all.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao originally also wanted to go to the scene. As the richest, most fearless, and healthy person in the team, she had to step forward. But after hearing Chu Fu's words, she thought that it was also very important to stay and accompany Chu Fu.","She grabbed Chu Fu's hand and said, \"Don't worry. Leave it to me!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao made frantic calls.","She not only called the bodyguards but also her friends.","Chu Fu was also calling Chu Feng.","Just then, Chu Fu suddenly heard the system's voice.","[System Prompt: Since the player \"Who wants to be a vegetative?\" is a key - concern object of the Primordial Gate, it has been detected that your life safety is under threat.","The game specially rewards you with a new - version experience card.","The effect of this experience card is: By using this card, you can extract the abilities of your game character into the real world for 3 hours.","Please note that extracting the character's abilities requires energy supply and a large amount of nutrient solution.","Your nutrient solution can last for 27 days.","So the abilities you extract need to be within the range of 27 days' worth of nutrient solution.","All your abilities have been converted into days of nutrient solution.","Do you want to use the experience card?]","Chu Fu's eyes widened.","The game invasion was still nine months away, but she had already obtained the experience card.","If she could carry out her abilities now, wouldn't she be able to kill gods if she met them?","Suddenly, she wasn't in a hurry anymore.","She called Chu Feng. As soon as Chu Feng heard that Chu Fu was in deep trouble, he immediately became anxious.","\"Wait for me. I'll be there right away!\"","\"Let's keep the call on.\"","\"Don't worry, brother. They can't break into the game pod. However, just now I received a game prompt. I got an experience card that can extract the game's power into the real world!\"","At this time, not only could Chu Feng hear, but everyone in the team could also hear, and they all showed expressions of disbelief.","Chu Fu sent the introduction and attributes of the experience card to the team, and everyone could see them.","It was time to give her teammates some shock!"]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: Teammates Shocked, Securing the Last First Kill","paragraphs":["Everyone stared at the experience card.","“No way!” Suture Saint’s voice cracked, her eyes wide with disbelief as she stared at the card.","If this was real...","If this was real!!!","She couldn’t even begin to imagine the massive changes and upheaval the entire world would undergo.","Xie Lin yanked off his blindfold in shock.","Chu Fu had posted the experience card in the team chat. Since the chat content could appear on their retinas, even if Xie Lin had his eyes covered, he could still see it—like wearing night-vision goggles.","But the image was blurry.","Now, however, he was staring wide-eyed at that experience card.","Shen Chi’s breath grew rapid.","“Bringing power from the game into reality? Then what about... our healthy bodies?”","Shen Chi felt like the surprise had come far too quickly.","He was almost stunned.","“Does that mean... I’ll be able to walk too?”","Xie Lin also realized the implication.","“I... can I regrow my eyes?”","Chu Fu nodded.","“Yes, and not only that—you’ll also gain the talents you have in the game!”","Everyone’s scalps tingled with shock.","In contrast, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was much calmer. She had suspected something like this for a while; it was just slightly different from what she had guessed. Still, that didn’t stop her from admiring Chu Fu.","“Plant Girl, you’re incredible! How do you have something like this? Are you some kind of chosen one by fate?”","Chu Fu laughed, her eyes slightly upturned, a mix of charm and playfulness.","“No, my brother is the real chosen one. I’m just piggybacking off his luck!”","On the other end of the comms, Chu Feng, hearing the chatter, thought: No, something feels off, because I didn’t get an experience card either.","Just as he was about to say something, the call suddenly dropped with a series of beeps.","Chu Fu noticed it too.","She tried reopening the communication channel, but there was no signal—she couldn’t connect to anyone.","“Something’s wrong. I’ve lost signal here. The communicator won’t work anymore. My brother can’t track my location now.”","Right then, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s phone rang. It turned out that Chu Feng, panicking when Chu Fu’s call cut off, thought something had happened!","He frantically called Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","“Chu Fu is fine. We’re still in the instance!”","“Brother, I’m okay, don’t worry. I have the experience card; no one here can touch me. Take your time finding people. I still need to finish this nightmare-level raid.”","“You’re still raiding?”","Chu Feng was shocked.","“What else would I do? I’m hanging up—there’s no time left on the lantern.” Chu Fu shouted.","Chu Feng: With that kind of determination to finish a raid, you’d succeed at anything.","Chu Feng logged off to deal with rescuing his sister’s gaming pod.","Chu Fu and her team, however, were racing against time.","Since Chu Fu insisted on clearing the dungeon, they had to finish it quickly so there would be no lingering worries.","Deep down, they were truly moved.","They felt that Chu Fu—having just received the experience card and being so openly honest with them, and still insisting on completing the raid—must be afraid that if something truly went wrong in reality, they wouldn’t be able to clear the dungeon without her.","She was willing to take risks just to secure the first kill.","She was truly a great teammate from the Hua clan.","In reality, Chu Fu just wanted to stockpile as many attribute points as possible.","That way, when she cashed them out later, as long as she had enough points,","her strength would be terrifying.","Normal people have 5 Strength?","With Chu Fu’s 50 Strength, she’d be on the level of Lin Daiyu effortlessly uprooting a willow tree.","So she was in a hurry.","Her teammates were in a hurry too. The thought that in-game attributes could become real—that they could stand again, that lost eyes could be restored—","Shen Chi and Xie Lin were charging forward like mad bulls.","In the nightmare-level raid, even the minor mobs had become elite mini-bosses, but under the team’s relentless barrage, they were annihilated on the spot.","Inside the nightmare-level Beast God Temple, the map was much larger. The first boss in the underground palace had become the Beast God Priest.","They steamrolled it easily.","The second boss was the Beast God Torchbearer.","[ Beast God Torchbearer (BOSS) Level 10: HP: 600,000. ]","“Sister Jiao, pull the boss now!” Chu Fu shouted.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao slammed her shield into the boss.","“Full damage output. Finish it in 30 seconds—don’t let it use any skills.”","They all understood.","They went all out.","Chu Fu’s Watermelon Bomb dealt 35,000 damage per detonation, though the boss had better defense than the Werewolf Tu Ge.","But the rest of the team wasn’t slacking either.","A relentless storm of attacks followed.","The boss collapsed to the ground with a crash.","“It dropped loot!”","Chu Fu looked at the skill book.","[ Scorching Fire Ring: Creates a ring of fire around the caster to burn enemies. ]","A top-tier aura-type skill book for fire mages.","First-kill rewards were insane!","“We can’t sell this skill. It stays in the guild for core members to bid on, and they’ll have to sign a contract!”","Chu Fu made the decision.","Everyone nodded.","After all, they were shareholders, and it was normal for raid drops to go into the guild inventory first.","As shareholders, they had to contribute to the guild.","They quickly moved into the final area of the Beast God Temple.","In an even more open hall stood a Beast God statue.","The boss was nowhere to be seen.","“The statue is the boss. Destroy it, and the Beast God will be summoned. So there’s no danger near it—in fact, we can prepare ahead of time.”","For this team, preparing ahead meant going all out for total annihilation!","Chu Fu immediately placed 20 watermelons around the statue.","After reaching Level 10 and allocating her points, she could now control 20 plants at once.","Not only that, but she also scattered Lala Vine and Dandelion seeds around the perimeter, stopping just short of sprouting them.","Shen Chi planted a bunch of mini-robots and landmines, which were his latest creations.","They were going to send the boss straight to the heavens in one go!","Once everything was set, Chu Fu continued:","“The nightmare-level boss is a Beast God Avatar. Being an avatar means it has no physical form and is immune to most physical damage.","However, it’s weak to Light and Fire damage.","Also, it has a gem on its forehead about the size of a palm. Hitting it with physical attacks deals bonus damage.","So this fight heavily tests everyone’s accuracy and positioning!","Since this boss is a spirit-type, it’s also immune to crowd control. Everyone, give it your all!”","Preparations complete, Chu Fu cast a Venom spell on the statue.","The statue sizzled as the venom corroded it, but the damage was minimal.","On the other hand, Shen Chi and Xie Lin’s damage was spiking.","The Mechanist’s artillery dealt extra damage to structures.","Shen Chi piloted a 4-meter tall mech, raising its arms to fire two stone-shattering shells.","“BOOM! BOOM! BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!”","Xie Lin’s greatsword was also perfect for hacking at the statue; each swing carved off chunks of debris.","Working together, the statue crumbled.","“Who dares disturb my slumber?”","A roar echoed through the hall.","A translucent figure emerged from the shattered rubble.","A colossal crocodile monster lay prostrate on the ground, its head alone as tall as a man, its maw wide enough to swallow a player whole in one gulp.","[Beast God Avatar (BOSS) Level: 10, Health: 1,200,000]"]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Stick to First Kill Completion, Choose Experience Card","paragraphs":["As the giant beast landed, dust and debris were blown away, revealing only twenty watermelons and a cluster of gleaming time bombs.","\"Boom, boom, boom, boom!!!\"","\"Bang, bang, bang, bang!!!\"","Combined, they dealt a total of 700,000 damage.","Even though the Beast God's phantom was merely a soul remnant, it now grew dim and lusterless, even entering a critically wounded state.","[Critical Wound: Target falls into a critically wounded state for 10 seconds. During this time, all damage output is doubled.]","A perfect opportunity!","You've shown a weakness here!","\"Fire at will!\"","Chu Fu immediately activated [Poison Vein Awakening], pushing her attack power to a new level.","Poison Technique, Slow Technique, and Plague Spread shrouded the Beast God's phantom.","She didn't use the Scatter Poison Technique—she had no toxin materials left, only quicklime powder, which would likely be ineffective against the Beast God's phantom.","Shen Chi and Xie Lin, the two main damage dealers, began unleashing a furious barrage.","Shen Chi's mecha switched its weapon to a Gatling gun, rattling shots at the gem atop the crocodile-shaped Beast God's phantom.","Under the relentless bombardment, Shen Chi's mana drained completely in less than five seconds.","Seizing the opening, Xie Lin smoothly took his place.","\"Piercing Rainbow Sword Strike!\" He landed a heavy blow directly on that green gem.","\"Crack!\"","A fissure appeared on the green gem.","With this, the Beast God's phantom grew even more translucent. Just as it tried to fight back, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao's taunt landed, successfully drawing the Beast God's attention.","No one sustained any damage.","The green gem shattered.","The phantom completely dissipated.","Then, a roar echoed.","\"How dare you destroy one of my avatars! I will remember you!\"","The Beast God's phantom howled in rage, and a Beast God's Gaze debuff appeared above everyone's head.","[You cleared the dungeon: Beast God's Temple (Nightmare Mode).]","[Dungeon clear time: 47 minutes, 21 seconds.]","[You received the first-clear reward: All stats +5, one Silver Chest.]","[A server-wide announcement is about to be released. Hide ID?]","\"No!\"","[Server Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Vegetable,\" \"Racing in a Wheelchair,\" \"Who Are You Calling Blind,\" \"Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao,\" and \"Suture Saint\" cleared the dungeon Beast God's Temple (Nightmare), achieving the server-wide first clear! Rewards have been distributed.] x3.","Finally finished!","A burst of light erupted around the boss, and among it, a silver glow enveloping a green shimmering item stood out conspicuously.","A Silver-grade piece of equipment had dropped!","Although [Nightmare Mode] Beast God's Temple did drop Silver-grade equipment, it was still a matter of probability.","It wasn't guaranteed every time!","Getting one on the first kill was quite a pleasant surprise.","After all, in the newbie village, only two bosses could drop Silver-grade equipment; the rest came from chests, so every extra piece was a massive improvement.","[Aura of High Soul Crystal Headband (Silver Grade): Attack Power +30, Spirit +10, MP Recovery Effect +15%.]","Another special piece had dropped!","The cloak from last time could be used by all classes, so everyone could bid on it.","But this piece's stats increased Spirit, making it usable only by Chu Fu and Suture Saint.","Chu Fu had the highest contribution, so she naturally had priority purchase rights.","If others wanted to compete in the auction, they would need to pay an additional 20% premium for bidding, and then the normal auction process would follow.","Chu Fu unhesitatingly stepped up.","\"I bid 1 gold coin!\"","\"I pass!\" Suture Saint agreed readily.","Even though they now knew a game incursion might be coming, making money useless,","Suture Saint simply had no money!","\"Now, this dungeon run is officially over. Time to open the chest!\"","Chu Fu took out the Silver Chest and opened it.","This time, she got a recipe item.","[Glowing Scale Powder (Silver Grade Recipe): Use materials to craft a poison powder. Upon release, the powder bursts with Light and Fire attribute energy.","Note 1: Can be thrown to create a blinding flash of light and white smoke to confuse enemies.","Note 2: Can be used to coat bladed weapons, adding Light and Fire attribute damage.]","Wasn't this just an evolved version of quicklime powder?","Plus, it could be used to coat weapons with extra effects.","To put it simply, if Chu Fu coated Xie Lin's heavy sword with it, the damage against soul-type bosses like the Beast God's phantom would definitely be much higher.","She would save it and make it back home.","Then, Chu Fu opened her own stats panel.","Currently, the four newbie village bosses had given Chu Fu a total of 10 all-stats points.","Two dungeon first clears added 18 all-stats points.","The achievement for killing 100,000 monsters added 3 all-stats points.","And at level 10, she had 50 free stat points, which she unhesitatingly put all into Spirit.","[ID: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable","Level: 10 (10.2% EXP)","Class: Toxicologist","Talent: Vegetable (S)","Skills: Poison Technique, Slow Technique, Plague Spread, Scatter Poison Technique, Poison Vein Awakening","Stats:","Physique: 32 (+39)","Strength: 32 (+15)","Agility: 32 (+18)","Spirit: 92 (+52)","Equipment: Mask of the Deceiver (Gold-tier), Green Poison Mushroom Skirt (Silver-tier), Malevolent Staff (Silver-tier), Poison Moth Cloak (Silver-tier), Beast Hunter's Emblem (Silver-tier), Aura of High Soul Crystal Headband (Silver-tier) ...","Wealth: 321 silver 829 copper.]","Truly magnificent stats.","After everyone exited the dungeon, Chu Fu checked the system notifications.","The system prompts had been too noisy while clearing the dungeon, so she had muted them.","Now that she checked, she noticed the notifications had changed.","[System Prompt: Your gaming pod is in high-speed motion while remaining relatively stationary.]","This description...","She was on a vehicle?","And the game system was this responsive?","Recalling from the original story that once the male lead had higher permissions, he could even converse with the [Primordial Gate] game system,","Since she herself had caught the attention of the Primordial Gate,","Chu Fu decided to just ask directly.","\"System, am I on a vehicle right now? Are there people around me?\"","[System Prompt: Your gaming pod is on a means of transportation, with 5 humans nearby.]","Chu Fu frowned immediately.","Five people nearby was very bad news.","She pulled out that experience card and checked the exchange values listed on it.","[S-grade talent Vegetable: Exchange for 20 days' worth of nutrient solution.]","[1 arbitrary attribute point: 1 day's worth of nutrient solution.]","[Poison Technique: 10 days' worth of nutrient solution.]","[Slow Technique: 15 days' worth of nutrient solution.]","[Plague Spread: 50 days' worth of nutrient solution.]","[Scatter Poison Technique: 15 days' worth of nutrient solution.]","[Poison Vein Awakening: 30 days' worth of nutrient solution.]","[Variant Dandelion Seeds (Black Iron): 100 space teleport stones.]","[Variant Cleaver Vine Seeds (Black Iron): 150 space teleport stones.]","[Variant Watermelon Bomb Seeds (Bronze): 200 space teleport stones.]","[Green Poison Mushroom Skirt (Silver-tier): 1500 space teleport stones.]","She had no space teleport stones.","There was no need to look at the rest.","What choice did she have?"]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Synchronize Data, Wake Up from a Vegetative State","paragraphs":["After thinking it over for a moment, Chu Fu made up her mind.","Twenty days to exchange for an S-grade talent: Plant Human.","Four days to exchange for physique.","Three days to exchange for agility.","The requirements for exchanging other skills were too high.","Besides, the game's invasion of reality was still nine months away. Over such a long period, the laws of the Flower Family were still in effect.","Not only that, even after the game invaded reality, national order had been maintained reasonably well.","There was absolutely no way she was going to end up in prison for killing someone.","As such, the ability to control plants offered much more versatility.","The season was also suitable; dandelions were everywhere. At worst, she could seize the opportunity to fly away.","Four points in physique gave her the stamina of a healthy person, while three points in agility were enough for escape.","As for strength, she would have liked to increase it, but she didn’t have enough energy.","[Experience method confirmed. Please enter deep sleep for rest to facilitate the transfer of abilities into reality.]","She even had to sleep.","Chu Fu quickly informed Jian Jian and the others.","“You need rest? Just head back to the guild headquarters to rest. A room has been arranged for you, its Employee Dormitory 301. Go find it yourself.”","“Okay~”","Chu Fu summoned the guild interface in the system and then located the [Return to Headquarters] function in the guild panel.","After activating it, a teleportation array appeared beneath her feet.","Ten seconds later, her view shifted, and she found herself inside a grand gate.","The entire headquarters was protected by high walls. Inside, it looked like a small fortress, featuring three-story Western-style round-topped buildings.","Apart from employee residences, there was also a commercial street, currently with a cafeteria and a pharmacy, where players could purchase medicine at a discount.","The guild also had a guild warehouse for storing and retrieving equipment.","The largest building directly ahead housed the guild core. If someone attacked and destroyed the guild core, the guild would be disbanded.","However, the guards on the walls were all level 10, so no one reckless enough dared to cause trouble at the Thorn Guild.","Chu Fu found the employee dormitory, went up to the third floor, and quickly located Room 301.","Pushing open the door, she saw the room was about sixty square meters, decorated like a cozy hotel room. The bed, table, and chairs were already set up, and a rabbit-fur carpet was laid out.","The furniture was clearly handmade by carpenters, simple in style. After all, it was already incredible that players could craft furniture by hand at this stage, so she couldn’t be picky.","The carpet was likely made by players like the Weaver of Dreams, who specialized in crafting items.","Yesterday, Chu Fu had hunted a lot of rabbits and once her bags were full, she’d shipped some materials to the Weaver of Dreams. It seemed the other person had added a few more touches to her room!","Without taking time to inspect the room further, Chu Fu placed the Rabbit Sleep Three-Piece Set on the bed and fell right asleep.","......","In reality.","The nutrient fluid in the game pod was rapidly depleting.","Large amounts of nutrient solution infused into Chu Fu’s body, gradually filling out her thin, withered frame.","More nutrient fluid flowed around her brain, seemingly in the process of enhancing something.","Time passed slowly.","Two hours later, the vehicle finally came to a stop.","They drove into a school.","[Linjiang City Auxiliary Education Disciplinary Special Training School.]","The car stopped in front of a two-story building. Soon, five large men carried the game pod inside.","On the second floor, some seemingly young teenagers stretched their necks to peer out. Some eyes burned with excitement, while others were dazed and numb.","Soon, a room was arranged for Chu Fu and her game pod.","A teacher from the school approached and said, “This is the game pod for Primal Gate? That’s hard to get into; it’s basically impossible to open. If we want the kid to quit the game addiction, we’ll have to trick... uh, get them out first.”","Guan Youlong waved his hand.","“The kid isn’t cooperating and won’t come out, but it’s fine. The nutrient fluid in this pod only lasts 27 days. After 27 days, she’ll have to come out whether she wants to or not, unless she wants to starve.”","The teacher nodded.","“Alright, let’s sign the contract first.”","Guan Youlong didn’t care about the money and immediately paid a tuition fee of fifty thousand.","He glanced at the game pod, whose signal had been blocked, and sneered.","“Let’s see what you’ll do in a month. I’m a patient hunter. Speaking of which, I’ve never tried a Plant Human before.”","As the grandson of the Sheng Tang Pharmaceutical Group, Guan Youlong had been groomed by the family and studied abroad, acquiring a wealth of medical knowledge.","He had a very perverse hobby: he liked to drug women he set his sights on.","Some of his victims had never realized they’d been harmed by Guan Youlong.","After all, in many people’s eyes, Guan Youlong was the epitome of a wealthy, handsome, and urbane elite. His overseas study experience only added to his aura.","When Wan Huanyu told him that Chu Fu and the others were plotting revenge, Guan Youlong immediately set his sights on Chu Fu.","In Guan Youlong’s eyes, they had already paid compensation, and the stain of prison had tarnished his illustrious background. He felt he was the one owed torture.","It wasn’t as if they had deliberately crashed into those people; Sun Jingya had been driving at the time. Why didn’t those people just get out of the way?","Because of that, he’d had to serve time with them.","Worthless lowlifes—how dare they plot revenge?","Now that the incident had blown over, they had plenty of ways to deal with these mere cornered beasts.","See? With just a small trick, wasn’t the leader of that disabled team already in his hands?","After 27 days, even if she reached level 20 or level 30, she’d have to open her game pod automatically, get kicked offline by the health system, and become a Plant Human ripe for the plucking.","He couldn’t wait.","Guan Youlong smoothed his collar and strutted away.","The school teachers respectfully saw him off, then returned to stand by Chu Fu’s game pod.","One of them knocked on it.","“This game pod costs a million. People really are willing to spend that much on these brats. A million would go a long way elsewhere.”","“Save the chitchat. Get the person out; maybe we can have some fun too.”","But no matter how much they knocked and banged, Chu Fu inside couldn’t hear a thing. Finally, they grabbed a chain and directly locked her pod shut.","“Ignore us, will you? Let’s see what you do when we let you out in 30 days. You’ll starve to death!”","Cursing, they left. They had other children to “educate” and couldn’t waste time here.","Inside the game pod.","Chu Fu kept absorbing energy, and after four hours of deep sleep, she finally fully awakened.","[System Notification: Your nutrient fluid is insufficient.]","[System Notification: The Experience Card function is now active. You have 2 hours, 59 minutes, and 59 seconds of usage time remaining.]","[System Notification: No humans detected in your vicinity.]","An opportunity!","Chu Fu took a deep breath, then selected to exit the game.","Instantly, that closed, dark world enveloped her.","It felt as if she had been locked inside a small room.","Chu Fu saw herself, shackled by unseen restraints.","But the next moment, a surge of green energy appeared at the center of her brow, as if a tiny sprout flickered and vanished.","S-grade talent: Plant Human.","The activation of her talent seemed to awaken Chu Fu, shaking off the invisible shackles that bound her. In an instant, the pitch-black cage shattered completely.","She snapped open her eyes.","Chu Fu was awake!"]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Where Did This Send Me An Internet Addiction School","paragraphs":["Chu Fu was no longer in a vegetative state.","Instead, just like in the game,","she was a healthy person.","Suppressing the surge of joy, Chu Fu felt the vitality of her body and nodded in satisfaction.","Taking advantage of the fact that no one was around, she quickly opened the game pod, but it only cracked open about ten centimeters—it was stuck.","Through the narrow gap, she saw a particularly thick iron chain binding the pod.","“Are the villains really this cautious?” Chu Fu muttered, scanning the room.","The room was extremely simple, like a small single dormitory, with no greenery at all.","But she was close to the bed.","Using her “mental power” to explore, Chu Fu soon spotted a plant.","It was the climbing ivy that covered the entire dormitory building.","[Climbing Ivy: Can mutate into Ladder Ivy.]","[Ladder Ivy: Can extend up to 50 meters. Even if it goes beyond the controller’s mental range, it will still extend to form a ladder upon command.]","“The prerequisite for a ladder is that I can get out first!”","This climbing ivy could only serve as a ladder—it couldn’t attack.","But she didn’t give up.","She immediately took control of the ivy.","“Go find me a dandelion!”","[Plant Manipulation]","Her mental energy infused into the mutated ivy, which seemed to come alive, quietly crawling and writhing along the walls.","Since their roots were naturally in the ground, dandelions were most likely to sprout in the corners.","Soon, the mutated ivy grabbed a dandelion, pulling away its leaves, roots, and fluffy seed head.","Then, the ivy climbed through the window.","It was summer, and the room had no air conditioning on—the window was naturally open, though there was an iron grille for security. But that didn’t slow down the mutated ivy.","“Wait, first take down the surveillance camera.”","Suddenly remembering something, Chu Fu controlled the ivy to crawl up the wall and dismantle the camera hanging in the corner.","In truth, Chu Fu had been overthinking.","In this kind of school, where students were often abused and punished, the surveillance cameras were usually broken and never turned on.","With the camera dealt with, Chu Fu finally let the Ladder Ivy bring the dandelion over.","The fluffy dandelion seeds were plentiful, and she carefully plucked some, clutching them in her palm.","There was no space backpack in real life.","Her secret weapon was these dandelion seeds.","She tossed one of the seeds out.","[Plant Mutation]","The dandelion seed began to grow in midair.","Its leaves sharpened, becoming long and wide, like a chainsaw.","In moments, a two-meter wide dandelion flared up arrogantly beside Chu Fu’s bed, its serrated leaves swinging wildly.","Finding the right angle, she cut!","“Vrrrrrr!”","The screech of the chainsaw instantly bit into the iron chain, sparks flying.","In just three seconds, the thick chain was cut through by the chainsaw dandelion.","“Clang!”","The severed iron chain fell to the ground.","“Open the pod!”","Chu Fu immediately opened the game pod and climbed out.","She checked her body carefully.","Her frail body had grown much healthier. Because of years spent bedridden, her skin glowed pale under the sunlight, and her long hair now reached down to her waist. Chu Feng hadn’t cut her hair short just because she was bedridden and required only simple care.","She wore a hospital gown, with underwear underneath—just no shoes.","But at this moment, she didn’t care about that.","Her feet touched the ground, toes curled as she searched around.","Previously, she couldn’t use the game pod to call Chu Feng; it must have been because of a signal jammer.","It should still be here.","Sure enough, under the bed inside the game pod, Chu Fu spotted a white box standing upright with seven or eight black antennas sticking out.","That was the signal jammer.","Chu Fu grabbed the jammer and handed it over to the Climbing Ivy on the Ladder.","“Take it away, far away!”","Chu Fu thought for a moment, then her eyes flickered with an idea: “Take it somewhere crowded.”","The Climbing Ivy on the Ladder wobbled slightly, then immediately dragged the signal jammer through the security window, disappearing from sight.","Chu Fu reactivated the game pod, then unlocked the spot where the phone was stored and took out her own phone.","This was obviously not the phone from the original memories; the phone from three years ago had been shattered.","This one must have been bought for her by Chu Feng.","Fortunately, combining her memories, Chu Fu quickly found Chu Feng’s number and immediately sent her location.","Once the location was sent,","Chu Fu naturally knew exactly where she was.","“What! They actually sent me to a rehabilitation school for internet addiction?”","Who could have guessed?","Chu Fu had thought that when Wan Huanyu and the others made their move, they’d lock her in some basement of a villa.","But reality in the business world was so plain and unremarkable.","They boiled water for the money tree, heated the koi to 90 degrees, swapped Ultraman for a statue of Guan Gong, and had the cleaning lady unplug the internet!","When it came to her, they actually sent the top player who first cleared the game to an internet addiction rehab school—to keep her from playing games.","This bizarre logic left Chu Fu stunned.","But rumors outside said this place was like a den of tigers and dragons.","Not only were the surrounding walls wired with electric fences,","They also frequently shocked others, often torturing and abusing the students sent here.","Some of the people weren’t even sent for internet addiction but because they didn’t obey their parents’ wishes—labeled as “bad kids” and forcibly brought here through deception.","Just as Chu Fu was pondering this, her phone suddenly rang.","Startled, she hurriedly answered.","Chu Feng’s anxious voice came through.","“Fufu, are you okay? Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao said you logged off just now. What’s going on over there? Are they threatening you?”","Chu Feng’s eyes were bloodshot.","In just four short hours, he’d been at the police station, checking all vehicles and screening suspicious people, but hadn’t found the car that took Chu Fu away.","When Chu Fu suddenly called him and sent her location, he was almost afraid to answer—it felt like someone was holding her hostage.","Especially since Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had just told him Chu Fu went offline!","Could Wan Huanyu have had weapons and subdued her the moment she stepped out of the game pod?","Is this call a threat now?","What made it all the more infuriating was that he had already mentioned the grudge between Chu Fu and Wan Huanyu to the Hats, but Wan Huanyu had an alibi, and the Hats lacked concrete evidence to investigate whether Wan Huanyu had orchestrated the whole thing.","Chu Feng could feel the suffocating pressure, frustration, and despair that Shen Chi must have endured back then.","Fortunately, after hearing about the feud between Chu Fu and Wan Huanyu, the Hats suddenly took Chu Fu very seriously and were now fully focused on analyzing the situation.","Unfortunately, all the leads had gone cold.","Zhao Deyu was nowhere to be found, and the surveillance cameras in Chu Fu’s hospital room were all malfunctioning. Questioning everyone one by one would take time.","What finally eased Chu Feng’s worried heart was Chu Fu’s soft, sweet voice, barely above a whisper.","“Brother, I’m okay!” Chu Fu said quietly, careful not to let anyone overhear.","She quickly relayed her situation to him.","Chu Feng let out a long breath.","“Stay inside the game pod and don’t come out. I’ll bring people over right away.”","Chu Fu was noncommittal.","“Brother, it takes at least four or five hours by car for you to get here from your side, but my experience card only lasts three hours. Instead of waiting for you, I’d rather get out first!”","Her tone was resolute.","In Chu Feng’s eyes, she was still the fifteen-year-old little sister who had been bedridden for three years like a vegetable.","But Chu Fu knew better—she still carried memories from her past life and was far from an ordinary girl.","Being protected by Chu Feng was certainly comforting.","But in the future, once the game invaded reality, who could protect her every day?","Besides, she wasn’t weak.","“No, don’t take risks. What if you get hurt?” Chu Feng tried to stop her.","At that moment, Chu Fu suddenly heard hysterical shouts echoing down the corridor.","“I’m not crazy! What I’m saying is true—the game is going to invade reality! I have an experience card, I’m a psychokinetic, I can control it! I’m just out of energy now, or I’d kill you!”","“That guy’s seriously lost it! Get the stun baton!”"]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Are You the Savior Sent by the Game The Thorn Queen","paragraphs":["“If you’ve got the guts, just kill me!”","The young man cursed loudly.","Hearing this, Chu Fu figured the guy probably didn’t just run out of mana—he was about to run out of life.","But she understood. Since this kid knew those secrets, he must have had some serious talent in the game, at least an S-rank talent, and had probably claimed quite a few first kills.","Now locked up and unable to log in, he was more anxious than anyone.","“Bro, there’s another player at the school with an experience card, but his family probably sent him here too. I’ll save him first, or he’ll get electrocuted. I’ll explain later!”","Chu Fu hung up the phone, slipped it into her pants pocket, hesitated for a second, then wrapped it with a bit of creeping vine.","She couldn’t afford to lose her phone—it would cause too much trouble.","Quietly opening the door, Chu Fu spotted a tall, skinny kid brawling with several short, stout instructors.","He darted left and right, moving like an agile little monkey.","It was total chaos.","Fake fighting: trading blows one by one.","Real fighting: wild screaming and clawing, with a grown man squirming like a pig being slaughtered.","Soon, the kid was pinned down by four or five guys and tied up with ropes.","One of them grabbed a stun baton and moved to jab the kid with it.","That’s when Chu Fu finally stepped in.","She threw the door wide open.","The sky-climbing vine lunged forward, roaring past Chu Fu into the hallway, instantly wrapping up all the burly men.","After its mutation, the vine mainly served as a ladder, but it was still a plant.","And plants could be controlled by Chu Fu.","Drawing on her experience with manipulating clinging creepers, she had no trouble making the vine twist and bind the men.","“Holy crap, holy crap, holy crap!”","The kid jerked his head up and saw Chu Fu—wearing a blue-and-white hospital gown, barefoot, hair wild and loose.","“No way, the Thorn Queen? You—did the game send you to save me?”","He jumped to his feet.","Chu Fu was amazed by his optimism but quickly said, “Run! What are you waiting for?”","He tore free of the ropes and dashed toward her.","The four instructors stood frozen, their faces showing shock, awe, even fear.","“Monster! Let’s go! Run!”","They squirmed like worms trying to escape Chu Fu, some even wetting themselves in terror.","She ignored them—it was fine if they were scared out of their wits.","She stopped controlling the vine to conserve her magic points.","If what the kid said was true—that he was a psychokineticist now out of mana—she had to watch her own reserves too.","Chu Fu summoned the electric saw dandelion from the room and launched it at the iron window bars.","“Vrrrrm!”","The terrifying blade spun, slicing through glass and security bars.","Shards of debris flew and cut into her delicate skin, but she didn’t care.","Once the window was torn open, the creeping vine surged up and formed a slide downward.","“Go!”","Chu Fu climbed through the broken window and slid down the vine ramp, landing on the first floor.","Just then, desperate cries erupted from every room on the second floor.","“Save us!”","“Help!”","“Please, help us!”","Young, anxious faces pressed against the windows, stunned by Chu Fu’s powers but even more desperate to escape.","Seeing them, Chu Fu couldn’t just leave them behind.","Some of these people might be talented players.","Locked up in an internet addiction boot camp, unable to log into the game—what a waste of combat power when the invasion came.","She shouted with all her might, “Get away from the windows!”","But her yell came out as weak as a kitten’s meow.","Even with 5 points in physique, her lung capacity wasn’t enough.","Just then, the psychokinetic kid slid down the vine and helped her shout.","“Back up! Back up! We’re breaking the windows! Now!”","His roar made the desperate crowd retreat. Chu Fu spun the electric saw dandelion.","The saw pressed against the wall, its two-meter diameter shredding the security bars.","Chu Fu started running.","Her control range was only ten meters.","Her bare feet hit the concrete—scorching and stinging. The summer sun had heated the ground to over 50 degrees Celsius, hot enough to burn skin.","Suddenly, she felt an arm grab her waist, and she was lifted into the air.","“You’ve got no shoes, Thorn Queen!”","The kid hoisted her like a chicken, then tossed her lightly onto his shoulder.","“Charge!”","He sprinted forward.","This was faster than running on her own.","Chu Fu didn’t bother being stubborn. She grabbed his head for balance, riding him like a living mount.","Now she could focus entirely on controlling the electric saw dandelion.","The dandelion ripped off window bars.","But it had been rooted in the ground—lifting it high and forcing it to cut through steel drained its health. Eventually, it broke apart.","Still, all the windows on the left side were open.","The creeping vine spread, forming ladder after ladder.","But five rooms remained on the right.","“Go save them!”","Chu Fu directed.","The kid carried her and ran.","Behind them followed the newly freed inmates.","“Shoes! I brought shoes!” A girl held up a pair of slippers.","The kid refused outright.","“She’s a patient. I’ll carry her. When I run out of steam, you take over. Quick—get the rest out, then we break through the main gate.”","Chu Fu germinated another dandelion seed, controlled it to climb the wall, cut through the window bars, and released the vine ladders.","Five more people climbed down.","Now there were twelve of them.","“Protect our mage!”","The psychokinetic kid shouted. The group formed a circle around Chu Fu and the kid.","They sprinted toward the gate.","The teachers and instructors finally reacted, grabbing bats and sticks as they chased.","These trainees had cost a fortune to lock up—they couldn’t escape!","The new instructors hadn’t seen Chu Fu control the vine and dandelion. They only saw thirteen people running and pursued with fury, cursing and shouting.","The kids ran for their lives.","Chu Fu felt the boy beneath her start to tire.","“Put me down. Give me the shoes. I’ll run.”","“No way! I’m not letting our savior get caught! In the game, I’m a Druid! Bear form!” shouted a chubby, baby-faced kid with dramatic flair.","He didn’t even have an experience card—he was just bluffing.","But none of the kids found it cringey. Instead, they felt their blood boil.","The psychokinetic kid set Chu Fu down, and the chubby, strong boy—barely heavier than air—hoisted her onto his back.","The girl on the other side shoved the shoes into Chu Fu’s hands and yelled, “I’m a girl—they won’t dare hit me. I’ll hold them off. Once you get out, make sure to call the police and save me!”","With that, she turned and hurled herself at the instructors.","Not only that, but four other girls in the group exchanged glances.","They couldn’t run anymore; they were too slow. If they could hold down even one, it would be one.","In an instant, the four of them twisted their faces into fierce, savage expressions, trying their best to look menacing.","As they lunged, they wrapped their arms around their targets’ thighs and bit down hard."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Queen, think of a way, can we still escape","paragraphs":["Around them came the heavy breathing and sobbing of the young boys.","\"Queen, think of something!\" the Telekinesis Master shouted.","Chu Fu was also getting anxious.","Her eyes searched around until she finally spotted her target.","\"Creeping vine, quick, head to that patch of grass over there,\" Chu Fu said, pointing at a clump of weeds in the vegetation.","The Druid, known as Druid Chubby, immediately started running with all his might.","[Plant Mutation]","Chu Fu instantly activated the creeping vine, forcing it to grow, bloom, and bear fruit, finally dropping new seeds.","At this point, apart from the coaches who were restraining and escorting the girls, everyone else was closing in.","But Chu Fu's speed-germination took time.","The opposition approached step by step, even carrying riot shields and electric batons.","\"Let's fight them!\" yelled the Telekinesis Master.","Just then, Chu Fu finally ripened the creeping vine seeds, grabbed a handful, and threw them.","The seeds only landed about two meters away.","Crap, she forgot she only had 1 point in Strength.","But it didn't matter—they had gotten close enough.","Chu Fu used Plant Mutation.","Instantly, the creeping vine seeds took root in the ground and grew at an astonishing speed.","Covering an area of 2 meters.","Extending up to 3 meters long.","Like venomous snakes, they lashed out and wrapped around the coaches and teachers.","\"Ah!!!\"","\"What the hell is this? Ghosts!\"","\"Sorcery! Black magic!\"","Their faces twisted in terror.","The creeping vine's armor-piercing thorns were dense and sharp. As the vines tightened, the wounds inflicted were pierced deep; the spikes entered the skin without drawing blood, but the pain was excruciating.","Now that Chu Fu had succeeded, the young boys surged forward, seizing weapons and beating down the coaches.","\"Stop fighting! Go rescue the others!\" Chu Fu shouted.","Everyone howled and charged toward the instructors who were holding back the girls.","Because the girls were using dirty tactics—pulling hair, scratching, biting—the coaches they attacked couldn't subdue them alone, leaving a full eight instructors occupied.","Seeing that he had been bitten, a coach erupted in fury and slapped a girl to the ground with such force she fell.","Who said these bastards wouldn't use violence?","When it came to attacking someone weaker, they had no hesitation.","Chu Fu gave chase. She had invested 3 points into Agility, bringing her total to 4, but she was still much slower than the other boys.","Fortunately, another boy came over, hoisted her onto his shoulder, and sprinted off.","Chu Fu wanted to yell that she could walk on her own!","But she really couldn't keep up in speed.","Soon, carrying Chu Fu, he reached the instructors who had captured the girls.","Then, all the boys looked at Chu Fu with hopeful eyes.","Chu Fu took out more creeping vine seeds, and with another toss, threw them to the ground.","[Plant Mutation]","The creeping vine seeds grew rapidly, wrapping tightly around several instructors.","\"Insanity! This world has gone mad!\" The instructors finally caught on, their worldview shattered.","Had those kids been telling the truth before?","Was the game really about to invade reality?","Was the world going to be destroyed?","Did they have to find the answers in the game and prevent this catastrophe?","So these teenagers were supposed to be the future heroes, and they were the ones blocking them?","No. Why?","They wanted this power too.","And if only a select few could possess it, why couldn't they be the first?","Now, looking at the vines again, deep inside them, fear was joined by excitement and greed.","\"Grab that girl! Get her—sell her to the big corporations. Dissect her. We could make a fortune.\"","\"That's right. The steward would surely want her.\"","\"No wonder that steward's brat sent these people here. He mentioned that using abilities consumes mana and has a time limit. We just need to stall!\"","Chu Fu and the others turned their gaze to the Telekinesis Master, all glaring with reproach.","Why did you tell them everything?","That boy, now frantic, said, \"I was just trying to make them believe!\"","No one had imagined it would turn into a leak of information.","Chu Fu couldn't attack now—she couldn't exactly use dandelions to saw off their legs.","\"If they're not blocking us, we leave!\" Chu Fu shouted immediately.","There was no time to waste here.","Everyone pulled the beaten girls along and ran toward the gate.","The instructors followed them, staying twenty or thirty meters away, having clearly figured out the range of Chu Fu's creeping vine attack.","Unfortunately, Chu Fu hadn't collected any climbing ivy seeds, or she could have tangled them up again.","It was too late for regrets now.","Soon, they reached the gate of the internet-addiction \"boot camp.\"","The gate was made of iron, incredibly heavy.","\"I suggest you don't touch that gate. It's electrified—the whole wall is live,\" the instructors sneered as they followed behind. Some of the injured ones, after Chu Fu left and the mutated vines went uncontrolled, had managed to break free.","Their clothes were torn, their skin damaged, and they were howling in pain, burning with hatred for Chu Fu.","Chu Fu ignored them and tossed out dandelion seeds again.","The dandelions instantly mutated into a chainsaw dandelion, spanning 2 meters in diameter.","Buzzzz!","The chainsaw dandelion spun and smashed into the iron gate.","Amid a blinding shower of sparks from clashing metal, the gate was sliced open, leaving a large semicircular hole.","Whoa!","The boys cheered wildly and rushed out.","But as soon as they all bolted outside, they froze.","The place they were in seemed to be on a slope.","Outside, there was only a single dirt road wide enough for one vehicle.","On both sides were endless cornfields.","The wind blew gently, and the rustling of the plants wasn't just soothing—it could have hidden wolves or tigers.","And the fields stretched as far as the eye could see.","That boot camp was built in the middle of nowhere.","Everyone had arrived here unconscious—brought by their parents after drinking a glass of milk or milk tea and falling into a deep sleep.","They had no idea what was out there.","If this was what they were up against, could they even escape?","\"What are you standing around for? Run! I've already called the police. My brother will come to rescue me—but we can't let those guys catch up. My trial card only lasts three hours,\" Chu Fu said in a low voice. \"And my mana is running low. I can only force-grow and control four plants now!\"","If the pursuers caught up to them, they truly wouldn't escape.","With that, the boys bit down and started running again.","But soon, they heard the sound of engines behind them.","The instructors were chasing them with cars.","Chu Fu immediately placed a dandelion in the middle of the road, force-growing it to a height of 2 meters to block them.","As if a pack of hungry wolves was hunting them, everyone gasped and sprinted for their lives.","But the vehicle was an off-roader. Seeing the chainsaw dandelion, it just drove straight into the cornfield beside the road, bypassed the obstacle, and came after them again.","It slowed them a little, but it wasn't enough.","The pursuers' goal wasn't to catch them.","They just wanted to trail behind, keep them from getting away, and outlast them.","Chu Fu and the others were already exhausted.","What were they going to do now?"]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Helicopter Lands, National Team Snatches Player","paragraphs":["A wave of despair settled over everyone's hearts.","Just then.","Chu Fu suddenly heard an extra sound.","\"Thump-thump-thump-thump-thump!\"","The noise was loud.","The sound of spinning rotor blades.","Chu Fu and the others looked toward the source of the sound, and the next moment, they all tilted their heads back, mouths hanging open, looking like they had never seen the world before.","What appeared in their sight was actually a helicopter.","Coming from the west, flying very close to the ground, allowing them to see it clearly.","It was larger than the helicopters they had seen on TV or in videos.","Its dark green shell looked like a roaring monster.","While they were still in a daze, another helicopter appeared in everyone's sight.","This time, it came from the east.","This helicopter was white, with four large red characters printed on its top: \"China Armed Forces.\"","It was an Air Force search-and-rescue helicopter.","The next moment, a even more distinctive blue-gray helicopter appeared right in front of them.","The three helicopters grew closer and closer, and finally they all hovered in a circle around the group of teenagers, as if surrounding them.","The terrifying wind from the helicopters sent the teenagers staggering.","\"Th-this... Did we break some cosmic rule? They're sending three helicopters to catch us?\" The telekinetic boy finally couldn't help it and plopped down on the ground.","Chu Fu was also stunned.","These were clearly national team helicopters, but to rescue people, why mobilize so much force?","Most importantly, Wan Huanyu and Guan Youlong couldn't possibly be powerful enough to command the national team.","Besides, they were the very ones who first initiated the split.","After the game invaded reality, they quickly occupied Wangxi Scenic Area, refused to be requisitioned as a settlement site, and openly challenged the national team.","How could someone like that have such a background?","Soon, the three helicopters dropped ropes, and troops descended directly from the air. A squad of soldiers ran over first.","A woman in a military uniform led the way, saluting Chu Fu.","\"We have received orders from superior command to ensure the safety of comrade Chu Fu, a special talent.\"","Special talent?","Me?","Chu Fu was somewhat taken aback. This was entirely a plot point that didn't exist in the book.","Or rather, it was the butterfly effect caused by her arrival.","Or maybe it was because Chu Feng was a lone wolf, so there was no description of how the national team dealt with this disaster before the game invaded reality.","Just then, the telekinetic boy beside her suddenly jumped up.","\"You-you-you, Fang Ning! Aren't you the host from those esports competitions, Fang Ning?\"","Everyone stared at her in astonishment.","Fang Ning was the most famous host in the esports circle at the moment.","She could speak five foreign languages, do on-site simultaneous interpretation, and had appeared many times in global esports tournaments. She loved wearing traditional clothing and promoting traditional culture.","These internet-addicted teenagers obsessed with games recognized her easily, but seeing her in a camouflage uniform was almost unbelievable.","Fang Ning laughed generously.","\"Looks like all those years weren't wasted.","Let me introduce myself briefly. I'm Fang Ning. I'm now a member of China's Special Preparation Bureau, specially assigned to recruit special talents for the country.","On behalf of Cangsong City, I warmly welcome comrade Chu Fu to join us.","Of course, if any of you have an S-rank talent in the game, you can join too.\"","Everyone was stunned by this shocking news.","China had actually established a department solely to recruit players with S-rank talents?","It felt like a dream.","Could they—these kids who just played games, these children not recognized by their parents—really join the national team one day?","The telekinetic boy immediately shouted.","\"Me, me, me! I have an S-rank talent, Telekinetic Field. I'm also a special class, a Telekinetic. My ID is Dream King, and my name is He Huiqi!\"","An unexpected gain?","Fang Ning's eyes lit up instantly.","Just then, the second squad of soldiers arrived.","\"Fang Ning, the public security in Cangsong City is so bad that schools like this haven't been shut down yet. This time, this genius player was even kidnapped and brought to Cangsong City. How dare you still invite her!\"","The man who spoke then turned to the group of teenagers with a smile.","\"Everyone, my name is Luo Qi. I'm the captain of the SAW team. I've also hosted some competitions. On behalf of Shanhai City, I invite you all to join us!\"","SAW was the strongest club in the esports field, sweeping all major championship titles. Luo Qi was the champion team captain of the first generation.","His credentials were clearly stronger than Fang Ning's.","It was just that when it came to appearance, he had no advantage. The esports circle rarely had anyone this ugly. When he smiled, it was downright scary.","Everyone stayed silent.","At that moment, another team ran over from the distance.","They carried stretchers and medical kits.","It was the rescue team from China Armed Forces.","\"Is anyone injured? The girl is the mission target, right? We need to give you a checkup. How are you feeling now?\"","Chaos ensued.","Chu Fu's injuries weren't serious—just scrapes—but others present had been beaten black and blue. Some had been running hard before and hadn't felt the pain, but now they couldn't hold it in anymore.","For a moment, everyone cried out in pain.","\"Boo-hoo, finally someone came to save us!\"","\"It hurts so much! They hit me!\"","\"My stomach hurts, my gut hurts too. I haven't had a full meal in days.\"","The crowd wailed.","The medical team rushed to treat them.","Just then, Chu Fu's phone rang.","It was a call from Chu Feng.","\"Fufu, are you okay? Are you all right? I got word that you've been rescued. Don't worry, I'll be there in another hour.\"","Just then, Chu Fu heard another voice on the other end of the line.","\"Brother Chu Feng, tell your sister—don't agree to anything Cangsong City or Shanhai City asks! She belongs to Linjiang City! Don't worry, I'll give you the best treatment.\"","\"Alright, alright, I know! I'm talking to my sister! Don't interrupt!\"","Chu Feng said a few more hellos.","\"Fufu, can you hear me?\"","\"Brother, I'm here. What's going on?!\"","Chu Fu wanted to know too.","Soon, Chu Feng explained it to Chu Fu.","During this time, Chu Fu and the others were taken back to the internet-addiction boot camp. Because Chu Fu wouldn't agree to board the helicopter, and Chu Feng didn't agree either, they couldn't just bake in the sun by the roadside, so they had to return to the school.","But this time returning felt completely different from before.","Previously, it was a cage.","Now, everyone knew they would soon leave.","This was just a temporary rest.","By then, all 34 people involved with the boot camp, including the kitchen auntie, had been taken into custody.","The surveillance footage was all deleted. Everyone was detained. All phones were confiscated.","But before that, the video had already been sent out.","Fortunately, it was only sent to a single person whose name wasn't marked. In fact, this person was Guan Youlong.","The moment Guan Youlong got the video, he forwarded it to Wan Huanyu, his voice almost breaking.","\"The vegetable has woken up! And he’s even brought abilities from the game. The world has gone crazy. No wonder, no wonder all the conglomerates are pouring massive amounts of money into the game now!\"","\"Wan Huanyu, hold tight—this is our era now!\"","Wan Huanyu watched the video, his fingers turning white from the pressure.","Just then, a knock came at the door.","\"Come in!\""]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: Preparations of the Blossom Clan, the Original Academy of Competitive Sciences","paragraphs":["Feng Huimin pushed the door open, adjusted her black-rimmed glasses, and said, \"Master Wan, here is the latest financial report. Our current expansion scale has exceeded the financial department's budget. Should we take some action to scale back?\"","Wan Huanyu had established the Huan Yu Studio, and among the 8,888 servers across 33 major regions, half of them had his people stationed.","Even if a single server had only 200 people, with a monthly salary of 10,000 each, the total payroll would be 30 million per month.","This was all liquid capital.","Not to mention purchases of equipment, acquisition of dungeon guides, and the living expenses of team members—money flowed like water.","For a newly established studio, it was practically a bottomless pit.","But Wan Huanyu was betting everything on it.","\"No, we must not scale back. On the contrary, we must increase the intensity and recruit directly from society!\"","\"Liquidate my real estate, antiques, and collectibles.\"","\"Oh, and the Wangxi Estate—sell it as soon as possible. You can reduce the price to offload it. Just make it quick!\"","That property was a money pit, difficult to sell.","With the current shifts in the global landscape, the downstream industries of his own group likely wouldn't want to fork over the cash.","If he lowered the price, some people of a lower tier who hadn't caught wind of the news might still think Primordial Gate was the product of advanced technology and cling to the hope of continuing their own business.","Then they'd have to rely on him and spend their money at Wantu Real Estate.","He had to make sure they took over the burden before they realized what was happening.","\"Understood. I'll handle it right away!\"","Feng Huimin furrowed her brow slightly. This task was not going to be easy.","...","At the internet addiction treatment center.","Chu Feng finally arrived by helicopter.","\"Brother, I'm here!\" Chu Fu waved.","She had already tended to her wounds, a band-aid still on her face. Her long black hair was brushed as neatly as possible, and her smiling face radiated sunshine.","Chu Feng felt a momentary trance.","It was as if this wasn't his sister.","She had gained weight—her once tiny face was now fuller, and her arms were no longer as thin as sticks.","Only her skin, pale and glowing, remained the same. Her eyes were dark as grapes with thick, curled lashes, the corners tilted slightly upward like a fox's gaze.","He hadn't seen Chu Fu with her eyes open in three years.","At this moment, Chu Feng—having been reborn and survived the apocalypse—couldn't hold back his tears.","\"Fu Fu!\"","He strode forward and pulled her into a tight embrace.","He wanted to hold her firmly but was afraid of hurting this fragile girl.","\"Brother, don't worry. I'm fine!\"","\"It's my fault for being careless. I'm sorry for what you went through, Fu Fu.\"","He had to make it up to her.","Right now, Chu Fu was in a different game server than he was, so he couldn't send her equipment.","That meant he'd just send her some property instead.","The kind that could still count as assets even after the game's arrival.","Then, Chu Feng introduced the middle-aged man standing beside him.","Li Weizheng.","\"Hello, hello, Miss Chu Fu. After receiving your brother's distress call, we immediately conducted a search, but the culprit was very cunning and left few clues.","\"Fortunately, you were brave and resourceful, and managed to escape on your own.","\"As soon as we learned of your whereabouts, I alerted the nearest armed forces in Shanhai City and Cangsong City to come to your rescue.\"","\"However, I heard that by the time they arrived, you had already escaped.\"","\"That puts my mind at ease. Miss Chu has been through quite an ordeal, so let’s head back now! We’ll discuss the rest later.\"","Chu Fu heard these words and felt a flash of familiarity—like when she had listened to her boss speak during her previous life working a job.","There was a hidden meaning behind his words!","[Immediate investigation] \"We’ve done our best.\"","[Immediate notification] \"We’ve put in serious effort.\"","[By the time they arrived, you had already escaped] \"These people didn’t really do anything—no need to mind them.\"","[Let’s head back now; we’ll talk later] \"Lure them back first to reduce the competition.\"","Impressive—truly impressive.","Still, Chu Fu had never planned to join another city anyway. After all, her roots were in Linjiang City.","Not only that, but most of the events in the storyline occurred in Linjiang City. Why would Chu Fu leave the stage of the plot to open blind boxes elsewhere?","So she agreed.","In fact, during the hour it took Chu Feng to arrive, he had already communicated with Chu Fu.","Huaxia had long been aware of the crisis of the Primeval Gate’s impending invasion into reality.","But the threat didn’t come solely from external forces—there were internal dangers as well.","\"Resorting to martial arts, unbound, is the road to chaos.\"","When ordinary people gained extraordinary powers, private conflicts would spiral out of control, even shaking the nation’s foundations.","But the ancestors had long known how to handle such matters.","Take in the best among the gifted.","The rest wouldn’t dare to cause trouble.","And so, the Special Preparedness Bureau was born, specifically tasked with recruiting S-class talent.","For now, to avoid widespread panic, the news hadn’t been publicly announced.","Still, the country had already taken targeted measures.","They established a nationwide chain of universities.","The Primeval Competitive Science Academy—","the only publicly funded e-sports college run by the state.","Tuition was free, the faculty was outstanding, and students could receive financial aid.","Moreover, this college was particularly aimed at young students who were addicted to gaming and didn’t want to go to school.","These people needed education to build a more solid worldview—rather than heading down a path of crime.","\"Miss Chu Fu, if you join the academy, I can arrange a grant of 5 million as a start!\"","\"Though it might seem a bit modest given your current achievements, you know state subsidies have never been high.\"","\"But I can promise you this: when the day comes, you’ll be among the first graduates of the Primeval Competitive Science Academy. Upon graduation, you’ll receive the rank of second lieutenant and serve as a vanguard!\"","Chu Fu thought: He wants me to become cannon fodder.","Instead of agreeing, she asked, \"Has the person who tried to capture me been found? And what about that doctor, Zhao Deyu? Was he caught?\"","Li Weizheng’s expression stiffened.","\"We’re actively pursuing him. The latest information is that Zhao Deyu has gone out to sea.\"","Linjiang City had a great river running through it that connected to the ocean’s estuary. Once past the estuary, one quickly reached international waters.","Shanhai City was right by the sea.","Once someone got out on the water, tracking them became extremely difficult.","Li Weizheng continued, \"Miss Chu Fu, do you have any other evidence? Besides Zhao Deyu, have you seen anyone else?\"","Chu Fu replied, \"I haven’t seen anyone else face-to-face, but earlier when I fought with those instructors, they said they were going to sell me to Master Guan's Sagely Group.","I believe they’ve been unlawfully detaining players and testing illegal drugs.\"","They still wanted to send me to be dissected.","You bite whoever you can.","Chu Fu would never let her enemies off the hook.","First, she gave the butler a taste of trouble.","Little did she know, she had hit the nail on the head.","...","On the high seas.","Zhao Deyu had changed into floral shorts and a white shirt, letting his potbelly show as he enjoyed the sea breeze, the ocean, and the sun.","A luxury yacht cruised toward him in the distance.","“Master Guan! What brings you here too? Heading abroad with me?”","Zhao Deyu greeted him warmly.","“Yeah,”","Guan Youlong replied, a hint of a well-concealed sneer at the corner of his mouth. “Come on, hop on my boat and have a drink!”"]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Your Experience Card Has Expired","paragraphs":["Zhao Deyu was extremely delighted. He went to Guan Youlong's luxury yacht to raise his glass and drink heartily.","Half an hour later.","Zhao Deyu was too drunk to wake up.","He was stuffed into a sack, thrown into the sea to feed the fish.","...","Inside the internet addiction reform school.","Chu Fu naturally accepted Li Weizheng's invitation to return to Linjiang City.","Li Weizheng couldn't stop grinning.","What surprised everyone was that these internet-addicted youths sent for reform had at least B-grade talents, but they had quickly fallen behind in levels due to their gaming addiction, leading their parents to send them to the reform center.","Now they've fallen behind in levels, and some are in an even worse state—the servers they played on had villages wiped out by beast tides.","For players on such servers, when their village is destroyed and they log in again, they appear in a ruined wasteland.","Not only that, but the area has likely become a gathering spot for monsters and bosses.","They would need a lot of luck to escape.","The chances of dying are high.","If that happens, creating a new character means their talent dies.","Fortunately, the national team discovered that after server merges, villages are connected, so they can go to those areas to clear out bosses and help these people keep their accounts.","Of course, this also depends on the city.","\"I don't want to go back. Can I follow Queen Sister? Even if my A-grade talent dies, it'll become B-grade, and I can still join an e-sports university.\"","\"After I became a druid in the game, I became really popular with small animals in real life. I found a dog, but my grandfather, who lives with me, thought it smelled bad and barked too much, so he killed it, cooked the meat, and wanted me to eat it.\"","\"He's too cruel. I can't believe he did that. I don't want to go back!\"","\"I argued with my grandpa, and my dad hit me, saying I was unfilial and that it was because of my gaming addiction that they sent me to this school.\"","\"I hate them.\"","The chubby boy's face trembled with fat. Judging by his solid, plump build, it was obvious he was doted on at home.","But when family conflicts like this erupted, it was a clash of values.","He couldn't accept his grandparents' generation being so bloody and brutal.","He even blamed himself for the stray dog's death—if he hadn't brought it home, it wouldn't have been killed.","His druid heart was wounded.","That's why he didn't want to go back.","Chu Fu comforted him: \"Every talent is extremely important, especially when that talent can be brought into reality.","Don't give up on yourself.","Besides, you can turn into an eagle, a leopard, or a bear, so you have a good chance of escaping from monster groups.","There's no need to delete your account and start over. But if you want to come to Linjiang City, come!\"","In the end, after everyone's persuasion,","the druid player Feng Leyuan still chose Linjiang City.","There were two others from Linjiang City.","He Huiqi, a psychokineticist,","and the girl who had given Chu Fu a pair of slippers, Jiang Yunuo.","Jiang Yunuo had been sent there by her stepmother under the excuse of gaming addiction.","Both planned to temporarily go to the e-sports university, where they could use dormitories for free and receive stipends that covered cafeteria costs.","\"I want to follow the Queen too!\"","\"Queen, can you give me your phone number? I'll add you later! I'll repay you someday!\"","\"Maybe we should create a group chat!\"","Among the discussions of the twelve youths, they finally set up a group chat.","Called: [Anti-Internet Addiction Academy Escape Group.]","These youths had their phones confiscated, so they couldn't join now.","They would have to wait until they got back to add Chu Fu.","On Chu Fu's side, her phone was also being bombarded. Huang Jiaojiao, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Li Zhenzhen had also formed a group chat.","[Thorn Founders (5/5)]","[Plantman]: I'll be back soon.","[Proud One]: Are you coming back by helicopter? Where are you landing? I'll pick you up.","[Wheelchair Person]: I'm coming too.","[Corpse Stitcher]: Pick me up too, please!","[Suture Saint]: Me, me, me, me! Take me, I beg you!","\"Officer Li, my friends are very worried about me and want to pick me up at the landing site. Can I tell them the landing address?\"","Li Weizheng's eyes lit up instantly.","Chu Fu was a plantman; she didn't have friends who cared about her.","They must be her teammates from the game.","Since Chu Fu could get experience cards, she must have gotten many first kills, so these friends were naturally from the first-kill team.","\"What talents do your friends have?\"","\"You'd better ask them yourself!\"","\"Fine, fine. Our landing address is the Linjiang City branch of the Original E-Sports Science Academy. They can come.\"","...","Original E-Sports Science Academy, Linjiang City branch.","The helicopter landed on the tarmac.","In the distance, a group of people craned their necks anxiously.","As Chu Fu got off the helicopter, she quickly waved at them in the distance.","This was everyone's first meeting in person.","Even in the game, they had only interacted for three or four days.","But there was no sense of unfamiliarity.","Huang Jiaojiao, with short hair and dressed in sporty streetwear, looked robust.","Shen Chi, sitting in a wheelchair.","Xie Lin, wearing sunglasses and leaning on a blind cane.","Li Zhenzhen, with long black hair and thick bottle-bottom glasses.","\"Jiao Jiao! Wheelchair Brother! Sword Saint Brother! Sister Suture!\"","\"Plant Girl!\" Shen Chi said, a smile tugging at his lips, his eyes warm and gentle.","\"Wow, Plant Girl, you've put on weight! Excellent! Much better than in the game, where you were skinny as a stick,\" Li Zhenzhen said.","\"Quick, show me! Can you actually bring your abilities to reality?\" shouted Huang Jiaojiao.","\"Alright! I only have three minutes left on my experience card!\"","Chu Fu immediately activated a mutated dandelion, even speeding up its maturation to produce a hot-air balloon dandelion.","At the internet addiction reform school, Chu Fu hadn't completed the maturation step because it wasted magic points, and the mutated dandelion seeds were too big to grip easily.","Now, there was no such concern.","She pulled down a hot-air balloon, plucked the seeds, and handed one to each person, making sure to place one in Xie Lin's hand.","In real life, Xie Lin couldn't see.","So he had stayed quiet.","Because he didn't know what Chu Fu looked like now; he could only hear her voice.","As he took the seed, his fingers seemed to briefly brush against a cool, soft touch.","Xie Lin smiled, rubbing the dandelion seed.","\"It's the same size as in the game!\" he said.","\"Exactly, Sword Saint Brother. You'll get your chance too!\"","Everyone chatted and laughed. Chu Feng and the two soldiers carrying the stretcher behind him watched Chu Fu anxiously.","\"Alright, lie down on the stretcher first. If you have anything to say later, you can say it in the game!\"","Chu Fu's experience card didn't have much time left.","She would become a plantman again.","This made everyone's smiles disappear, their expressions turning somber.","\"My brother's right. We'll talk in the game.\"","Chu Fu lay down, ready to be locked back in the small dark room.","[System Notification: Your experience card has expired.]","In an instant, Chu Fu felt some force being drawn out from inside her."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Finally No Longer a Vegetable, Double Happiness Arrives","paragraphs":["It was as if something vital had been stripped from her soul, causing her to lose the talent for awakening.","Her S-grade plant-based talent had vanished.","Next came her constitution attribute points.","In an instant, Chu Fu felt herself growing weak. Her face turned pale, and she visibly withered.","Her body grew heavy, no longer possessing the agility of a healthy frame.","Her constitution and agility were gone.","\"Fufu!\" Chu Feng grabbed Chu Fu's hand, his eyes bloodshot, on the verge of tears.","But then, the next moment—","Chu Fu blinked.","\"I...\" Chu Fu said in astonishment, \"I'm not a plant anymore!\"","She was no longer locked in that dark little room.","She had regained her consciousness.","She was merely weak, with low attributes, but she had woken up.","In reality, as long as someone with locked-in syndrome wakes up, it means they've recovered.","Because Chu Fu had experienced the abilities from the game, her awakening still affected her.","\"Fufu! Thank goodness, you're okay, you're okay!\" Chu Feng exclaimed, overwhelmed with excitement.","\"Wow! Awesome, Plant Girl!\"","Jiao Jiao and the others were thrilled too.","Just then, Jiao Jiao's phone rang. She picked it up unhurriedly, saw the saved number, and finally answered.","It was the salesperson from Wangxi Estate she had added yesterday.","Since she still needed time to deal with her real estate and assets, Jiao Jiao hadn't bought a house yet.","But she had already asked about the prices.","The salesperson had been very cold, only sending basic info after adding her, and hadn't followed up much.","After all, people who could afford an estate were rare.","Now that Chu Fu was no longer a plant, what better reason to celebrate?","Might as well finalize the house.","She answered the call.","A very enthusiastic voice came through.","\"Hello, Ms. Huang. I'm a salesperson from Wangxi Estate. You previously expressed interest in our estate's houses. Now, we're having a massive promotion—everything is 50% off! You can buy an estate at half price.","The original 12.8 million yuan, 320-square-meter standalone villa is now only 6.4 million!","The original 22.4 million yuan, 580-square-meter estate villa is now only 11.2 million!","The original 40.32 million yuan, 1,020-square-meter garden villa is now only 20.16 million!","And the prestige villa, only 9 of these in the whole complex, covering 2,050 square meters!","First come, first served. Original price 80.64 million, now only 40.32 million!","Finally, the super prestige villa is also being sold at a massive discount—original price 172 million, now only 86 million! Only one in the whole complex! Don't miss out!\"","Jiao Jiao was stunned by the barrage of prices.","Then, she instinctively asked, \"What's the down payment percentage?\"","\"Thirty percent. You only need 30% down. For the most basic model, just 1.92 million to take it home!\"","Jiao Jiao tried to do the math in her head but couldn't figure it out.","She gave up.","\"Hang on. I'll come find you to buy it later. I'm busy now, gotta go!\"","Jiao Jiao excitedly said to Chu Fu, \"Plant Girl, Wangxi Estate suddenly lowered prices! They're having a clearance sale at 50% off, and you can get a 30% down payment. Should we go all in and buy?\"","Chu Feng was taken aback.","Wangxi Estate? Wasn't that Wan Huanyu's base for the Wanhuan Guild?","And Jiao Jiao, his sister, wanted to buy it?","Why would she even think of buying that, especially when she was still a plant?","For a moment, Chu Feng looked at Chu Fu, his eyes filled with a probing curiosity. He asked tentatively, \"Fufu, why do you want to buy that estate over there?\"","In an instant,","Chu Fu felt the atmosphere around her freeze.","Meeting Chu Feng's gaze, she trembled all over.","How could she explain?","Could she say she was reborn and knew the secret? But the original Chu Fu's past life ended on the first day of the game's invasion.","She had no knowledge of Wangxi Estate.","And if she said she had transmigrated from a novel...","Chu Feng cared so much about his sister. If he found out that his sister's fragile soul had already dissipated, and that an otherworldly soul now occupied her body, would he accept it?","In that moment, Chu Fu's mind spun wildly, and she ultimately decided to tell a white lie.","She leaned close to Chu Feng, cupping her hand around his ear, and whispered, \"Brother, if the game really does descend into reality, besides the monsters, wouldn't the beginner village also descend?","Our 030 server is Wangxi Village, which corresponds to the Wangxi Scenic Area. I'm just betting on it!\"","Chu Feng paused for a second, then quickly accepted this explanation.","That was right—Chu Fu was correct. Wangxi Village was indeed the corresponding server for Server 030.","Back then, that server was controlled by one of Wan Huanyu's capable subordinates, Huanyu Kuangba.","With his aggressive and domineering style, he forced all players in the beginner village to join the Wanhuan Studio, and successfully won the village defense battle.","Although after the battle, Huanyu Kuangba's reputation was ruined—he was even criticized for defaulting on player wages—he didn't care at all.","Especially after the game invaded reality.","Because Wangxi Estate became the largest residential area within the beginner village's landing zone, he scored a major achievement for the Wanhuan Group.","As a reborn player, Chu Feng hadn't even thought to seize Wan Huanyu's Wangxi Estate first.","Because he had been focused on developing in the game, knowing that money now was just useless paper.","Later, when the Blue Star's land area expanded, he could just grab territory with sheer power.","But thinking about it now, uprooting Wan Huanyu's foundation would be fantastic!","\"Fufu is really smart!\" Chu Feng praised, then turned to Jiao Jiao.","\"My sister isn't in great shape and she's injured. Let her get on the game first. I'll go with you to buy the house!\"","\"Sure!\"","Jiao Jiao immediately agreed.","As for Chu Fu, Chu Feng decided to temporarily leave her at the e-Sports University.","What e-Sports University was this?","This was essentially a military zone!","It was definitely safe enough.","...","Beginner Village 0308888.","Chu Fu logged in and first checked the level rankings.","It was already the fourth day since the game launched.","She had been out of the game for three hours. Not much had changed on the rankings, though most players had already reached level 4.","Xie Lin, Shen Chi, and Suture Saint all needed to return home before logging in.","So Chu Fu opened her flight wings and flew toward the tiger king's area.","On the way, she asked Li Weizheng about the instant respawn point for level 10 monsters, the colorful tiger.","As the head of Linjiang City's e-Sports University, Li Weizheng naturally had access to more detailed strategies—ones discovered by his team of warriors through ground searches.","Chu Fu planned to grind monsters there to earn the achievement of 100,000 kills.","What Chu Fu didn't notice was that as she flew over the forest of red-eyed rabbits, a player with a name so dark red it was nearly black was down below.","ImmobileKing!","\"Why isn't anything happening?\"","\"Then why were they collecting kills?\"","ImmobileKing frowned deeply.","Soon enough, a wolfman cloaked in a black robe approached him."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: The Immortal King Joins the Evil Side and Betrays Humanity","paragraphs":["\"Wicked one, butcher of humanity, slaughterer, fanatic who loves bloodshed and war, would you like to join the chaotic faction, embrace the embrace of the evil deity, and gain the evil deity's favor and blessing?\"","ImmobileKing heard the system prompt and felt ecstatic in his heart.","So that was it.","Plantman and the others had all joined the evil faction and gotten their benefits.","So what was he hesitating for?","ImmobileKing immediately agreed.","\"Good, good, good! ImmobileKing, you're the truly clever human. Here, take this mask. Conceal your identity well. When the beast horde attacks the village, I have a task for you!\"","Werewolf Tuge handed the Disguiser's Mask to ImmobileKing.","Seeing the golden mask, ImmobileKing felt that all his previous investment had been worth it.","Damn, that Plantman and his group were so sneaky.","Hiding such a great opportunity like this.","But at that moment, ImmobileKing also understood why, among all those districts with so many talents, only three villages had managed to hold off the beast horde.","There were traitors among the crowd!","Fortunately, he had now become one of those traitors.","ImmobileKing grinned, picked up the mask, changed his ID, and altered his appearance.","In that moment, his name turned white.","ID: 【Playing Dumb】","...","Chu Fu flew halfway when Suture Saint came online first, quickly sending a private message.","\"Plant Girl, I'm planning to collect heads to get the Disguiser's Mask. Help me kill Werewolf Tuge later!\"","Chu Fu was a bit surprised.","Suture Saint had never been all that invested in the game before. She'd always cashed out the money she made and wouldn't spend it in-game.","This incident must have really shaken her up.","\"Alright, but you'd better find a few people to protect you. You're a priest after all. If you become red-named, I'm afraid someone might get greedy and attack you.\"","Suture Saint felt a chill run down her spine.","What Chu Fu said was entirely possible.","Although the Thorn Guild now dominated server 0308888.","Who knew if there were remnants of the Huanyu Studio still around?","\"Alright! I'll ask for help.\"","Suture Saint called out in the guild, planning to hire a few people with copper coins or equipment.","Right then, Shen Chi and Xie Lin came online.","【Rocket on a Wheelchair】: No need to call anyone. I'm doing achievements in the Red-Eyed Rabbit area. I'll keep an eye on things.","【Call Me Blind】: Count me in too!","Suture Saint was moved.","Her teammates were so thoughtful, making her feel truly secure.","Soon, Shen Chi and Xie Lin arrived at the Red-Eyed Rabbit zone, found a quick-respawn spot, and started farming.","【0308888】【Suture Saint】: Offering 10,000 for getting killed, buying player kills. Those who want payback, come to coordinates XXXX.XXXX.","But no sooner had Suture Saint shouted this than she received a whisper.","【Shafu Liangu】: What's up with you all? Everyone seems to be buying kills. But someone earlier was offering 5,000 for kills—you're overpricing it.","Suture Saint was taken aback.","【Suture Saint】: Who? Who was offering 5,000 for kills?","【Shafu Liangu】: A guy named ImmobileKing.","Suture Saint had never heard of him. With 10,000 players in the whole server, how could she know everyone?","But she had a bad feeling.","She already knew that the game was seeping into reality, and Werewolf Tuge was clearly an enemy.","Was there still anyone in the beginner village who could take down Werewolf Tuge?","Of course not.","Could he have joined the evil faction?","Thinking this, she quickly sent a message to Chu Fu.","When Chu Fu saw it, her eyes sharpened.","\"We've got a traitor in our village!\"","Chu Fu knew that players who joined the evil faction would side with the monsters when the beast horde attacked the village.","Not only that, but the most terrifying part was that these players wanted to upgrade their Disguiser's Mask.","Kill 1,000 people.","Would he honestly still just buy kills now?","With the golden mask, he could just straight-up murder people.","【Who Wants to Be a Plant Lady】: We need to watch out for him griefing other players. Starting today, organize patrols. If anyone sees him PK-ing low-level players, immediately stop and kill him!","【Suture Saint】: I'll arrange it right away.","She now acted as Jiao Jiao's secretary. With Jiao Jiao away, she naturally had to handle some guild matters.","While she was busy, Suture Saint's communication device rang.","[Incoming call request from: Keng Die.]","Suture Saint answered: \"What's up?\"","\"Hey, kiddo, last time you said you made money in the game. Could you send me some? I'm trying to bid on a piece of equipment, but it's kinda expensive!\"","Suture Saint really didn't have any money left. She had just emptied all her earnings and sent them to Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao to help her buy a house.","She wanted to live in Wangxi Manor too.","Stick with Plant Girl—can't go wrong.","\"I'm broke too. I spent all my money on a house!\"","\"Buying a house now? Houses aren't worth anything these days. This cross-gen game is the real investment target.","Have you read any novels? You know, those ones with Dragon-Slaying Wizards or Shadow Assassins?","Forget it, can't explain it to a bookworm like you. Tell me, your mom and I are both alternative internet addicts—how did we end up with a straight-A student like you?\"","Suture Saint facepalmed.","Her contact name \"Keng Die\" was totally fitting. Her dad was the biggest obstacle in her life.","Her parents were considered rebellious by everyone else.","They fell in love online at sixteen, eloped, and her mom gave birth to her at seventeen.","The two were truly in love; Suture Saint was the accident.","Maybe two wrongs made a right, because Suture Saint was unusually sharp from a young age and an excellent student.","By the time she reached school age, her flaky parents were only twenty-one. They finally took responsibility, started working, and began providing for her.","But when they went to work, they left her behind as a \"left-behind child.\"","She lived with her grandparents, who favored boys over girls. It was a brutal start in life, but she knew that only by studying nonstop could she escape.","Her maternal grandparents had often tried to take her mom back.","The first time her mom was lured back was when Suture Saint was two. Her mom was then \"married\" to a bachelor 17 years her senior, beaten badly, until her dad rescued her.","Something like this happened every few years.","Now, her uncle was a 39-year-old bachelor no one wanted to marry.","And her mom was still a 43-year-old internet-addicted girl at heart.","At least this time, her parents had done something right.","They bought her a gaming helmet, hoping to drag her into playing with them.","\"Dad, you know those are just game novels. You don't think you're the main character, do you?","I'm telling you, I'm working for a top-tier player—a real protagonist. She's setting up a guild, and I've invested in it.","Once I buy the house, I'll rent it out to those gamers in the studio. Easy passive income, right?","You're the one with no vision.","Anyway, when the house is ready, I'll bring you both over to live with me.","Like I said last time, the big shot I'm with has made enemies. I'm worried you two might get stabbed in your rental place.\""]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: The Property Deed Is Under My Sister's Name, the First Wild Boar King Battle","paragraphs":["\"Fine! But are you sure I can't give your dad 600 bucks for a Black Iron grade piece of equipment?\"","Suture Saint: ...Why didn't you say so earlier?","What do you mean, small ask?","But seriously.","\"How come you're asking me for 600 bucks? Didn't I send you 500,000 before?\"","\"Your mom won't let us use it. She says it's saved for your dowry. We're both zero-spending players—only freeloading allowed. No depositing money into the game, or we'd be a disgrace to the free-to-play crowd!\"","\"Stop, stop, stop!\" Suture Saint sometimes couldn't keep up with his dad's gaming lingo, so he cut him off, saying he had things to do and hung up.","He wondered if Jiao Jiao was having any luck on her end, and whether she could snag a villa for herself too.","...","On the other side.","Huang Jiaojiao and Chu Feng headed to Wangxi Estate together.","Considering this was still a property of Wantu Real Estate, Huang Jiaojiao and Chu Feng put on disguises—one wore a mask, the other sunglasses.","Dressed in designer labels, Huang Jiaojiao said to the saleswoman, who stared in shock, \"I'm buying houses for my lovers.","Here's the plan: 50 million for my main wife—the biggest imperial palace—and see what else you can throw in.","Then 23 million for my second wife.","13 million for my third!","5 million for my fourth!","All on loans!\"","The saleswoman's expression shifted completely as she looked at Huang Jiaojiao.","A queen in the lesbian world?","That was brutal—four wives, spending 90 million in total.","If this deal went through, she'd be rolling in commissions.","Soon, with the saleswoman's recommendations, Huang Jiaojiao secured a 5,600-square-meter super imperial palace and two 2,050-square-meter mansion estates for Chu Fu.","She got two 2,050-square-meter mansion estates for Shen Chi and one for Xie Lin.","She added a bit more money and bought a 1,020-square-meter garden villa for Suture Saint.","All on loans.","Finally, for herself—she could only afford half of the remaining villas.","She only had 100 million in liquid cash left.","Just as she was hesitating, Chu Feng stepped in.","\"Don't just go for the big ones. We'll split them half and half.\"","Though he said half and half, after Huang Jiaojiao spent 100 million, Chu Feng dropped 200 million and bought up all the remaining estates.","Together, they secured 95% of the houses in the entire complex.","The saleswoman's heart nearly jumped out of her chest.","Was money really just a number to the rich?","Huang Jiaojiao wasn't surprised. Chu Fu's brother couldn't be a nobody—this was a mega-bigshot.","And Chu Feng's money came from meeting a tycoon in the car earlier, selling him a guild token meant for auction for 200 million.","After the game [Primordial Gate] launched and enabled bank card-linked trading, the bank's monitoring systems became essentially useless (a revisions—making it more logical).","That was exactly why major nations were eager to uncover [Primordial Gate]'s secrets.","If this continued, the existing economic system would completely collapse.","But this played right into Huang Jiaojiao and Chu Feng's hands.","They swiped their cards without any hiccups.","First came the deposits.","Full payment would come when the property deeds were issued.","The saleswoman was frantic, her entire team moving like their feet were on fire, getting everything done in half a day.","\"Put all these houses in my sister's name!\" Chu Feng said.","Huang Jiaojiao: \"...Is it too late to call you brother now?\"","Chu Feng raised an eyebrow. \"As I recall, you're older than me!\"","\"Brother Feng, you'll always be my brother in my heart!\"","Both were easygoing people, and after just half a day together, they were already comfortable enough to joke around.","...","[Server 0308888]","[Server 0308888] [Suture Saint]: Recruiting—1,000 for getting killed. Death allows resurrection and revival; you'll lose EXP, which can also be used to exchange for gear. One person can be killed up to 10 times. Message me.","That's right, Suture Saint suddenly had an idea—why not kill people and then resurrect them?","That way, the other party wouldn't lose their character, and he could rake in sin points.","Sure enough, this method exploited a bug and actually worked.","However, every time Suture Saint revived someone, they got a heavy injury debuff, reducing health and HP cap. After 10 kills with this debuff, they would permanently die and couldn't be revived.","That's why Suture Saint only offered up to 10 kills.","Even so, he was racking up sin points faster than anyone else.","The world chat chimed in with jokes:","\"Those who sold their heads for 1,000 earlier really missed out!\"","\"The ones for 5,000 got an even worse deal.\"","\"Hey, our village priest actually has a resurrection skill? Can you bring me back if I die later?\"","[Suture Saint]: Accepting resurrection requests. 1 silver coin per revive. Extra charge for long-distance; no dungeons.","Although Chu Fu said one resurrection cost 10,000, that was for areas with players above level 10. Prices were lower in the starter village now. Some players, unwilling to lose their accounts, naturally turned to Suture Saint.","\"Don't bother the plant girl. We three can handle it!\" Shen Chi said, readying his mech and bomb-thrower.","Xie Lin nodded.","They had all grown stronger.","But the werewolf Turg's stats remained the same.","If it showed up, they'd still wipe the floor with it.","It just took 3 minutes to kill instead of 30 seconds.","Three minutes later.","The werewolf Turg was dead for good.","Finally, Suture Saint got his Golden equipment piece.","\"Thanks, my amazing teammates from Touching Flower Nation!\" Suture Saint expressed his gratitude to the two.","\"No problem. I'm off to farm the mutated rat achievement!\" Shen Chi said.","\"Me too!\" Xie Lin added.","\"I'll stay and farm red-eyed rabbits. I can one-shot them now with my needle!\"","Suture Saint stayed behind, simultaneously messaging Chu Fu to tell her she didn't need to come back and that he was farming red-eyed rabbits.","\"You've got the Stitch Corpse skill, so you don't have to grind this hard!\" Chu Fu said.","Healers were always special.","Suture Saint smiled. \"I believe resurrection-type skills will become common later. Then what difference would I have from other healers? Grinding hard now is so I can take it easy later!\"","In Suture Saint's view, [Primordial Gate] might be called an RPG, but it was really an experience simulator.","How well you built your character came from daily effort.","Clearing dungeons for first kills required skill; earning achievements for stat points required persistence.","Neither could be missing.","He probably couldn't rack up too many monster kills within 10 days, but he couldn't afford to fall behind either.","\"Alright, keep farming for now. When Jiao Jiao logs in, we'll clear some world bosses and then tackle a nightmare-level dungeon. Let you guys hit level 10 first, so achievements will be easier.\"","After saying that, Chu Fu frowned.","\"Is the boar king supposed to respawn soon?\"","Suture Saint checked the time and asked curiously, \"There's still one hour and three minutes. But do we really need to farm the boar king now?\""]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Server-wide Rule Established: No Malicious PK Allowed","paragraphs":["They were all level 10 now, and the Wild Boar King's bronze equipment, for just level 5, wasn’t really worth it.","Besides, other squads from the Thorn Alliance would fight to grab it too.","Top-tier squads didn’t bother with such low-level loot.","But Chu Fu said coldly, “That ImmobileKing definitely joined an evil organization earlier. He wants to level up his mask without paying a huge price, so he could just kill players through malicious PK.\"","“The Wild Boar King fight is going to be total chaos.”","“People might even go hostile for the sake of snatching the boss!”","“And the most important thing: Jiao Jiao collects kills. So do Wheelchair Brother and Sword Saint Brother, and now you do too!”","“Attention-seekers have already noticed. Maybe someone has even posted a guide on the forums by now.”","“During the free-for-all around the Wild Boar King, who’s to say someone won’t try a one-and-done solution, completing this hidden quest without spending a cent?”","“If that happens, we’ll be setting a bad example!”","Chu Fu wasn’t trying to stop others from completing this hidden quest.","But this kind of thing, increasing your kill count, should be done with everyone’s consent, right?","Otherwise, wouldn’t it just be hurting lower-level players?","Of course, when Chu Fu completed the hidden condition, she never asked the people from Universal Studio for permission.","What could she do? She’s that two-faced.","Too bad she has a score to settle with Universal Studio!","In the future, her thousand-kill and ten-thousand-kill achievements would still rely on Universal Studio.","“And besides, that ImmobileKing — now we know he’s joined the evil faction.”","“Is he going to go around killing other players?”","“This could be a small issue or a big one, because if he kills too many, it’ll affect the Village Defense War.”","Suture Saint finally understood.","“So what do we do now?”","“Go over there, put on a show, and lay down the law!”","Chu Fu’s weak voice spoke the most domineering words.","An hour later.","Inside the Wild Boar Ridge.","The majority of players were now levels 3 to 4, leveling up by grinding monsters in the ridge.","Most importantly, some people actually knew the Wild Boar King’s respawn time.","Right now, near the Wild Boar King’s lair, at least four to five thousand players had gathered, more crowded than a train station.","All teams were rubbing their hands in anticipation, and some lone wolves wanted to get the final blow to claim the bronze equipment and make some quick money.","The Thorn Guild members stood together. They didn’t bother clearing the area, but every squad was neatly arranged, their gear clearly far superior to ordinary players’.","This immediately sparked a buzz of discussion.","“Everyone in the Thorn Guild is such a high level — all level 4, and some even level 5 or 6.”","“That guy riding the giant spider — his gear is the Mutant Rat Queen set!”","“That’s the sixth-ranked player, Shafu Liangu.”","“Such a fierce name.”","“Can we even compete? Their DPS is so much higher than ours.”","“Hey, it’s all about luck. What if we snag it? Are they going to kill us? That wouldn’t be any different from Universal Studio.”","As they were thinking that, the noise grew louder.","Someone pointed to the sky.","High above, several players with huge mechanical wings descended from the skies.","It was Chu Fu and her crew.","Everyone craned their necks, gaping like country bumpkins seeing modern tech for the first time.","Especially when they noticed the complex equipment on them, emitting a faint silver glow and shimmering— unmistakably silver-quality gear.","“Wait... this is just a level 5 boss. Is it really necessary for the top-ranked player to come and snatch it?”","\"Already wearing a full set of Silver-tier gear, and you’re still eyeing this Bronze equipment?\"","\"Might as well spend the time grinding Beast Temple instead!\"","Chu Fu didn’t say a word. In many people’s eyes, despite her frail appearance, she was incredibly strong.","But her voice was weak, lacking any real authority.","So instead, Chu Fu directly used a server-wide megaphone.","[Server 0308888] [WhoWantsToBeAVegetable]:","\"Everyone, we're all players from the same beginner village. The boss is up for grabs, but as we've seen in earlier zones, infighting over the boss leads to heavy casualties and ultimately failing to defend the village. I hope we can agree on this: from now on, everyone can compete for the boss, but no malicious PKing.\"","[Server 0308888] [WhoWantsToBeAVegetable]:","\"If a player is killed by malicious PK, they can wait for a resurrection from the number one healer of the Thorn Guild, Suture Saint. After resurrection, the victim must provide video evidence of the malicious PK. The cost will be paid by the offender. And if someone repeatedly engages in malicious PK, I will step in and personally force them to reincarnate.\"","[Server 0308888] [WhoWantsToBeAVegetable]:","\"This is for the good of our server, 0308888. We all want it to become the main server and keep our beginner village alive, save the NPCs in it. Let’s work together and protect it.\"","Chu Fu’s words didn’t force anyone to give up the boss, nor did they drive anyone away. Instead, they simply urged everyone not to engage in malicious PK.","In the end, many players who were running quests agreed.","After all, everyone knew that NPCs in a beginner village would never respawn once killed—every NPC was unique.","Word was that another server had an incredibly cute little girl NPC. During the village defense battle, she died in the beast tide.","All the players regretted it afterward.","\"That’s right, we need to stick together. No PK, just peaceful competition for the boss. Friendship first, competition second.\"","\"The NPCs in the beginner village already have friendly relations with us. Besides, if the village gets destroyed, the cats and dogs there will probably be eaten too. I can’t accept that!\"","\"I agree.\"","\"Agreed. +1.\"","Everyone nodded. When a proposal is made and most people follow it, it becomes a rule.","Chu Fu’s words, backed by her strength, naturally won everyone’s approval.","Just then, the Wild Boar King spawned.","The crowd surged forward immediately.","But everyone held back their attacks, careful not to hit others.","The Wild Boar King only had 200,000 HP. If Chu Fu threw two watermelons at it, the boss would be dead instantly.","But she only cast a Poison spell to speed up its death. Whoever got the kill was up to their own skills.","Melee players swarmed in, but it turned into a crowded mess.","However, the Wild Boar King didn’t stay put. In fact, its charge attack was devastating.","\"Oink! Oink! Oink!\"","The Wild Boar King suddenly charged fifty meters, knocking all surrounding players away.","Some low-HP Assassins screamed in pain and collapsed into corpses, forced to send messages on the map channel.","[Map]: \"Healer, save me, please.\"","Chu Fu hovered in the sky, keeping an eye on everything.","She didn’t miss a single dead player.","Her gaze swept over, though it didn’t appear sharp, it still sent an inexplicable chill creeping up the backs of those below.","The ImmobileKing lurked within the crowd.","Gritting his teeth.","‘Damn, this Plantman is way too controlling. She even cares about killing?’","How was he supposed to kill more people and upgrade the Disguiser Mask?","And something wasn’t right—if the Plantman had agreed to side with Werewolf Tuge, since they were supposed to be together, with her strength, she should have wiped out the entire newbie village by now.","Eliminating the village would definitely bring massive rewards.","It’s just a game—how you play it shouldn’t matter, right?"]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: Leading Guild Members on a Team-Building Trip, Radiant and Glorious","paragraphs":["But right under the other party's nose, Bu Dong Wang didn't dare to make any rash moves.","The others also chased after the Wild Boar King's tail, countless ranged-class players unleashing magic and arrows.","The Wild Boar King had 100,000 health points, and when Chu Fu and Shen Chi were both level 1, they had spent a long time grinding it down.","Now, in less than three minutes.","This field boss crashed to the ground.","Loot dropped!","Two pieces of bronze equipment sparkled and shone, floating in the air. The nearest person reached out to grab them, only to find they couldn't pick them up, and let out a sigh of disappointment.","Xie Lin flew over, his heavy sword resting on his shoulder, radiating intimidation.","\"Alright, alright, if you didn't get a chance to grab anything, move along. Let the designated looters handle it, everyone disperse.\"","\"It's just two pieces of bronze equipment anyway. The Thorn Guild will put a batch up for auction later.\"","\"When everything's ready, we can all upgrade and take on the nightmare mode dungeon!\"","The crowd cheered at Xie Lin's words.","Their goodwill toward the Thorn Guild skyrocketed.","Look at them.","Now that's setting an example.","\"In truth, equipment prices on our server are quite a bit cheaper than on others.\"","\"You don't get it, do you? That's because our server's progress is way ahead of others. Take District 26, for example—they started four days before us and still haven't cleared the nightmare mode dungeon!\"","\"Since Plant Boss led the charge through the dungeons first, surplus equipment started circulating, allowing more people to clear dungeons and more gear to be sold. That's why our server's players keep getting stronger.\"","\"We'll definitely be able to defend the village.\"","Everyone was quite fond of the current gaming environment.","If the Huanyu Studio had taken over the newbie village, they could already imagine the hard times they'd be facing.","...","The Plant Boss they were all buzzing about, Chu Fu, had already led her team away.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao finally logged in.","\"Plant Girl, I handed the deed to your house over to your brother. The villa still needs to be cleaned up and stocked with some essentials—it'll take at least five or six days. Your brother says you can just focus on the game during that time!\"","Chu Fu naturally nodded.","Little did she know what a huge surprise was waiting for her.","\"Since you're online now, let's start today by leading the team to take down bosses. Bosses give great experience, and it'll help the guild level up faster. It's worth using the double experience boost here.\"","\"No problem, let's go, let's go!\"","In the game [Primordial Gate], players at level 20 can form a 10-player team, also called a mercenary group, but the group leader must register as a mercenary group captain.","However, guild leaders and vice presidents have the authority to form super large teams.","That means up to 500 people.","Chu Fu had formed the team earlier, and now there were 329 members online, all present.","This was the Thorn Guild's first super large-scale event.","Chu Fu used her team-wide communication privilege, so her voice could be heard by everyone without her needing to shout.","Her voice was weak, but every word was clearly enunciated.","\"Hello everyone, members of the Thorn Guild! I'm the Vice President... You can call me Plant Girl or Plant Sister, or just 'Plant' for short. But please don't call me Plant Boss, because I'm not a plant lady anymore!!\"","Chu Fu's words seemed to put headphones on everyone, her voice ringing directly in their ears.","Hearing how she referred to herself, everyone let out good-natured laughter.","\"Since this is everyone's first time participating in an activity, let me go over the rules first.\"","\"For this boss kill, all dropped items will be publicly auctioned.\"","\"Ten percent of the proceeds go into the guild's operating fund, and the remaining funds will be distributed among all participating members.\"","\"Our kill route is the Silvermoon Wolf King, the Bear King, and the Tiger King.\"","\"Among them, the Tiger King has a chance to drop a guild token. If it drops, the guild management will purchase it on the spot for 100 million coins, distributed as rewards based on contribution to the boss.\"","\"Theoretically, everyone could get 200,000 coins each!\"","The Thorn Guild members erupted in screams and cheers again.","This carrot was both sweet and well-rounded.","Chu Fu smiled as she cracked jokes along the way, making the journey less boring.","Plus, as players leveled up, their movement speed increased. It took only an hour to reach the Silvermoon Wolf King's territory.","The Silvermoon Wolf King was still standing on a large rock. Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao pulled aggro, and the battle began on the spot.","Xie Lin covered his eyes, attacking the Silvermoon Wolf King's weak point from behind.","From his position, he could \"see\" Chu Fu's silhouette.","She was commanding with calm precision.","She called out the Silvermoon Wolf King's skills, adjusted everyone's positions, assigned each person accurately, and ensured everyone dealt damage.","An intangible aura was forming around Chu Fu.","An unseen momentum.","She had gone from a sickly girl to a powerhouse in the game, and now she was a real authority figure in a major guild.","From a nobody in a weak position, she had become dazzling.","I want to be like that too, Xie Lin thought.","Under everyone's relentless barrage.","The Silvermoon Wolf King soon fell, dropping bronze equipment that sold at auction for a high price of 42 silver coins.","Four silver and two hundred copper went to the guild fund.","The rest was distributed immediately.","Those with high contribution got a few hundred copper, while those with less got a few dozen.","More importantly, the boss's experience was shared among everyone. With the double experience boost activated, it was definitely more profitable than grinding normal monsters.","Plus, the hourly double experience could be paused and reactivated when needed, making it very cost-effective.","Next came the Bear King, followed by the Tiger King.","Chu Fu smiled and said this time: \"The Tiger King requires a lot of attention. Everyone, please look after your own safety and ease the healers' burden. Also, I won't be holding back this time.\"","\"After all, it's something worth 100 million, so the management has to do their part too!\"","During the Wolf King and Bear King fights, Chu Fu and Shen Chi hadn't used their full strength.","Since their damage output was explosive and far beyond everyone else's, if they went all out, no one else would get any contribution.","As usual, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao pulled the aggro.","Chu Fu started with her skills: Poison Spell, Slow Spell, Plague Spread.","And Scatter Poison, using lime powder.","She hadn't had time to make the new recipe yet.","After this set of skills, everyone noticed Chu Fu's team contribution skyrocketing, surging to 20%.","Her damage was incredible.","Little did they know, she was still holding back!","When the Tiger King used its \"Soar on Wings\" skill and flew into the sky, Chu Fu tossed out all the watermelon bombs from her inventory like bowling balls.","And at level 10, she could stack up to 20 watermelon bombs.","The Tiger King was killed mid-air.","Chu Fu alone dealt contribution equivalent to an entire team, accounting for 50% of the total.","\"Boom!\"","The Tiger King crashed from the sky to the ground, dropping a pile of loot.","\"Did it drop? Did the guild token drop?\"","Everyone was hooked by Chu Fu's promise, craning their necks to get a look."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: The guild is full of talents, and both hosts and guests are delighted.","paragraphs":["Of course, the result was nothing!","This item wasn’t so easy to get.","But a silver-tier weapon was guaranteed to drop—a gleaming silver longsword.","【King’s Sword (Silver-tier)","Physical Attack: 52-64","Magic Attack: 25-35","Strength +5","Agility +5","Sword Aura: Attacks generate an additional 1 meter of sword aura range.】","“Wow!”","“Amazing! A melee weapon with extra attack range means a bigger area of effect!”","“God, if you combine this with an AoE skill, it’d be insane.”","“How much is this weapon worth?”","Every melee-class player got excited.","This was a silver-tier weapon.","It was definitely the first of its kind on the entire server. Even Chu Fu and the others’ weapons came from silver-tier chests.","Chu Fu controlled her voice to sound more excited, stirring up the crowd.","“A silver-tier weapon, the only one on the server—our guild’s melee fighters and warriors didn’t come for nothing!”","“Right now, the melee class with the highest contribution in the guild is: Shafu Liangu. He gets the first bid! Everyone else must bid at least 20% more than his opening price.”","“If there’s a competitor, follow the normal auction process. Now, Shafu Liangu, please state your bid!”","Chu Fu pointed at Xie Lin.","The priority bidding right was a privilege for high-contributors.","Restricting the equipment’s class and type also prevented others from disrupting the auction for reselling purposes.","Gear from guild activities staying in the hands of guild members boosted the guild’s overall strength.","These rules had evolved over time through Chu Fu’s story progression.","Using them ensured fairness and saved a lot of trouble—rather than just handing gear to whoever needed it.","What if one person never got their piece of equipment?","That’s why Chu Fu’s team always used auctions from the start, distributing the funds to everyone in the group.","Even brothers settle accounts openly.","As Chu Fu’s words landed.","Xie Lin immediately made the first bid.","500 silver.","Chu Fu smiled and added, “Last time, when we took down the Tiger King, the drop was the cloak on our guild leader Prideful Proud. As a special slot item, it sold for 1 gold.”","“But everyone knows how important weapons are. The guild management held back to give you all a chance! Bidding starts now. Minimum bid increment is 100 silver.”","Xie Lin also spoke up: “Don’t hold back just because I’m management. Highest bid wins, and everyone shares the earnings.”","In the guild, some players could only stare longingly. 500 silver was 500,000! Who could afford to compete?","Prideful Proud struck first.","“600 silver!”","As a shield warrior, Prideful Proud could use a one-handed shield and sword. The King’s Sword wasn’t a two-handed weapon, so she was eligible.","“700 silver!”","More competition?","Chu Fu glanced over and saw a woman with a stylish silver hairstyle, looking to be in her fifties.","ID: Wu Chunying.","Beside her, a few younger girls chattered: “Grandma Wu, this sword is good, but 700,000 is too expensive.”","“Yeah, you don’t have to raise it that much. After the guild leader added 100 silver, you could’ve just added 1 silver—601 silver. Slowly bid, and the final price won’t be so crazy.”","Wu Chunying smiled warmly, with a relaxed and comfortable demeanor.","Every move she made carried a unique grace.","But Chu Fu still reminded her, “Grandma Wu bids 700 silver. Please be rational—700,000 is no small sum. If your kids found out, they’d think you were scammed!”","Someone in the guild quickly typed back.","【Little Sister Wu】: Vice leader, it’s fine. My mom has money and time. She’s the honorary president of Linjiang City’s Tai Chi Sword Association. If she likes a sword, she’ll buy it.","“So, you two are mother and daughter in the guild?”","“Alright, Grandma Wu bids 700 silver. Anyone else?”","Xie Lin raised the bid: 800 silver!","Prideful Proud countered: 900 silver!","Xie Lin raised again: 1 gold!","This time, Grandma Wu hesitated.","“It’s not that I’m out of money. But I can see this kid really wants the sword. Plus, the King’s Sword clashes with my Tai Chi philosophy. Maybe it’ll serve him better.”","Xie Lin said, “It’s not that profound—I just like the high stats.”","But thinking it over, her words carried a lot of depth.","“Grandma Wu, I learned something today,” Xie Lin said.","If the game’s invasion of reality was only a matter of time, then as someone aiming to be a Sword Saint, he needed to understand the sword better.","Just like how he wanted to become a Blind Monk—there had to be obsession!","Prideful Proud, hearing this, said, “Hmph. I’ll take Grandma Wu’s advice too. This sword is yours!”","In truth, Prideful Proud thought: I’m a queen too, so why wouldn’t this King's Sword suit me?","But as a melee DPS, Xie Lin would make better use of it.","By raising the bid, she also wanted to avoid leaving a bad impression on the guild—that management was buying gear cheap while treating members as free labor.","They were a legitimate guild, not a black-market coal mine like the Universal Guild.","Chu Fu then announced, “Any more bids? No? Then countdown: 3, 2, 1!”","“Congratulations! Shafu Liangu wins this silver-tier longsword! Congratulations, boss!”","Xie Lin spent 1 gold and secured the sword.","The guild chat immediately erupted with emojis and texts:","“Congratulations, boss ✿✿✿✿!”","“Generous boss ✿✿✿✿!”","“Thanks, boss! Hope you get rich ✿✿✿✿!”","Next, the bronze-tier gear was auctioned off.","Everyone competed fiercely.","Although only a few could get the gear, the rest still got wages!","Chu Fu distributed payouts based on contribution.","She unceremoniously took 477 silver for herself.","The other players got at least 1 silver, with some getting 3 to 5 silver. That was the equivalent of over a thousand in real-world daily earnings—already a high-paying job.","If only this could last forever. But they all knew it could only continue for five more days.","Because the server had been open for five days. In five more days, the village defense battle would begin.","Luckily, this event didn’t just offer cash—it also gave tons of experience.","Shen Chi and Xie Lin reached level 10.","Prideful Proud and Suture Saint were just shy of level 10.","Most guild members gained at least one level.","Some elite players could even organize to tackle the Beast Temple Dungeon.","With that, Chu Fu arranged the next steps, splitting the team into two groups.","Chu Fu and Prideful Proud’s group: one tank, two DPS, one healer.","Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Suture Saint’s group: one tank, one DPS.","While Shen Chi could serve as either a main tank or DPS, with Chu Fu around earlier, the bosses died before they could chain their sustained damage.","But together, they were more than enough to clear Nightmare-level Beast Temple.","As for Chu Fu’s group, she invited players who had performed well during this event.","【Leader】【Want to Be a Plant? (Poison Master, Level 10)】","【Member】【Prideful Proud (Shield Warrior, Level 9)】","[Team Member][Shafu Liangu]: Gu Master, Level 8","[Team Member][Wu Chunying]: Martial Artist, Level 6","[Team Member][Little Sister Wu]: Shaman, Level 7"]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: On the Eve of the Village Defense Battle, Rongxun Studio","paragraphs":["\"Let's head back to town to repair first and meet at the entrance of the Beast God Temple. I need to brew a poison.\"","Chu Fu opened the guild interface and looked up the guild quests.","The guild quest list allowed members to post requests for collecting wood, stone, basic materials, etc., in exchange for experience points and guild contributions.","There was also a lot of experience to be gained.","That meant players who hadn't joined a guild were naturally missing out on the experience from guild quests.","Chu Fu posted a temporary quest.","[System Notification: Members of the Thorn Guild, please note—administrator \"Who Wants to Be a Plant Guy\" has posted a temporary quest: collect materials—fire stone, scale powder, sunflower petals, and white quartz sand. Reward: a certain amount of experience points and copper coins.]","Fire stone could be gathered in the wild, scale powder was dropped by winged insect-type mobs, and both sunflowers and white quartz could be collected.","Among the players, there were hoarders who would gather anything valuable, even if they had no immediate use for it, and then sell it to the general store.","As soon as Chu Fu posted the quest, some players specifically went to work on it.","They could submit the materials directly through the guild panel, so all Chu Fu had to do was collect them from the warehouse.","With the materials in hand, Chu Fu headed to the alchemist’s lab and rented a private room for 20 minutes to start crafting.","[System Notification: Crafting successful. You obtained Flash Scale Powder x1.]","[System Notification: Crafting failed!]","[System Notification: Crafting successful!]","[System Notification: ...]","Soon enough, Chu Fu had crafted about a dozen batches.","She messaged Shen Chi and Xie Lin.","\"You two haven't gone to run any dungeons, right? I’m going to coat your weapons with poison to make the boss fight easier.\"","Shen Chi and Xie Lin quickly came to the pharmacy.","\"Just coat my mech’s cannon barrel with poison. The Sword Saint doesn’t need any.\"","Chu Fu tilted her head, looking puzzled.","Shen Chi chuckled lightly and said, \"We learned level 10 skills. I have Mech Overload, which can boost damage by 200%. The Sword Saint unlocked a special move—Holy Light Slash!\"","Chu Fu turned to Xie Lin in surprise.","A smile lingered at the corner of Xie Lin’s mouth. Though his eye patch covered his eyes, his expression was still full of cool confidence, carrying a hint of smugness.","\"Holy Light Slash has a built-in flash effect. Not only that, but when the enemy's health drops to 20%, it can execute them. That means even a boss could be sliced down by 20% of its health in one blow—though there's only a 5% chance.\"","\"Whoa! That's powerful!\"","Shen Chi’s level 10 skill was similar to Chu Fu’s Poison Vein Awakening—both were level 10 burst abilities.","But Xie Lin’s Holy Light Slash felt more like an ultimate move.","This might be the difference between a hidden class and a special class.","\"Let’s go ahead and coat the weapon anyway. You can still use it with other skills. Ultimates always have a cooldown!\"","Shen Chi was only joking; he didn’t actually mean to stop Xie Lin from poisoning his weapon.","\"Let’s farm more materials lately and upgrade your sword too. If the attack range were increased by two meters, you could practically function as a melee mage.\"","\"Yeah, for sure. Plant Girl hasn’t upgraded her weapon yet either, has she? I’ll gather some materials later and upgrade it for you as well.\"","Consider it payment for the poison coating. Mentioning money might make things feel awkward between them.","\"Then thanks a lot, Sword Saint bro!\"","Chu Fu raised her hand, crossing her thumb and index finger into a heart shape.","With everything settled, Chu Fu led her new team into the dungeon to start clearing it.","Incidentally, she also probed into the talents of these two potential members.","Among them, Grandma Wu Yingchun's talent was: [Tai Chi Grandmaster (S)]: Automatically brings learned Tai Chi techniques into the game, with additional damage Amplification.","As for the Professional Martial Artist, it was also a hidden class.","Passive: [Martial Arts Foundation]: Body, Strength, and Agility +10%.","Level 1 Skill: [Meditation]: Stand and regulate breathing for 3 seconds, slowly restore health.","Level 5 Skill: [Combo]: Attacks flow continuously; the more hits landed, the stronger the damage. No more than 3 seconds between two hits.","This effectively meant that Grandma Wu had no active attack skills; she relied entirely on her own techniques or basic attacks.","But this made her even stronger.","Because Grandma Wu could use the Tai Chi Sword, and there were so many Tai Chi moves that it felt like every move could be turned into a skill.","With this kind of talent, there was a high probability she could become an advanced player or even a star player.","But Chu Fu had never heard of her before.","It was definitely all Wan Huanyu's fault.","Moreover, Grandma Wu was a busy old lady in real life, always participating in community activities and the Tai Chi group in the square.","She didn’t spend much time playing the game; otherwise, with this talent, she wouldn’t be only level 6—and that was her level after taking down a boss.","Little Junior Sister Wu from the Wu family was more diligent. Since she was a healer, she leveled up faster.","Next, Chu Fu took the two to grind through the Nightmare-level dungeon.","The Beast God Temple dungeon could be cleared in 47 minutes, but this time they were short two damage dealers.","However, the impact wasn’t big. In the end, one clear took an hour, and they quickly brought both of them to level 8.","Over the next few days,","Chu Fu spent 6 hours each day leading guild members to take down 3 bosses and the Nightmare dungeon, and used the remaining time to work on the 100,000-kill achievement.","The targets were: level 10 Striped Tigers, level 9 Ravens, level 8 Black Panthers, level 7 Giant Pythons, and level 6 Black Bears.","By then, most players had also reached level 6. When Chu Fu went back to the level 3 Wild Boar Ridge area, there were hardly any players around, perfectly avoiding the main crowd.","After that, she added level 4 Wolves and level 5 Mutant Bulls.","Including the Beehive Bees, that made a total of 11 achievements.","Of course, there were more monsters in the novice village, but the others didn’t form sizable groups or respawn instantly. Within the strict 10-day limit, she couldn’t complete achievements for them.","Especially since their novice village no longer had 10 days left.","Only 8 days remained.","Because once 1,000 players in a novice village reached level 10, the village defense battle would trigger early, starting at midnight.","Now, on the novice village leaderboard, only three people had not yet reached level 10.","Everyone was waiting for these three.","And those outside the leaderboard were still trying their best.","Just as Chu Fu was busy preparing with the Thorns Guild, a video exploded online.","A video posted by a Douyin influencer with millions of followers, filled with righteous indignation, sparked outrage among players of \"Primordial Gate,\" and even drew serious attention from the officials.","\"Hello everyone! I’m Lin Haowan, a game review streamer! When it comes to the hottest game right now, it has to be 'Primordial Gate,' the groundbreaking full-dive virtual reality MMORPG! It’s even taken the world by storm.","From 80-year-old grandmas to 13-year-old kids—boys and girls alike—everyone has jumped into the game, hailing 'Primordial Gate' as the second world.\"","It is also because of its unique partitioning and regional server settings that it has established a distinctive platform.","When the streamer entered the game, they spawned on server 0268888.","The players on this server are all from Linjiang City.","Shortly after entering the game, the streamer quickly discovered that a local company had already invested in a studio.","Rongxun Studio!"]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Furious at Three Major Groups, Chu Fu Suspects He Was Taken Out","paragraphs":["Chu Fu watched the video, curious about the events that hadn’t appeared in the storyline.","It was like pieces of a puzzle, filling in the gaps of the entire world.","Everything she hadn’t understood now had an explanation.","In the video, the indignant streamer displayed a pixelated picture.","It was clearly an image of a cup of yogurt.","Even though it was blurred, Chu Fu could instantly tell what the yogurt picture was.","It was from Shunmuyuan.","A local dairy company in Linjiang City.","Chu Fu knew it all too well.","Because the chairman of this company’s last name was Wang!","That was Wang Silu, who had been drinking with Sun Jingya, Wan Huanyu, and Guan Youlong three years ago during that car accident.","But this studio wasn’t opened by Wang Silu—it was her brother, Wang Rongxun.","After all, a rich girl who had been to prison and even bore a stain on her arranged marriage wouldn’t have been qualified to get the money to start a studio.","However, Wang Rongxun was cut from the same cloth as Wan Huanyu and Guan Youlong.","In the video, the streamer named Lin Haowan grew increasingly emotional, even furious.","“As a solo player, my gaming experience has been absolutely terrible.","The best resource points are all monopolized by that studio.","When fighting bosses, I get maliciously PK’d.","Even the dungeon entrances are blocked off,","so other players can’t claim the first kills.","And that’s not even the worst part!","Let me remind you, Server 026 already went through a village defense battle two days ago.","But what infuriates me is that the members of Rongxun Studio—who got the boss first kills and dungeon first clears—all logged off at the edge of the beginner village.","They grabbed the best resources,","got the best gear,","and then dodged the responsibility of defending the village!!!","As a result, the remaining 5,214 players were completely wiped out, all killed by monsters.","That’s right, you heard me!","By the time the village defense battle started, only 5,214 of us were left.","And from what I know, Rongxun Studio had recruited about 1,200 people, with an average level of 9.","This is a blatant, undisguised setup by capital.","After the village was destroyed on Server 0268888, I wanted to expose this.","But by the time I finished editing the video, it was already the next day.","And coincidentally!","The exact same thing happened on Server 0278888!","Most importantly, that server had a guild—they got a guild token and established the Huanyu Second Guild!","Same monopoly, same formula, same cowardly retreat!","I’m absolutely furious.","I gathered my fans, found some friends, and will be livestreaming the entire village defense battle on Server 0288888 today.","That server has a studio run by a local Linjiang City business—it’s called the Youlong Studio.","Then, Server 0298888 has the Longhan Studio!","And worth mentioning, Server 0308888 originally started with the Huanyu Studio as the main force. Over 200 people blocked the beginner village entrance at launch, forcibly recruiting high-talent players. If anyone refused, they were harassed, kicked out of grinding spots, or had their monsters stolen. And if that didn’t work, they were cursed out.","But unlike the other servers, this one had a wildcard!","Two solo players—’WhoWantsToBeAVegetable’ and ‘Rocket on a Wheelchair’—claimed the Wild Boar King first kill within the first ten hours of launch.","Then, when they were ambushed by Huanyu Studio at the level 3 dungeon, they didn’t back down. They fought head-on, taking out fifty members of Huanyu Studio, and even trapped them at the beginner village gate, turning their names blood-red from the kills!","The video is on the official site—you can look it up. I gotta say, watching that was incredibly satisfying!","So cathartic.","After that, these solo players went on to claim first kills on all three-person dungeons, even clearing the nightmare mode ones.","They also took down every boss in the beginner village. That’s when Huanyu Studio completely disappeared.","But according to an anonymous source, the studio’s remaining 150 members were all sent back to respawn by ‘WhoWantsToBeAVegetable,’ silencing them for good.","Later, the Thorn Guild was established. The guild leader, ProudButNotArrogant, is reportedly a top-tier rich woman and the main investor.","That’s normal—in a game this big, you can’t build a guild on your own without a backer.","But after this guild was formed, what did they do?","In the Wild Boar King area, they emphasized that malicious PK was forbidden.","For wild boss kills, it was every man for himself.","They organized small auctions,","distributed surplus gear to ordinary players,","drove down the price of bronze equipment,","and didn’t hesitate to take non-guild members through dungeons.","In this harmonious atmosphere,","the entire Server 0308888 saw players level up rapidly.","As of the time this video was recorded and published, only 7 players on the server’s leaderboard hadn’t reached level 10!","Barring any surprises, tonight they’ll face the village defense battle alongside the studio from Server 0288888!","So, let’s see what happens.","Will the capital-backed studio collapse in defeat, or will the wealthy second-generation heiress successfully defend the village?","At midnight tonight, I’ll livestream the village defense battles of both servers.","Not only that, but assuming Server 030 defends its beginner village, Servers 026 through 030 will inevitably merge. As a veteran player, I’ll immediately apply to that server.","I’m going to establish an anti-capital monopoly alliance.","I hope more players oppressed by capital will join us!","Thanks for watching this video. I’m Lin Haowan. Follow me, and you won’t get lost.”","Chu Fu finished watching the video.","She tapped her chin, her gaze unfocused as it settled on a single point, lost in thought.","This Lin Haowan had some skills.","It was clear he was genuinely angry.","But later in the video, he dragged the Thorn Guild into it,","pitting the Thorn Guild against the four major studios.","And on top of that, he ended with a rallying cry, clearly wanting to take on a leadership role.","Times create heroes.","This really could be a standout player.","The storyline wouldn’t cover everyone anyway.","After all, the plot revolved around her brother, a solo player.","And he was always ahead of everyone else, mostly having little interaction with the crowd.","But Chu Fu leaned toward another possibility.","This Lin Haowan might end up assassinated!","Before Chu Fu could think further, she was interrupted by a call.","“Fufu!”","Chu Fu snapped back to reality and squinted at her brother, Chu Feng, with a slight upward tilt at the corners of her eyes, like a little fox. She put on a sweet, coaxing smile.","“Brother!”","“Let’s go! The game pod has been carried downstairs. I’ll carry you on my back.” Chu Feng crouched down in front of her.","“No need, Brother. My body is much better now. I don’t need you to carry me anymore. I think I’ve got at least 2 points in constitution now!”","Ever since waking up from her vegetative state, Chu Fu had been soaking in nutrient fluid every day.","And after every deep sleep, she felt the fluid repairing her body.","Three years in bed couldn’t be fully recovered in just one day.","Chu Fu was still very thin, like a gust of wind could knock her over, but her complexion was much rosier.","Her face was still the size of a palm, but her sunken cheeks now had a bit of flesh, making her features smoother.","Her once-young expression had also become more radiant.","Chu Feng thought: My little sister has grown up.","\"If you won't let me carry you on my back, then you can just stay in the wheelchair. When you run into that friend of yours, at least the two of you will have something to talk about!\""]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Statement from Youlong Studio on the Plunge of Three Stock Markets","paragraphs":["Chu Feng helped Chu Fu carefully sit down in the wheelchair.","Then he pushed her out the door.","But when they reached the stairs, Chu Fu had to stand up.","Because the building was part of the former military district converted into Linjiang City’s original e-sports branch campus, all the structures were old—nothing but stairs, no elevators.","It wasn’t unusual for a school to have no elevators.","Chu Fu had to go down step by step.","She could feel her legs trembling.","She was a college student now, and before the word \"college student,\" there had to be a prefix: fragile.","She moved carefully, while Chu Feng supported her. Li Weizheng hurriedly played the part of a lackey, carrying the wheelchair.","“Chu Fu, feel free to come to class anytime. The school has now published the big map, and there are plenty of respawn points.","We’ve also set up some management courses to help you run the guild better.","You’re a key figure in the guild now, and you’ve gained some online fame recently.","I hope you can set a good example and show all players that this game isn’t controlled by capital.”","Chu Fu smiled.","“Not controlled by capital? Well, once I become capital myself, I’ll rewrite the rules!”","Chu Fu finally made it down the stairs and settled back into the wheelchair, letting out a long sigh.","So exhausting!","This fragile body.","Chu Feng pushed Chu Fu’s wheelchair. Though he wanted to get rid of Li Weizheng quickly, he was careful not to jolt Chu Fu, maintaining a steady, even pace.","Li Weizheng’s eyes went wide. He hadn’t expected Chu Fu to say things like that.","Ah, these young kids—they were simply unruly.","But what right did he have to discipline them?","If the game really did invade reality, people like Chu Fu would be the ones wielding true power in the future.","Rather than trying to control her, it was better to serve her.","With that thought, Li Weizheng suddenly felt enlightened.","“Miss Chu, you’re right. If you ever need anything, just come to me!”","“Speaking of which, you have the village defense battle tonight. None of the previous servers managed to hold on to their villages.","After the merger, it’s bound to be a tough fight!”","Chu Fu understood.","At the moment of the merger, at least three servers would merge with hers.","Among them, the three major studios combined had at least 3,000 members.","The Thorn Guild, on the other hand, only had 500.","But Chu Fu wasn’t worried.","Once the merger happened, she had only one thing to do.","And that was to kill.","...","Wangxi Manor.","Today was the day Chu Feng and the others moved.","Before the village defense battle, they settled everything. Now the entire Wangxi Manor was as tight as an iron fortress.","Chu Fu and Chu Feng lived in the largest Imperial Manor. To the left was Shen Chi, to the right was Xie Lin, behind them was Huang Jiaojiao, and further back was Li Zhenzhen’s villa.","Except for Huang Jiaojiao, everyone else’s families had moved in.","Shen Chi’s family, in particular, had filled two super-sized villas to the brim. Given Shen Chi’s current income, supporting a large extended family with food and expenses was more than enough.","The group had a small get-together offline and planned to go online again at 4 PM to prepare for the village defense battle.","At the dining table.","Chu Feng handed Chu Fu a gift box tied with a bow.","“Fufu, you were asleep for the past three years, so you missed your birthdays. This is your brother’s belated birthday gift for you. I hope you like it!”","Chu Fu looked at the gift box with surprise, wondering what was inside.","But she knew the charm of sweet words.","After all, a smooth tongue makes life easier.","“Thank you, Brother! I’ll love whatever you give me!” Chu Fu’s voice was sweet, laced with a breathy, fragile tone that made it even softer.","Chu Feng’s heart melted.","“Open it and see.”","Chu Fu carefully untied the bow and opened the box. Inside, dozens of little red booklets were neatly arranged.","On the cover, nine golden characters read:","[People’s Republic of China Property Rights Certificate]","“Why are there so many?”","Chu Fu was dumbfounded.","She remembered that the money she got from the guild token dividends had bought three properties in Wangxi Manor. Jiao Jiao had already told her about them and placed them in Chu Feng’s hands.","But these...","Chu Fu couldn’t even count them all at a glance.","Jiao Jiao finally couldn’t hold back.","“Plant Girl, you have no idea. Your brother went crazy and bought 200 million worth of villas, snapping up almost all of the remaining ones in Wangxi Manor. He put everything under your name. This place is yours to rule now!","Since you’re here, when I rent out the staff dorms later, I’ll just deal directly with you instead of looking for someone else!”","The three people listening nearby were completely dumbfounded.","Shen Chi: So rich!","Xie Lin: How is he this rich???","Li Zhenzhen: I’ve stumbled into a royal family~~~","Chu Fu’s eyes went wide too. Staring at Chu Feng in disbelief, she asked, “A-all of them are under my name?”","Chu Feng smiled. “Didn’t you want them? I bought them while they were still cheap. We’re already in contact with the last five homeowners. Soon, this will all be our territory!”","Chu Fu’s heart was a mess of emotions. Chu Feng had lived before, so he absolutely understood the value of property.","When the game invaded reality, everyone who transferred their game characters gained a game panel!","And to keep modern society from collapsing, the Origin System would tally all assets.","Money would turn into worthless paper.","But property would be counted as personal assets. Property in safe zones, especially, could be used to expel intruders with a single command, or even turned into shelters using system building blueprints.","This place had originally been the headquarters of the Universal Studio.","Now, it all belonged to her.","She had thought about farming another guild token in the game, splitting the money again, and buying more villas and land.","But she never expected Chu Feng to beat her to it.","And he had put all these priceless assets under her name.","Her heart felt like it was being warmed by a cozy hearth.","“Wuwuwu, Brother, you’re too good to me! But I already have three big villas. Why don’t you take the rest back, Brother? I don’t need them all!”","More importantly, she felt uneasy.","Because she wasn’t the real Chu Fu!","She couldn’t accept someone’s gift without guilt.","Maybe it was because, in her past life, she had lived as an underdog struggling at the bottom. Her sense of self-worth was too low.","Whenever someone showed her kindness, she feared they wanted something from her.","But Chu Feng gave to her without holding anything back.","This kind of familial love—something she had longed for in her previous life but could never reach—felt too heavy to bear.","“Silly little sister, do you not like the gift your brother gave you?","Why are you refusing it?","You’re my only family.","Whatever you want, I’ll find a way to bring it to you.","Don’t think of these as too valuable. They’re just the tip of the iceberg.","Stop crying. You’re turning into a little crying kitten.”","Chu Feng wiped away Chu Fu’s tears.","Jiao Jiao quickly cheered her up too. “Today’s a happy day! Why are you crying? Didn’t you see? After that video the other day from Lin Haowan, Universal Studio and the others have been completely exposed.","Now, the stock prices of both companies are plummeting. They’re running around like ants on a hot pan.","Hey! The official account of the Youlong Studio just released a statement!”"]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Youlong Studio Takes Up the Challenge, Lin Haowan Serves as a War Correspondent","paragraphs":["\"Wandering Dragon Studio:","Hello, all players of the Original Gate. I am the current head of Wandering Dragon Studio 0288888.","At present, our studio is developing well, with our team having reached 1,500 people.","We are offering employment procedures for our players, along with free medical insurance from the Holy Hall Medical Group and generous employee benefits.","The actions of our studio within the game are part of normal competition.","We will investigate the claims made by streamer Lin Haowan.","If there is no evidence, we will sue streamer Lin Haowan for damaging our group’s reputation.","At the same time, regarding tonight’s village defense battle, our Wandering Dragon Studio will give it our all.","If we truly cannot hold the line, I will lead all players in a breakout together.\"","Amazingly, this apology letter, which did not seem sincere at all, was actually lauded!","— The bosses built the studio to give players benefits, isn’t it great to make money while gaming? Aren’t those people just jealous because they lack talent or have bad classes?","— Everyone, be rational. What Glory Studio and Universe Studio did has nothing to do with Wandering Dragon; Wandering Dragon is suffering an undeserved calamity too!","— With benefits this good, I want to join.","— If I weren’t a player on this server, I’d believe the above too. They haven’t done any less than the earlier servers, hogging resource points and stealing first kills. Now that it looks bad, they come out saying they want to defend the village—let’s see them defend it with their heads.","— Replying to the above: they spent so much money, they can play however they want. Haven’t you ever been crushed by a whale in a game before?","— If you’re this fragile when gaming, why not play some simple card game instead of a game where your character gets deleted instantly!","— Actually, the other two studios’ actions are also normal. How hard is village defense? Even experts with amazing talent find it difficult!","— Weren’t all the top players killed?","— Do you have proof? Don’t spread rumors!","\"Crap, Holy Hall must have hired bots!\" Huang Jiaojiao said angrily.","She hadn’t expected such a heated debate under this announcement.","It wasn’t a clear one-sided condemnation of Wandering Dragon.","But Chu Feng thought it was normal.","Having lived another life, he knew the strength of his opponents all too well.","\"The key isn’t Wandering Dragon—it’s the Sun family!\"","Chu Feng said coldly, \"The Sun family controls Longhan Film and Television Company, a nationally renowned corporation. When Sun Jingya hit someone with her car, it should have been a societal incident, but not a whisper of it got out.\"","\"Because everything was suppressed.\"","\"Longhan Film and Television not only has many celebrities but also commands over 500 bot companies. What’s a little storm like this to them?\"","\"Just watch—Lin Haowan probably can’t even make a phone call right now with all the harassment!\"","Chu Fu had also stopped crying and quietly operated her phone to send a message.","\"I think he’s talented. I’ve already contacted Major Li Weizheng to reach out to him, at least to protect him for now.\"","The others turned to look at Chu Fu.","Lin Haowan had actually used their Thorny Brotherhood guild, deliberately dragging them into this mess.","And yet Chu Fu still wanted to protect him.","She was just too kind!","If Chu Fu knew what they were thinking, she would have been extremely embarrassed. It wasn’t kindness—with today’s village defense, they were likely going to merge with three servers.","There was no way to stay low-profile then.","Better to fight head-on!","Unlike Chu Feng, who kept his identity hidden—no one discovered who he was, not even Huang Jiaojiao and the others knew Chu Feng’s ID, though they knew he was a big shot from Zone 001.","Xie Lin sneered from the side. In the real world, he wore sunglasses, said little, and looked extremely stern and cold.","\"What’s the use of all this talk? If we lose the village defense, we’ll still get cursed.","In gaming, being bad is the original sin!","Wandering Dragon Studio never cared about letting other players survive.","With the overall player strength as weak as it is now,","if a single studio could defend a newbie village,","then none of the previous servers would have lost it!","They’re just trying to stabilize the stock market. When the battle is over, they’ll realize their actions will backfire on them in a much bigger way.\"","He wasn’t wrong.","For previous servers to clear the content patch, they needed not only many players but teams capable of clearing nightmare-tier dungeons.","You even needed four such teams!","For Wandering Dragon to defend the newbie village was nearly impossible—harder than climbing to heaven.","Now they were forced into it, hoping to sacrifice this one studio to salvage the stock market.","At the very least, before they found some fool to buy out their other assets, the market couldn’t collapse.","...","At 4 PM.","After eating, Chu Fu and the others logged into the game.","On the rankings, the last three players had all reached level 10.","[System Announcement: 1,000 players in your server have reached level 10, drawing the Beast God’s attention. At midnight real-world time, a beast horde will launch to raze the newbie village.]","[System Announcement: First content patch—Beast Horde Invasion countdown begins: Remaining time: 8 hours. All players, prepare. After the invasion starts, you cannot log off until it ends. The invasion will last 24 hours.]","Chu Fu remained relaxed.","If she couldn’t clear the newbie village content patch, her eight days of effort would have been for nothing.","Just as she was thinking this, she spotted a semi-transparent person in the crowd.","In spirit form.","What was this? Had the Soul race arrived so soon?","But on their head, an ID was actually showing.","[Lin Haowan - Love to Play]","???","Chu Fu’s mind was full of question marks.","They clearly spotted Chu Fu, too, and immediately dashed over in a frantic drift, speaking excitedly.","\"Hello, hello! You’re ‘Who Wants to Be a Plant,’ right!","I’m streamer Lin Haowan.","This time, at the invitation of Original Gate, I’ve become a war correspondent. I can teleport between servers to record promotional content for the Original Gate village defense battle.","Are you available now? Can I do a quick interview with you?\"","Chu Fu suddenly understood.","A war correspondent.","This was indeed a special profession in Original Gate.","While in \"interview\" mode, you appear as a spirit, gain no XP, cannot be attacked, cannot touch or pick up items, and can teleport between servers for interviews.","But was this profession already appearing so early?","She asked curiously, \"How did you apply for this job?\"","Lin Haowan was very excited.","\"I submitted a feedback request to the game officials. I said that allowing only photos and recordings was too outdated. Which game these days doesn’t support livestreaming? But Original Gate isn’t a PC game, so naturally you can’t livestream.\"","\"Unexpectedly, the officials replied! They approved my request and granted me this permission.\""]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: The Butterfly Effect Again: The Origin of Xie Lin's ID","paragraphs":["Chu Fu suspected that if she hadn’t transmigrated, Lin Haowan would have still released that video, just without any mention of the Thorn Guild.","He would have still applied to be a war correspondent and live-streamed the village defense battle.","As it turned out, neither Youlong Studio nor Longhan Studio, run by the Sun family, managed to hold the line.","The pressure then fell on Huanyu Kuangba. With two extra days to prepare, he ultimately succeeded in defending the newbie village.","No wonder, despite being so weak, he still managed to hold the village and eventually became Wan Huanyu’s right-hand man.","Everything made sense now.","As for why Chu Fu had never seen Lin Haowan in the novel’s plot?","That was simple—he really did get killed.","Because only by killing Lin Haowan could the Four Great Families intimidate anyone who dared to oppose them.","They could dress it up as an accident.","But those in the know, knew the truth.","The Four Great Families were making an example of him, killing the chicken to scare the monkeys.","So that future monkeys wouldn’t dare touch this matter.","But now that she had transmigrated into the original host’s body, everything had changed.","She just hoped Lin Haowan wouldn’t meet with an accident this time.","He was a pioneer—someone with passion and the courage to resist.","“So that’s how it is. What are the requirements to become a war correspondent?” Chu Fu asked.","“Of course there are requirements. You need at least some hosting experience. Not just anyone can become one—it has to be approved by the game company, right?","Haha, how did it turn into you asking me questions? So, Plant Master, can I interview you now?”","“Of course, but I need to prepare for battle afterward. I can’t delay too long.”","Lin Haowan nodded eagerly. “Plant Master, you’re not only powerful but also kind. Now, the first question: your current ID is different from your old one—is it an item?”","“Yes, but I can’t reveal the source of the item,” Chu Fu admitted openly.","In truth, such items would become widespread sooner or later, especially once players with resurrection abilities started appearing in level-20 maps.","But Chu Fu didn’t want everyone learning about it from her.","Lin Haowan understood that this was a secret known only to high-level players. By asking this question, he was simply making it clear to everyone that the person before them—[Who Wants to Be a Plant]—was the same player who had secured all the first-kills in the newbie village.","Still, when Lin Haowan actually saw Chu Fu, he was taken aback.","She looked far too young, like a fifteen- or sixteen-year-old girl. Her features were surprisingly sweet, but she was far too thin, like a bamboo pole.","It was hard to imagine that such a person had led the charge to take down the Huanyu Studio.","Meanwhile, Lin Haowan could not only broadcast but also see the viewers’ comments.","At that moment, most of the questions were about Chu Fu’s current situation.","“It seems this name-change item will require players to discover it on their own. Now, the next question—one that viewers are very curious about.","This question may be a bit offensive, but if there’s a clear answer, it might encourage families who resist the game to join in.","Your ID is ‘Who Wants to Be a Plant’—were you really a vegetable?”","The question was indeed rude. No one in the Thorn Guild dared to bring it up, afraid of touching a sore spot for Chu Fu.","But Lin Haowan had a point.","In fact, with a global population of 10 billion, not nearly as many people had entered the game. The reason new servers kept opening was simply because too many players kept dying in failed defenses of the newbie villages.","These players constantly joining new servers created a false sense of prosperity.","If more new players could be brought into the Gate of Origin, then once the game invaded reality, more players would be able to extract the game’s power, and there would be more strength to defend.","This was a truly meaningful endeavor.","With that in mind, Chu Fu took a moment to gather her words before speaking:","“To be precise, I’m not exactly like a traditional vegetative patient. I have Locked-In Syndrome.","That means lying in bed, unable to control my limbs, trapped as if inside a sealed room.","Most people mistake this for being a vegetable.","But my mind has always been fully awake.”","“So, why did you choose that name back then?” Lin Haowan pressed on.","Chu Fu pressed her lips into a smile. She couldn’t exactly say it was just a sarcastic remark she made right after she transmigrated, could she?","Fortunately, she had already prepared an answer.","“Because I really didn’t want to be a vegetable. When I entered the game and the system asked me to pick a name, I made that sarcastic comment.","But it turned out to be useful—thanks to it, when I had my routine checkup last time, I actually woke up.","I’m truly grateful for this game!”","Lin Haowan quickly latched onto the key point, sensing it could be a major highlight.","A vegetable patient playing a game being stimulated back to consciousness by the brain activity—","This was an incredibly positive story for publicity.","“Master, are you fully recovered now? That’s amazing. I have to say, the Gate of Origin might just be the greatest game ever made.”","“Exactly. Before I entered the game, I heard that many hospitals are trying to use the game on comatose patients to wake them up.","Besides such patients, others with different conditions can also live a normal life inside the game.","And giving humans double the time—it becoming a second world is hardly surprising.”","Just as the two were chatting, Xie Lin, Shen Chi, and others logged in as well.","Seeing Chu Fu talking to a spirit, they thought there might be a quest happening and came over.","Lin Haowan quickly introduced himself again.","Then he began interviewing everyone.","“Many netizens call you the ‘Disabled Alliance.’ Are you all actually friends in real life who agreed to play together?”","“It’s just a coincidence!” Shen Chi said. “But I’m grateful for that coincidence, because it let me meet friends I can fight side by side with!”","Lin Haowan then turned to Xie Lin.","“Blind Sword Saint Master, when you chose the ID ‘Who The Hell Are You Calling Blind,’ what was going through your mind?”","Xie Lin got irritated just thinking about it.","“I know a lot of players have figured out that the game talents are based on your chosen name and personal situation, giving unexpected results. So when I entered the game, I immediately tried using ‘Blind Sword Saint’ as my ID, but it was already taken!","After that, names like ‘Blind Man,’ ‘Blind Guy,’ and ‘Blind Monk’ were all occupied!","I figured I’d just reverse the strategy and pick a name like that.”","Back then, Xie Lin was really in a rush.","He had to start killing monsters and leveling up as soon as possible—he was a hardcore player and didn’t want to waste time on naming when some people would spend half an hour just to get a good name.","He went against the flow, picked a long, rhetorical ID, and it was approved instantly.","“And you, Master Mechanic?”","“Just what everyone expects—self-deprecation. I picked my name on a whim.”","Lin Haowan introduced everyone, also to build some momentum.","A server like 0308888, with three S-ranked powerhouses, could only protect a novice village of this sort; as for the Youlong Studio, there was simply no way they could hold it.","After a brief delay, Chu Fu and the others needed to prepare for battle, so they parted ways with Lin Haowan. Of course, if he wanted to follow and interview them, there was no problem with that.","Chu Fu first went to find the village chief to accept quests.","Pre-battle tasks included making traps, building barricades, gathering wood and stone, digging pits, and so on.","The most important was setting up the traps.","Chu Fu wanted to oversee it personally, crafting a battlefield perfectly suited for Plants vs. Beasts!"]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: Dual-Livestream, Reaping What You Sow, The Village Defense Begins","paragraphs":["Currently, Chu Fu can control 20 plants.","Among them, the one with the widest and densest attack range is Galium.","Its range is about five meters.","In other words, Chu Fu can set up an interception zone of up to 100 meters in width.","The exit of Wangxi Village is roughly 800 meters wide and 1 kilometer long.","If Chu Fu blocks the entrance, she can guard one-eighth of the area.","This entrance faces the Red-Eyed Rabbit zone and will bear the brunt of the impact.","Chu Fu had everyone arrange the barriers and traps in a V-shape, funneling the monsters to gradually converge near the entrance, and then she used Galium to seal off the entrance, reducing the pressure on others.","Not only that, Shen Chi, as a mechanic, also built fully automatic targeting arrow towers with a range of 50 meters.","Each tower cost 100 silver coins, and they built a total of 100 towers.","But this money didn’t come from Shen Chi; it came from the quest materials crowdfunded by all players.","United in purpose.","Lin Haowan looked down from the sky, quite moved.","“We can see that in server 0308888, pre-war preparations have already begun.","The current number of online players is 8,827—a truly astonishing number!”","The entire area outside the village has been piled high with stone slopes, and beyond the stones, pits have been dug.","Just imagine: a beast falls down, can barely climb back up, and then gets focused down by ranged players!","If it manages to crawl out, it will be met by melee fighters ready to reap.","I’ve also noticed that players in server 0308888 have very high levels. I rarely see anyone below level 7.","It feels like there are at least a thousand level 10 players, and level 9 players are everywhere. Under these conditions, once the battle starts, player levels will spike quickly. Level 10 players can even learn new skills, so their combat power keeps growing!”","Lin Haowan showered them with praise, observing from his aerial view overlooking the entire village. For the first time, players saw their village from this perspective, and it felt incredibly lively.","And with the Thorns Guild’s base in the distance, surrounded by stone formations, it looked like a double-yolk egg.","It was truly beautiful.","“Now let’s check server 0288888.”","Lin Haowan got his bearings, then suddenly flew off to a new location at terrifying speed, faster than an airplane, soaring across the map.","This perspective was unique.","Lin Haowan said, “In the Original World, each newbie village isn’t an isolated map—they’re connected. I just passed by another village, likely server 0298888, which will have its siege battle tomorrow.","Alright, I’ve arrived at server 0288888. Hmm? They haven’t started preparing yet?”","From above, the village had half as many players as Wangxi Village, and they weren’t enthusiastic at all. The traps were sparse and scattered.","Online players: 2,972.","That was way too few.","Lin Haowan was stunned. He descended, knowing he wasn’t welcome among the guilds, so he found a corner and targeted a level 5 player.","A level 5 player definitely wasn’t part of any guild.","“Bro, isn’t your siege defense supposed to be today? Why are there so few people?”","The player looked up at Lin Haowan and immediately recognized him.","He was gleeful.","“Wow, how’d you manage to come to our server and witness the joke in person? You ask why we have so few people? Isn’t it your fault?”","Lin Haowan quickly denied it.","“How’s it my fault? I didn’t do anything! And I’m not even from your server!”","The player laughed uncontrollably. “You exposed all those guilds’ shady actions online. After players in our server found out, they realized the Dragon Rogue guild didn’t want to defend the newbie village at all.","They probably wanted to run too, but after your video came out, they couldn’t escape and had to say they’d defend. But they don’t have the strength—they can’t hold it! Why would we solo players stay and become cannon fodder?","So, those who weren’t online just didn’t log in. We didn’t have many active players to begin with. The ones online couldn’t quit in time, so they went to the village’s edge—ready to bolt as soon as the beast horde starts!","At level 5, I’ll stick around for quests to level up a bit and leave two hours early—plenty of time. Now, it’s not the guilds running—it’s us solo players!”","Hearing this, Lin Haowan realized it really was his fault.","If he hadn’t exposed the guilds’ dark secrets, solo players would naturally want to defend. But if they didn’t find out until the battle that Dragon Rogue had fled, it would be too late.","Now, with the plot exposed, the solo players were the ones fleeing.","Dragon Rogue stayed behind, but if they ran, they’d just get wiped.","The higher-ups had issued orders: they couldn’t run—at least not in the first few waves of the beast horde.","But to cut their losses,","They were offloading copper coins at low prices.","What was once 1 copper coin for 1 yuan had become 3 copper coins for 1 yuan—and no one was buying, so the price kept dropping.","After all, no one had the confidence to safely bring out the copper coins.","The guilds were selling off, and solo players followed suit.","It caused a total market crash.","This scene stood in stark contrast to Wangxi Village.","Lin Haowan left a fixed camera in place and returned to Wangxi Village.","This was much more interesting to watch!","Over the next 8 hours, players worked with enthusiasm. The number of online players climbed steadily, reaching 9,273 at midnight.","In other words, over eight days, aside from the 200 players Chu Fu had killed from the Universal guild, and the kills by Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Jiao Jiao totaling around 300,","Their entire server had only lost about 200 players.","With that many players, what village couldn’t be defended?","Finally, midnight arrived!","As the time came, all players heard the system announcement.","【System Announcement: Wangxi Village is about to face a beast horde. All players, be alert.】","【System Announcement: Beast Horde Invasion begins! Contribution Leaderboard opened: Participants: 9,273. Pre-battle preparation quests also count toward contributions.】","Chu Fu stood on the stone wall, looking into the distance. A haze of dust appeared on the horizon.","That was the dust kicked up by an uncountable number of monsters migrating and moving.","Nearby, at the Red-Eyed Rabbit spawn point, monsters surged rapidly. Bunnies leaped out of burrows in droves, gathering together and charging forward frantically.","When they entered within 50 meters of the village, the arrow towers opened fire!","Shen Chi’s contribution began to skyrocket.","Automated towers sure were handy.","But no matter how good, each tower could only fire one arrow at a time.","As for Chu Fu, a single skill was enough to catch up to his contribution score."]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: Village Defense Battle: The Terrifying Spread of Plague","paragraphs":["[Plague Spread]","Chu Fu cast a pink fog. The red-eyed rabbit that was hit by it not only had red eyes now.","It had swollen lymph nodes, which even bulged out its cheeks. The lumps that couldn't be covered by its fur seemed about to explode.","A sense of suffocation emerged, along with fever and madness.","Moreover, because the beast tide was getting closer, one infected two, and the plague spread at an extremely fast speed.","The figure-eight trap made the beast herd even more crowded, all squeezed together.","In the blink of an eye, the level-1 monsters fell like a wave.","Lin Haowan was live-streaming this scene.","\"Oh my god, the contribution of the Plant Master is skyrocketing! It's increasing by 100 points per second!\"","\"The Mechanical Boss is also very powerful! He's really worth a hundred people!\"","\"It seems that the first wave of level-1 monsters will be cleared soon!\"","\"The Professional Master has gone to both sides and cast skills. I don't know what these skills are. They're so powerful!\"","It was impossible to tell what these skills were with the naked eye. Only those who were hit would know the effects.","However, some of the people watching the live stream knew what they were.","...","Wantu Real Estate.","Among the people resting in the Huanyu Studio, many were watching the live stream.","Among them was Huanyu Kuangba.","When Huanyu Kuangba logged out as a real person at that time, he didn't go and thus escaped that disaster.","Seeing this skill now, he immediately recalled the fear of being dominated by this skill in the Silent Forest.","\"It's Plague Spread. It should be a skill dropped from the Nightmare-level Rat Nest.\"","Feng Huimin immediately recorded the information.","This was very useful. Since this skill was so powerful, if they managed to obtain it, they could also create a powerful mage.","At this moment, they were looking at the live-streaming pictures of the two servers and shaking their heads secretly.","The gap was too big.","Now it was just level-1 monsters.","In Wangxi Village, the monsters were quickly killed, taking less than 10 minutes.","In Tianhe Village (the novice village of Server 0288888), there were fewer people, and the defensive works were not well-built. The beast tide directly rushed into the village.","The guards and NPCs in the village started to fight.","It was in a complete mess.","All the various shops in the past were closed. Some child NPCs were hiding at home, shivering. Even a child was kicked against the wall by a red-eyed rabbit, and blood splashed out.","The bullet comments were filled with anger.","\"Oh my god, the quest players can't accept this. I thought every village was about the same, but I didn't expect the NPCs to be different. Wangxi Village and Tianhe Village are different from the novice village I'm in. Does that mean if these NPCs die, they won't be resurrected?\"","\"My god, those NPCs are so real. It's like they're really being invaded by monsters in their homes and are also fighting hard.\"","\"Quickly protect the NPCs, especially the pharmacy and the blacksmith shop. Otherwise, there won't be any potions or places to repair equipment.\"","\"Protect the village head. If the village head is killed, it's a failure.\"","\"Damn it, is the Youlong Studio doing this on purpose? Do they think that if the village head is killed, they can escape?\"","\"What a bunch of useless people. Who on earth is joining this kind of studio?\"","The scolding never stopped.","Since the live stream was on the same screen, there were definitely more people scolding the Youlong Studio than those praising Chu Fu's side, so the scolding continued.","...","Wangxi Village.","Chu Fu activated her wings.","The 10-level mechanical wings upgraded by Shen Chi were faster. It felt like from the initial slow flight to the current accelerated flight.","It was probably about 60 miles per hour.","It only took 40 seconds to fly from the main entrance to the two flanks of the battle line.","Chu Fu went to support the four city walls and cast a wave of [Plague Spread] to help clear the monsters.","Everyone's pressure wasn't very high.","Five minutes later, a shrill screech came from the four directions of the village.","A huge red-eyed rabbit appeared.","The Red-Eyed Rabbit Boss!","It was a full two meters tall, very robust, with extremely powerful thighs. With one leap, it could jump fifty meters, almost jumping over the players' traps.","The arrow towers attacked first.","Chu Fu also locked onto it.","[Poison Technique] [Slow Technique].","She applied them all.","The boss landed beside its minions, and [Plague Spread] immediately spread back and forth on it. Soon, three layers of toxins had accumulated.","Before it could make a second leap.","The big rabbit crashed to the ground.","The whole process took only five seconds.","[System Prompt: \"Who Wants to Be a Vegetable\" has killed the beast tide boss, the Red-Eyed Rabbit. Reward: 1 free attribute point for the whole team.]","The boss was killed.","This boss wasn't the main boss of the novice village, but it still had a reward, only 1 free attribute point.","The members of the team could also get the reward.","[System Prompt: \"Rocket on a Wheelchair\" has killed the beast tide boss, the Red-Eyed Rabbit. Reward: 1 free attribute point for the whole team.]","[System Prompt: \"Who Are You Calling Blind\" has killed the beast tide boss, the Red-Eyed Rabbit. Reward: 1 free attribute point for the whole team.]","[System Prompt: \"Suture Saint\" has killed the beast tide boss, the Red-Eyed Rabbit. Reward: 1 free attribute point for the whole team.]","The team members were having a voice conversation.","\"Saint is so powerful!\" Chu Fu praised.","Now they each took charge of one city wall in order to grab the final blow on the boss.","Jiaojiao Bujiao and Suture Saint were together. One was a tank and the other was a healer. Whether they could grab the final blow was up to luck.","But when Suture Saint reached level 10, she also awakened a great skill called Thousand Needles Piercing.","It was almost like a torrential rain of pear blossom needles.","This made Suture Saint a semi-healer and semi-dps class.","However, she wouldn't stay on one city wall all the time. Instead, she patrolled around because the dead would ask her to resurrect them.","She had announced that she would provide free resurrection services during the city defense.","She aimed to keep everyone in the village alive.","As soon as she said this, of course, the online rate increased.","After the boss was killed, the number of red-eyed rabbits also began to decrease.","Chu Fu had previously obtained the information given by Li Weizheng. There were a full million monsters in the first wave. Assuming there were 10,000 players in the novice village, each person had to kill 100 monsters.","But in reality, some people killed more and some killed less.","And the continuous stream of a million monsters was really terrifying!","Fortunately, the first wave of defense was very easy.","It took a total of 10 minutes.","After that, the players had a 10-minute break.","At this time, a large number of corpses were piled up outside.","All the players rushed forward and dragged all the corpses into the village.","A special collection team started to skin and collect.","Zhimengzhe, the leader of the life players, handed all the collected materials to Shen Chi.","Shen Chi used these materials to make mechanical puppet beasts and then sent them into the battlefield.","Everyone had their own duties.","Fortunately, the system's statistics were very intelligent. These life players who collected materials could also earn contribution points.","Moreover, when the mechanical puppet beasts made by Shen Chi killed monsters, they would even share some contribution points with these life players!","\"Everyone, hurry up! The 10 minutes are very limited!\"","\"Defend our village, defend Grandpa Li, Grandma Wang, Zhuangzhuang, Maomao, Tongtong, Xiaosanhua, Yuanyangyan, Dahuang, and Xiaohei in the village.\""]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: 3 Hours, 8 Waves of Monsters in Wangxi Village; Defend or Destroy Tianhe Village","paragraphs":["For 10 minutes, they repaired equipment, bought potions, reset traps, and filled the trenches.","The players once again stood atop the stone walls they had built themselves!","The battle at Tianhe Village was still ongoing; 20 minutes had passed and they still hadn’t finished clearing the rabbits.","Their numbers were three times fewer than those at Wangxi Village, and their combat strength was far weaker.","Some had even died!","A cornered rabbit will bite, and these were mutated rabbits, and there were many of them.","The mutated rabbits surged toward Tianhe Village wave after wave.","Given the number of players at Tianhe Village,","each person needed to clear over 300 rabbits.","But with five people forming a team, that meant clearing 1,500 rabbits per team.","Their clearing speed wasn’t fast enough. As more rabbits piled up from behind, each team faced an ever-increasing number of enemies.","Moreover, they hadn’t built stone walls; their traps were sparse and scattered, and in the end, they could only rely on barricades to hold back the beast tide.","After 20 minutes, the barricades had been shattered by the rabbits.","Players were being attacked from all sides by the mutants.","With no choice, they retreated one by one into Tianhe Village, using the village buildings for shelter.","Without a solid defensive line, a large number of rabbits flooded into Tianhe Village.","And on top of that, there were the BOSSes.","Four giant mutants charged in, smashing three houses. Inside one house, a family of three NPCs was crushed to death.","But the players didn’t care at all; they hurriedly pulled back.","“Quick, take down the BOSS!”","“Take out the BOSS first, then clean up the rest slowly!”","“Fight around the houses! Deal damage! What are you all doing? Can’t you handle such a small BOSS?”","Everyone scrambled, and they finally took down the BOSS.","But the rabbits had spread throughout the entire village.","It took them a long time just to find all the monsters.","Finally, at 53 minutes, they killed all the Red-Eyed Rabbits.","However, the next wave of monsters would arrive in just 7 minutes.","It was 7 minutes instead of 10 because the beast invasion, a major event in this expansion, refreshed on the hour.","If they couldn’t clear the current monsters within an hour, the next batch would spawn, and the monsters would accumulate more and more.","...","At Wangxi Village.","Within that one hour,","they had fought three entire waves of monsters.","The Chu Fu team managed to snatch three Level 2 BOSSes. But even though they were Level 2 BOSSes, getting the last hit only awarded 1 free attribute point instead of 2.","They secured all the Level 3 BOSSes because those had more HP. Chu Fu and Shen Chi were close to Jiao Jiao and Suture Saint; they flew over and helped snatch the final blows.","Their free attribute points increased by a total of 11.","Chu Fu allocated all the points to Spirit, raising her Spirit stat to 103.","Once her Spirit stat exceeded 100—not counting equipment—Chu Fu felt a cool sensation on her forehead.","A feeling of breakthrough.","Her perception of the outside world sharpened, and the number of plants she could control seemed to increase.","It went from 20 to 40.","Chu Fu immediately fast-germinated 20 dandelions, arranging them in an interwoven pattern to form a plant formation.","She was buzzing around like a little bee.","Mostly because she had to compete with Shen Chi for first place.","“A Mechanic is basically a swarm army! Infinite mechanical units can fight on their own.","But the number of plants I can control is limited, and so is the range!","Still, these machines are low-level. Once the monster levels get higher, my advantage will kick in!”","Chu Fu racked her brains to outdo her teammate.","Shen Chi was also grinding hard, his hands practically smoking from all the work.","In the previous dungeon, with the BOSS’s HP as it was, Chu Fu did the most damage and had the highest contribution, which naturally lowered others’ shares.","But now it was different.","Now it was about monster-killing efficiency.","Shen Chi’s mechanical army, because he spent money (on materials and crafting costs), was far more autonomous than the plants Chu Fu could summon.","They could rush out and fight monsters on their own.","As long as he kept crafting puppet beasts, his contribution would soar.","However, as the monster levels increased, his mechanical puppets started to feel like little toys.","But Chu Fu’s [Plague Spread] skill turned out to be even more absurdly powerful.","In the first hour,","Wangxi Village held off three waves.","In the second hour,","Wangxi Village held off another three waves.","In the third hour,","Wangxi Village held off two more waves!","...","At Tianhe Village.","The fourth hour arrived, and with it came everyone’s despair.","They hadn’t even finished clearing the third wave’s Level 3 monsters—wild boars, wolf cubs, and foxes—","when the fourth wave appeared: gray wolves, giant wild boars, and black chimpanzees.","Along with eight BOSSes.","This time, there was truly no stopping them.","The remaining players at Tianhe Village averaged only Level 5, while the monsters were Level 4. Worse, each player had to face an endless stream of monsters, with each team needing to kill 1,500 just to clear them all.","Their mana was depleted, and during the cooldowns of their skills, the monsters overwhelmed them.","There were simply too few people.","Not only that, but a pack of over ten Black Wolf Elites appeared—fiercer and even craftier than the Silvermoon Wolf King.","They leapt into the crowd, ruthlessly targeting the healers among the players. Their intelligence was terrifyingly high.","They tore the players’ defensive line apart.","More monsters poured into the village. Wild boars rammed into buildings, leveling houses one by one.","The village chief, in despair, was bitten and killed by the black wolves.","Everyone heard the system announcement.","[System Announcement: Remaining buildings in the village at 10%, NPC survival rate at 10%, village chief dead. Village defense failed!]","[System Announcement: All players from Tianhe Village lose 1 point from all attributes and receive the debuff ‘Fugitive’: All attributes reduced by 20% for 2 days.]","[System Announcement: Tianhe Village has been removed from the map, becoming Tianhe Village ruins.]","By now, the players had suffered heavy losses.","But oddly, all the members of the Youlong Studio had survived, as their strength was still considerable.","Those few BOSSes and elites only targeted the independent players, avoiding a direct clash with Youlong Studio’s members.","The leader of Youlong Studio’s server, Youlong Zhuye, shouted, “All players, break through! Head southeast—there are no monsters spawning there!”","Far from grieving the village’s destruction, they actually breathed a sigh of relief.","They no longer had to die alongside these people.","Blame that damn Lin Haowan, and that Thorn Association.","Otherwise, none of them would have perished.","Fortunately, orders had already come down from above.","Currently, three beginner villages—26, 27, and 28—had all been destroyed, but over 5,000 players had escaped.","Merging servers would also meet the condition of having over 10,000 players.","If the 30th server merged with them as well, Rongxun, Huanyu, and Youlong would collectively have 5,000 members.","Thorn Association only had 500 members.","They stood no chance against them.","And they still had a secret weapon.","Youlong Zhuye’s gaze fell on the dozen or so Black Wolf Elites that had spawned. A cold smirk crept across his face."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: The Last Wave of Monsters, The Immortal King Transforms","paragraphs":["\"Server 0288888 has already fallen. Seeing it from this perspective for the first time is really tragic. Just as the viewers said, NPC deaths should be irreversible.\"","Lin Haowan was still live streaming.","In just three hours, Tianhe Village had failed to defend itself.","It was truly an ugly sight!","After all, the fourth wave consisted of only Level 4 monsters.","If anyone was to blame, it was Youlong Studio for burning bridges, making ordinary players completely lose trust in them, leaving their levels lagging far behind with a massive gap.","Meanwhile, Wangxi Village was bustling with activity.","They had already reached the eighth wave of the monster siege, with only two waves left to win the village defense.","Not only that, but since the eighth wave monsters were Level 8, the players killing them gained experience rapidly.","Golden flashes kept appearing.","Upon reaching Level 10, players could learn a new skill.","Some chose burst skills, while others went for ultimate finishing moves.","Either way, they could greatly strengthen themselves.","The skill trainers were overwhelmed with work.","The Orb of Wisdom stopped letting people touch it and instead emitted streams of blue light that struck the players.","Some players cheered, others pondered—everyone was busy understanding their Level 10 skills.","Chu Fu was incredibly busy.","As she flew around, she kept unleashing Plague Spread, running along all four city walls.","The spreading plague boosted her contribution points rapidly.","But Shen Chi's arrow towers and robots struggled against the Level 8 monsters, their effectiveness fading.","Lin Haowan continued dutifully, \"Right now, we can see the player with the highest contribution is 'Who Wants to Be a Plant?'—no surprise there.","'Rocket on a Wheelchair' is second.","'Who Are You Calling Blind?' is third.","'Suture Saint' is fourth.","Fifth is 'Omnipotent Mage'.","Oh, and the leader of the Thorn Guild, Proud Yet Not Arrogant, is at a disadvantage. As a frontline tank class, she isn't earning many contribution points.","In village defense battles, besides boss kills counting for the whole team, contributions for kills beyond 100 meters are lost, and tanks only get credit for holding off monsters.\"","The problem was that faraway monsters were killed by mages before they could even get close to Proud Yet Not Arrogant, so she couldn't compete.","She was gritting her teeth in frustration.","Lin Haowan shouted again, \"Alright, the monsters are almost cleared. Everything's going smoothly for now, but things will change. The ninth wave is coming!\"","\"The ninth wave consists of flying monsters. Many village defense teams have fallen in this wave.\"","\"Players are at a huge disadvantage against flying monsters!\"","A 10-minute break.","Everyone quickly learned skills, restocked potions, and took advantageous positions—rooftops!","The ninth wave of flying monsters appeared from the horizon, a pitch-black mass.","As they flew over, the entire village went dark.","Countless ravens, eagles, bats, vultures, and other monsters appeared overhead.","But in the next moment, countless players below also deployed items.","Mechanical Wings!","These were basic mechanical wings made by Shen Chi. Though not fast, they were genuinely capable of flight.","Every melee class had been given one.","\"Oh my god! The players of Wangxi Village are flying!!!\"","\"My god, these must have been made by 'Rocket on a Wheelchair'. Crafting-class players are terrifyingly awesome!\"","\"Most importantly, this kind of item gives players limitless possibilities. And he actually sold that many!\"","\"Three thousand—at least three thousand players have this item. Can they withstand the flying monsters?\"","Chu Fu just wanted to say: Easy as pie.","[Plague Spread]","Pink mist clouds exploded in the sky, spreading the plague from one to two, two to four.","Even though the flying monsters came from all directions,","they ultimately converged over the village center and then swooped down.","The sky was completely dark.","But with Chu Fu's Plague Spread, a rain of birds fell from the sky.","Chu Fu's eyes scanned the black tide of beasts and spotted the bosses.","She had given up controlling the previous 40 plants, but her backpack contained 40 watermelon bombs.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","Watermelon bombs, each the size of a washbasin, arced through the air and struck a boss.","[System Notification: Player \"Who Wants to Be a Plant?\" has killed the beast tide boss Eagle King. Awarding all team members 1 free attribute point.]","Keep going!","Watermelon bombs hurled again.","[System Notification: Player \"Who Wants to Be a Plant?\" has killed the beast tide boss Bat King. Awarding all team members 1 free attribute point.]","[System Notification: Player \"Who Wants to Be a Plant?\" has killed the beast tide boss Raven King. Awarding all team members 1 free attribute point.]","[System Notification: Player \"Who Wants to Be a Plant?\" has killed the beast tide boss Vulture King. Awarding all team members 1 free attribute point.]","The ninth wave was cleared!","Players quickly picked up gear—the ground was littered with white-tier, black-iron-tier, and even bronze-tier equipment.","\"I've got a bronze-tier piece the big shot didn't pick up, for mages. Anyone want it?\"","\"Black-iron-tier gear is free! Hurry, hurry, my inventory's full!\"","\"Aura priests are buffing everyone for free! Come get your boost!\"","\"Bread—free bread that restores stamina!\"","\"Wine, for recovering mana! Mages who are overworked come collect it here!\"","\"Are there any unlucky dead souls who need resurrection? Report your coordinates fast, or you'll lie there until the event ends!\"","\"Suture Saint, me, me!\"","\"Help! Saintly Healer, save me!\"","Items were no longer being sold—whoever needed something just took it freely. Buffs and supplies were flying everywhere.","Ten minutes went by, and everyone was frantically busy.","It was almost over!","In just four hours, over 3,000 players had reached Level 10, the rest were at Level 9, with very few stuck at Level 8.","They all waited for the final wave.","...","Hidden in the forest, ImmobileKing was also watching the live stream via the game's official website.","He watched in fear!","How was he supposed to fight that?","One person against 9,000?","Even if he became a world boss, wouldn't he just be killed in two blows?","Beside him stood the NPC who had lured him into the evil faction, the werewolf Tuge.","\"It's your turn now, ImmobileKing!\"","\"These fools—the more they kill, the more the Beast God's power descends.\"","\"Even if they destroy my avatars, the power won't fade.\"","\"That power will merge into your body and make you strong!\"","\"Come, let me show you the power of the Beast God!\"","The werewolf Tuge began to pray.","In the next moment, a blood-red streak appeared in the sky, like a silk ribbon descending from above, merging into ImmobileKing's body.","Instantly, ImmobileKing's body began to stretch, muscles tearing apart in excruciating pain, and black fur sprouted all over.","He gradually transformed into a massive black wolf.","Not only that, but more and more silk-like red streaks fell, enlarging his form further.","The werewolf Tuge went from pride at first, to a stiff expression, to a dark, gloomy face.","\"How can there be so many?\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: The Arrival of the Super Giant Boss, the Hound of the Evil God, Targets the Suture Saint","paragraphs":["A black substance, as dark as ink, pressed through the air like an evil force mistakenly crossing into the normal world.","A total of 56 strikes.","But here, there was only ImmobileKing alone.","What about the other 55?","The other 55 clones of Werewolf Tuge?","All dead?","If such a massive slaughter had occurred, the newbie village shouldn’t have so many people left—it should have been reduced by half.","What on earth was going on?","Werewolf Tuge had no shared memories with his other clones, so naturally, he couldn’t make sense of it.","The Thorn Guild had mastered the method to obtain the Disguiser’s Mask. Five members had already collected heads, and when others asked, Chu Fu said it was a special mission.","The only other one who had collected heads was ImmobileKing.","But after that, he never appeared again.","Many players suspected he had turned red-named (criminal) and was picked off by others. Killing red-named players didn’t make you red-named, so that guy must have been quite wealthy.","Afterwards, Chu Fu naturally never mentioned this matter again. Instead, she began secretly fulfilling the prerequisites with those contracted under the Thorn Guild.","For a guild of 500 people, this was relatively easy.","And those who obtained the Disguiser’s Masks were all core members.","They managed to produce as many as 50 Disguiser’s Masks.","They tore through Werewolf Tuge.","They even treated Werewolf Tuge like an experience piggy bank, forming different groups to share the experience.","However, with benefits came drawbacks.","Each werewolf drawn in was a fragment of evil power.","At this moment, these powers had yet to find a master.","They all converged onto ImmobileKing.","His body began to stretch and expand, becoming robust and elongated. Black fur sprouted across his skin, and his head transformed into that of a wolf.","“Ah! It hurts! It hurts so much!”","ImmobileKing screamed in agony.","But amid the pain, he could feel himself growing stronger.","Gradually, he shifted from a human form into a massive black wolf.","After absorbing the first wisp of black mist, he had only become a two-meter-tall, four-meter-long black wolf.","But after absorbing all 56 strands of the black substance, he had transformed into a colossal beast.","Standing on all fours, he was as tall as a three-story building, about 15 meters long.","His massive head alone measured over two meters in diameter, and when he opened his jaws, he could swallow any player whole.","Such a terrifying form represented terrifying power.","HP: 5.6 million!","His stats were off the charts, and he even had exclusive skills.","ImmobileKing was stunned!","“Howl! Howl! Howl...” He wanted to say something badass, but all that came out was a wolf’s howl.","Yet, surprisingly, Werewolf Tuge understood him.","“This is the power of the Great Beast God. Your choice was right; the fools were wrong.”","“Now, go and crush the village! Kill everyone inside, defeat all outsiders.”","[Beast God’s Command: Destroy Wangxi Village, kill all NPCs, defeat all players. Reward: One piece of golden equipment, retain part of the bestowed abilities.]","The reward was incredibly generous!","And now, his stats and state were practically invincible.","“Sure enough, learning from those big shots is the way to go. But why didn’t they come?”","“Unless they haven’t joined the evil faction.”","“Then how did they get the Disguiser’s Masks?”","The prerequisite for the Disguiser’s Mask was to kill 100 players and earn 10,000 sin points.","Afterwards, all the Plantmen turned into white names and even changed their IDs. This was clearly the effect of donning the Disguiser’s Mask.","That left only one way to resolve this besides joining them.","“Could it be that they...”","Just the thought of choosing a different path from the others made ImmobileKing uneasy, feeling like he had taken a wrong turn.","But when he saw his current attributes, he straightened up again.","It was nothing but a twist of fate.","By refusing to join the evil faction, they had inadvertently turned him into an ultra-level BOSS.","With that, who would win or lose was anyone’s guess.","He believed his strength had already become unbeatable in the newbie village.","“I absolutely cannot lose. If they die, then so be it!”","At this moment, the werewolf Tu Ge urged him on.","“Your turn to step up!”","“Don’t worry, I’ll kill them all!” ImmobileKing opened his huge wolf mouth, howling loudly.","But Tu Ge understood perfectly and laughed heartily.","“Waiting for your good news!”","ImmobileKing nodded his massive wolf head and suddenly took off running.","His first few steps were a bit unsteady, but as he adapted, he quickly picked up speed.","His speed was incredible.","Like a sports car.","In just a few strides, he crossed a hill, dodged trees, and dashed through the forest, heading straight for Wangxi Village.","By now, the tenth wave of monsters had already spawned.","Not only that, but massive numbers of level 10 monsters and level 10 BOSSES appeared from all four directions around the city.","[Crocodile King (BOSS) Level: 10, HP: 1.5 million]","[Wooden Hammer Ape King (BOSS) Level: 10, HP: 1.4 million]","[Forest Python King (BOSS) Level: 10, HP: 1.8 million]","[Mutated Pterosaur (BOSS) Level: 10, HP: 2 million]","The first three BOSSES were manageable, but the last one was a flying type. Chu Fu and her team took the lead in dealing with the Pterosaur.","Meanwhile, the members of the Thorn Guild split into three groups to hold back the other three BOSSES.","ImmobileKing was already close to the village.","As he approached, he had already devised a plan.","There were too many people in the newbie village, and the root cause was the healers.","The healers were too strong, with resurrection spells ensuring that players wouldn’t lose their accounts even after dying.","Therefore, the only way to slaughter the village was to take down the healers.","His target was clear: the Suture Saint!","The Suture Saint was currently also in the air, and ImmobileKing hadn’t tested how high he could jump yet.","So he couldn’t let them escape.","ImmobileKing hid himself, refraining from striking immediately, instead observing from the shadows.","Inside Wangxi Village.","Chu Fu and the others were surrounding the Pterosaur, attacking furiously.","Various poisons were applied, and everyone worked together to bring down the monster.","[System Notice: “Who wants to be a Plantman?” has slain the Beast Horde BOSS Mutated Pterosaur, rewarding the entire team with 1 free skill point.]","One down.","Soon after, a team quickly moved to the eastern city wall.","There, the BOSS was the Wooden Hammer Ape King.","This was a massive black gorilla wielding a huge tree trunk.","The Thorn Guild’s other main tanks held its aggro, but the gorilla’s powerful tree swings made close-range combat extremely difficult.","Moreover, the gorilla was highly intelligent; when aggro wavered, it would leap up to attack the healers in the team.","It was extremely dangerous.","Chu Fu decided to take down this BOSS first.","......","Elsewhere.","A flash of crimson flickered in ImmobileKing’s eyes.","His moment had arrived.","His gaze locked onto the Suture Saint.","Crawling low, he suddenly surged forward with terrifying speed, aiming to reach the Suture Saint and swallow her whole."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: I've recorded every move you make","paragraphs":["ImmobileKing felt that his sneak attack was absolutely flawless.","With terrifying speed, he could close the three-hundred-meter distance in just five seconds.","But just as ImmobileKing suddenly launched his assault, he heard a voice full of mockery.","\"Big bad wolf, your opponent is me!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao raised her shield to block, taunting him at the same time.","At that moment, ImmobileKing’s gaze immediately shifted from Suture Saint to Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao. The moment he saw her, all the hatred buried deep within him erupted.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","Why did she look so annoying?","And why was she so rich?","Her gear was top-notch.","Why couldn't that be his?","He might as well kill her. Once she was dead, all of it would belong to him.","With that thought, ImmobileKing lunged forward instantly, swiping a claw at Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","\"Bang!\"","The claw collided with the shield.","ImmobileKing thought viciously that this strike would surely crush Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","But in reality, a massive shield appeared before Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, actually blocking the claw.","Not only that, ImmobileKing felt as if his claw had struck a solid rock.","Pain!","\"Damn it!\"","ImmobileKing grew even more enraged and attacked again.","However, after five seconds, ImmobileKing suddenly snapped out of it.","Why was he attacking a player who was a tank? Wasn't that falling into their trap?","He should go for the healer first.","ImmobileKing immediately turned his wolf head, intending to bite Suture Saint.","One fierce leap would be enough to pounce and kill him.","But he couldn’t move.","Around him, creeping vines had been planted, tightly binding him.","That person had struck.","It was \"WhoWantsToBeAVegetable\"!","ImmobileKing let out a furious roar and broke free from the vines, the sharp pain driving him even angrier.","Worse still, he felt his body weakening, his life draining away rapidly.","He checked his status.","Toxic Spell, Slow Spell, Plague Transmission.","Damn it—so many poisons had been stacked on him.","That plant guy was incredibly annoying.","Maybe he should kill the plant guy first!","ImmobileKing thought, locking his gaze onto Chu Fu. She was closer, and her appearance looked far too frail.","Her arms were like matchsticks—they’d surely snap with one bite.","He was about to pounce on Chu Fu.","The next moment, a mech blocked his path and fired two cannonballs right at his nose.","Those two hits made him shriek in pain.","Why was a dog’s nose so sensitive?","He gritted his teeth through the pain and let out a wolf howl, forcing Shen Chi’s mech back.","But the mech stubbornly guarded Chu Fu.","No, he still had to kill Suture Saint.","Yet just as he made a move, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao blocked him again.","\"Little wolf pup, your momma’s right here!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao taunted, brandishing her shield.","ImmobileKing’s eyes flushed with bloodlust again, his gaze fixed on Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, endless hatred surging within him.","After five seconds, his madness subsided, and reason crept back in.","Damn it!","He was being ganged up on, completely unable to break free.","No wonder those bosses were all so slow-witted.","Now that he had become a boss, he was being toyed with.","Maybe he should power up and kill Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao!","With that tank around, he had no chance for a sneak attack.","But somehow, he felt that if he did that, he’d only be falling for their scheme.","Wasn’t that exactly what Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was doing—building aggro successfully?","At that moment, ImmobileKing felt his intelligence completely outmatched.","So this was what being a boss felt like?","Was it really this helpless?","He checked his health.","Only 5% had been lost.","For a moment, he didn’t know whether the remaining 95% would be a chance for him to turn the tables, or just more of the same torture.","...","Above Wangxi Village, a translucent shadow flickered into view, its lens focused on Chu Fu and the others, livestreaming the entire battle.","Lin Haowan shouted excitedly: \"This ultimate boss is incredibly powerful—high attack, high defense, and ridiculously thick health!","And it’s highly intelligent; it just tried to pull a sneak attack. Luckily, I recorded it and tipped off Plant Master beforehand.","Now let’s see how the boss handles this monster!","The fight’s going fast—1 minute for 5% health loss means just 20 minutes to kill it!","Other areas are moving quickly too, but if this keeps up, the other bosses might not give the first-kill team the free attribute points! They’re being held up by this wolf.\"","\"Ten minutes have passed—the boss is at half health!\"","\"Plant Master’s about to unleash her big move! Here it comes—watermelon bomb attack!\"","...","Outside the East Gate city wall.","Chu Fu saw the enemy’s health and spoke.","\"Prepare for the kill!\"","Chu Fu had been holding back all along.","She was afraid ImmobileKing would flee.","Of course, Chu Fu knew this person was ImmobileKing.","In the original storyline, her brother had never experienced evil-faction player attacks during the village defense battle.","But four bosses were fixed—so where had this huge fifth one come from?","And considering how cowardly this boss had been, lurking silently in the forest, only discovered because Lin Haowan’s high-altitude livestream had spotted the giant wolf—all the evidence pointed to the wolf king’s identity.","ImmobileKing had the ability to transform into a werewolf, ignoring aggro and control skills. With his speed, he could easily escape.","Chu Fu didn’t know what this boss would drop, but killing it was still the right move.","Who’d have thought that cultivating worms would spawn such a massive boss?","Now, his health was down to 280,000.","Each of her watermelons dealt 50,000 damage—40 of them would hit 200,000 in total. Plus, Xie Lin had his Holy Light Slash, which had a chance to instantly kill.","Even if it didn’t kill him outright, the poisons stacked on him and the 40 watermelons would whittle down his remaining health.","Chu Fu struck.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The watermelon bombs tore through the air with heavy whistling sounds.","One after another.","They aimed precisely at the giant black wolf’s flank and belly.","\"Boom!\"","\"Boom, boom, boom, boom!\"","A rain of watermelon bombs descended.","The black wolf that ImmobileKing had transformed into was flattened to the ground, trapped in a paralysis state, as his system panel flashed a warning.","\"No!\"","Watching his health plummet like a waterfall, ImmobileKing clawed at the ground, trying to drag his shattered body to escape.","In his panic, he hadn’t even used his rage skill, triggered when health dropped below 10%.","Then a figure blocked his path. The man’s eyes were blindfolded, striking a cool pose, holding a gleaming silver sword.","\"Holy Light Slash!\"","A single slash, and a terrifying sword aura expanded. Dazzling light surged toward ImmobileKing. He instinctively shut his eyes to dodge, only to expose his wolf throat.","A massive wound appeared.","Bones were severed; the head was sliced off!","-560,000 damage! Weak-point attack! Critical hit! Decapitation!"]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Perfect Village Defense, All Aboard, Heading to Tianhe Village","paragraphs":["[System Prompt: “Who Called Me Blind” killed a minion of the evil god and foiled the evil god’s plot, rewarding the entire team with 10 free attribute points.]","A whopping 10 points all at once.","Not only that, but as the giant wolf died, thick black smoke poured from its body. However, the smoke in the air was compressed by an invisible giant hand, turning into beads that floated in mid-air, glowing with the light of dropped equipment.","And that light was golden.","Chu Fu quickly grabbed one.","[Evil God’s Divine Substance (Gold-tier Item):","Can be used on equipment level 10 or below (including level 10) to improve the equipment's quality.","Bronze to Silver: Requires 1 piece.","Silver to Gold: Requires 10 pieces.","Gold to Dark Gold: Requires 100 pieces.]","Jackpot!","Chu Fu and her teammates picked up all the items and found 56 beads.","Chu Fu quickly divided them up.","“We’ll split them based on contribution,” she said. “But if any of you don’t have enough to make 10, you can buy the extras from others at 100 silver coins each. Sound fair?”","Gold-tier equipment was incredibly valuable in the newbie village—practically priceless and unavailable on the market.","But they were about to head to a level-20 map, where nightmare-difficulty dungeons dropped gold equipment, usually selling for between 1 and 9 gold coins.","Of course, this item could be used to enhance any gear slot. If you used it on something like a cloak, you’d make a massive profit. The price would easily double.","That said, they were a fixed team, members of the same guild, and even shareholders in the same company.","At this moment, having a few extra pieces of gold gear wasn’t as important as maintaining fairness and unity within the group.","Chu Fu’s proposal was both fair and considerate of everyone’s feelings. It was spot on.","“No problem! You’re taking a loss again this time,” Jiao Jiao said. “When we get to the new map and a special piece of gear drops, I’ll let you have it!”","“Boo-hoo, thank you, Plant Girl, I know you’re looking out for me,” Suture Saint chimed in. Her contribution this time hadn’t reached 20%, so she couldn’t get 10 pieces of the substance.","But at least she wasn’t short on money anymore. Her Corpse Sewing skill was earning her a fortune every day, making her the highest earner in the team.","Next came the distribution.","Chu Fu’s contribution was 39%, earning her 22 pieces of the Evil God’s Divine Substance. She would naturally have to give a few away.","This was essentially giving up a gold-tier piece of equipment.","How could that not be a huge sacrifice?","Chu Fu then sold 6 pieces of the substance, pocketing 600 silver coins. The others traded among themselves until everyone had 10 pieces.","After the distribution, nobody used them immediately. The monster tide wasn’t over yet.","“Kill, kill, kill! If Plant Master shows up, there’s no way we can compete with their team!”","“Free attribute points! Grab those free attribute points!”","“Go all out! Use your skills!”","Thanks to everyone’s efforts, the other teams snatched up all three boss kills. But with 10 free attribute points from killing the motionless king, Chu Fu had made up for her previous deficit and even earned an extra 7 points.","Once the bosses were dead, clearing the smaller monsters became easier. After Chu Fu unleashed a few rounds of [Plague Rat Spread], the monsters began to fall in droves.","Fifteen minutes later, all the monsters were dead.","The system let out an electrifying announcement.","[System Announcement: The monster tide has receded. Wangxi Village’s building preservation rate is 100%, NPC survival rate is 100%. Village defense successful!]","[System Announcement: Perfect defense rating achieved: 100% protection. All players receive a Guardian Badge, and all rewards are doubled.]","[System Announcement: All players in Wangxi Village gain +2 to all stats.]","[System Announcement: Public event contribution points are now being tallied.]","[System Announcement: A limited-time shop is now open. Exchange contribution points for rewards. Duration: 24 hours.]","[System Announcement: Players who have reached level 10 can spend 1 gold coin to teleport to the next-tier map: Fengdu Town Fortress.]","[System Announcement: Wangxi Village map restrictions have been lifted. Players can also travel to Fengdu Town Fortress on foot.]","[System Announcement: Level restrictions for all newbie village players have been removed.]","Everyone could hear these announcements.","But the next notification was personal.","[System Notice: Player “Who Wants to Be a Plant Lady,” you ranked first in contribution points during this monster tide invasion event, with a total of 6.28 million points.","You have received: Talent Enhancement Stone x1, Skill Enhancement Stone x5, Gold-tier Chest x1.","Due to the village achieving a perfect defense, your rewards have been doubled.","You have received: Talent Enhancement Stone x2, Skill Enhancement Stone x10, Gold-tier Chest x2.]","Then, a temporary exchange shop appeared automatically on her interface.","The first item made Chu Fu’s eyes light up.","[Talent Enhancement Stone: Exchange requires 5 million contribution points. Limit 1 per player.]","Chu Fu acted instantly and bought it.","Now she had 3 enhancement stones!","Some talents couldn’t be fully upgraded in a single enhancement, after all. Even among S-tier talents, there were differences in strength.","It was never a mistake to buy it.","Meanwhile, Jiao Jiao’s hysterical voice echoed across the entire server.","[Server 0308888] [Jiao Jiao]: “Don’t waste your contribution points! They’re now tokenized with numbers on them and are tradeable! I’m buying contribution points at a 1:1 ratio! Unlimited purchases! Unlimited!”","Jiao Jiao wanted that Talent Enhancement Stone!","Chu Fu quickly shouted, “Jiao Jiao, have someone help you buy them. This isn’t the time to celebrate. Gather everyone now. We’re heading to Tianhe Village!”","The team was stunned.","Shen Chi was the first to react. “You’re thinking of doing...?” he started.","Before he could finish, Chu Fu sent a shout across the server.","[Server 0308888] [Who Wants to Be a Plant Lady]: “Thank you to all the players of Wangxi Village. Today, we fought alongside Server 0288888. Although their server failed to defend their village, there are definitely NPCs still hiding there. And the monster tide will keep attacking.","“Hey, everyone, do you want to come with me to rescue those hidden NPCs? And the monsters in Tianhe Village will give tons of experience and gear. Anyone who wants to come, head there now! I’m leading the Thorn Guild out first!”","Chu Fu unfolded her mechanical wings and flew toward Tianhe Village.","Her team quickly caught on and unfolded their wings too.","They would follow Plant Girl!","Meanwhile, Lin Haowan was stunned by what he was seeing.","As Chu Fu soared into the air, the entire newbie village rose with her.","Over nine thousand players, each with a set of flying wings, soared together beside Chu Fu, heading toward Tianhe Village.","In that moment, Lin Haowan felt a surge of excitement, adrenaline rushing to his head.","“How is this even possible? This is incredible!”","“Right, there are still NPCs alive.”","“Hurry up, move faster! I’ll give you coordinates!”","“Those monsters are looking for NPCs right now. Some NPCs are hiding in a cellar, and the monsters are wrecking everything everywhere.”","“Damn it, why couldn’t the players in Tianhe Village hold out just a little longer? If they’d held out just a bit more time, you would’ve made it to support them!”","“Useless bunch!”","“Shit, a few wolf-type elite monsters have found the NPCs! But they’re too big to get inside for now—they’re destroying the cellar!”"]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Shen Chi Strengthens the Golden Mech, 1 Minute and 40 Seconds","paragraphs":["Lin Haowan was extremely anxious!","He wished his soul could rush over and wipe out those black wolves, but he could do nothing.","He wanted to urge Chu Fu, but she was already doing her best. The mechanical wings of Chu Fu and the others were the most advanced equipment available, and even the earlier districts had never seen such high-quality gear.","Just then, he noticed someone in the crowd who hadn’t moved yet.","It was obvious—a four-meter-tall mecha!","Then, a black glow enveloped the mecha, and in no time, the entire mecha began to transform.","The mecha’s height became eight meters, as tall as a small three-story building, gleaming in black and gold.","This mecha had turned into a gold-grade mecha.","Shen Chi had used cosmic substance to upgrade the mecha to gold grade.","“When the mecha isn’t in combat mode, its straight-line flight speed reaches 360 kilometers per hour!”","“That’s enough!”","Shen Chi activated the mecha, which blasted off into the air, quickly overtaking everyone and catching up to Chu Fu and the others at the front.","Now Shen Chi’s mecha was a massive behemoth. He reached out an arm and grabbed Chu Fu!","Chu Fu was held in the mecha’s palm, her slender frame completely hidden within the giant hand.","Shen Chi’s mecha’s right hand also caught the Surgical Ace.","“You two, step onto my feet!”","Shen Chi shouted.","Xie Lin immediately understood. His figure flickered as he landed on the mecha’s foot, which was about two meters long.","“I’m here!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao leaped as well, grabbing the other foot and pulling a tripwire from her backpack—a leftover tool from setting traps—to wrap herself around the mecha’s foot.","“Sword Saint Brother, bear with it!”","Chu Fu tossed down a vine seed.","The seed grew rapidly mid-air, turning into vines that bound Xie Lin to Shen Chi’s gold-grade mecha’s foot.","Once all four were secured, Shen Chi’s voice rang out in the team.","“Hold tight! The gold-grade mecha’s speed is 360 kilometers per hour. According to Lin Haowan’s data, Tianhe Village is only 10 kilometers away. That’s just... 1 minute and 40 seconds!”","Boom!","The roar of the engines exploded as Chu Fu heard the fierce wind howling in her ears.","“Damn, damn, damn! I’m getting a mouthful of wind—I should have faced backward!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao yelled. Fortunately, her physique and strength were high, and her gear was strong enough to withstand the raging winds.","As for Xie Lin, he was already losing health!","Though it was just a few points at a time, it showed the speed was so great that his body couldn’t endure it.","Shen Chi said nothing, driving forward relentlessly.","In the sky, Lin Haowan, now in his soul form, was shouting himself hoarse.","“Ahhh! A mecha! So cool!! Damn, real men play mechas! A just descent from the heavens, a divine arrival! Faster, almost there! We’ll make it!”","The entire livestream was flooded with frenzied comments.","“This speed is insane—a savior has descended!!!”","“Oh my god, so touching—they’re saving the world!”","“I’m an old player, now at level 17. After the newbie village was destroyed, we got a quest to clear the ruins. Down in a cellar, we found children who had starved to death. It hurt so much—felt like the devs were stabbing us. Now, someone’s reversing it all. They’re filling in the gaps in our quest!”","“Please, let’s all stick together to defend the village from now on! I can’t bear to see this happen.”","“We need more top players like this! The rest of us are useless!”","“And no more infighting. In the previous village, fewer died from monsters than from fighting over bosses.”","The comments rolled on fiercely.","The summary was one line:","Villages like Wangxi Village were too rare.","Meeting the Thorn Guild was the luck of this village’s players.","...","In the sky, Shen Chi’s mecha raced forward.","Chu Fu wasn’t idle either. Though they were rescuing the village, the monsters were overwhelming, and Tianhe Village lacked any defenses—it was probably reduced to a few broken houses.","Without a frontline, players were at a huge disadvantage.","Chu Fu had to find another way.","No defense.","So boost the output.","In the contribution shop, aside from the talent enhancement stones costing 5 million, there were also skill enhancement stones at 1 million each.","Chu Fu bought one, and combined with system rewards, she now had seven.","Without hesitation, she enhanced [Plague Transmission].","Her skills included only Plague Transmission for area attacks. Poison Spray depended on the poisons Chu Fu brewed, and supplies in the newbie village were too scarce for many formulas.","Plus, [Plague Transmission] had already been enhanced once from a silver chest.","Now it was seven times!","Boom, boom, boom, boom, boom, boom, boom!","The skill burst with radiant pulses.","[System Notification: Your Plague Transmission has evolved into Pandemic Spread.]","[Pandemic Spread (Enhanced +8):","Upon activation, deals 220% spell attack poison damage, creating a plague zone within an 80-meter diameter that expands outward.","If a second target appears within 10 meters of any target, the plague automatically spreads.","When a target dies, its body rapidly decays, causing a corpse explosion. The explosion deals secondary damage and continues to spread the plague toxins.","Every 10 seconds, one stack of Plague Effect is applied:","1 stack reduces the target’s defense by 50%, movement speed by 50%, and drains 2% of life. Lasts 3 minutes.]","Chu Fu took a deep breath looking at this enhanced skill.","80 meters in diameter, forced percentage damage—if a boss stood dumbly in her plague zone for three minutes, that was 36% of its health.","This was far more reliable than Xie Lin’s Holy Light Slash.","And since the flooded Tianhe Village wasn’t large, one strike from Chu Fu, with the spread, would be as easy as harvesting wheat!","Too powerful!","Without further thought, Chu Fu took out three talent enhancement stones and upgraded her talent.","Talents had clear tiers, unlike skills. With three talent enhancement stones, her S-grade Plant Whisperer talent evolved.","The previous effects grew stronger, and most importantly, a new trait appeared.","[SS-grade Talent Plant Whisperer:","Trait 1: Plant Mutation—You can accelerate plant growth and cause mutations, with a small chance to summon plant spirits that fight alongside you.","Trait 2: Plant Control—Plants you nurture are under your command. When uncharted, they attack autonomously.","Trait 3: Wood-element spell power increased by 200%.","Trait 4: Shared Plant Resilience—Plants you nurture share your life force. Damage is prioritized to plants, and when surrounded by plants, you automatically recover health, mana, and stamina.]","Trait 4 was a defensive skill.","But it was excellent too. On top of that, the first three traits had also improved.","Finally, there was the cosmic substance and the gold chest.","Which piece of equipment should she enhance?"]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: Rush to the Scene, Plague Spreads and Clears the Area","paragraphs":["There was no time to hesitate.","The gale still howled in her ears, and Shen Chi had said it would take only one minute and forty seconds to reach Tianhe Village.","So, Chu Fu directly chose the ra piece of equipment on her person.","The badge!","This badge was a special reward, a quest item.","It couldn't be enhanced by Shen Chi's skills. Her cloak was also rare, but later on, she could use other equipment as materials to upgrade it.","Thus, Chu Fu selected this badge for enhancement.","In an instant, the badge was infused with the Abyssal substance, transforming from silver into a black-gold hue, taking on a more ancient and textured appearance.","[Beastheart Badge (Gold Tier):","When equipped, all stats +10.","Damage dealt to beast-type monsters increased by 20%, critical hit rate +2%. Simultaneously, beast-type monsters' aggro toward you increased by 20%.]","The stats had improved by five points, and an additional critical hit rate modifier had been added.","Not bad at all.","Next, Chu Fu opened the remaining two gold treasure chests.","[You obtained: Poisonwood Window (Gold Tier)]","[You obtained: Spirit Plant Satchel (Gold Tier)]","What were any of these?","Chu Fu immediately checked her inventory.","Poisonwood Window turned out to be a sugar-cube-shaped emerald ear accessory!","Accessories were exceedingly rare—rings, bracelets/bangles, and necklaces were common types.","But forehead ornaments, earrings, and waist pendants were uncommon finds, unless specially custom-made.","She hadn't expected to pull a stud earring.","[You obtained: Poisonwood Window (Gold Tier):","Physical and magical attack power +65.","Spirit +40.","Trait 1: Wood-element attack power +100.","Trait 2: Poison-element attack power +100.]","Once equipped, her attack power surged by over 200 points instantly.","The only pity was that the traits didn't increase by a percentage—otherwise, Chu Fu would never need to swap out equipment again.","Chu Fu selected the Poisonwood Window in her inventory and chose to equip it.","In that moment, she felt a sharp sting in her ear as the accessory was forcibly worn.","She didn't have pierced ears.","But that was trivial—it only cost her two health points.","There was one last piece of equipment.","Chu Fu’s gaze settled on it.","[Spirit Plant Satchel (Gold Tier):","Special equipment: Spatial backpack.","Trait 1: Can infinitely store seeds and plant-type items.","Trait 2: Contains a 50x50x50 planting space with inherent soil. Planted crops yield +20%, maturation time -20%, and have a 3% chance to improve quality.]","This was exactly what she needed.","Not only that—Chu Fu read the words \"infinitely store\" carefully, mentally calculating.","If this truly allowed unlimited storage, wouldn't she have an endless supply of water-bomb melons?","She promptly placed her dandelion seeds, cleaver vine seeds, and water-bomb melon seeds into the Spirit Plant Satchel.","From now on, she could plant crops inside first, then summon them during battle—striking unexpectedly while also saving time.","It was absolutely perfect.","Chu Fu was about to plant some water-bomb melons when Shen Chi's voice echoed in her ear.","\"We're here. Get ready to drop!\"","The surrounding speed came to an abrupt halt.","A black-gold mechanical arm extended horizontally, its palm opening slowly, allowing Chu Fu to see the light again.","Chu Fu immediately activated her flight wings, lifted herself into the air, and gazed down below.","The entire Tianhe Village lay in full view.","Buildings were damaged, and countless wild wolves and boars rampage everywhere.","Some were even gnawing at corpses.","Suddenly, the Suture Saint spoke up: \"Can these corpses be revived?\"","Chu Fu’s eyes lit up.","“I don’t know, but it’s worth a try. What if it works? Save the NPCs first!”","Of course, she had to clear out the monsters first.","Chu Fu raised her staff and slammed down a Plague Spread onto the beast horde below.","In an instant, her mana dropped by 80%.","It startled her.","The enhanced skill was indeed powerful, but consuming that much mana was not ideal.","It would be useless in battle if she couldn’t cast it properly.","She quickly drank a potion.","At that moment, Plague Spread erupted fully.","A cloud of pink mist rose from the ground beneath her feet.","Previously, the rat plague spread in pink, but now a tinge of scarlet had joined it.","The red radiance expanded, and every monster caught within it fell, struck down one after another.","But that wasn’t all. Beyond the 80-meter range, more monsters were affected, and the plague continued to spread.","Like a drop of water falling onto a calm lake, it rippled outward in circles.","90 meters, 100 meters, 110 meters...","It extended infinitely.","How far the Plague Spread would reach depended on how many monsters there were.","The terrifying pink fog expanded, even spreading into the forest outside the village. In an instant, every monster was wiped out.","Shen Chi and the others almost dropped their jaws in shock.","“This! Did your skill mutate?” Suture Saint exclaimed in amazement.","They were familiar with Chu Fu and knew all her skills. This was clearly an expanded version of Rat Plague Spread.","Shen Chi stood frozen inside his mech: “So I’m just a driver?”","He had been ready to go on a killing spree.","But Chu Fu had cleared the entire map.","“I get it now! It’s the Enhancement Stone! Collect the contribution points!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao wanted to use her money power again.","At that moment, the shock was even greater in Lin Hao Wan’s livestream.","Countless messages exploded across the screen.","“A forbidden spell!! If this isn’t a forbidden spell, I’ll eat my own poop! My God, how did she do that?”","“Are we even playing the same game?”","“Mom, why am I kneeling while watching my phone?”","“In short, just one line!”","“The comatose girl is freaking amazing!!!” ×9999!","The barrage was so dense it almost blocked the stream.","...","Inside Tianhe Village.","Chu Fu canceled the expansion of Plague Spread. The pink mist stopped, and without magical support, the plague gradually dissipated without harming the NPCs.","At that moment,","the ground was covered with white equipment, beast flesh, hides, bones, and other materials.","Only one spot was different.","One minute earlier,","inside a courtyard, several black wolves had been excitedly clawing at a cellar entrance.","They let out short, beast-like calls that other creatures couldn’t understand, but the black wolves themselves could.","“There are NPC kids down here! Come help!”","“The players all ran away, only the little NPCs are left. I’ll help you dig, but I get one each!”","“Hurry up. Who knows how long this power will last? The master, Zhu Ye, has already gone far. We need to follow him to the level-20 map.”","The wolves worked together, frantically digging at the cellar entrance, nearly collapsing it.","Just then, a cloud of pink mist appeared.","The black wolves froze.","“What is this?”","The next moment, they felt their bodies ache and their muscles weaken. Their eyes turned bloodshot, their lymph nodes swelled, and their defense and movement speed dropped.","“Ugh!” One black wolf coughed up blood as its health plummeted.","[System Notification: You have been attacked by \"Who Wants to Be a Vegetable.\" Since you are a red-name player, killing you does not increase the attacker's malice value.]","[Beast God Notification: You are poisoned. Elite template resistance has increased. Your defense and movement speed are reduced by 10% (originally 50%).]","\"Who's attacking us? Are there even any other players here?\"","\"Wait, 'Who Wants to Be a Vegetable'—isn't that a player from Zone 030? How did they get over to our side?\"","\"Damn, why is my health dropping so fast? I've got 100,000 HP!\"","\"The fog is toxic. Run first, get out of here.\""]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Live Stream Shock: The Counteroffensive Begins","paragraphs":["These players who had joined the evil faction and been strengthened by the werewolf Tuge began to run.","But in less than ten seconds, the second layer of poison arrived.","Speed reduced by 20%.","And no matter how they ran, they couldn’t seem to escape the poison mist.","The third layer of poison stacked on top.","Chu Fu’s damage was simply too high, and the toxins she inflicted were terrifying. These giant wolves couldn’t even last three minutes; within thirty seconds, they fell to the ground screaming in despair, unable to escape the poison mist.","All their equipment dropped to the ground—uniformly Bronze-tier gear. But not only that, there was also a black sphere radiating a golden light.","[Evil God’s Divine Power Substance]","Chu Fu descended, picking up the Evil God’s Divine Power Substance.","Shen Chi and the others were stunned for a moment, also shocked by Chu Fu’s skill, but quickly landed to help pick up the items.","“These beasts, traitors to humanity! They even wanted to kill NPCs!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao cursed.","There were fifteen Evil God’s Divine Power Substances in total.","Clearly, the people from the Dragon Tour Studio also knew this strategy; they had assembled fifteen players and joined the werewolf Tuge’s faction.","So, did players from other studios know about it?","That’s why the earlier servers had such low player counts—because they too were collecting disguise masks, drastically reducing the number of players.","After all, fifteen Evil God’s Divine Power Substances meant the heads of 1,500 players.","And fighting the boss, competing with each other, and PKing in the wild also led to player deaths, further decreasing the numbers.","In the original plot, Huan Yu Kuang Ba ended up defending the beginner village, likely because his authority in the studio was too low to know this strategy, and he didn’t turn on ordinary players.","The more Chu Fu speculated, the more control she gained over the storyline.","Still, thanks to the people from the Dragon Tour Studio, she now had two extra Gold-tier equipment pieces.","Chu Fu immediately equipped one onto her cloak and one onto her headband.","[Poison Moth Cloak (Gold-tier): Defense +150, Constitution +15, Spirit +15, Attached Skill: Poison Powder]","[High Soul Crystal Headband (Gold-tier): Attack +60, Spirit +38, Mana Recovery Effect +20%]","Before she even reached the level 20 map, Chu Fu had already gathered four Gold-tier equipment pieces.","How come she felt stronger than her brother Chu Feng, the male lead?","Chu Fu didn’t overthink it and started helping Suture Saint gather the corpses of the NPCs.","The sturdiest building in the village was the village chief’s house, and at its entrance, a nearly shattered corpse lay before everyone’s eyes.","The village chief’s abdomen had been eaten clean, likely because he was old, so the monster hadn’t devoured him entirely.","Suture Saint had never stitched up such a broken corpse before, but upholding her medical student professionalism, she replaced the chief’s organs.","Ever since she had mastered Corpse Sewing, the materials in her backpack had changed.","Hearts of mutated rabbits, hides of wild boars, livers and intestines of wolves, stomachs and kidneys of tigers.","She had known how to harvest from the start.","After switching to Free Mode, any monster became dissection material in her hands.","She practically performed a full organ transplant on the village chief.","Meanwhile, Lin Haowan’s livestream room exploded once again.","This time, it wasn’t praise—it was horror!","“Holy crap, holy crap, holy crap! How is the game not blurring this out? It’s just raw footage like this? I can’t take it, I’m gonna puke.”","Ahhhhh! This is horrifying. Usually seeing chopped pork doesn't bother me, but this is a person!","I always thought the strongest in the team was the Plant Girl, the coolest was the Wheelchair God, the most arrogant was the Sword Saint, the richest was Jiao Jiao—turns out the most ruthless is the Suture Saint!!!","Barrage defense!!! Protect my eyes!","Medical student reporting. This Suture Saint is incredibly professional—you can't develop that technique without at least ten years of dissection experience!","But she's saving lives!","And with the Suture Saint's expert treatment, the village chief's body was actually stitched back together.","As the Suture Saint's healing spell took effect,","the village chief of Tianhe Village suddenly opened his eyes.","He was alive.","\"I... I'm not dead?\"","No, he remembered. He had died. He had been torn apart by a pack of wolves. Even while he was still alive, they had ripped out his organs.","He looked around.","He saw a tall, elegant woman holding a needle and thread, her expression both saintly and serious.","\"Awakened one, you saved me!\"","\"Yes, I saved you. Got any treasures on you? Don't forget to reward me!\"","The Suture Saint said casually while treating the next NPC villager.","\"Oh, you've lost your hand. I'll replace it with a bear's paw! It'll pack a punch from now on.\"","The Suture Saint swiftly stitched away.","The village chief looked around. Everywhere there were the bodies of wild beasts, and a few people were busy working.","He finally realized what had happened.","\"You... you saved Tianhe Village?\"","\"Thank you, Awakened ones!\"","\"On behalf of Tianhe Village, I thank you!\"","\"But the beast tide isn't over yet. More beasts will come. You need to flee—take the remaining children in the village and escape!\"","Chu Fu walked up to the village chief and said, \"Grandpa Chief, we are villagers from Wangxi Village. Our village's Awakened ones are on their way. Don't worry—we will definitely defend this village!","Now, is there anything you need help with?\"","So hurry up and give us a quest—or some rewards!","The village chief of Tianhe Village looked at Chu Fu.","From the large energy-stone headdress on her head, to the sugar-cube-shaped earrings, to her skirt, cloak, and staff...","\"Ah! A powerful Awakened one! Thank you, thank you for coming to save our village!\"","\"If you can defend Tianhe Village, I will give you all the village's wealth as a reward!\"","\"For now, please save the villagers!\"","Immediately, Chu Fu received a system prompt.","[You have accepted the village chief's First Quest: Defend Tianhe Village.]","[Second Quest: Collect the remains of deceased villagers and body fragments.]","[Third Quest: Resist the beast tide.]","[Fourth Quest: Build traps.]","[Fifth Quest: Supply medicine.]","[Sixth Quest: Rebuild Tianhe Village.]","A series of quest prompts appeared.","Some of them were prerequisites for the village defense quest.","Then, a system announcement appeared.","[System Announcement: The village chief of Tianhe Village has been revived. After completing the village chief's quest and healing 11% of the NPC count, the contribution ranking can be reactivated, initiating the counterattack.]","[Countdown: 10 minutes!]","The task of saving people was left to the Suture Saint.","But the other quests also required a lot of manpower.","Right now, there were only five of them.","Time was running out; there were only 10 minutes left. There was no time to spare."]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Rebuilding Tianhe Village, the Beast Tide Returns","paragraphs":["\"Hurry, help me find the corpses of the pharmacist and the blacksmith—rebuilding the pharmacy and the blacksmith shop is the top priority!\"","Suture Saint shouted.","Chu Fu kept helping to move the corpses.","Right then, Shen Chi stepped forward again!","\"Plant Girl, use those white-level equipment on the ground. I just upgraded my talent—I've got one more chance to craft!\"","Shen Chi's crafting wasn't always successful. Sometimes the results were so poor they couldn't be counted as equipment and had no attributes.","But that's how invention worked.","Not every attempt was a success.","This time, Shen Chi was incredibly rough.","Countless pieces of white-level equipment were gathered as materials, fused into a giant iron plate.","On top of that iron plate were all seats.","The iron plate was thirty meters long, ten meters wide, crammed with seats.","Over five hundred seats in total.","No roof, just some railings.","A super open-top car.","Shen Chi put this vehicle into his backpack and then used a town-return scroll.","It would take a whole minute to fly back to the village from here.","But the town-return scroll only took ten seconds.","Ten seconds later, Shen Chi was back in Wangxi Village.","He summoned his mecha again and equipped the open-top transport vehicle.","With a thunderous launch, it took only about ten seconds to catch up with the main force.","After all, their flying wings were way too slow.","\"Get on! Hurry up and get on!\"","Shen Chi sent out a server-wide broadcast!","People naturally noticed Shen Chi's mecha—the thing made a huge noise when it flew—but when they saw its new look, they were all dumbfounded.","The mecha was holding giant chains in both hands, with a platform hanging below, covered in seats.","If it weren't so simply designed, it would have looked like a pirate ship.","Just looking at the seats, everyone understood.","Shen Chi was going to transport them with this pirate-ship-like iron plate covered in chairs—way faster than they could fly!","At their flying speed, it would take at least thirty minutes to reach the neighboring village.","The cavalry would be way too late.","\"Hurry up! We only have one minute—everyone get on board!\"","Shen Chi shouted while flying—time was of the essence.","Those who could take a seat would sit; those who couldn't would have to fly themselves!","Seeing this, the players pulled out all the stops.","\"Leaping Slash!\"","A warrior suddenly activated his skill in midair, slamming down onto the seat of the open-top car. He noticed each seat had an iron bar at the backrest that could be pulled down—just like the safety guard on a roller coaster.","\"Shadow Follow!\"","An assassin used a skill to instantly reach the target's back, landing on the iron plate!","\"Grappling Hook!\" Some players used items from the village defense phase to latch onto the seats.","A crowd flocked in, flapping their wings, looking from afar like a swarm of bats attacking a giant metal plate.","What chaos!","Shen Chi was impatient too. He maneuvered the iron plate vehicle, sharply scooping through the crowd like a slotted spoon scooping dumplings, dragging players aboard.","After loading about three or four hundred, Shen Chi didn't wait any longer.","\"Ready to set off!\"","Shen Chi began to accelerate.","The players on the iron plate clung desperately to their seats, then let out earth-shattering screams—you could even see right down their throats.","\"Aaaaaahhhhh!\"","Even though it was linear acceleration, it was way too fast!","Said it was an open-top car.","Looked like a pirate ship.","Was it really a roller coaster?","Shen Chi charged forward fiercely with the roller coaster, passing players still using their flying wings, sparking envious shouts.","\"Aaaaaah! Take me with you, veteran driver!\"","\"Wait for me—I haven't gotten on yet!\"","\"Quick, throw out your grappling hooks—you can hitch a ride!\"","\"I never hitched a train when I was young!\"","Quite a few players actually managed to grab onto the vehicle.","Speed: 360 kilometers per hour!","Under this acceleration, some players' health was dropping like crazy, and some were even thrown off.","The healers on board, once they steadied themselves, started casting heals in midair.","Time seemed to frenzy by.","After one minute and thirty seconds.","Tianhe Village had arrived!","At this point, only six minutes remained until the mission deadline.","But over five hundred players had shown up.","Their arrival was like throwing water into a boiling oil pan—crackling everywhere.","Players already had construction materials in their backpacks, and they immediately started repairing the pharmacy and the blacksmith shop.","Suture Saint had already revived the NPCs of the pharmacy and the blacksmith shop.","The blacksmith shop could stay closed for now, but the pharmacy was critical.","The revived pharmacy owner was an old, gray-haired woman.","\"I need herbs—make a batch of potions—otherwise, when the beast tide comes, we definitely won't hold!\"","\"Stop wasting time, just tell us how many potions you need, and we'll give them to you!\"","Making potions was a mandatory skill for all players, and herbs were something everyone carried.","Plus, the blood of many monsters was also a material for potion-making.","A mountain of materials was submitted, and the pharmacy's quest progress maxed out.","Chu Fu was also working there, helping craft potions.","Maybe it was because of her hidden trait as a Plant Girl—her potions often had critical hits.","When others made one bottle, she sometimes made two.","But at that moment, one person's power was limited. She was just one player among many, doing her best for the task.","[System Announcement: Tianhe Village Pharmacy has been repaired.]","The mission completed, players scattered like birds, dashing off to do other tasks—staying at the pharmacy for even a second was a waste.","\"Hurry up and do the other tasks—make traps, quick!\"","\"Build the walls! Does anyone still have materials left? I have none left!\"","\"Shrink the trap perimeter—only surround the inner area!\"","\"Rescue the NPCs and take them to the blacksmith shop to hide.\"","Players swarmed the village, setting up barricades and traps.","Five hundred people did the job faster than the original three thousand players from Tianhe Village had done.","Another four minutes passed.","Shen Shi brought back another five hundred players.","Only two minutes remained before the mission deadline.","Shen Chi didn't transport any more people. Instead, he quickly released the machinery from his backpack.","\"Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!\"","Rows of arrow towers appeared, rising from the ruins of Tianhe Village.","With these towers constructed, they were worth more than a hundred barricades.","The defense fortification mission progress instantly maxed out.","[System Announcement: Tianhe Village defenses are adequate.]","[System Announcement: Newbie Village major event, Tianhe Village Counterattack, has begun!","All players in the Tianhe Village area will receive contribution points for killing monsters and completing logistics tasks.]","\"We did it!!!!\"","\"Awesome! We are champions!\"","\"Ah, I'm so emotional. I feel like I've changed history—this is the thrill of gaming!\"","\"Don't celebrate too early. Get ready for the beast tide. Right now, we only have a thousand people.\"","\"Mecha Guy, hurry and bring in more people!\"","All the players were counting on Shen Shi, since his mecha's transport capacity was just too strong.","But Shen Chi had no intention of leaving.","\"That's enough,\" he said.","The newly arrived players were full of confusion.","\"How can this small number of us possibly be enough!\""]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Analysis of the Flower-Family, the Astonishment of the Wandering Dragon in the Wild","paragraphs":["Although their levels were high—all Level 10 players—facing a Level 5 beast tide of a million, and surrounded from all sides, they were still no match!","It meant fighting on four fronts, with barely over 200 people on each line.","That was nowhere near enough.","“Damage output is sufficient!”","Shen Chi said.","He wasn't wrong, of course.","Because as the beast tide thundered in,","Chu Fu took the initiative to attack.","Each village had a different geographical location. Tianhe Village had a river on one side and a forest on the other.","Most of the beast tide came from the forest.","They were still 200 meters from Tianhe Village.","Chu Fu didn’t wait for them to get close; she flew out proactively.","Plague Spread.","A patch of crimson mist shrouded the front line of the beast tide, then expanded outward.","The monsters in front were instantly killed, their bodies radiating ominous red mist, then rotting, swelling, and exploding!","“Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!”","The exploding corpses formed a kind of barrier, forcibly halting the beast tide.","On the side with the most monsters, Chu Fu held the line all by herself.","She chugged potions frantically, then headed to another direction.","By then, the enemy had already charged to within 50 meters of Tianhe Village.","She unleashed another Plague Spread.","Server 0308888 | [ProudButNotArrogant]: Just defend the southeast direction, leave the rest to Plant Girl, and also collect contribution points!!! I’m begging you all.","Even at a time like this, ProudButNotArrogant didn’t forget to collect contribution points.","The players of Wangxi Village had been rushing and doing quests earlier, with no time to watch the livestream. They didn’t even know what kind of ability Chu Fu had used to clear the ruins of Tianhe Village.","Now they finally understood!","Chu Fu had super-evolved!","At that moment, the players of Wangxi Village were even more excited than the livestream audience.","“Plant Master, I’m so proud to be in the same village as you!”","“Ahhhh, Plant Master, you’re so awesome! How did you do that? What happened?”","“Do you even need to ask? It must be skill enhancement stones!!! Otherwise, why would the big spender ProudButNotArrogant be collecting them?”","The viewers in the livestream couldn’t see the contribution ranking or the contribution shop.","They didn’t know what the first-place player would be rewarded with.","Most of them were players who had failed their beginner villages, or queued players who hadn’t joined the game yet.","Only a few high-level players had guessed the situation.","And besides them,","even the official team of Huaxia was watching the video without blinking.","They had made several backups, intending to go back and study it frame by frame, hoping to analyze exactly how Chu Fu had done it.","In fact, it wasn’t just Chu Fu.","Shen Chi’s mecha-making was also extraordinarily impressive.","“Plantman and Xie Lin’s situation is too strong. If this continues, won’t they be invincible? Isn’t there any monster that can counter them?”","Someone raised a question.","Everyone in the analysis department immediately turned to look at that person.","“Why are you all staring at me like that?”","“Isn’t it better for players to be strong? Why do you want to find something that counters her? Are you a human traitor?”","That person’s face instantly turned red, then he retorted loudly: “Only by identifying weaknesses can we make up for them! Besides... besides, this is a game, right? It should be fair! She’s so strong, and everyone else is so weak—that’s not fair!”","“Hah, wait until the day the game descends in reality, and then talk about fairness. See if you aren’t crying out to cling to her leg then!”","Still, that person’s suggestion was worth being cautious about.","One of them said, “Plantman is indeed very strong, almost overpowered in the beginner village. But she does have a fatal weakness: she’s a mage and summoner type.","And against an assassin ganging up on her, she could die in an instant.","For instance, the strongest assassin in Zone 001, ID Lu Xing, could likely one-shot Plantman.","Plus, this Lu Xing really enjoys killing people. He specifically targets guild players. Even though he has a disguise mask, he still wears a mask and never shows his true face.","To this day, no one has found out his background. He’s the strongest solo player in Zone 001.","If someone like that, for money or because he’s truly a human traitor, goes after Plantman, then she’s in danger!”","Huaxia had already marked Lu Xing as a triple-S-level dangerous target.","“As for the guy in a wheelchair flying on a mecha? That’s obvious. The main monsters on the Level 20 map are goblins. Goblins live in forests or caves—that mecha can’t enter caves. He’s already lost 90% of his combat ability!”","At this argument, everyone thought it made sense.","As for the others, they were also strong, but nothing special so far.","...","Tianhe Village.","10 kilometers away.","Youlong Zhuye led his group out of the beast tide’s encirclement, narrowly escaping danger.","The next moment, Youlong Zhuye’s face turned as black as charcoal.","He kept taking calls, his expression growing uglier with each one.","The disguised team that their Youlong Guild had carefully cultivated was completely wiped out.","And the ones who killed them were from Server 0308888, the Thorn Guild that had been used as their control group—who would’ve thought?","This was insane.","How could players from other servers enter their own server?","But he quickly realized what had happened.","Because the other team had completed their village defense and joined the main map, connecting with Server 0288888 to head to Fengdu Town.","Thus, their beginner villages were now linked.","Yet instead of heading to the new city, these people came to their beginner village to save those NPCs.","Meddling where they didn’t belong.","Just as he was thinking this, he suddenly had a bad feeling.","He immediately opened the official currency trading platform, checking the exchange rates.","The currency sold in Tianhe Village, because the village was destroyed and many players quit, had been put on the platform at an exchange rate of 1 yuan to 7 copper coins!","But now, all those high-rate copper coins had been swept clean.","Who did this?","“Damn it, we took a huge loss!”","Youlong Zhuye cursed.","Afraid that all the effort of their studio would go to waste, they had also dumped a large amount of copper coins onto the trading platform, even driving up the price with their own hands.","They had planned to scoop them all up once they left the beginner village, making a profit off the casual players.","But now, all that preparation had been done for someone else.","What hurt him most was that ten minutes later, he heard another announcement.","[System Announcement: Beginner Village Major Event: Tianhe Village Counterattack Begins.]","“What?”","Youlong Zhuye was completely dumbfounded.","What was worse, when the casual players heard the news, they first looked at each other, asked what was happening, and then learned the truth.","“It’s players from other servers coming here to help! A counterattack is possible!”","“I want to go back to the village!”","“Let’s go, hurry back! There’s still a chance!”","Half of the crowd immediately turned around, determined to return and defend the village.","Youlong Zhuye had originally planned to use these people as cannon fodder, protecting their group on the way to Fengdu Town, since the route wasn’t just blocked by beast tides but also by goblins.","Now it'll take another hour to get back to the village. Will we make it in time?"]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Chu Fu's Lucrative Deal: Who Dares to Steal the Fruit","paragraphs":["Inside Tianhe Village.","The fifth wave of monsters had been intercepted, granting a ten-minute break.","Outside the village, equipment and materials lay scattered everywhere, waiting to be collected.","The truth was, Chu Fu had single-handedly killed all these monsters, but she simply couldn’t pick everything up.","She gave up collecting altogether.","That way, other players could take the equipment instead of letting it go to waste.","After all, she had already earned enough.","When she first arrived at Tianhe Village, relying on her knowledge of the storyline and her own judgment, she immediately realized the price levels here were different from those in Wangxi Village.","Players sold copper coins only within their own server.","Now that the beginner village was no longer restricted to a single map, players could temporarily cross servers, traveling from Wangxi Village to Tianhe Village.","With Tianhe Village players fleeing, the currency’s value naturally tanked.","Chu Fu frantically stocked up, buying all the copper coins on the market that were priced above a 7:1 ratio.","Spending only 5 million, she acquired 37 gold coins.","One gold coin equaled 1,000 silver coins, which equaled 1 million copper coins.","That meant these gold coins were worth 37 million.","A massive profit.","As for the copper coins dropped by the monster tide — level-5 monsters dropped about 5 copper coins per kill, but the drop rate was roughly one drop every ten monsters.","Even if Chu Fu had wiped out 500,000 monsters, that would only be 250 silver coins.","She considered it welfare for the players picking up equipment.","But her generosity made the players too embarrassed to take her loot.","They didn’t keep the materials for themselves either. Instead, they gathered the equipment and piled it up, along with a large heap of copper coins, right in the center of the village.","They had done the same thing last time.","The players from Wangxi Village truly had too high a moral standard.","Chu Fu couldn’t carry it all either. Her guild members hadn’t arrived yet, and Tianhe Village had no guild warehouse, so the equipment had to stay there.","Shen Chi had become the Roller Coaster Driver again, transporting more players over.","This time, the situation wasn’t as urgent, so Shen Chi brought back seven or eight hundred people at once.","The fastest group of players was also about to fly in.","That way, Tianhe Village could definitely hold the line.","Afterward, Chu Fu joined in crafting traps.","On the north side of Tianhe Village,","in front of the defensive line built by the players, Chu Fu planted 20 creeping vines, covering a hundred meters of the frontline battlefield.","Now that Tianhe Village’s defensive perimeter had shrunk — it couldn’t compare to Wangxi Village —","this hundred meters was enough to block the entire contact zone of the monster tide.","With the monsters intercepted, the players would be safer.","To Chu Fu’s delight, among these 20 vines, one had mutated and given birth to a sprite.","[Creeping Vine Sprite (Special Summon): Born of nature’s call, a sprite born from a special plant. Fragile in life but powerful in attack. Can use skill: Thorn Entanglement.]","It was a dark green sprite, no bigger than a palm, wearing a skirt, with dragonfly-like wings on its back, able to fly through the air.","It could communicate simply with Chu Fu, heal her plants, and also attack enemies.","Much more useful than Shen Chi’s robots.","Chu Fu then went to the other side of the line and released 20 dandelions, which summoned another sprite holding a green chainsaw.","[Dandelion Sprite: Can use skills: Leaf Chainsaw, Hot Air Balloon Escape.]","Next, Chu Fu planted additional watermelon bombs inside her spirit plant pouch.","Sure enough, she could plant new ones and store the watermelon bombs.","While continuously storing them, a Watermelon Sprite also appeared.","[Watermelon Sprite: Can use skill: Throw Watermelon Bomb.]","Chu Fu couldn’t even imagine — if she had unlimited storage, she would have an army of plant warriors!","Chu Fu set up defenses on the western and northern walls using plants to intercept the monsters.","She herself appeared at the southeast corner, planning to use [Plague Spread] to clear the area.","The sixth wave of monsters came quickly!","Three minutes later,","the sixth wave was wiped out in seconds!","Chu Fu’s level skyrocketed to 12!","There were simply too many monsters — even if each monster gave her only 1 XP, that was still over 500,000 monsters.","The players present erupted into heated discussion.","“Plant Boss alone can kill all the monsters.”","“Do you think after the counterattack, we’ll still get attribute points? And double XP? That’s like getting an extra first-kill bonus!”","“Either way, we’re better off than other servers. I’ve heard that out of 28 major regions and 280,000 servers, none have achieved a perfect defense.”","They were incredibly lucky.","To have become players of Wangxi Village.","In the team, Jiao Jiao flattered Chu Fu: “Plant Girl, after you exchange your points later, sell me your leftover contribution points! Then I won’t have to shout myself hoarse buying them! Please, please!”","“No problem!”","With [Plague Spread], she could already dominate the entire beginner village.","Next came","the seventh wave...","the eighth wave...","the ninth wave...","all cleared.","Only the last wave remained!","At that moment, Youlong Zhuye and his team finally returned.","They entered the Tianhe Village area, accepted the quest, and saw Tianhe Village like never before.","Stone walls were piled up around the village.","Standing on the walls were players, all at level 10 or higher — some even at level 11 or 12.","Not only that, their equipment was incredible. Every single one wore bronze gear, the worst being black iron, and among every ten players, one glowed with silver equipment light.","The Youlong studio had only a little over a dozen silver items, all from first-kill silver chests.","What kind of well-armed village was this?","They cautiously approached, hardly daring to believe it.","Youlong Zhuye steeled himself and came forward, saying: “Everyone, we were the original players of Tianhe Village. Thank you for helping us defend our beginner village. We’re truly grateful. Could you let us in too? To defend the last wave.”","The Wangxi Village players frowned.","They didn’t come back before, but they come back now?","To leech rewards?","Everyone was displeased, yet they felt they had no grounds to refuse — after all, Tianhe Village was indeed theirs.","They all instinctively looked at Chu Fu.","Chu Fu raised an eyebrow and finally said, “No one’s stopping you. Come on in!”","Chu Fu didn’t plan to make a move just yet.","She naturally let them enter.","From within the team, Xie Lin’s voice rang out.","“Speaking of which, if Tianhe Village holds, will it merge with Server 26-27?”","“After all, each server only has one beginner village!”","“If they add Server 029, which failed its defense, that makes about 10,000 people. Won’t we have to wait for later server merges?”","“After the merge, dungeons and field bosses will unlock. That might delay us five whole days before we can take the first kill!”","Xie Lin was torn.","On one hand, he couldn’t abandon the beginner village.","On the other, he was especially annoyed at the four major guilds for creating a hegemonic server.","Chu Fu was about to explain","when text suddenly refreshed on the map, accompanied by fierce arguments.","Are the people on your server completely shameless? The copper coins we laid out were meant for the Plant Man Lord to collect, and you actually stole them!"]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Chu Fu Captures the Thief with Conclusive Evidence","paragraphs":["\"What's going on!\"","Chu Fu immediately flew toward the center of the village.","It wasn't just her—Xie Lin, Shen Chi, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, and Suture Saint also rushed over.","As soon as she arrived, Chu Fu saw Zhimengzhe, her face flushed bright red, eyes red-rimmed, and her body trembling slightly.","She was stammering as she spoke, but it was clear she was absolutely furious!","She wasn't even good at arguing.","Yet she was fighting tooth and nail.","\"It was your people, or else, or else how come these copper coins have been sitting here so long without anyone taking them? It was your people who took them! You won't admit it, so give them back!\"","Zhimengzhe stammered out.","But the people from Youlong Studio couldn't care less. A few of them even muttered among themselves, flashing malicious grins.","Youlong Zhuye knew full well that there was a good chance someone from his studio had done it, but he wasn't about to admit it.","He shot a quick warning glance at his subordinates, and soon a chorus of denials rose up.","\"You've got no proof! Maybe someone was waiting for our people to get close before taking them, just to frame us!\"","\"That's right, we never even got near here! How can you accuse us of stealing them?\"","\"You're just causing trouble, little girl. Look at you, all worked up, about to cry. Don't think that shedding a few tears will soften us up and make us give it to you—you're acting like a beggar.\"","\"Hmph, if you care so much, why didn't you put them away? Why show them off out in the open? Isn't that just asking to be stolen?\"","What had started as a spontaneous, heartfelt gesture among players","had been twisted by their relentless arguments.","Chu Fu stepped forward, positioning herself in front of Zhimengzhe, and stared coldly at the other group.","\"Do you, Youlong Studio, want to start a war with the Thorn Guild?\"","Youlong Zhuye was jolted wide-eyed with shock.","He'd just wanted to take advantage of the situation—he hadn't actually wanted to fight Chu Fu and her team. Most importantly, they really couldn't win.","His tone suddenly became much more respectful.","\"Vice President Plant, we have no intention of going to war with the Thorn Guild. But you can't misunderstand us either! If you insist we stole those copper coins, you at least need evidence! Don't go pinning a crime on us like this.\"","Xie Lin sneered from the side.","\"So, if there was proof, you'd be the ones wearing that crown, huh? Youlong Guild folks really are disgusting—you love wallowing in dirt!\"","Youlong Zhuye turned to look at Xie Lin, noticing that he too was decked out in silver equipment, his weapon glowing with a golden light. Youlong Zhuye's face twitched.","Who's this big shot now?","The people of Wangxi Village were way too loaded.","One glance at the ID: Who You Calling Blind.","This guy was clearly in cahoots with Plantman and Wheelchair. With Plantman on his team, he was acting cocky, daring to go up against Youlong Studio.","Thinking about how the other guy was blind, Youlong Zhuye flashed a look of pity mixed with contempt.","No matter how good you are in the game, in real life, you're still a nobody.","Youlong Zhuye's face hardened.","\"You people from the Thorn Guild have no manners. You have zero evidence—first you falsely accuse us, and now you start hurling insults! Is this the kind of atmosphere your guild fosters?\"","That hefty accusation was practically saying the Thorn Guild was just stirring up trouble.","Chu Fu knew full well that a guild's reputation hugely affected its future development. Who wouldn't want their guild to stand on the side of justice?","Games amplify the worst in human nature while raising the bar for morality. Whether a guild had a good name or not would later determine if they could attract top-tier players.","But trying to pull these tricks on Chu Fu?","They had the wrong person.","Chu Fu's face was set, her eyes fixed on Youlong Zhuye like she could see right through him.","\"Youlong Zhuye, you don't really think we have no evidence, do you? Remember, players from both servers were defending the village together today, and it was all livestreamed. You say your people never got close, and we say the same about ours.\"","\"So if we just rewatch the livestream, we'll find the truth easily enough.\"","What Chu Fu said made perfect sense.","But Lin Haowan was sweating buckets right then, because he'd been searching, and so had the viewers in the livestream.","No one had spotted anything.","Chu Fu remained calm and unhurried.","\"If neither side sees anything, then there's only one possibility—the culprit is an invisible unit, like an Assassin or Thief.\"","\"Then we just need to look through the footage and see who went invisible around the time the coins vanished. That should reveal the culprit.\"","\"And not only that—they might still be invisible out of guilt!\"","With that, Chu Fu grabbed a handful of toxins and flung them into the air.","[Flash Scale Powder]","If Flash Scale Powder hit a target's eyes, it could blind and burn them.","But the game had an incredibly high degree of freedom, and Chu Fu had discovered that using her toxin-scattering skill could not only poison enemies but also had a unique effect—exposing hidden units.","Plus, with her current mental strength,","a single toxin-scattering could cover a 50-meter radius.","In an instant, any invisible players were revealed, covered in scale powder and poison.","Soon enough, a player with the ID Youlong Shendao appeared in everyone's line of sight.","He looked panicked and immediately tried to flee.","He was the one who had stolen the money.","His talent was extremely rare—an S-rank—allowing him to pick up items while invisible without being detected.","Moreover, as long as he didn't move or attack, his invisibility could last indefinitely.","The people at Youlong Studio had even built a strategy around his talent for future boss raids. Even if they didn't land the killing blow, he could still sneak in and grab the loot.","So when he saw that huge pile of copper coins, he'd gone invisible, approached them, and picked them up.","When a heap of copper coins was stacked together, a single pick-up action collected them all.","He had gotten 1 gold coin and 750 silver coins.","Since there were so many players in Wangxi Village, the in-game currency was consumed quickly. The exchange rate held steady at 1 copper coin = 1 real-world dollar.","After the 7:1 exchange rate had been bought out, the currency's value shot up even higher. To Youlong Shendao, this wasn't just 1 gold coin and 750 silver coins.","It was 1.75 million!","If the village defense event hadn't locked in players and prevented them from logging out, he would have quit the game and run off with the money right away.","He never expected that, while hiding perfectly in stealth, he would be exposed like this.","He stared at Chu Fu in terror, watching as this girl, pretty as a doll, raised her staff at him without a hint of mercy.","There was not only cold cruelty in those big, beautiful eyes—but also a flicker of excitement.","The same excitement a cat feels when it catches a mouse.","Chu Fu swung her staff, and a flash of sickly green light landed directly on Youlong Shendao.","[Toxicity]","He didn't last even a second before collapsing to the ground.","Instantly, a gleaming gold coin and a pile of silver coins burst out from his drop.","\"Case closed.\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: Destroying the Youlong Studio, indeed too poor to have a single silver coin","paragraphs":["Chu Fu's voice, though soft and sweet, was resolute—each word clear and firm.","The surrounding crowd erupted in uproar.","Not only them, but even the viewers in the livestream room were cursing.","“Thief! Still in denial?”","“Youlong Studio is so shameless! Taking what’s lying around and then calling others rude?”","“Let’s see him talk his way out of this one!”","The members of Youlong Studio were mortified.","But Youlong Zhuye, as the high-priced team leader, quickly thought of a way out, struggling desperately to say:","“Why did you kill our man? He’s the finance officer of our studio! Those gold coins are studio funds!","And he’s an S-rank talent—do you have any idea how much damage you’ve done to Youlong Studio by killing him?","Revive him now, and I’ll let this slide. Otherwise, Youlong Studio isn’t just big on this server—we’ve got people in other regions too.","Youlong isn’t a group you can just mess with!”","He blustered, trying to sound intimidating.","Chu Fu’s lips curled slightly, a mischievously wicked smile spreading across her face.","If he weren’t an S-rank talent, she wouldn’t have bothered killing him!","After arriving, Chu Fu had questioned the situation, asking Lin Haowan first. But Lin Haowan said she hadn’t seen anyone, and hardly anyone had been close.","Chu Fu’s first thought was an invisible unit sneaking in to loot the gear.","But thieves and assassins couldn’t pick up items while invisible.","The only exception was if they had advanced stealth techniques.","In the original story, Youlong Guild indeed had such an expert.","That was Youlong Shendao.","As an S-rank player of Youlong Studio with strong abilities, he was later developed into an SSS-rank talent, clashing with Chu Feng and causing him plenty of trouble.","Though his end was tragic.","But Chu Fu didn’t mind nipping the enemy in the bud.","As for Youlong Zhuye’s excuses,","Chu Fu gave only three words in reply:","“I don’t believe you.”","Youlong Zhuye felt like he’d punched cotton.","Such a perfect excuse.","And Chu Fu didn’t buy it?","Of course, no one else believed it either.","Youlong Zhuye shouted in disbelief, “What do you mean, you don’t believe me? That’s it?","You won’t even give a basic reason—are you just being unreasonable?”","He tried to turn the tables.","Though Plantman didn’t play by the rules, he’d done everything he could.","That would save Youlong Studio a lot of public relations costs.","But then, the girl’s voice rang out again, like the whisper of a sorceress:","“Because your studio’s about to go under. You’ve sold every copper you could online.","So, not only does he have no money—you don’t either!","If you don’t believe me, I can prove it to everyone!”","Youlong Zhuye couldn’t piece it together.","He even asked,","“How will you prove it?”","How to prove it? That was easy!","Chu Fu raised her staff again.","In an instant, a blood-red mist enveloped everyone in front of her.","This farce had set Thorn Guild and Youlong Studio at odds.","All the players from Thorn Guild and Wangxi Village stood behind Chu Fu, glaring at Youlong Studio’s people.","Youlong Guild had a full fifteen hundred members.","But the players from Tianhe Village stayed far off, some even gleefully siding with the Wangxi Village players.","Chu Fu cast Plague Spread.","In a flash, it blanketed everyone in Youlong Guild.","Then, everyone felt the terror of the plague.","Their heads spun, bodies grew weak, lymph nodes swelled, and their lungs felt like they were bursting—coughing up blood.","Chu Fu’s damage was too high.","Within seconds, someone from Youlong Studio collapsed.","Their body swelled quickly, then exploded with a bang!","The corpse explosion killed those nearby, triggering a chain reaction.","Screams filled the air.","Priests frantically healed themselves, but their health dropped faster than they could restore it.","Still, Youlong Studio had talent. One priest had a cleansing skill.","Since the plague was a virus—a debuff in the game—any cleanse-type skill could remove it.","She cast a purge centered on herself, thinning the mist slightly. But the mist thickened again, and she was poisoned once more.","There were too many infection sources around.","After a few rounds, that priest fell too.","Total annihilation.","Within ten seconds.","Everyone in Youlong Studio was dead.","Even dead, their corpses seemed to have living mouths.","Youlong Zhuye went berserk, sending text on the map channel:","【Map】【Youlong Zhuye】: Plantman! How dare you! Killing our entire guild! You bitch! Wait and see—I’ll—","Chu Fu stood on his corpse and said, “Didn’t you ask me to prove it? I proved it, and now you’re mad?”","“Look at your guild—everyone’s so broke, the ground’s littered with copper coins!”","“And you say your guild can cough up one gold coin?”","“Stealing is bad enough, but you wouldn’t own up, and then you try to blame us?”","“Think the Thorn Guild’s people are pushovers?”","The next moment, a server-wide announcement blared:","【0308888 Server】【Who Wants to Be Called Plantman】: From today, the Thorn Guild officially declares war on Youlong Studio! Any guild member who kills a Youlong Guild player earns contribution points. The guild will cover resurrection costs for those killed. No mercy!","Seizing the chance,","Chu Fu publicly declared war.","They’d have to fight sooner or later anyway.","Might as well have a righteous cause.","So, she tore off any pretense of peace and went all out in the game.","What use was superficial peace?","Chu Fu didn’t need it.","If they had to fight, let it be early,","and cripple Youlong Studio until its stock hit rock bottom.","Of course, as Youlong Zhuye had said,","Youlong Studio had people beyond just this server.","They had many studios,","hiring tons of workers—","maybe enough to crush Chu Fu’s Thorn Studio.","But for now, Chu Fu could deliver a fatal blow,","humiliating them in the official livestream.","Before players could digest what had happened,","the tenth wave of monsters attacking the village arrived.","【0308888 Server】【Who Wants to Be Called Plantman】: The final beast wave is coming! All drops, including boss loot, are free for everyone to pick up.","【0308888 Server】【Who Wants to Be Called Plantman】: And here, I thank the Wangxi Village players for joining me in saving a desolate village ruined by a shady studio. We’ll be the heroes of this village—and in my heart, you’re the most righteous players of all!"]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: The Counterattack Ends: Where Does Tianhe Village Go from Here","paragraphs":["Chu Fu flew through the air, her cloak scattering scale powder, trailing a fluorescent glow as she went outside the village to spread the plague.","Soon, the tenth wave of monsters was also cleared.","And they noticed that this time, there was no giant black wolf boss!","The players didn’t think much of it, assuming the black wolf’s appearance was based on the players’ overall strength. Since Wangxi Village was so powerful, it made sense to have an extra boss.","Tianhe Village was so weak, so not having that kind of big boss was even more reasonable.","When Chu Fu canceled the plague spread and canceled auto-loot,","countless players rushed into the wilderness to pick up equipment.","“Haha, I picked up a silver equipment! Thanks, Plant Master!”","“Boo-hoo, I’m so jealous of you guys from Wangxi Village. We can’t even pick up stuff as fast as you!”","“At least the newbie village is saved. Can we get a stat bonus during settlement? I had my stats deducted before!”","Finally,","With the last monster cleared,","the system announcement rang out again.","[System Announcement: The beast tide has receded, the Tianhe Village counterattack is complete!]","[System Announcement: Non-Tianhe Village players have achieved the special achievement: Savior, receiving the Savior Badge.]","[System Announcement: All players who participated in the counterattack gain +1 to all attributes.]","[System Announcement: Public event contribution points are being settled!]","[System Announcement: Limited-time shop is now open. Reward items can be exchanged using contribution points. Duration: 24 hours.]","[System Announcement: Newbie village major event! The future of Tianhe Village.","Tianhe Village survived the beast tide by a stroke of luck, but suffered heavy losses. They are asking the saviors for help.","Choice 1: Relocate to Wangxi Village. Wangxi Village will expand into a medium-sized settlement, increasing its capacity for newbie players.","Choice 2: Rebuild Tianhe Village. Reconstruct Tianhe Village from its ruins, releasing a large number of quests. Since the village guards cannot protect more people, this newbie village can only accommodate 1,000 people. Reconstruction difficulty is high.","(All players who participated in the counterattack can vote. Votes will be allocated based on contribution points.)]","Chu Fu chose Option 1 on the spot.","She alone held 52% of the vote.","As soon as the vote share came out, even the other players felt they had no stake in it. They already knew the outcome.","The NPCs of Tianhe Village were going to Wangxi Village after all.","These NPCs emerged from their homes, carrying their luggage, leading their children and livestock.","The village chief looked at the players.","“Esteemed awakened ones, would you be willing to escort us old folk to Wangxi Village and help us build some shelter to live in? This old man thanks you all!”","The surrounding players immediately received a quest.","[Yes/No Accept Quest: Escort the Villagers to Wangxi Village.]","The players naturally chose to accept.","Shen Chi then brought out his iron-plate roller coaster again.","“Village Chief, walking from Tianhe Village to Wangxi Village would take a very long time. We have prepared flying vehicles that can carry you all!”","The village chief looked at the strange flying vehicle, hesitating.","“What is this thing?”","The nearby players immediately started cheering.","“Wheelchair Boss, you’re not planning to make the village chief ride the roller coaster, are you!”","“Oh man, wouldn’t that mean all the quests are done by Wheelchair Boss? Boss, don’t do that! Leave some NPCs for us to escort!”","“Given how old the village chief and these NPCs are, I’m afraid they might croak in midair.”","Shen Chi shrugged helplessly and said, “Everyone accepted the quest, so everyone should be able to complete it. I’ll fly a bit slower later. If you all follow, won’t we complete it together?”","That did make sense.","“You all arrange for the NPCs to board. I’m going to dismantle the arrow towers. Take everything we can carry; don’t waste anything. We leave in 20 minutes!”","Everyone responded and started taking apart the traps and trenches.","The stones and wood were all materials.","They couldn’t leave them here.","The players who took part in the village defense and counterattack in Tianhe Village also helped out, planning to head to Wangxi Village later to upgrade.","Twenty minutes later,","Shen Chi brought the roller coaster, carrying the 100 NPCs saved by the Needle-Saint Healer, heading toward Wangxi Village.","Over nine thousand players all took off, flying around the iron-plate roller coaster.","The Tianhe Village players who wanted to follow to Wangxi Village were all dumbfounded.","Seriously? I know this is a roller coaster, but I didn’t know it was a flying roller coaster!","How did it take off?","And how does everyone have wings!","Was this a standard issue in Wangxi Village?","So what now? They had to travel on the ground again?","The Tianhe Village players wept tears of envy.","...","As the Wangxi Village players escorted the Tianhe Village NPCs away,","Lin Haowan’s livestream finally reached its end.","[System Prompt: Village defense battle ended: Livestream will close in 10 minutes!]","Lin Haowan was filled with regret.","He really wanted to continue interviewing Chu Fu and the others, eager to know what changes Wangxi Village would undergo next.","But the livestream didn’t allow it.","He could only use the last ten minutes to follow the Wangxi Village players’ procession, watching them leave.","“Seeing a village so united, I’m truly moved beyond words. I sincerely thank someone like Who Wants to Be a Plant, a true master, for leading such a great village and presenting us with such a spectacular village defense battle.","At the same time, we strongly condemn the shady operations of the Youlong Studio.","Monopolizing game resources, suppressing other players, not defending the village, not contributing, and even stealing the fruits of Wangxi Village’s labor after returning, slandering others, and bullying the weak.","This unscrupulous studio, I hope everyone will join me in boycotting it!","Let’s restore integrity to the game!”","The viewers in the livestream naturally detested the Youlong Studio’s behavior.","“Boycott Youlong Studio!”","“Which group funds this studio? Boycott them all!”","“It’s funded by the Crown Prince of Shengtang Group!”","Lin Haowan, seeing that everyone shared his sentiment, finally breathed a sigh of relief.","The livestream closed!","Lin Haowan checked his queue information: he could only join Zone 0598888!","In truth, his talent wasn’t high. Even if he went to a new zone, he couldn’t possibly snag the first kill, and he’d face endless capital-backed studios.","So why not wait for the server merge and join Wangxi Village instead?","That would surely be a thriving paradise!","Thinking this, Lin Haowan suddenly felt his future in the game would be much easier. Maybe he could even join the Thorn Guild!","He pulled out his phone, opened his fan group, and was about to share his decision.","But the moment he opened it, his name was being spammed with notifications.","He wasn’t too surprised—after all, he was the first officially invited streamer.","But the next second, his eyes widened in shock.","The group was full of screenshots of trending topics, links to trending articles, and even official notices with blue backgrounds.","Trending: [Boycott Unscrupulous Studios in Games]","Trending: [Shengtang Group Expected to Hit Daily Limit Down at Market Open]","Official Notice: [Suspect Guan Youlong is suspected of illegally using drugs to cause unconsciousness, illegal detention, rape, seduction, and other extremely egregious acts.","Suspect Guan Youlong is now overseas. The Chinese authorities are calling for public tips and will make every effort to bring him to justice.]","Trending: [Guan Youlong MJ Case, Crown Prince of Shengtang Group (Explosive)]","Trending: [Shengtang Group Sealed and Under Investigation (Explosive)]"]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Official Intervention Leads to Dissolution of Youlong Studio","paragraphs":["The Linjiang City authorities finally made their move.","Saints Hall Group was swiftly locked down, and furthermore, it was implicated in multiple illegal activities.","Drug abuse.","Human experimentation.","And organ trafficking.","The emergence of the “Primordial Gate” had also cured a range of mental illnesses.","Several drugs produced by Saints Hall Group were exactly what these patients needed most.","The Primordial Gate had only been open for a little over a month, yet sales of various drugs dropped sharply.","Saints Hall Group assembled a team to investigate its secrets.","They needed to obtain this technology.","After all, there were still many people who didn’t play games—especially those with mental illnesses. They planned to extract the technology, repackage it, and sell it to patients for profit.","But this required a large number of experiments, hence the emergence of illegal human research.","The kidnapping of Chu Fu by Guan Youlong was merely a trivial tip of the iceberg.","Following this lead, the entire Saints Hall Group was uprooted.","Now was the time to close the net.","However, Guan Youlong and his family had sensed the crisis early and fled overseas.","Naturally, the lockout of Saints Hall Group meant the golden goose disappeared.","Guan Youlong’s Dragon Roam Studio also collapsed instantly.","Inside the Dragon Roam Studio:","“I’ve wanted to quit for ages. We work in hospitals during the day, and at night, we’re still grinding in the game. Get a promotion, they said. Orders from above, they said. No time to ourselves—do I owe you my labor?”","“The studio boss is already inside, and you want me to stay calm? You go calm yourselves down!”","“Disgusting. I can’t believe I worked for someone like this. I’ve known it was wrong for a while—it’s only because of orders from above that I played the villain.”","The players of Dragon Roam Studio defected one by one.","Those players who had carried the “Dragon Roam” name tag found it became a cyber stain on their records. They were even hunted down and assassinated in the game.","Eventually, they had to quit the server, create new IDs, and cut all ties with Dragon Roam Studio.","The Linjiang City authorities kept issuing updates:","“It is strictly forbidden to commit criminal acts in real life over in-game conflicts.”","“The city has solved a major gang crackdown case, serving as a warning to the public and preventing further escalation of disputes.”","“The authorities will strictly crack down on in-game harassment and abusive behavior. Players can report it to the authorities for action to prevent hidden criminal forces behind them.”","This string of thunderous actions finally allowed the furious players to vent their pent-up emotions.","“The internet isn’t a lawless place. Those studios cuss people out at the drop of a hat, and if they can’t beat you in the game, they ambush you offline—it’s lawlessness.”","“If they curse at me in the game, can I record the screen and report it to the police? This is great.”","“With official backing, we won’t have to fear their numbers anymore. They’re nothing but gangsters.”","Amid this outcry, a video went viral.","“Game Avenger, Real-Life Brawl: Blind Monk Takes on 13 Alone.”","It was the indoor and corridor video of Xie Lin being surrounded.","A blind man was chasing down 13 thugs.","The thugs fled in panic.","Edited and wildly promoted by creators in the meme video community, the clip exploded.","Because of his distinctive appearance, he was quickly recognized.","Game ID: Who Says Play Blind!","He was Thorn Group’s Blind Sword Sage.","“In the game, I’d call them big shots in-game; in real life, I’ll call them my boss!”","“How could a member of Plant Master’s squad be ordinary?”","“How do I explain to my foreign friends that we really don’t all know kung fu in this country?”","“Wheelchair Boss has a mech, Suture Boss can stitch up a corpse, and Blind Boss can fight—only Proud Boss came up short. Both contribution rankings were very low.”","“Proud Boss has the power of wealth!”","Unexpectedly, after this live stream, the most popular person wasn’t Chu Fu, nor Shen Chi in his mecha, nor Suture Saint performing live dissection—it was Xie Lin.","He had gone viral beyond anyone’s expectations.","...","Inside Wangxi Village:","The players escorted one hundred NPCs into the village.","The village chief naturally welcomed the newcomers and planned to expand the village.","Proud Not Spoiled immediately had an idea: she settled the new NPCs next to Thorn Guild’s headquarters.","Thus, after the village expanded, Thorn Guild’s base ended up counted as part of the village’s area.","This was huge.","All other studios were built out in the wild.","Only they were inside the village.","This meant the NPC guards would defend Thorn Guild for free.","Aside from expansion tasks, players also traded contribution points among themselves.","Wangxi Village Contribution Points and Tianhe Village Counterattack Contribution Points were two different currencies.","There were two exchange shops, but the items available were the same.","Chu Fu had only 6.28 million Wangxi Village contribution points, but a staggering 22.21 million Tianhe Village Counterattack contribution points.","She planned to exchange contribution points 1:1 to maximize their use.","After a few hours of work, Chu Fu finally exchanged all the items and sorted her gains.","Tianhe Village Counterattack rewards: 1x Talent Enhancement Stone, 3x Skill Enhancement Stones, 1x Golden Treasure Chest.","Wangxi Village shop exchange: 2x Skill Enhancement Stones.","Tianhe Village Counterattack shop exchange: 1x Talent Enhancement Stone, 3x Skill Enhancement Stones.","In addition, both shops allowed the exchange of 100,000 contribution points for 1 attribute point, with a limit of 10 on each of the four stats.","She spent 8 million contribution points to buff all stats by 20 points.","With 4.99 million contribution points left, Chu Fu purchased an additional 10,000 points and exchanged them for a Resurrection Scroll.","【Resurrection Scroll = 5 million Contribution Points (Limit 1)】","As the name suggests, this scroll allows a player to be revived—not only themselves but also others.","In the scroll merchant’s shop, it cost 100 gold coins each.","At the current market price, that was roughly 100 million per life.","And 5 million contribution points was the purchase price from Proud Not Spoiled’s acquisitions.","A huge profit.","The group was buying contribution points in the newbie village square. Proud Not Spoiled stood with her hands on her hips, laughing wildly.","“Hahaha! My talent—it’s finally S-rank!”","Proud Not Spoiled’s talent had been A-rank 【Pain Immunity】.","This was crucial for a tank being immune to pain, making her fearless.","Pretty worthy of the name—she was certainly not fragile.","However, its attribute boosts and combat abilities were relatively weak.","After upgrading to S-rank, Proud Not Spoiled instantly leaped in power.","【S-rank Talent: Body of Fearlessness:","Feature 1: Pain Immunity Ignores all pain; being hit or severely wounded does not cause flinching, retreat, or reduced combat effectiveness from pain.","Feature 2: Fearless Spirit Any attack has a chance to be blocked. After blocking, reflect 200% of the enemy’s damage.","Feature 3: Increase max HP by 100%.】","“Proud’s skill, hmm, her damage output depends entirely on how hard the enemy hits!” Xie Lin commented first.","Chu Fu nodded. “The more the boss hurts you, the higher your damage. The higher your damage, the more stable your aggro. From now on, no fear of losing threat!”","“Hahaha!” Proud Not Spoiled was incredibly proud:","“A tank who knows martial arts—unstoppable. From now on, I’m a super damage dealer.","But don’t worry, I won’t forget my original job. I’ve upgraded my shield to level 6.”","From now on, you don't need to worry about your safety!","Compared to her excitement, the Suture Saint looked as mournful as if he had lost his last hope."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Take Stock of Gains and Leave the Novice Village","paragraphs":["\"Two talent stones, and my talent only went up to A-rank. I thought each talent stone would raise it by one level! Turns out it's all about probability!\"","In the battle of Tianhe Village, Suture Saint healed 106 NPCs, earning 100,000 contribution points per NPC, totaling over ten million contribution points.","In the end, he exchanged for two talent stones.","Suture Saint's talent had only been B-rank.","Now evolved to A-rank, it didn't seem that powerful either.","【A-rank Talent: Nimble Meridians","Trait 1: Nimble Hands: Your hands are extremely dexterous; the speed of any ability executed with your hands is increased by 50%.","Trait 2: Meridian Flow: Healing ability is increased by 50%.】","\"I should've swapped for skill enhancement stones instead. My ultimate level 10 skill was pretty good!\" Suture Saint felt regret.","But the total number of monsters in the beast tide was fixed, and adding bosses and quest contributions, it all came to 100 million contribution points.","Not everyone was willing to sell their contribution points.","So it was impossible to fully redeem all the rewards.","\"I told you to listen to me, and you didn't!\" Xie Lin said with schadenfreude.","He also understood that Suture Saint's talent was low, and as a healer, he probably felt replaceable, so wanting to boost his talent was natural.","However, from an expert player's perspective, he should have upgraded his ultimate skill.","For example, Xie Lin himself had swapped for six skill enhancement stones. With the one gained from being third in contribution ranking at Wangxi Village, that made seven stones, all invested in Holy Light Slash.","His original level 10 ultimate skill’ Holy Light Slash’ had become ’Holy Light Judgment,’ with a judgment range of 30 meters in diameter, transforming him from a short-range fighter to a long-range attacker.","As for Shen Chi, he bought a batch of contribution points and exchanged for two talent stones but still didn't elevate his talent to SS-rank.","Being second in the Wangxi Village rankings rewarded two enhancement stones, which doubled to four; one more from Tianhe Village brought it to five stones. He put them all into his level 1 skill ’Mechanical Fabrication.’","Level 10 ’Mechanical Overload’ was also very useful, but a mechanic's entire attack power stems from machinery, so fabrication suited him better.","Then everyone turned their eyes to Chu Fu.","\"Plant girl, can you take another step? Did your talent reach SSS-rank?\"","Chu Fu shrugged helplessly.","\"No, I just control 10 more plants. Plus, leveling up to 15 added another 5, so now I can command 55 plants.","For skill enhancement, I'm planning to visit Fengdu Town to learn new skills first—then upgrade!","But I did get something great from my golden chest!\"","Chu Fu showed the item.","【Poison Vial (Gold-grade):","Off-hand Weapon","Physical Attack: 1-5","Magical Attack: 75-95","Spirit +25","Agility +25","Magic Points +850","Toxin Fusion: Absorbs surrounding toxins and stores them in the Poison Vial, usable for extracting materials or as an attack.】","An off-hand weapon, essentially the player's second weapon.","Assassins could carry two daggers.","The shield warrior Jiaojiao Bu Jiao could wield both a shield and a longsword.","Shen Chi was still using dual guns.","For mage-type players, off-hand weapons included magic orbs, crystal balls, etc.","A poison master using a poison vial as an off-hand weapon made perfect sense.","This equaled Chu Fu gaining one more piece of gold-grade equipment.","Chu Fu opened her stats panel, and the numbers were so dazzling that even she found it hard to take in.","Chu Fu allocated all 70 free attribute points gained from the village defense and counterattack battles into Spirit, dramatically transforming her stat panel.","[ID: Who Wants to Be a Plant","Level: 15 (0.0% Experience)","Class: Venomancer","Talent: Plant Person (SS)","Skills: Venom Strike, Slow, Plague Spread +8, Poison Spray, Toxic Vein Detonation.","Base Stats:","Physique: 73 (+58)","Strength: 73 (+37)","Agility: 73 (+102)","Spirit: 207 (+212)","Equipment: Disguise Mask (Dark Gold), Beast-Hunting Heart Emblem (Gold), Forest Poison Window (Gold), Toxic Moth Cloak (Gold), High Spirit Crystal Circlet (Gold), Poison Bottle (Gold), Guardian Emblem (Silver), Green Toxic Mushroom Skirt (Silver), Malevolent Staff (Silver), Savior Emblem (Bronze)...","Wealth: 39 Gold, 32 Silver, 323 Copper.]","Chu Fu's Disguise Mask had advanced to Dark Gold rank after killing players from the Soaring Dragon Studio, granting +20 to all stats.","Just based on her core attributes alone, Chu Fu was now over ten times stronger than an average player.","She had become a truly elite player.","If the novice village had a perfect score of 100, Chu Fu had earned 120 (with bonus points from the counterattack).","That was enough.","However, compared to her brother and other players with SSS-rank talents, Chu Fu still couldn't measure up.","They had an even more broken ability.","They could directly add attribute points through their talents.","No matter how hard Chu Fu worked, she knew she couldn't compete with the prodigies described in the storyline.","So, she still needed to push herself.","\"The novice village has no more resources to gather. We've even reached level 15 because we completed two village defense missions. Assign the team members, leave some players stationed in the novice village to recruit new players after the server merge. The rest of you, prepare to head to Fengdu Town!\"","The teleport fee to Fengdu Town was 1 gold coin.","That was far too expensive.","Chu Fu suggested they fly instead.","On a normal route, dodging high-level monsters and taking detours would take at least half a day.","But Chu Fu and her team could fly.","Their speed was more than double that of walking, and they could take a straight path.","From the novice village to the town, it would only take an hour and a half.","Even though they had only been in the novice village for eight days,","after experiencing two monster tides, everyone felt a strong sense of belonging to the village.","After all, it was the village they had defended.","When they left, each of them carried two emblems.","There seemed to be nothing left to handle.","Yet they were deeply reluctant.","Chu Fu took one last look at the thriving village.","She believed that once the server merge happened, the famous Server 0308888 would attract many new players!","Chu Fu unfurled her flying wings and took off first.","Soon, more players joined the formation, a massive swarm like a flock of bats, all flying toward the same direction.","Half an hour later.","They flew past the outermost boundary of the novice village.","[System Prompt: You have left the novice village. Your level is 15. To avoid stealing resources from lower-level awakening users, you are prohibited from entering the novice village unless for special quests.]","[System Prompt: You have entered the 4th Mirror Map of Fengdu Town, Server 0308888.","Server 0268888 has entered the 1st Mirror Map.]","Server 0278888 enters the second mirror map.","Server 0288888 enters the third mirror map.","After 39 hours, 57 minutes, and 23 seconds, the game will consider merging servers as appropriate.","Upon server merge, world bosses will respawn, and instances will be unlocked.","[System notification: You have left the newbie village area, activating more gameplay!]","[Pet system unlocked!]","[Mount system unlocked!]","[Fullness system: deep experience now available.]","[Public quests are now permanent.]","Amid uninterrupted notifications and continuous flight,","a mighty fortress appeared in everyone’s view.","“Ahead is Fengdu Fortress!”"]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Main Character Setting Collection","paragraphs":["【Character: Chu Fu","Age: 18","ID: Who Wants to Be a Plantman","Class: Poison Master","Talent: Plantman (SS)","Skills: Lethal Poison, Slow Spell, Plague Spread +8, Poison Scatter, Poison Vein Eruption","Appearance: Slender build, soft and sweet voice, speaks softly. Holds a poison bottle in left hand and a staff in the right. Wears a green little dress with a forehead ornament and a pair of oversized green candy earrings.","Role: Core team damage dealer. Fair and impartial in decisions; makes an excellent team leader.","Personality: Outwardly delicate, inwardly strong. Sweet-talker who loves to smile around friends. Doesn’t hesitate to call others “bro” or “sis” to cheer everyone up. A little sun in the human world; a decisive leader.】","......","【Character: Shen Chi","Age: 21","ID: Rocket on a Wheelchair","Class: Mechanist","Talent: Mechanical Modification (S)","Skills: Machine Fabrication, Machine Repair, Machine Overload","Appearance: Wears light armor. Owns a super cool mech, 10 meters tall, black-gold in color, with dual gun barrels mounted on its arms.","Role: Team transporter, great support for the MT, weapon enhancement master.","Personality: Outwardly gentle, inwardly struggling. Low enthusiasm for life; his condition gradually improves after entering the game. Focuses devotedly on mech research.】","......","【Character: Xie Lin","Age: 23","ID: Who Are You Calling Blind","Class: Sword Saint","Talent: Heart Eye (S)","Skills: Spirit Sword Shadow, Heaven-Piercing Strike, Holy Light Judgment","Appearance: Always blindfolds his eyes with a cloth strip. Wields a heavy sword early on and later a golden king’s sword.","Role: Executioner, humanoid boss crusher. Heart Eye ignores stealth units, can reveal hidden enemies; unbeatable in PvP.","Personality: Tenacious and unyielding, with the spirit of a strong person. Never gives up. Sharp-tongued in person, but playful and cute when joking with teammates via text.】","......","【Character: Huang Jiaojiao","Age: 25","ID: Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled","Class: Shield Warrior","Talent: Fearless Body (S)","Skills: Taunt, Shield Guard, Stone Fortress","Appearance: Clad in silver heavy armor, carries a bear-shaped shield.","Role: MT, tank, frontline class. Steps in with taunts at critical moments, always saving teammates from danger.","Personality: Outgoing and generous to a fault, but craves recognition from her father or desires to achieve something big to shame him—a man who values sons over daughters and has many illegitimate children. Acts as team glue, team boss, and guild financier.】","......","【Character: Li Zhenzhen","Age: 27","ID: Suture Saint","Class: Ancient Chinese Physician","Talent: Thousand Hands of Salvation (S) (Volume 2)","Skills: Acupuncture, Healing Flying Needles, Thousand Needles Ten Thousand Holes","Appearance: Wears whatever is available; uses healing priest robes. Early equipment provided by Huang Jiaojiao.","Role: Healer. Masters resurrection spells, strategically significant. Can revive NPCs to earn extra contribution points.","Personality: Clear-headed and self-aware. A small-town grindsetter—the responsible daughter of irresponsible parents. Knows she stumbled into a celestial game and works hard to keep up with her teammates. Huang Jiaojiao’s loyal sidekick. “Your humble servant has arrived!”】","......","Potential core team members:","【ID: Shafu Liangu","Age: 32","Class: Gu Master","Talent: Pig Raising Expert (A)","Skills: Contract Gu Insect, Sacrifice Gu Insect, Gu Insect Detonation】","......","【ID: Wu Yingchun","Class: Martial Artist","Talent: Tai Chi Master (S)","Skills: Basic Combat, Evasion and Shifting, Ultimate Combo Strike】","......","【ID: Little Sister Wu","Class: Witch Doctor","Talent: Pending","Skills: Prayer, Weakness Curse, Symbiotic Fate Link】","......","【Character: He Huiqi","Age: 16","ID: Dream King","Class: Telekinesis Master","Talent: Psychic Magnetic Field (S)】","......","【Character: Chu Feng","Age: 24","ID: Lu Xing","Class: Slayer","Talent: Killing Star (SSS)】"]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Fengdu Fortress, Battle Imminent","paragraphs":["The walls built of black stone were extremely imposing, lying low across the plains like a crouching giant beast.","The entire town of Fengdu was built strictly with a side length of two kilometers, covering an area of four million square meters.","So far, only one city wall was visible, but arrow towers and cannons had already appeared on it. Countless archers stood atop the wall, staring seriously at the outside.","There were also multiple watchtowers outside the city, constantly monitoring dangers around Fengdu Town.","As Chu Fu and the others approached, the archers’ gazes instantly locked onto them. Some even began to draw their bows to shoot arrows.","But the next moment, sharp-eyed archers showed expressions of surprise, then actually bowed slightly toward them.","\"We welcome the guardians and saviors.\"","They didn’t recognize these players.","They knew they were Awakened.","But the badges on them couldn’t be faked.","【Guardian’s Badge (Silver Grade)","After equipping, all stats +5.","(Obtained by achieving the achievement of perfectly defending a beginner village.)】","【Savior’s Badge (Bronze Grade)","After equipping, all stats +2.","(Obtained by achieving the achievement of saving a village. Saving more villages can continue to upgrade.)】","The badges weren’t just an extra piece of equipment; they represented military merits and honor.","\"Esteemed ones who hold the Guardian’s and Savior’s badges, this is your first time entering the city. Please dismount and go through entry procedures first,\" said a very tall NPC, quickly greeting them.","A golden exclamation mark appeared above his head.","Clearly, there was a task.","Specifically, a beginner guide task.","Chu Fu landed beside him.","\"This is your first visit, sir. I’ll assign a guard to show you around Fengdu Town.\"","【System Prompt: Fengdu Town guide quest started.】","Ah, they had to go through the boring sightseeing task again.","...","In reality.","【The Original Competition Academy of Sciences】","\"Yes, yes.\"","\"You flatter me, sir.\"","\"Yes, I will definitely complete the task!\"","Li Weizheng laughed like a blooming chrysanthemum, his face full of wrinkles piling up.","This time, their Linjiang City had stolen the spotlight.","Especially after learning that \"Who wants to be a vegetable\" had agreed to join the 【Original Competition Academy of Sciences】, he was praised for his sharp eyes and decisive action.","No, he had to strengthen security for Chu Fu and the others.","Wangxi Manor—he’d better send a full special forces company to protect them.","Before they acquired in-game powers, these gems absolutely could not die.","...","The Zhōngjiā official Analysis Bureau.","With the defense battles of Wangxi Village and Tianhe Village over, they naturally had more data.","\"This Thorny Thorns guild definitely has an expert guiding them.\"","\"Based on known intelligence, the distributor of the Mask of Disguise, Werewolf Tuge, is a minion of the Evil God, opposed to the Original System. The Evil God is like a virus code, invading beginner villages, inciting internal strife, and slaughtering players. In the end, it even strengthens evil-aligned players into elite black wolves. Players aren’t NPCs without brains—they cause greater destruction.","But Thorny Thorns turned this flaw against itself. Not only did they get over fifty free Masks of Disguise, they also spawned a big boss, killing it to gain 10 free attribute points.","The perfect defense of Wangxi and the counterattack at Tianhe Village truly opened our eyes.","In terms of attribute point acquisition, this team has reached the limit.","It also gave us a new way of thinking.","Can we replicate this plan?\"","The subordinates exchanged glances, then began a heated discussion.","\"Fifty masks alone are an impossible task. Killing five thousand people requires a resurrection spell in a beginner village!\"","\"How do you take down a wolf king with 5.6 million HP?\"","\"Counterattack also requires high movement speed. How did two villages support each other after one was wiped out? Might need a mechanic.\"","\"Shouldn’t the question be how to achieve village defense within four hours?\"","\"Well, if two villages fight their defense battles simultaneously, village with a later sequence number would need to reach level 10 with a thousand players at least a day earlier. That alone would eliminate 90% of beginner villages.\"","Only then did the analysts realize what amazing cards the people from Thorny Thorns had played to pull off this grand slam.","Final conclusion: replicating Wangxi Village’s success was extremely difficult!","The head of the Analysis Bureau could only sigh: What a pity.","...","Wantuzhiye Tower.","Conference hall.","Wan Huanyu sat stiff-faced, expression unreadable, slouched crookedly in his executive chair, staring at the dense crowd of studio representatives and outstanding employees inside the meeting room.","Among them, Feng Huimin stood on the podium next to a projector playing a PowerPoint.","\"The videos currently trending online are too widespread to remove, and the public opinion against our Huan Yu Studio is extremely unfavorable.","What has happened cannot be changed, so we must change our strategy—or solve this problem.","First point: I hope from now on, all studio team leaders will restrain their members, forbidding insults, personal attacks, and such behavior.","However, PK and monster stealing are not banned in-game.","If we get the resources, that’s our skill.\"","Feng Huimin pushed up her glasses, hiding her contempt.","She had originally despised such behavior.","But after all, their studio boss had served time in prison.","He was essentially a rotten, wealthy second-generation troublemaker.","As a high-level employee, sticking to morals meant losing money, while making money meant abandoning ethics.","So she turned a blind eye.","But now that Linjiang City’s officials had stepped in to support, insults in-game were bound to be restricted.","The previous thuggish tactics were no longer viable.","They had to restrain themselves to reduce the studio’s losses.","She emphasized the importance of this matter and instructed everyone to strictly follow it.","\"Second, how to deal with Thorny Thorns.\"","\"Currently, one of our studio’s teams, from server 0278888, is bound to merge servers with Thorny Thorns. Next, we need a direction: should we face them head-on, or develop in the shadows, trying to avoid their edge?\"","Feng Huimin pushed up her glasses again, glancing at Wan Huanyu, and saw he was playing on his phone.","Because his back was to her, Feng Huimin could see he was browsing a black website.","It was full of all sorts of strange ads.","Feng Huimin frowned, thinking to herself that at such a critical moment, Wan Huanyu could still be browsing color websites?","Little did she know, it wasn’t a porn site at all.","It was the dark web.","Wan Huanyu was placing an order.","An assassination order for Chu Fu.","Price: 100,000,000!","He didn’t just want a killer—he wanted someone who had mastered in-game powers to personally assassinate Chu Fu.","Because Chu Fu possessed that kind of power.","\"Master Wan, do you have any plans regarding Thorny Thorns Studio?\"","Feng Huimin had to prompt Wan Huanyu; it was his turn to speak.","Wan Huanyu looked up, then turned off his phone, saying, \"What?\"","Feng Huimin suppressed the emotion in her eyes.","\"Master Wan, should we attack Thorny Thorns?\""]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: You Came Up with Plans B, C, and D, but the Boss Says: Let's Go with Plan A (10,000-Word Bonus Chapter)","paragraphs":["Wan Huanyu's lips curled with a hint of amusement. \"If I said we had to fight, what could you do?\"","Feng Huimin immediately pulled up a PowerPoint presentation, bringing out all the data she had collected for analysis.","Feng Huimin analyzed from four angles: talent, class, skills, attributes, and equipment.","Summary: Super talent, powerful class, overpowered skills, ten times the attributes, and crushing equipment.","The team leaders on the call felt their scalps tingle.","How were they supposed to fight this?","Yet Feng Huimin remained perfectly calm.","\"Very simple: assassination!\"","\"Plantman is, after all, a mage-type class. As long as we deal enough damage, we can assassinate her completely!\"","\"Not only that, many of her skills actually have countermeasures.\"","\"For instance, the most troublesome skill, Plague Spread, can be dispelled with purification-type healing skills.\"","\"The second method: antidote potions!\"","\"Plantman is a special class—a Poison Master. Her initial attack power isn't strong; the real damage comes from the poison status after poisoning.\"","\"But if the entire raid team carries antidote potions to nullify her toxins, her skills become far less deadly!\"","\"And antidote potions aren't actually that expensive!\"","\"Over the next thirty-nine hours, all the alchemy-type players in the studio will work overtime to mass-produce antidote potions in preparation for our fight against Plantman.\"","\"Once the servers merge the day after tomorrow, we'll set up an ambush!\"","\"The ambush location will be at the level 15 boss, the Goblin Warlord.\"","\"Plantman will definitely go there.\"","\"A key point: on level 20 maps, squad members can form parties of ten. We need not only to assassinate her but also to block her teammates!\"","\"Next, here's the data and feasibility plan for dealing with Wheelchair.\"","\"Targeting Who Called Me Blind...\"","\"And Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao...\"","\"And Suture Saint...\"","\"Here's the predicted data on five possible high-talent members of the Thorn Guild...\"","\"At this point, it looks like we'll need a full assassin squad of a hundred people to have a chance. In addition, we'll need star-level players to face them head-on and crush them on talent.\"","\"So, we have to team up with the Rongxun Studio!\"","\"In fact, if the Longhan Studio fails to defend their village early this morning in zone 029, we'll need to ally with them too.\"","\"We can outnumber them. Although Wangxi Village has nine thousand people, the Thorn Guild only has five hundred. How can they compare to the five thousand-plus people we'll have combined?\"","\"Those scatter players are just a mob. Faced with true self-interest, there's no way they'd help the Thorn Guild fight us—and they couldn't even win!\"","\"That's all the information I've gathered so far. Master Wan, is there anything you'd like to add?\"","Wan Huanyu gave a light laugh.","Then he waved his hand and said, \"Do you take me for one of those fools from Youlong Studio? Walking right into a fight when they know the enemy's superior in talent and strength?\"","\"We're not fighting. No need to fight!\"","\"Maybe in a few days, this will all resolve itself!\"","Feng Huimin's expression stiffened, a sense of resentment building inside her. Her chest felt tight, as if a breath was stuck.","If he didn't intend to fight from the start, why did he ask?","Making her talk for a full half hour until her mouth was dry.","It felt like she had worked out plans B, C, and D, only for the boss to say, \"Let's go with A.\"","What an idiot boss!!!","...","Inside the game.","Within Fengdu Town.","Over nine thousand players blended into the vast town, injecting new life into it.","Chu Fu followed a guard around to get a feel for the layout, familiarizing herself with the potion shop, weapon shop, general store, and quest hub.","\"Plant Girl, got any strategies now? There's no boss or dungeon to run, so what can we do?\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao asked.","Chu Fu was their guild's go-to advisor.","For a new map, of course they had to ask her.","\"Follow me. Heading to the quest hub.\"","Everyone rushed straight to the quest location.","\"All Thorn Guild members, reservists included—accept this quest!\"","Chu Fu sent the quest details to the guild channel.","[Quest: Clean up the newbie village ruins, rescue trapped villagers, and help bury the dead.]","Xie Lin removed his blindfold, glanced at the quest, and a flash of insight struck him.","\"This quest—does it specify which newbie village?\"","Chu Fu's eyes landed on Xie Lin's face, and she gave him an approving smile. \"Sword Saint Brother, you really are a skilled player—you catch on instantly.\"","\"What riddle are you two playing?\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao asked.","Shen Chi and Suture Saint quickly figured it out too.","\"Server 0298888—which village is that?\"","Chu Fu snapped her fingers, deciding to stop being cryptic.","\"It's called Longshan Village. This village, along with Wangxi Village and Tianhe Village, forms a triangle, and it's the farthest from Fengdu Town.","In real-world geography terms, this is a standard mountain village.","Too bad, they've only developed the tourism facilities there—no estates or houses for sale.","In the game, this village faces its village-defense battle in fifteen hours.","The leading studio is Longhan Studio!\"","Chu Fu's expression turned cold.","Longhan Studio was part of the Sun family's business.","But their style wasn't much different from other studios.","\"This studio's combat capability is pretty average; there's no way they'll hold the village.","If the village is wiped out, it lifts the map restrictions.","Outsiders can then enter!","Plus, a wiped-out village stops being a 'newbie village,' so players above level 10 can also enter.","When that happens, we'll charge in for a harvest.","Whether it's free attribute points, contribution points, or talent stones—we can all grab them!\"","Suture Saint got excited instantly.","\"Ah! Does that mean my S-rank skill and the upgrade stones for my ultimate are in reach?\"","\"Exactly! But since the monster wave is still fifteen hours away, going there now would be a waste of time. Let's head to the ruined village in zones 026 and 027 first!\"","\"It's only been three days. Some NPCs might still be alive!\"","Everyone nodded in agreement.","Shen Chi summoned his mech.","\"Anyone want a ride?\"","\"Of course! Let's go!\"","Shen Chi stepped onto the mech, reached out, and grabbed Chu Fu and Suture Saint's hands.","Xie Lin and Jiao Jiao resignedly climbed onto the mech's feet and tied themselves in with ropes.","The mech roared into the air and shot off toward the town's outskirts.","In less than ten minutes, they reached the ruins of a place called Blackstone Village.","This was the newbie village for server 0278888, which had been attacked by a monster wave thirty-two hours earlier.","The ruins had nearly become a new beast lair.","Monsters were gnawing on crops, rummaging for food, with numerous bosses gathered together.","However, on the edge of the village, some players were still pulling and killing monsters.","When they heard the mech's roar overhead, they looked up—and a moment later, terrified screams erupted.","\"Crap! It's Plantman! Run! No, log out! Log out now!\""]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Universal Studio Evade, Save the Village","paragraphs":["\"What's going on? I think I heard something.\"","Chu Fu, standing in the palm of the mecha, was filled with confusion.","She hadn't even shown her face!","How could someone call her name?","Shen Chi was controlling the mecha, and as a machine, it had some radar scanning functions.","He naturally saw those people.","They were fleeing in panic.","On the team voice chat, Shen Chi said,","\"The mecha is too conspicuous; it was recognized by Wan Huanyu's studio. But apparently, my intimidation isn't enough—after seeing me, they yelled Plant Girl's name instead.\"","Xie Lin sneered. \"Blackstone Village is Wan Huanyu's territory, so it makes sense they're here. Still, these cowards—they didn't even try to fight us and just ran off!\"","Suture Saint thought it was normal. \"They're all just workers trying to save their own characters. They can't beat us anyway. If they dared to come, Plant Girl would wipe them out with one move.\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao chuckled.","\"I've got an inside source in their studio. They just told me that Wan Huanyu doesn't dare fight us at all and has already adopted a policy of avoiding conflict!\"","Chu Fu hadn't expected Wan Huanyu to be so spineless. Was it because she lacked protagonist luck?","He hadn't been stupid enough to attack her.","Back then, Wan Huanyu had gone out of his way to cause trouble for her brother.","But when it came to her, he was choosing to avoid battle.","Chu Fu had no idea.","What underhanded tactics Wan Huanyu might be using against her, making him hold back his studio from going all out.","\"They're gone? Good. We're taking over this quest!\"","The [Rescue Quest] offered generous experience points, plenty of game coins, and even reputation and hidden rewards.","To monopolize this quest, Wan Huanyu's studio had already cleared the area.","And since the location was far away, solo players didn't want to travel that far.","All the resources here had been claimed by Wan Huanyu's studio.","Now that they had fled, it all became Chu Fu's gain.","A massive beast tide of five million stretched as far as the eye could see, completely engulfing the village.","Above the village, flocks of crows and bats circled.","As Shen Chi approached, these birds, like sharks smelling blood, swooped down toward his mecha like a black cloud.","\"Holy Light Judgment!\"","Xie Lin found his chance to shine and unleashed a big move, blasting a hole through the area where the crows and bats gathered.","Shen Chi controlled the mecha, opening its palm to release Chu Fu and Suture Saint.","The evil Chu Fu was unleashed!","The ultimate weapon had arrived.","Chu Fu waved her staff, casting [Plague Spread]. A scarlet mist enveloped the monsters in the sky.","Within moments, the bird monsters screeched in agony and fell like rain.","As their bodies hit the ground, they swelled up like balloons and exploded, infecting all the monsters on the ground.","Not only that, as Chu Fu attacked, the poison bottle in her other hand began to absorb the released toxins in reverse, gathering them inside the bottle as if brewing some ultimate move.","Saving it up, she might feed it to some boss later.","In just ten minutes,","The gathered beast tide was completely cleared by the toxins, leaving equipment scattered all over the ground.","\"It's just the few of us—how long will it take to pick all this up?\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao felt overwhelmed.","Shen Chi, however, revealed a slightly smug smile.","The top three contributors in the village defense and counterattack battles each received golden treasure chests, though the skill stones and talent stones diminished in number.","\"My golden chest gave me something good.\"","He showed it off.","[Multifunctional Equipment Vacuum Collector (Golden Grade)","Special Item:","Feature 1: Automatically absorbs all drops within a 100-meter radius centered on itself.","Feature 2: Equipment is temporarily stored in the collector and can be dumped out all at once. Storage capacity: 100x100x100.]","A special item like this, similar to Chu Fu's [Spiritual Plant Pouch].","It had no stats,","But it was incredibly useful.","As soon as the vacuum collector activated, a gust of wind swept through, and the coins, materials, and equipment on the ground were all sucked in.","This made things so much easier—","No more picking up every single copper coin.","In total, they got 2 gold coins, a large number of white-tier equipment, over 100 black-iron pieces, 32 bronze pieces, and 4 silver pieces.","Chu Fu didn't need anything, so Shen Chi bought it all up. His mechanical crafting consumed a lot of equipment, and all his material sources came from the dismantling ability.","Chu Fu earned 3 gold coins.","Next came clearing the ruins of the village.","There were few corpses worth salvaging, and the hidden cellar where the children had been kept was clearly destroyed—no NPCs survived.","A flicker of disgust passed through Chu Fu's eyes. She suspected this was the work of evil-aligned players from Wan Huanyu's studio.","Fortunately, the bodies of the children hiding in the cellar hadn't been taken away.","Those evil-aligned players hadn't gone completely mad and eaten the children.","The bodies were intact.","Their time of death was no more than three days ago.","Suture Saint could still repair them.","After stitching up the wounds and channeling internal energy into them, the children hidden in the cellar gradually awoke.","\"Ah! Mom! Wolves! A wolf wants to eat me!\" one child cried out.","A \"...\" dialog box appeared above their head.","This was an interaction prompt.","\"No wolf will eat you. We've driven the wolves away!\"","Chu Fu comforted them.","The child sobbed, looked at the group, and then whispered, \"Where's Mom?\"","Chu Fu...","How was she supposed to answer that?","The village massacre had happened more than a day ago—58 hours by the count.","With a beast tide swarming the area—millions of beasts—how could Suture Saint, no matter how miraculous, piece together different people from incomplete remains into one whole?","So only these children survived; no one else made it.","The child seemed to understand something.","\"Are you... Awakened Ones, sir?\"","Chu Fu nodded.","\"Then when I grow up, I want to be an Awakened One too!\"","Chu Fu smiled and patted the child's head, feeling a pang of sadness in her heart.","NPCs could become Awakened Ones—after all, that was their life!","Because all NPCs were set programs created from souls that died during the game's invasion of reality.","Some souls had awakened, realizing they were in a game, and now served humanity.","They had their own duties, and as versions updated, they might join battles, or even die.","Chu Fu couldn't bear to imagine this child's fate.","\"You can definitely do it!\"","Chu Fu checked her backpack and pulled out a silver-tier staff.","The Malefic Staff was a silver chest reward when Chu Fu was level 4—by now it couldn't compare to the stats of a level 10 dungeon staff or field boss staff.","But its 20% poison damage amplification had kept her using it until now.","She had also kept a level 10 silver staff as a backup.","Now, she took out this staff and gave it to the little NPC."]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Sometimes Being Too Fair Hurts Feelings","paragraphs":["I hope he can grow up and stay alive.","Next,","Suture Saint stitched up 32 corpses and brought them back to life.","The entire village was thoroughly searched, leaving no one behind.","Shen Chi brought out the roller coaster track and loaded up all 32 rescued orphans.","Next stop, Lotus Village.","That was the starter village for Server 0278888.","The destruction of Lotus Village happened 24 hours before Blackstone Village, technically occurring just yesterday.","After Chu Fu and the others arrived, they cleared out the monsters and rescued the children.","Not only that, but because the damage wasn’t as severe, they also found some adult remains.","They saved 56 people.","Eighty-eight people in total.","Shen Chi brought out the roller coaster, loaded all 88, and returned to Fengdu Town.","Inside Fengdu Town’s quest completion hall,","Chu Fu and her team submitted the mission.","The NPC receptionist looked at the automatically generated quest scroll.","\"Great awakened ones, you saved two villages and killed 10 million monsters in just two hours? My god, you are truly a magnificent team.\"","The NPC’s expression was incredibly lifelike; such achievements were unprecedented.","Although village rescue was a team mission, the more you killed, the higher the reward.","But no one had ever killed this many.","And on top of that, they rescued 88 NPCs.","A protection mission like that would normally take half a day to get back to Fengdu Town.","Yet they completed the return trip in two hours, plus visited two villages.","The NPC receptionist exclaimed dramatically,","\"Although the contribution points for a rescue mission are lower than for a village defense mission, based on your completion rate, you’re still awarded 9.82 million contribution points.","Also, because you used your awakened abilities to save all the villagers,","those contribution points are not discounted—totaling 8.8 million contribution points.","You can use these points at Fengdu Town’s private treasury to exchange for rewards.","Your achievements in rescuing survivors will be recorded on the Savior’s Badge.","For such an immense contribution, the Thorns Guild you belong to will become well-known to the townsfolk from now on.\"","[System Notification: Savior’s Badge (Bronze Level) – Next Level Upgrade Conditions: 88/100.]","[System Notification: Your guild, Thorns, has gained 186 reputation points in Fengdu Town.]","The rewards were massive.","Most missions in Fengdu Town didn’t offer reputation.","Only difficult missions rewarded reputation.","With 500 reputation points, they could buy another guild base near Fengdu Town.","The Thorns Guild could then upgrade to Level 2, accommodating up to 5,000 people.","Five people had completed one-third of the reputation in a single run—an incredibly fast pace.","Afterward, they headed to Fengdu Town’s private treasury to exchange items.","In the end, they got three talent enhancement stones and three skill enhancement stones.","Now came the question: how to split them?","This was a team mission.","Before everyone could overthink it, Chu Fu spoke up:","\"There will be many team missions in the future. We can’t always be 100% fair. Sometimes being too fair damages relationships.","For this mission’s rewards, I’ll take one skill enhancement stone. Wheelchair Brother and Sword Saint Brother, plus Sister Jiaojiao, will each take one skill enhancement stone. Sister Suture will take two talent stones.\"","Suture Saint only had an A-rank talent now, and even a healer with revival ability felt the pressure.","Because she realized that the probability of her teammates dying was almost zero!","That was quite awkward.","What was the point of her running around saving others all the time for the team?","So she really wanted to improve her talent, at least in terms of talent level, so she wouldn't fall behind.","Taking her anxious mindset into account, Chu Fu made the allocation this way.","The cold eyes of Suture Saint immediately welled up with tears as she looked pitifully at Chu Fu.","\"Boo-hoo, Plant Girl, thank you!\"","This allocation by Chu Fu clearly gave up a huge share of the benefits—at least 1.2 million contribution points—that she shouldn't have taken.","Moreover, Shen Chi's contribution from traveling also had to be considered.","On top of that, Xie Lin had also taken action, and it wasn't that he couldn't have gotten that share, but Chu Fu's single move was enough for the team.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was practically the one carrying everyone.","But what Chu Fu said was right.","Sometimes, being too fair can also hurt feelings.","This time, Suture Saint got something, and next time she would take less.","As long as everyone worked together, they would all improve.","\"You're so polite, making me feel a bit embarrassed for taking without effort! Haha, then I won't stand on ceremony!\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao took a strengthening stone.","After everything was distributed, Chu Fu used the talent strengthening stone.","Hmm, no advancement.","Meanwhile, over at Suture Saint's side, a scream erupted.","\"Ahhh! Look at what talent I got!\"","[S-level talent: Thousand Hands Save the World:","Feature 1: Skillful Hands: Your hands are extremely dexterous; the speed of any ability performed with your hands is increased by 100%.","Feature 2: Thousand Hands: When casting a skill, generate hand illusions to perform multi-casting.","Feature 3: Healing ability increased by 100%.]","Only one additional feature, but it instantly took off.","Originally, casting a single skill could trigger Thousand Hands, and if it really could produce a thousand hand illusions, that would be incredibly overpowered.","It was a qualitative leap.","Suture Saint couldn't wait to try out this ability.","Just then,","a message came through Chu Fu's gaming pod.","It was a call from Chu Feng.","Chu Fu checked the time—24 hours had passed since she logged in yesterday at noon.","\"Time's up. I need to log off for rehabilitation. I'll be back in a bit.\"","\"Alright, Plant Girl, eat more meat and get fatter!\" Jiaojiao Bu Jiao said.","Xie Lin said, \"Want me to help? I'm really good at rehabilitation!\"","Shen Chi glanced at Xie Lin and said nothing in the end. In the past, he would have felt useless, but since learning that the game would merge with reality, he wasn't so pessimistic anymore.","He felt that the emotions of hopelessness and lack of motivation to live were gradually fading away.","His condition seemed to have improved a lot. Perhaps what those netizens ganging up on St. Hall Group said was right.","[Primordial Gate] could indeed cure mental illnesses. He felt much lighter now.","So, he decided to stay and think up more machinery and create items that could help everyone!","\"No need, no need. I have a rehabilitation therapist at home. You guys focus on doing more reputation quests. Once the servers merge, we can buy a guild territory. We need to snag the best one!\"","\"Alright!\" Xie Lin didn't insist.","\"Logging off now. See you later!\"","Chu Fu chose to disconnect.","As she left the game, Chu Fu's abundant energy began to fade, and the weakness of her body gradually set in.","So fragile.","She felt the nutrient solution repairing her body, but it could never match the speed of eating real food, taking medicine, and exercising to recover.","She needed to feast heartily in order to regain her flesh and blood.","After the nutrient solution in the game pod drained, the pod opened, and Chu Feng was already waiting beside it."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: The Village Defense Battle of Longshan Begins, Lin Haowan's Competitor","paragraphs":["“How’s Fufu doing in the game? Have the other studios been ganging up on you guys?”","Chu Fu smiled and said, “Brother, the servers haven’t merged yet. Everyone’s still doing quests and exploring Fengdu Town in the mirrored map.","We have to wait until midnight, after the village defense battle in Longshan Village ends, to get the full details on the server merge.","But Wan Huanyu has already ordered not to attack us. I just don’t know what Guan Youlong thinks about it, or how Wang Rongxun, the head of the Rongxun Studio, has issued his orders!","Hmph, if they won’t attack me, I’ll attack them first. I’ll find any excuse to wipe them all out!”","Chu Feng immediately burst out laughing. He didn’t find Chu Fu’s words malicious at all—instead, he found her mischievous and adorable.","He reached out, wanting to pinch her cheek. She used to have a hint of baby fat, but now her small face was all sharp angles, without a trace of softness.","A flicker of tenderness crossed his brows, and in the end, he gently patted Chu Fu’s head.","“That’s right, take them all down. But you also need to be careful. Your Thorn Guild should have left some people in the newbie village, right?”","Chu Fu nodded.","“Then you have to watch out for spies infiltrating your guild.”","Chu Feng spoke from experience.","In his previous life, major guilds were constantly scheming and betraying each other, resorting to all sorts of dirty tricks.","“Once your guild expands, don’t just recruit every player who leaves the newbie village with you all at once. Otherwise, it’ll become too big to manage later.","If you’re recruiting high-level talents, make sure they’re all truly high-level.","And keep your distance from guild members—you can’t let them know your moves. If someone gets isolated, they’ll be easy prey!”","“That healer you have, the Suture Saint, her skill is actually ‘Suturing the Dead.’ If any of you get caught and die, and your bodies are smashed to bits, she won’t be able to revive you!”","Chu Fu thought this made a lot of sense.","“Especially since she’s a healer—if she gets caught, it’ll be even worse! Losing her would be a huge blow to you guys!” Chu Feng warned.","After all, ‘Suturing the Dead’ is a skill, not a talent, so it can’t bring the Suture Saint back to life.","If her character dies, she’s done for.","Chu Fu thought about the Suture Saint’s recent promotion to S-tier talent today and realized that if the enemy tried to assassinate her, it might be anyone’s game.","“I’ll remind them when I get back!” Chu Fu promised.","Afterward, Chu Feng helped her out of the gaming pod and supported her as she went downstairs.","They had a hearty, nutritious lunch, and then Chu Fu strolled through the garden of the estate, soaking up the sun.","She worked out for another hour, returning drenched in sweat.","After freshening up, Chu Fu logged back in.","No one had disbanded the team, and as soon as she logged on, everyone saw her.","“Plant girl, are you tired? Want to eat something? After level 10, it gets so realistic, right? We should stock up on food in our backpacks from now on,” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was the first to speak.","“Not too tired. It’s only going to get more realistic. Oh, by the way, my brother said...”","Chu Fu shared Chu Feng’s warnings with everyone, urging them to stay vigilant.","The Suture Saint floated away.","\"Just now, I tested it—my innate critical hit rate is incredibly high. Of course, it's impossible to have a thousand hands, but at the very least, there are ten hands! If I unleash the Thousand Needle Barrage, it’ll be even more terrifying! Who dares to attack me? I'll make sure they face ten hands!\"","Chu Fu suddenly slapped her forehead.","\"Ah, I was so busy grabbing quests earlier that I forgot to learn the level 15 skill. You guys go ahead and handle the quests; I’m off to learn it.\"","She dashed toward the skill instructor.","Although Fengdu Town had swelled with over nine thousand players, only her team had reached level 15 on the leaderboard.","When Chu Fu arrived, no one else was around. The NPC instructor was flipping through a book.","A familiar, enormous crystal orb sat before the instructor.","\"Instructor, I need to learn a skill.\"","Without putting down the book, the skill instructor said, \"You know the rules, right? Five hundred silver per lesson! Pay up, and you can learn!\"","Prices had skyrocketed.","That was half a gold coin now.","Fortunately, Chu Fu was already a wealthy lady. She handed over the money without hesitation, then placed both hands inside the crystal orb.","What kind of skill would she learn next?","So far, the system-taught skills—Venomous Art, Poison Spray, and Poison Vein Awakening—felt rather mild, not sharp enough.","Surprisingly, it was the rare skill dropped from a dungeon, Plague Transmission, that had given Chu Fu the biggest thrill.","Poisoner skills didn’t seem very lethal!","As she pondered this, an image suddenly flashed in Chu Fu’s mind—a man in a green robe.","He was casting a skill.","It was Poison Spray!","But every time he released poison, it was different—snake venom, plant toxins, and various other poisonous powders.","Then, in the next moment, his staff swung.","All those poisons exploded violently.","[System Notification: You have learned Poison Explosion: By exerting your spiritual power, instantly detonate all poisons afflicting the target, triggering all subsequent damage at once, with an additional 50% damage increase.]","Chu Fu suddenly understood.","A combo skill.","All her skills were about applying poisons—deadly venom, slowing toxins, and plague poison.","These poisons needed time to take effect, the shortest lasting 15 seconds, the longest up to three minutes.","But once Chu Fu unleashed Poison Explosion, the poisons that would normally take 30 seconds to deal damage would detonate instantly.","The damage was massive.","And utterly unpredictable!","Especially when snatching the final blow on a boss, it was nothing short of divine.","After all, Plague Spread could drain 36% of a boss’s health over three minutes.","Although bosses had skills to resist percentage damage, this was still devastating.","Not bad, not bad at all.","Yet Chu Fu felt this skill could be improved even further.","She took out enhancement stones and hammered away.","[System Notification: Your Poison Explosion has evolved into Malicious Explosion!]","[Malicious Explosion (Enhancement +8):","By exerting spiritual power, instantly detonate all poisons on the target, triggering all subsequent damage at once, with a 400% damage increase.","Poisons on the target transform into a toxic pool, forming a poisonous prison that continuously traps the enemy, preventing movement. Jumping, flying, or using control removal skills can escape.","The toxic pool continuously inflicts deadly poison damage.]","Chu Fu was very satisfied.","“Once our reputation hits 500, let’s go farm goblins. The goblin kill achievement on this map doesn’t require solo kills; you can complete it as a team. The only problem is there are just too many of them.”","“Let’s go, forget the quest!” Jiao Jiao, who was never fond of quests to begin with, immediately gave up.","Since Fengdu Town was the newest map unlocked, Li Weizheng didn’t even know where the fast farming spots were.","Chu Feng’s usual map for levels 10 to 20 wasn’t Fengdu Town either, and without any storyline guidance, Chu Fu could only slaughter every goblin tribe she came across.","She was level 15, well-equipped, and the monsters in Fengdu Town were no match for her.","Caught up in the busyness, time slipped away without notice.","...","Midnight.","The village defense battle at Longshan Village had begun!","Lin Haowan, the game’s very first live streamer, immediately switched to reporter mode and entered Longshan Village.","But as soon as he arrived, he spotted competition.","[Host Lulu]","“Hello everyone, I’m Lulu.”","At the same time,","Chu Fu, still hunting monsters in the wild, took a moment to glance at the livestream.","Seeing Lin Haowan’s camera focusing on a semi-transparent reporter player, her eyes widened.","Wang Silu!","She actually applied to be an official reporter too?","Who does she think she is?"]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Succubus Jiang Yixing: The Studio Doesn't Pay, Employees Pay to Work (500 Comments Bonus Update)","paragraphs":["(I sent the wrong volume in the middle of the night yesterday and worked on it all night. Sob sob, I didn't sleep well. Chapter 86 was late and got stuck in review. The makeup chapter 87 couldn't be moved, so I had to add a main character group setting at the end of the previous volume. Interested readers can check it out~)","Chu Fu's eyes turned icy cold. Shen Chi and Xie Lin also noticed the person in the video and instantly grew serious.","This host, Lulu, was none other than Sun Jingya's good best friend, Wang Silu.","At that moment, Host Lulu was interviewing a player.","\"Today, I'm interviewing the artist Jiang Yixing. I didn't expect Yixing to be in the 029 District.","Wow, you look so handsome in the game! I believe the audience in the live stream must be screaming!\"","The man beside her was indeed stunningly handsome, and more importantly, he exuded a unique charm, as if surrounded by a halo of light.","\"Thanks for the compliment, Lulu. It's mainly because I awakened a talent that boosts charm. It seems the game also recognizes my good looks. I feel truly honored.\"","\"Is that so? Then what effect does this talent have?\"","\"As for its effect, most players won't refuse my requests. Of course, I won't misuse it. Right now, I'm just thinking—if we fail in the village defense battle later, I hope everyone won't blame me!\"","Jiang Yixing, with the ID \"Falling Star,\" made a \"please, please\" gesture toward the camera.","Inside Lulu's live stream, countless fans of Jiang Yixing flooded the screen.","\"My husband is so handsome!\"","\"Ahhh, how could anyone blame my husband!\"","\"That's right, hubby, why didn't you tell us you were playing this server? Otherwise, I would have joined you for sure!\"","\"Ah, didn't Jiang Yixing tell you? But he mentioned it in the die-hard fan group, though only fans who've spent over a million on him can join that group.\"","Chu Fu opened Wang Silu's live stream and saw a flood of comments.","\"This is troublesome,\" Chu Fu muttered to herself.","The name \"Falling Star\" was like thunder in her ears.","In the original storyline, Falling Star was a notorious male seducer, backed by three wealthy women and five rich men.","Back then, when he targeted her brother Chu Feng, he was eliminated in a single encounter by Chu Feng.","Utterly pathetic.","But after his backers heard of his death, they went mad seeking revenge on Chu Feng.","In the end, they were all cut down like cabbages, yielding a massive haul of coins and equipment.","His role... probably lasted about two or three chapters.","She hadn't expected him to be in the 029 District and about to merge with them.","To Chu Feng in the later stages, Jiang Yixing was nothing more than a clown.","But for Chu Fu right now, he was a real headache.","In the live stream, Lulu continued her questions: \"So, Yixing, do you lack confidence in this village defense battle?\"","Jiang Yixing nodded immediately: \"That's right. It's not that we don't want to defend, but the 0298888 server itself doesn't have any top-tier players. We've tried clearing nightmare-level dungeons many times, but we always failed.","Also, some people have been spreading rumors that our server is monopolized by a gaming studio.","That's not true. It's just that my fans and I play this game together, and everyone really likes me, so we've been playing around casually. We didn't expect to actually get a guild token and establish our Star Alliance.","But since I'm a signed artist with a company... I'm sorry if people misunderstood.\"","He bowed once more.","The livestream chat erupted again.","\"Long Han is so exploitative—working for real, working in the game too. My poor brother!\"","\"He must have forced our boy to do this. He wouldn't want to.\"","\"Our brother's playing games with his fans. He's just too doting!\"","Xie Lin glanced at the livestream, smirked, and sneered, \"I looked into this Star Alliance guild. There's no real investment from Long Han Studio behind it.","Because every member who joins this guild has to pay a membership fee.","They're all this pop idol's fans.","The guild doesn't even give members any perks; instead, it forces them to contribute equipment. And whoever contributes the most gets the right to team up with Jiang Yixing for dungeons and monsters.","So as long as you have enough money, it doesn't matter if your talent, level, or skills are weak. There's no way they'd ever clear a nightmare-level dungeon.","Fighting a boss? It's a human-wave tactic, letting Jiang Yixing land the final blow. Word is, one time a different player got the first kill, and that player was immediately kicked out—though they were also a fan of Jiang Yixing.","They didn't even get mad. Instead, they spent a huge sum of money buying gifts to apologize to him.","So across the entire server, there are no more than 21 pieces of silver-tier equipment—from silver chests from four bosses in a five-man party and the Tiger King's silver gear—and twelve of those are on Jiang Yixing.","But here's the thing: his class is a Bard—half healer, half support, basically no attack power. He can only buff teammates. It's a complete waste.","They're not here to play the game.","They're here to harvest their fans like cash crops.\"","Fans have to pay dues just to join a guild?","And then they're forced to free labor for Long Han Studio?","As far as capitalism goes, these guild builders are geniuses.","Star Alliance is nothing but a giant money-making machine.","Still, Chu Fu noticed how dismissive Xie Lin was of Jiang Yixing and recalled how Jiang Yixing was introduced in the story's plot. So she decided to warn everyone.","\"The Bard class isn't weak at all—especially if the player's talent is Charm and they've picked up some Siren Song skills. Their damage output can be massive.\"","\"Start making mind-clear potions right now to boost your Spirit stat. This player might try to charm us all with his charisma.\"","\"Let's be real: when the fight starts, no one will have the heart to kill him!\"","\"But if our Spirit stats are high enough, we should be able to resist it.\"","Chu Fu was now the vice-leader of a major guild, so with a single command, she could easily call on crafting specialists to brew those potions.","Soon, every member of Thorn Guild had a mind-clear potion on hand.","The brewing and distribution took some time, but since Thorn Guild members all had flight wings, they weren't slow.","Three hours later.","Members of Thorn Guild, including their associate members, had all gathered at the farthest edge of Dragon Village.","The newbie village hadn't been destroyed yet.","The map wasn't open.","So they couldn't go in—they could only wait.","On top of the 500 core members and 1,000 associate members, word had spread among friends—there were now about 3,000 people in total.","Tagging along with the \"Plant King\" everyone was buzzing about? Even if they only earned a little contribution points, as soon as the counterattack began, they'd get a permanent one-point stat boost.","Who wouldn't want in?","So no one minded the wait.","Stats are the real prize.","Meanwhile, they all opened the livestream and watched.","After the incident where the players of Tianhe Village collectively walked off the job, Server 029 was clearly prepared to put up a fierce fight to protect the newbie village.","There were 7,128 players online.","Around four hundred of them were level 10.","So they cleared monsters more than twice as fast as the players of Tianhe Village had.","In three hours, they wiped out six waves of monsters.","But clearing too quickly also had its downsides.","The players’ potion resistance had already risen significantly, and casualties were mounting.","When the seventh wave of monsters arrived, the top-tier players’ team could no longer hold back the BOSS’s assault. Losses were devastating.","Jiang Yixing led his team in a hasty retreat. The village could be sacrificed, but he had already gained enough free attribute points—he absolutely could not die.","“Xingxing, hurry and go! Protect yourself!”","“That’s right, escape to the mountains. That route isn’t where the beast tide is coming from. Run! We’ll hold them off for you.”","The BOSS and lesser monsters broke through the defensive line, charging into the village to slaughter. Buildings were toppled, and NPCs fell one after another.","Chu Fu stood up, gripping her staff and poison bottles tightly.","“Get ready,” she said. “It’s time for us to enter the fight!”"]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: The Suturing Master: Danger The Male Star's Tactics","paragraphs":["[System Announcement: Novice village buildings remaining at 10%, NPC survival rate at 10%, Novice village chief deceased, village defense battle failed!]","[System Announcement: All players in Longshan Village, all attributes -1.]","[System Announcement: Longshan Village has been erased from the map, Longshan Village ruins.]","With Longshan Village transitioning from a novice village to Longshan Village ruins, the map restrictions were lifted.","Since it was no longer a novice village, Chu Fu and the others, who were over level 10, could freely enter the area.","Shen Chi, piloting a mech, took the lead and reached the village in less than half a minute.","This time, they arrived a bit more promptly.","The village had just been breached, with only 10% of the NPCs remaining, still engaged in battle with wild beasts.","By the time the roar of the mech arrived, there were only a little over four thousand players left in Longshan Village, who had just fled the novice village and hadn't yet reached the foot of the mountain.","The village was overwhelmed by a tide of beasts, with more monsters continuously squeezing in.","At that moment, a patch of red mist descended from the sky.","The scarlet mist fell into the beast tide. The surging, roaring beasts seemed to freeze, falling to the ground with agonizing cries.","Then, like a single drop of water falling onto the surface of a calm lake, ripples spread out, sweeping through the beast tide.","The beasts writhed, screamed, and prostrated themselves, their movements growing sluggish, losing all of their former ferocity.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, the NPC villagers fought back fiercely, managing to carve out a glimmer of hope.","The mist was clearly spreading, yet it avoided them, causing them no harm at all.","\"A powerful awakened one has come to save us!\"","As for the not-so-powerful awakened ones, it was obvious who they were referring to.","With a light laugh, Chu Fu landed in the village.","[Suture Saint] immediately activated Suture Technique to begin treating Longshan Village's chief.","As she performed the Suture Technique, [Thousand Hands Savior] activated as well, accelerating the speed of her stitching. Even several nearby NPCs were also revived.","The three thousand members of the Thorn Guild helped transport the bodies, moving all the NPCs around the village to the chief’s residence.","The village had a total of 300 NPCs, all arranged neatly.","The remaining people repaired the buildings and set up new traps.","Shen Chi, on the other hand, used a large-scale vacuum cleaner to suck up all the copper coins and equipment, preventing a repeat of what happened last time.","Chu Fu was also busy.","The village only needed defense from the east and west directions. Chu Fu set up plant traps behind the village.","55 units of Clinging Vines could cover a range of 275 meters, which was exactly the width of the village.","This filled the Thorn Guild members with a sense of security.","All they had to do was output from behind the Clinging Vines, while the monsters trapped by them became easy targets.","With such a powerful intervention, the Longshan Village players who were originally trying to flee were utterly dumbfounded.","There were reinforcements?","It had only been 2 minutes since the village was destroyed.","A new announcement appeared!","[System Announcement: Longshan Village defenses meet standards.]","[System Announcement: Novice village major event, Longshan Village Counterattack Battle initiated!","All players entering the Longshan Village area, by killing monsters or completing logistics tasks, can earn contribution points.]","Jiang Yixing and the others, who hadn't gone too far yet, all stopped in their tracks.","In fact, they had already been standing and staring dumbfounded for a long time.","They were all playing the same game.","Why did the combat power and discipline differ so much?","A flicker of astonishment passed through Jiang Yixing's eyes.","\"Yixing, should we still leave?\" a middle-aged woman beside Jiang Yixing asked.","Her eyes were sharp and fierce, but when she spoke to Jiang Yixing, her tone was gentle.","She was Jiang Yixing's agent, ID: Mia.","Of course, it was Mia who handled the money-making schemes; Jiang Yixing always remained innocent and pure.","\"Of course, we need to go back and help too!\"","Jiang Yixing began scheming in his mind.","Of the six monsters they had fought earlier, the team had let Jiang Yixing's group land the final blow each time. Now that the counterattack had started, there were three more waves of monsters to take down—that meant another 12 free attribute points.","The gap was huge.","He wanted them badly.","Not only that, but he believed his talent could make Plantman fall for him. Plantman looked like just a middle school kid.","At that age, they loved flowery pretty boys and male celebrities most of all.","Seducing him would be a piece of cake.","Once he joined Plantman's team, with their top-tier equipment, he'd reap plenty of benefits after the server merge—getting access to dungeon instances, taking down bosses, and more.","As for any feud between Longhan Studio and Plantman, he had no clue.","He was simply confident in his own talent.","Soon, Jiang Yixing found Chu Fu standing by the East Gate.","\"Hello, Plant Master, thank you for coming to rescue Dragon Mountain Village. Our Star Alliance will always remember your kindness.\"","\"In the future, when we get to the town, with just our two guilds, I hope we won't fight and kill each other. I hope for peaceful coexistence, fair competition, and even better—cooperation!\"","\"Oh, and can you add me to your party? I have skills that can grant you buffs and help you in battle.\"","As he spoke, he casually glanced at Suture Saint.","\"Your healer is amazing, too, but she's busy resurrecting NPCs and can't fight with you. Let me take her place and help you out!\"","He was confident Chu Fu would agree.","Because his charm talent was enough to boost any player's favorability toward him. No one could refuse him.","Suture Saint had been busy stitching up an NPC's corpse, but now she suddenly lifted her head, staring in their direction.","Danger!!!","How could some shameless jerk try to steal her spot on the team?!","She immediately typed in the team chat, since saying it out loud would let everyone nearby hear.","[Suture Saint]: That shameless pretty boy wants me to leave just to give him my place! How dare he have such a big face!","[Suture Saint]: Plant Girl, did you take your awaken potion? Don't agree to him no matter what!","[Suture Saint]: Shameless bootlicker of the capitalists, trying to seduce our leader.","[Jiao Jiao Not Spoiled]: Wow, I think he's really handsome. Some of his requests are pretty reasonable!","Suture Saint could hardly believe it.","[Suture Saint]: Jiao Jiao, snap out of it! Did you take the potion? Are you not on your meds?","[Jiao Jiao Not Spoiled]: I took it, I took it! But isn't it normal for him to talk about peaceful coexistence?","[Who Calls Me Blind]: Jiao Jiao's spirit attribute is too low, and she might just be a lookist. Jiao Jiao, you're so shallow!","[Jiao Jiao Not Spoiled]: No, I'm not! I'm not a lookist. I'm just being honest. I really am not a lookist.","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]: Double negative equals affirmative.","Chu Fu saw what the team chat was saying and realized how truly terrifying Jiang Yixing was.","[Who Wants to Be a Plantman]: Send Jiao Jiao to the West Side. Keep her away from here.","Soon, Shen Chi came and took Jiao Jiao away. Fortunately, as a mechanic, Shen Chi needed some mana to build machinery, so he had also invested in spirit attributes. Plus, like Jiang Yixing, he was a straight man, so he was naturally less affected by the aura.","Xie Lin was purely a prodigy of talent; his insight could see through everything.","Chu Fu looked at Jiang Yixing, her eyes showing neither admiration, appreciation, nor curiosity. Instead, they were filled with calm detachment and formality.","\"There's no need for gratitude. We're here to earn contribution points too.\"","\"A fair competition between two guilds is no problem. But I'm worried that after you fail to secure resources, you'll go back on your word and attack us.\"","\"As for you joining our team, that's completely unnecessary. Our team doesn't exactly lack a healer.\"","Jiang Yixing's smile froze."]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Fair Competition for the Boss Why Are You Still Killing People","paragraphs":["Jiang Yixing never expected Chu Fu to reject him.","After all, he was an SS-grade talent.","[SS-grade talent: Enchanting Singer:","Trait 1: Enchantment – You can add a layer of charm halo to yourself, enhancing your appearance, temperament, and aura.","Trait 2: Seduction — Your attractiveness to the opposite sex is increased by 100%, NPCs' affinity toward you is increased by 50%, you are more likely to receive special quests, your suggestions are easily accepted, and the more reasonable they are, the more likely they are to be approved.","Trait 3: Sonic skill effects are increased by 200%.","Trait 4: Songstress – When you perform, your charm skyrockets, granting buffs to allies while causing confusion, infatuation, drowsiness, and other effects on enemies—they won’t attack you actively!]","A super powerful talent.","Especially Trait 2.","Basically, whatever he said, these women would all agree.","Yet Chu Fu had actually turned him down.","Little did he know, the person standing before him was likely the highest mental stat entity in all five beginner villages.","With 400+ mental stats, not only would she not fall for Jiang Yixing’s suggestions, she could even sense whether every word he spoke was sincere or a lie.","As for how handsome he was—","Well, her brother was handsome too!","Shen Chi was also handsome, and even taller.","Xie Lin was handsome as well, but Xie Lin’s handsomeness was the kind of powerful, unyielding charm.","She wouldn’t let someone’s looks override her principles.","For Chu Fu and Jiang Yixing, this was their first meeting, and the other party was working for Longhan Studio, a completely opposing faction. How could she possibly agree to his request?","Jiang Yixing’s face changed quickly.","His expression turned dejected, a faint melancholy shimmering in his eyes.","“Alright then. I just wanted to help you guys fend off the beast tide together. I guess the Plant Master doesn‘t need it. It's my fault for not being good enough!”","Chu Fu’s eyes went wide.","Was she dealing with a male version of a „green tea“?","Sure enough, as soon as Jiang Yixing finished speaking, the members of the Xingxing Alliance glared at Chu Fu and began speaking with sarcasm.","“Our Xingxing is great enough, isn’t he? He’s definitely better than your healer. Why won’t you take Xingxing? You made Xingxing sad.”","“And how can you not want a healer? Which team doesn’t need one? When the monsters charge, how are you going to fight alone?”","“That’s right! If you take Xingxing, we have professionals to block the monsters for you. We won’t even form a party with you, won’t steal your last hit—it’s free labor.”","“Too embarrassed to switch teammates? No problem, I’ll pay. 100 silver coins, how about that? Let Xingxing join you! 100,000 yuan for one party—cost-effective for those free attribute points, right? After all, these aren’t all-attribute points, that’s the going rate!”","Chu Fu fiddled with a poison vial and said, “Are you only hearing what you want to hear? Or can you just not understand what I’m saying?","You made a suggestion, and I have the right to refuse.","I told you, I don’t need an extra healer, and I’m not breaking up my fixed team.","If you want the free attribute points, then do as he said—compete fairly, that’s all!","The boss is right there. Whoever gets it, gets it.”","Logically, it made sense, but they felt that no one should reject Jiang Yixing.","Rejecting him meant she didn’t know what was good for her.","“Hmph, Xingxing, let’s compete. I don’t believe our whole group can’t out-grab her!”","“Exactly! With all our teams, how can we not out-grab her?”","“Stay sharp! We must make sure they don’t get a single boss!”","The Xingxing Alliance members were full of indignation.","Jiang Yixing could also see Chu Fu’s attitude—she was completely unyielding, neither flattery nor threats working.","Under so many people’s verbal pressure, she hadn’t budged; her mental defenses were too strong.","Just as they were arguing, Xie Lin and Shen Chi arrived at Chu Fu’s side.","“What’s going on? Didn’t they give you a hard time, did they?” Shen Chi’s massive mecha gave off a commanding sense of pressure, his cannon already aimed at the crowd.","“The Linjiang city official notice has already been issued. If there’s evidence of anyone insulting others in the game, they won’t ignore it.”","Xie Lin came close, his eyes covered, but his fingers lightly traced the King’s Sword.","“I prefer simpler methods. If you make things difficult for our captain, I’ll just take you all out!”","The members of the Thorn Guild gathered around, glaring at the Xingxing Alliance.","Whether it was level, equipment, or overall battle discipline (completing quests, setting traps, saving NPCs—everything orderly), they far surpassed the Xingxing Alliance.","If anyone thought Chu Fu was soft just because of her appearance, they were sadly mistaken.","Chu Fu’s strength was something these people had no idea about.","Chu Fu waved her hand.","“I... we didn’t say anything!” muttered one of the younger players.","Jiang Yixing also realized things had gone completely off track from what he had planned, and could only look for an easy way out.","“It was just a communication issue earlier. Everyone, let’s not argue!”","“Since the Plant Master has spoken, let’s each rely on our own skills!”","Jiang Yixing’s team was formed specifically to snatch the boss. It consisted of three archers, one high-damage mage, and Jiang Yixing as the singer.","“Don’t hold back later. If we can secure it ourselves, it’ll make us stronger—it’s better than letting other villagers have it. I believe in all of you!”","The others tightened their weapons, waiting for the moment to snatch the boss.","As they argued, time flew by, and the eighth wave of monsters appeared.","In the east at the village entrance, there were two bosses.","In the west at the village end, there were also two bosses.","They waited for the bosses to come within attack range before making their move.","But in the next moment, they saw Chu Fu unfold her flight wings and fly out.","“Damn it, is she going to start attacking early?”","“What kind of item is that? Get one for my bro too!”","“Seems like everyone from Wangxi Village has it—is it a local specialty? I’ll pay a high price to get one!”","As they had various thoughts, they watched Chu Fu to see her next move.","She waved her staff, and a massive scarlet mist spread across the beast tide, infecting and expanding.","Then, the beasts that were charging forward came to a halt.","The thick smoke of the beast tide never even got within a hundred meters of the village entrance.","“Not good! The boss’s HP is dropping too fast! Hurry, hurry—last-hit the boss!”","A crowd rushed beyond the protective zone of the traps and attacked the boss.","How could Chu Fu let them snatch it?","When the boss’s HP dropped below a third, Chu Fu activated her level 15 skill!","Virulent Burst!","“Boom!”","All the toxins on the boss exploded. Eighteen layers of plague toxin, worth 36% of its HP, sent the boss flying into the sky.","The worst part—the toxins exploded, creating an enormous green poison pool right where Jiang Yixing and his team had charged forward, and they all stepped right into it."]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: It wasn't intentional killing, just sew their corpses back together","paragraphs":["A sharp pain shot up from beneath their feet. Sunk into the poison pool, their bodies were covered in a sickly green. In moments, a massive damage number appeared above their heads, and they collapsed to the ground.","Poisoned to death.","Chu Fu was stunned.","System notifications flooded in.","[You have killed Star's Small Shield. Sin value +100.]","[You have killed Star's Cure. Sin value +100.]","[You have killed Only Love Yixing. Sin value +100.]","[You have killed Mia. Sin value +100.]","[You have killed Falling Star. Sin value +100.]","It filled the screen.","She had killed forty-two people in one go.","Their bodies lay within the fifty-meter-diameter poison pool.","Chu Fu’s sin value instantly increased by 4,200.","She was shaking with anger!","She had finally managed to clear her sin value by saving two ruined villages.","And yet, people still came charging in to get themselves killed!","The members of Star Alliance were also shocked. They never imagined that after Chu Fu killed the boss, she would go on to kill their people as well.","“You! Plantman, you’ve gone too far! Didn’t you say fair competition? Why are you still killing people!”","This time, Chu Fu was truly innocent!","In fact, she felt that these fans of Jiang Yixing were truly different from the people at Longhan Studio.","These fans hadn’t taken money from Longhan Studio. They were just brainwashed by Jiang Yixing, tricked by his skills.","So Chu Fu had no intention of attacking them!","She distinguished between grievances and didn’t involve the innocent. Besides, these players were really young—some looked even younger than Chu Fu.","Who would have thought that, even though she didn’t plan to kill anyone, these people would just stumble into her skills?","“How can you blame me for this? They stepped into it themselves. Fine, I’ll call our healer to stitch you all up and revive you!”","“Be careful next time and don’t step in again. If you die again, it’ll cost you!”","Chu Fu called for Suture Saint.","At the same time, she canceled the poison pool.","The massive pool gradually reverted to its original state as the spell was dismissed.","But the corpses that had died in the pool were still tinged with green.","“Boo-hoo, Xingxing has turned green! So tragic!”","“Bring them back quickly. The beast tide is coming soon.”","The forty-two green-tinged corpses were hastily brought back by members of Star Alliance, along with their equipment.","Suture Saint only arrived belatedly after killing two bosses.","Seeing Jiang Yixing’s poisoned corpse, a hint of amusement flickered in her cold eyes. The corners of her lips were held back, but her gloating was impossible to hide.","She really wanted to laugh!","‘You said I was useless, and now look—I’m the one you need.’","Suture Saint activated her stitching skill.","This time, she had a massive outburst. The ethereal image of over fifty hands appeared simultaneously, and countless threads and needles danced through the air, resurrecting all forty-two bodies at once.","Mass resurrection!","That was incredibly powerful.","It was the kind of skill that could turn the tide of battle.","Even though the members of Star Alliance had originally come not to play the game but to chase a star, after seeing Suture Saint’s feat, they could no longer say she wasn’t as strong as Jiang Yixing.","No wonder she could follow a top-tier player!","She was amazing.","Jiang Yixing’s eyes snapped open. He had really thought he would have to delete his account and start over—his SS-grade talent!","At that moment, he really wanted to curse out loud, completely abandoning his celebrity image.","He had thought about Suture Saint’s resurrection skill and wondered what price it would take to get her to help. He never expected Chu Fu to tell Suture Saint to revive them for free!","Hmph. A little girl. She was still charmed by him after all.","“Xingxing, are you okay? Did it hurt?”","“Xingxing, I brought back your equipment!”","“Xingxing, that Plantman is way too ruthless. Don’t be mad—you don’t even look handsome when you’re angry!”","Jiang Yixing’s private messages exploded.","[Mia]: Enchantment, quick, use your skill! Your beauty filter is gone!","Jiang Yixing suddenly snapped back to reality. He raised his hand and gently wiped his face, then immediately activated his talent skill!","Soon, he became handsome again, with an air of shattered romance, since he had just been killed.","“I’m fine, I’m just a little sad. It was my mistake to give that order. But this Plantman’s skill range is just too big—we really can’t compete with that. So for the next wave, we’ll go grab the monsters at the West Gate!”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","This Plantman’s skills were terrifying. The starting area alone had an eighty-meter diameter—that was about half the size of a school playground.","The spreading poison was even scarier; it cleared the whole field.","And the boss-killing move had such a massive area that there was no way to get close.","“But Xingxing, the next wave has flying monsters. I’m afraid we won’t be able to grab those either.”","Jiang Yixing gritted his molars.","“Then we’ll go for the last wave!”","His fans finally nodded, and the group marched off toward the West Gate.","The ninth wave of monsters descended!","The players of Thorn Guild all had flight wings and soared into the sky to clear the monsters, letting their bodies fall to the ground.","The coins and equipment that hit the ground were swept up by a massive mech.","Not a single corpse was left for Star Alliance.","Jiang Yixing endured it.","Finally, the tenth wave arrived.","East Gate: Wyvern, Python King.","West Gate: Crocodile King, Hammer Ape King.","Familiar bosses, familiar formations.","Not only that, but among the beast horde, six black wolves with their heads down and bodies lowered to stay out of sight let out low growls.","“Ow-ow-ow!”","They growled at each other, and while humans couldn’t understand, they could.","“Damn it! What a scam! Taking this gold mask forces you into a mission, or else that werewolf Tu Ge will kill you.”","“Who knew this Plantman would be so nosy, coming here to play defense. If not for her, I would have destroyed the village, taken the gold mask, and even gotten rewards from killing more NPCs. Now it’s all ruined!”","“It’s all that Plantman’s fault, and that streamer’s too. What’s he doing? Now the studio has ordered everyone not to grab gold masks by killing. Such a good item, and I can’t take it! Frustrating!”","“The trend has turned. Maybe from now on, all servers will start protecting villages. Werewolves won’t survive.”","“Damn it, werewolves are hunted by everyone. This game isn’t Werewolf—what’s wrong with playing the evil faction?”","Amid their complaints, these players were caught in Chu Fu’s Plague Spread. They didn’t even have time to scream before they died.","As hostiles, they wouldn’t be resurrected. Their corpses would remain for 24 hours, and then they could create new characters.","At the village’s western front, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao single-handedly pulled two bosses, and their health bars dropped rapidly.","“Get ready to grab the monster. Warrior types with big ultimate skills, get up! Archers and mages, prepare too!”","Jiang Yixing gave the command.","The moment he spoke, a blinding holy light suddenly enveloped everyone.","After the dazzling white light, his vision turned black and white. He entered a soul state, looking at the world from a strange perspective.","That perspective wasn’t great, but he could see the blindfolded swordsman—who had been acting cool the whole time—let out a disgusted shout.","“Are you doing this on purpose just to frame us?”"]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: The Last Counterattack Ends, Deciding the Fate of the NPCs","paragraphs":["Under Xie Lin's blade, 52 souls instantly perished.","The BOSS was naturally slain by him.","Once again, the Star Alliance failed to land the final blow on the BOSS, and Jiang Yixing died again.","This time, the corpse wasn't a sickly green, but pitch black.","Xie Lin's Holy Light Judgment was a blinding radiance with a searing effect; after a kill, the corpse turned black.","\"You! You're too much, how dare you kill our Star again!\"","\"Star's been burnt to a crisp!\"","\"Don't, don't scold them—what if they get ticked off and won't revive us?\"","\"Quick, get that Suture Saint over here to help! Star's lying on the ground getting cold.\"","The Suture Saint had been fighting for the BOSS too. After both BOSSes were eliminated, the entire team had fully secured all the BOSSes in this counterattack war.","There were 12 in total, granting 12 points of free attributes.","With the monsters dead and the minor mobs cleared, the system naturally announced the victory.","[System Announcement: The beast tide has receded, Dragon Village Counterattack War completed!]","[System Announcement: Non-Dragon Village players achieve special achievement: Savior; receive Savior Badge.]","[System Prompt: Detected that you have obtained the Savior Badge. Badge progression progress increased.]","[System Prompt: Savior Badge (Bronze Grade) upgrading to Savior Badge (Silver Grade, next upgrade condition: 520/1000.]","The Savior Badge had become Silver Grade.","Not just them, but all 3,000 people who had come received Silver Grade badges.","The players who didn't make it tonight would surely regret not joining Chu Fu and their team's operation.","Next came the leaderboard settlement.","[Contribution Leaderboard Rank 1: Suture Saint: 45.7 million; Reward: Talent Enhancement Stone ×1, Skill Enhancement Stone ×3, Golden Chest ×1.]","[Contribution Leaderboard Rank 2: Who Wants to Be a Plant: 16.34 million; Reward: Skill Enhancement Stone ×2, Golden Chest ×1.]","[Contribution Leaderboard Rank 3: Who's Calling Me Blind: 5.22 million; Reward: Skill Enhancement Stone ×1, Golden Chest ×1.]","The Suture Saint secured first place by rescuing 432 NPCs.","It made her want to jump for joy.","But before she could show off, a crowd came begging her to save people.","\"How did they die again? Ah, killed by the Sword Saint? Well, that's fine, but this time it's not free—100 silver coins to revive a person. Pay up first!\"","The Suture Saint had raised her prices.","Of course, it wasn't because Dragon Village's prices were different. On the contrary, the copper coins produced by Dragon Village had long been cleaned out, traded to Jiang Yixing, and then quietly sold off by him.","Most were sold to individual players. Even guild members who needed to learn skills, repair equipment, or buy potions had to fork over their own money.","So prices were very high: 1 type-flower coin could only buy 0.5 copper coins.","Even at the last moment before the village's destruction, the economy hadn't collapsed.","For the Suture Saint to revive one person, it cost them 200,000.","Guild members naturally didn't have that much money; even the wealthy backers lay dead on the ground.","Fortunately, when Jiang Yixing died, the gold in his pockets dropped, and someone took the liberty of trading it to the Suture Saint.","With 5 gold and 200 silver spent, Jiang Yixing and the others were all revived.","Jiang Yixing covered his face, quickly casting his Enchanting Aura charm. His look of brokenness didn't seem like an act.","He wanted to say that he had scoured an entire newbie village, hoarded all that money, and it was all used just to resurrect him?","Reviving him was fine—why did he have to pay for reviving everyone else?","But he didn't dare say it.","That would seem too stingy.","That's not what an idol should do.","He should be \"spoiling his fans.\"","Besides, these people had rushed in on his orders. Who knew that the Blind Man, plain as day and a melee player, could unleash a full-screen attack with a terrifying Holy Light spanning a 50-meter diameter?","Was this whole team a bunch of monsters?","At that moment, he deeply doubted whether he was even playing the same game as Chu Fu and their crew.","Compared to their heavy losses, Chu Fu's side was booming.","The Suture Saint had taken first place, with contributions reaching a terrifying 45.7 million.","After exchanging for 1 Talent Stone, 3 Skill Stones, and 1 Revival Scroll, she still had 28.7 million in contributions left.","\"How much are you guys short? I'll split the rest among you—no need to pay me back.","This is my thanks to the team for always carrying me!","If you hadn't shared a Talent Stone with me last time, I wouldn't have earned this much!","I still feel a bit sorry for Plant Girl. Actually, first place should've been yours, but there weren't enough monsters for you to kill, so I got it. It's a shame the mission rewards and limited Talent Stones can't be traded, or I would have given one back to you!\"","The Suture Saint was a little embarrassed.","Chu Fu laughed. \"What's there to apologize for? There were only three waves of counterattacks left. Even without the BOSSes, we could only get about 27 million in contributions. You pushed that value higher—everything extra is pure profit for us!","Besides, this is the last perk we can enjoy. There won't be any more counterattacks to fight!","This one move of yours gave the team at least two extra Talent Enhancement Stones!\"","The Suture Saint's individual contribution helped cover Shen Chi, Xie Lin, and Jiao Jiao, letting them all buy enough Enhancement Stones.","Chu Fu also spent 12 million to purchase the basic 1 Talent Enhancement Stone, 3 Skill Enhancement Stones, and 10 points of all attributes, leaving her with 4.34 million.","\"Let's save up another Revival Scroll for Wheelchair Brother to hold. If we get wiped out, you're fast enough to come back and revive the Suture Saint.\"","You always need a backup plan for survival.","They hadn't died yet, but that didn't guarantee they wouldn't in the future.","Double insurance was best.","With the exchanges done, it was time to deal with Dragon Village's NPCs.","Chu Fu and the Suture Saint hadn't voted yet, so the system's voting progress was stuck.","[System Announcement: Newbie Village Major Event! The Future of Dragon Village.","Dragon Village survived the beast tide but suffered heavy losses. It seeks help from the Saviors:","Choice 1: Go to Hope Creek Village. Hope Creek Village expands into a large settlement, increasing capacity for newbie players.","Choice 2: Rebuild Dragon Village by restoring the ruins. Many quests will be issued. With a higher number of surviving NPCs, the rebuilt village can still accommodate 10,000 players.","Choice 3: Go to Fengdu Town. Escort the NPCs there to increase its population, earning a generous reward (Exp, Silver Coins +10, Reputation +10, Guild Reputation: Participant Count ×10, Guild Building +1).]","The Star Alliance members didn't want to merge with Chu Fu's group at all, so they all chose choice 2.","But even with all of them voting, their 3,000 votes only accounted for 5%.","\"Plant Girl, which one should we pick?\" The Suture Saint's single vote could decide everything. She had never felt such heavy responsibility on her shoulders."]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Bold idea: acquire land quickly to build employee dormitories","paragraphs":["Chu Fu was also frowning.","Guild buildings were often only obtainable after a guild accepted large-scale quests.","The benefits they provided to guild members were enormous.","Especially some special buildings.","[Revival Holy Spring: After dying in the wild, your soul can return to the guild’s Revival Holy Spring to revive. Limited to once per day.]","Of course, the level of this building was divine.","It could only be obtained by a level 10 guild, and in the plot, such guilds were basically national forces.","China’s Level 10 Guild: Dragon Soaring Over Nine Provinces.","USA’s Level 10 Guild: Free Federation.","Russia’s Level 10 Guild: Winter War Alliance.","Only these three had obtained this building.","But level 10 for a guild was simply too far away.","Low-level guild buildings could also be obtained through quests, but the chance to upgrade to a large village only came once.","Most importantly, after reading this introduction, a bold idea emerged in Chu Fu’s mind.","“Choose 1.”","Chu Fu said decisively.","As Chu Fu’s words fell, both she and Suture Saint chose 1.","Option 1 received 80% of the votes, exceeding 33.3%, so the other votes no longer mattered.","The system automatically released the quest: escort the NPC to Wangxi Village.","[Yes / No: Accept the quest: Escort Villagers to Wangxi Village.]","[Your level has reached 15. After accepting the quest, you can enter the newbie village.]","Accept!","The players of the Thorn Guild also accepted one after another.","They could go back to the village again.","Everyone looked at Shen Chi.","It was time for the Big Iron Plate to take action.","Shen Chi took out the iron plate, but when the items overflowed from it, it immediately drew exclamations from the players.","“Wow!”","It turned out to be a ship.","If you saw a ship in reality, it wouldn’t seem like much.","But in a game, a massive ship only amazed the players.","In this newbie village where flying wings were already a revolutionary invention, Shen Chi had surprisingly come up with a ship equipped with countless flying wings.","That’s right, this ship actually had flying wings.","The hull was pitch black, with flying wings flapping on all sides like oars. Not only that, but besides seats inside, three-story cabins were built on top of the hull.","It looked like an aircraft carrier.","“Can this ship really fly?” with excitement, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao said immediately.","No more tying up ropes to catch the wind anymore.","Shen Chi’s brows relaxed, a smile curved at the corners of his mouth, and his mood was as sunny as a bright day.","“Of course!”","Xie Lin asked curiously, “But isn’t your skill only for one-time reinforcement? This ship is clearly modified.”","“My talent has leveled up!”","He posted his talent panel to the team.","[SS-Rank Talent: Mechanical Transformation","- Trait 1: Creation: You can designate a portion of materials and transform them into a mechanical item of your choice, with a certain probability of mutation. (Limited to 30 uses per day.) You can continue to modify the same item, but the materials required will double, and the quality must be one level higher.","- Trait 2: Reinforcement: You can designate a portion of materials to reinforce equipment. The strengthened item’s effect is calculated based on material level, with a guaranteed minimum upgrade of one affix. (Limited to 30 uses per day.) You can continue reinforcing the same item, but the materials required will double, and the quality must be one level higher.","- Trait 3: Mechanical and trap-type damage increased by 200%.","- Trait 4: Mechanical Fusion: The mechanical items you create can wrap around your body for combat. Before the machine is destroyed, you will not receive any damage.]","It felt similar to Chu Fu’s SS-Rank Plant User — both were group battle talents, and the fourth trait naturally developed into a survival ability.","Traits 1 and 2 had also evolved.","Plus, you could keep improving them, as long as you had enough materials.","In theory, you could even evolve an ordinary white-tier equipment into a divine artifact.","It just consumed far too many resources.","This time, the airship modification used up a large number of Black Iron-tier equipment, promoting the ship into a special Black Iron-tier transport vehicle.","The NPCs boarded the ship one after another.","This time, everything could be loaded at once.","Then, Shen Chi piloted the airship toward Wangxi Village.","But the speed of the airship was exactly the same as the flying wings, with no increase at all. The players of the Thorn Guild and the players who had come along kept up easily.","This made Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao extremely disappointed.","“I thought we’d get a covered boat ride, but it’s still this slow!”","It seemed they still needed ropes tied to the mechs’ ankles after all!","And as Shen Chi took off with the NPCs...","The members of the Star Alliance stood there with their mouths wide open, looking like a group of bumpkins who had never seen the world.","“Wait, something’s wrong. What about us? They’ve all flown away. How are we supposed to escort anyone? Where’s our quest?”","Just as they said that, the system sent a notification.","[System Prompt: Your escort target has been more than 500 meters away. Escort quest failed!]","In the live streams of Lin Haowan and Wang Silu, players watching the broadcast started spamming in the bullet comments.","“This plot... I feel like I’ve seen it somewhere before.”","...","Inside Wangxi Village.","The addition of 400 NPCs caused the village to expand again.","It was estimated to grow to 1200 meters by 1500 meters.","Looking at the expansion area, Chu Fu used her flying wings to lift herself into the air, constantly taking screenshots.","She had a big plan.","After finishing the screenshots, Chu Fu immediately called Li Weizheng.","At this time, it was 5 a.m. in China.","Only a faint trace of light appeared on the horizon, and the world had not yet awakened.","But since the birth of the “Primordial Gate,” humans spent their sleep time in the game.","Li Weizheng worked during the day and had to stay online in the game at night.","Time was tight.","When he saw the caller’s name, Li Weizheng’s eyes lit up.","He had been monitoring the battles in server 0298888 before this.","After yesterday’s live streams, the number of streamer slots applied for inside the game surpassed several thousand. Among servers 0290001–0299999, more than half had streamers broadcasting, creating unprecedented popularity.","But as broadcasts spread, it became clear that the success rate of village defense battles was too low.","Those like Wangxi Village were rare as phoenix feathers.","Now that Chu Fu was calling him, he was naturally happy to communicate.","Although she had joined the Primordial Academy of E-Sports Science, the arrangement was nominal.","It wasn’t that the school could teach her anything — based on her achievements in the newbie village, she could probably teach courses there herself.","“Hello, Classmate Chu Fu. I haven’t congratulated you yet on winning another counterattack battle. Do you have any good news to share with us?”","Chu Fu chuckled softly.","“Lieutenant Colonel Li, I know that the school currently has a system of internal contributions, redeemable for real-world resources.","I can share with you some game strategies that even ordinary people can use.","I want to exchange these strategies for some plots of land to build employee dormitories and office buildings for Thorn Corporation. Is that feasible?”","Li Weizheng was stunned.","Then his expression changed.","“Which plot of land do you plan to ask for?”"]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: Chu Fu's Tips for the Flowery Kingdom, a Killer with Blonde Hair and Blue Eyes","paragraphs":["\"Somewhere near Wangxi Manor! I want to build an all-round resort and tourist town around Wangxi Manor.\"","Li Weizheng couldn't sit still this time.","The official power in China is indeed powerful, but who among the truly available official personnel would join the game at the very beginning?","By the time they realize something is wrong and start queuing up to organize people to take action, they'll all end up in the later server regions.","Moreover, when a situation becomes a national concern, the official power simply can't cover everything.","Take the simplest example. The permanent population of Linjiang City is 5 million.","The number of stationed military forces is 25,000.","The number of police officers is 20,000.","The number of administrative staff is 35,000.","Some of these people may have joined the game in advance.","After quickly organizing the remaining people, with each server accommodating 200 people, there will only be 40 teams.","Some of them have already joined the old server regions, such as [Area 001], [Area 009], [Area 017], and [Area 023].","They planned to enter [Area 030] early this morning.","So, their information is lagging.","There is also one most important reason. According to research by the Academy of Sciences, the more a player recognizes the [game] and the more obsessed they are, the higher their talent will be.","The recognition level of official personnel is really too low.","So, to make up for this shortcoming, they established the Primordial E-sports University, but so far, the results have been minimal.","\"Student Chu, is there any reason related to the game invading the real world for you to want to buy the land in Wangxi Village? Do you think that not only will monsters invade, but also the novice villages will descend into the real world?","To be honest, since you bought Wangxi Manor, we officials have also been paying attention to the previous locations of the novice villages, and it turns out that they match the real - world locations.","Of course, this is normal. The introduction of the [Primordial Gate] also says that it is a 100% simulation of the real - world map, but it will be enlarged.","In the real world, two villages are only a few hundred meters apart, but in the game, it's a distance of more than ten kilometers.","If you can submit a detailed report, I can decide to sell you the land around Wangxi Manor. You can do whatever you want with it!\"","Li Weizheng has quite a lot of authority.","This matter concerns the survival of the whole world.","It is even more related to the lives of the more than 5 million people in Linjiang City.","The most crucial thing is that there is more than one novice village in Linjiang City. If Chu Fu really provides useful information, although Wangxi Manor has been given to Chu Fu, there are still other novice villages that can be managed.","Chu Fu was amazed by Li Weizheng's acumen.","But at the same time, she also realized one thing.","It was the butterfly effect again.","Because Chu Fu had changed the plot.","In the book \"Reborn in the Online Game: The King of Slaughter\", Chu Feng's sister didn't wake up, didn't defeat Huanyu Kuangba, and didn't buy Wangxi Manor.","In Chu Feng's protagonist storyline, Huanyu Kuangba was just an insignificant little character.","However, with Chu Fu's rebirth and her entry into the official's sight, her big - deal purchase of Wangxi Manor was really worth noting.","In her previous life, Chu Feng was a lone wolf, forging an army by himself and being invincible in the world.","Ordinary humans would only become the prey of monsters after the game invaded the real world.","Of course, Chu Fu couldn't blame her brother.","After all, he had saved the situation countless times.","As the protagonist, all the highlights were on him.","But Chu Fu thought that there was another route that could be tried.","\"Since Major Li is so sincere, then I can directly tell you the information I think. Of course, this is just my speculation.","Assume that monsters will enter our world and the [Primordial Gate] is training us to resist the monsters. Then, will the novice villages appear synchronously?","The biggest advantage of the novice villages is that they are safe zones.","No monsters will spawn in the safe zones.","However, the captured safe zones will turn into ruins, where monsters will spawn.","And...\"","Chu Fu paused, and her tone became serious.","\"At 0:00 today, all the servers in Region 001 should be facing the town - siege battle.","It must not fail.","If it fails, try to arrange evacuations as soon as possible!","Otherwise, if this place turns into ruins, it may become a future monster lair!\"","Li Weizheng's breathing became heavy.","He quickly went through the existing information in his mind.","The [Primordial Gate] opens 9,999 servers every day, with China occupying 600 of them.","Correspondingly, there may be 600 towns, or counties, or regions.","The population is about 100,000.","Currently, the success rate of defending the villages is 20%.","Then, 50 million people will be caught in the beast tide.","This result is really terrifying.","\"I understand. I will definitely pass on your information. Also, I'll approve the land you want as soon as possible. If you don't have enough funds and want to take a loan from the bank, just tell me!\"","Chu Fu nodded in satisfaction.","\"I'll submit a strategy later, which may also help everyone.\"","She planned to give China information such as the achievement of killing 100,000 monsters, using bombs to blow up beehives, trapping wild boar monsters, the hidden quest of the Beast - Hunting Heart, the method of obtaining the golden mask, the requirements for the team to kill Werewolf Tuge in reverse, and the seriousness of joining the evil faction.","But this strategy must never be made public.","Because the disguise mask is too easy to obtain.","The scariest thing is that as long as you agree to Werewolf Tuge's request, the mask will be soul - bound. After death, the newly created account will automatically join the evil faction.","And the number of these players will only increase. There are even some people who are naturally fond of venting their emotions on the Internet, claiming that faction choice is free, that they like the evil faction, that they like to be unrestrained and like killing.","After these people gather, they can even agree to apply for the same server and then massacre villages, towns, and cities, doing all kinds of evil.","Chu Fu will never allow such people to exist in China.","As for other countries, especially some so - called free countries and war - torn countries, she is powerless.","...","Wangxi Mountain.","As a famous scenic spot in Wangxi Scenic Area, it is very popular among the citizens of Linjiang City.","Standing on the mountain, you can overlook the distance. In the sea of green rice fields, Wangxi Manor looks extremely beautiful.","At this time, several blond - haired and blue - eyed people were looking at Wangxi Manor.","One of them lowered his voice and said, \"Boss, the biggest one over there is the target location. But the target is in the game pod all day long. That game pod is even harder than a tank. We can only assassinate her when she gets out of the game pod.","Fortunately, I bribed the security guards in the community!","I heard that she comes out to soak up the sun every noon.","But there are too many people here!\"","He couldn't believe that there were so many people climbing the mountain in this remote area!","What's so good about climbing a mountain?","There are people everywhere.","How can they set up a sniper rifle?","It's easy to be discovered.","The man called the boss smiled slightly. \"Ross, times have changed. Now, it's the era of extraordinary powers. You have absolutely no idea what abilities a level - 30 assassin has!\"","He smiled proudly. \"I'll be like a fish in water!\"","They didn't notice that the people around them, originally middle-aged and elderly folks in their fifties and sixties, had gradually been replaced by young people in their twenties and thirties. These young people had dark skin and were physically fit, forming a encirclement around them. Suddenly, the people around them took out their weapons and pointed them at the two of them. \"Freeze! We are Chinese special police. Please show us your IDs!\""]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: Assassins from the Game Descend into Reality","paragraphs":["The blonde-haired, blue-eyed man called Ross instantly raised his hands in a gesture of surrender, his eyes filled with terror.","He hadn't expected to be surrounded the moment he showed his face.","But another man named Laurent suddenly let out a savage grin.","\"You don't understand the power of the game!\"","As he spoke, his figure abruptly vanished from where he stood.","Invisibility!","It was absolutely incredible.","Ross's eyes went wide as he stared at the empty space in disbelief.","The SWAT officers' expressions shifted simultaneously as recent training flashed through their minds.","Game Experience Card!","This man had acquired power from the game.","There was only one explanation for his disappearance.","A Stealth ability from the Assassin class.","\"Everyone on alert, thermal imaging scan.\"","Swoosh, swoosh, swoosh!","The fully equipped armed force instantly swapped their glasses for thermal imaging goggles. As their surroundings shifted, the thermal scan quickly revealed the hidden figure.","\"There he is!\"","\"Watch out!\"","An armed officer shouted as several of them opened fire.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Bullets flew.","But they missed.","His speed was inhuman—faster than any creature on this planet, swift as lightning as he dodged the bullets. His combat knife slashed viciously toward an officer's throat.","In an instant, blood sprayed.","The officer collapsed with a thud, blood pooling around him, leaving no hope of survival.","\"Ah!\"","The entire unit erupted in fury, spraying fire at the enemy's position.","But he had already closed in on a second target, striking again.","That officer's eyes flickered with determination as he grabbed the arm stabbing toward him.","The blade buried itself in his neck, but he held tight.","\"Ugh... got... got him!\"","\"Fire!!!\"","Someone roared.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Bullets hammered into the enemy, only to pass straight through his body, nearly hitting their own man.","Assassin Level 30 Skill: Gale Step – increases speed by 200%. Upon activation, the user's body turns into the wind itself, entering an invincible state that cannot be locked onto.","Horror seized every heart.","\"Eagle!\"","\"Captain!\"","The armed officers roared, fury surging through them. One pulled a flashbang, predicted a trajectory, and threw it.","\"Boom!\"","The officers with thermal goggles were unaffected, but the enemy was stunned.","Gale Step had a five-minute cooldown, so he dared not fight any longer. He turned and disappeared into the forest.","The armed officers gave chase, knowing they were outmatched but refusing to let him roam free—lest he unleash chaos on civilians.","Ross was captured and immediately put through interrogation until he revealed the target.","The SWAT team had already guessed.","There was only one target.","Chu Fu!","As the leader of the first village publicly livestreamed, Chu Fu had made an overwhelmingly strong impression.","And on that very night,","a bounty of one hundred million had been posted on the dark web.","People came one after another, but Li Weizheng had reinforced defenses, recently catching several foreign assassins.","But this time, with his Game Experience Card, the enemy was far too dangerous.","Li Weizheng immediately called Chu Fu.","\"Student Chu, a foreign assassin has slipped into the area near Wangxi Mountain. His target has been confirmed as you.","He has a Game Experience Card and is an Assassin-class player.","We've already engaged him. He escaped. You're in constant danger now. Don't leave the game capsule for the next few hours. We're requesting backup!\"","Chu Fu frowned deeply upon hearing the news.","\"You engaged him? Were any of you hurt?\"","Li Weizheng fell silent, then said heavily, \"Two of our soldiers have fallen.\"","Chu Fu felt as though a giant hand had squeezed her heart, sending a wave of bitter pain—followed by blazing fury.","\"Don't move the bodies. Don't cremate or freeze them. He's not the only one with a Game Withdrawal Card. I'll have Sister Suture come out with an experience card.","Also, what skills did this assassin use?\"","Li Weizheng's heart jolted.","Suture Saint... did have a Suture Technique!","Hope surged within him.","He quickly described the assassin's abilities.","Chu Fu's heart sank.","Gale Step. A Level 30 Assassin skill.","The game had only been open for thirty-nine days. Even among players from Zone 001, Level 30 was rare as phoenix feathers.","And once you hit Level 30, you could withdraw skills permanently.","But it required gold.","A massive amount of gold.","That was why he had accepted the dark web contract.","Someone had posted a one-hundred-million-dollar bounty on Chu Fu.","It was a global posting, so the currency was Federal coins.","At the exchange rate in the Free Federation, that could be converted to 1,000 gold.","How hard was it to accumulate gold in the game? You had to clear dungeons, kill monsters, and fight world bosses.","And you could be killed by a boss at any moment.","Not everyone could solo a boss.","By Level 30, silver-tier gear was worthless, gold-tier was standard gear—worth only 1 to 9 gold each. Only dark-gold-tier equipment could sell for real money.","From that perspective, killing people was faster.","That was why Laurent had come to Zhonghua.","Once Chu Fu stepped outside, he would kill her.","And if she didn't come out? He would kill her family's maids, her security guards, create chaos, and force her out.","Word was, she had a brother.","...","Inside the game,","Chu Fu warned Li Weizheng not to send anyone to their deaths. If the assassin's target was her, he would surely head to Wangxi Manor.","She also called Chu Feng and told him everything.","\"Fufu, don't be afraid. I'll check things out first. Don't come out yet.\"","Chu Fu wasn't about to go out and get herself killed.","As for that Laurent,","he was doomed.","Then Chu Fu called everyone in the team.","\"Lieutenant Li Weizheng just told me an assassin player is trying to sneak into Wangxi Manor. No one logs out for now. Tell your families to get into their game capsules.","My brother told me about a new achievement I can unlock.","Jiaojiao, how much gold do you have on you?\"","\"80 gold.\"","Jiaoyao Bu Jiao didn't have much liquid cash either—she was running a guild and paying salaries.","Of course, the guild had extra income; every player who completed missions earned guild funds.","The guild funds could also be used to buy potions, repair gear, and so on. There was a margin to be made, but it could only be spent, not withdrawn, and extracting it was tricky.","Chu Fu said, \"Trade it all to me.\"","Jiaoyao Bu Jiao immediately sent her gold to Chu Fu.","[System Notification: You have received 100 gold. Achievement unlocked: Tycoon! All stats +1.]","Chu Fu took the money and returned to Fengdu Town, walking through its bustling streets.","After circling the commercial street twice, she spotted a handsome man in a magnificent robe carrying a shoulder pole approaching her.","The outfit was oddly jarring.","Above his head were four words.","Mysterious Merchant: Tianheng.","\"Customer, care to browse my wares?\""]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: The Mysterious Merchant's Wish Chest, An Unexpected Surprise","paragraphs":["“Of course!”","Chu Fu immediately looked toward his carrying pole.","The very first item in the goods made her heart race.","[Resurrection Scroll: Price 100 Gold Coins.]","Chu Fu remained unmoved.","She continued browsing.","[Rosemary Essential Oil: After use, transforms you into the opposite gender, with a small chance of becoming a hermaphrodite. Price: 1 Gold Coin.]","[Big Big Bubble Gum: Expands continuously when chewed, increasing both defense and attack power for 10 minutes. Price: 10 Gold Coins.]","[Eraser: Erases a segment of the target’s memory. Price: 50 Gold Coins.]","This was truly bizarre.","But all these items had unique functions.","Especially the Eraser.","Chu Feng had used one before.","He had once stolen a divine-tier piece of equipment from a deity’s follower and then erased the memory from that follower’s mind, leaving them completely unaware that they had lost a divine-level item.","Bubble Gum could make you bigger, which was incredibly effective when facing oversized monsters.","Otherwise, a monster’s attacks would come with a crushing effect, dealing damage that was far too overpowered.","However, none of these were Chu Fu’s goal.","She locked her sights on a treasure chest.","[Wishing Chest: Can be opened to obtain the item you desire. Price: 1 Gold Coin each.]","Chu Fu immediately bought 40 of them!","Those 40 were paid for with the money in her own bag. As for why she had asked Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao for money, it was because the mysterious merchant, Tianheng, only appeared when a player obtained their first 100 Gold Coins.","If you wanted to activate the mysterious merchant, you could also piggyback off someone else’s encounter.","His items were truly wondrous.","Chu Fu took out a Wishing Chest and concentrated her mental energy.","“Experience card, experience card, experience card!”","Chu Fu opened the chest.","[Joyful Lollipop (Gold-grade item): Consuming it brings extreme happiness, lifts your mood, nullifies negative status effects, and cleanses curses.]","A gold-grade item—not a loss.","But this wasn’t what she wanted!","Chu Fu began murmuring again.","“Game experience card—one that lets you extract in-game abilities into the real world!”","[Piggy Bank (White-grade): Smashing it gives you 10 Copper Coins.]","It was “experience card,” not “extraction,\" and somehow it got tangled up with money.","And exchanging 1 Gold Coin for 10 Copper Coins? You’ve got to be kidding!","Chu Fu grit her teeth and started frantically clicking.","[You obtained: Broken Fishing Rod (Damaged-grade): The line is already snapped, the hook is missing, and it cannot fish.]","[You obtained: A Bundle of Twine (White-grade)]","[You obtained: Potion of Strength (Silver-grade): Strength +1.]","[You obtained: Tiramisu (White-grade Food): A delicious dessert that increases satiety upon consumption.]","[You obtained: Purple Poison Mushroom (Silver-grade Plant): Purple has a certain charm, so anyone who sees it will desperately want to eat it.]","Money was flowing like water.","But her pockets were full of junk.","Thankfully, a consolation prize appeared: this mushroom could actually mutate.","[Mutated Purple Poison Mushroom (Silver-grade):","Trait 1: Can lure monsters within 100 meters to continuously approach.","Trait 2: Each spore it releases also contains poison, capable of infecting enemies’ lungs. The mushroom can grow anywhere upon landing, with an extremely fast growth rate.]","“Could this be the legendary ‘Mesmerizing Mushroom’?”","Chu Fu immediately placed this mushroom into her Spiritual Plant Pouch. After harvesting a batch of watermelons, she planted it there.","Whenever she encountered mutated plants, she would first preserve their seeds. This mushroom spread via spores, and Chu Fu had little experience with that.","Fortunately, although the spores were invisible to the naked eye, they could be captured using mental energy. Soon, they propagated within her Spiritual Plant Pouch.","They had spent 10 Gold Coins and only got one Silver-grade item—an absolute loss.","But Chu Fu gritted her teeth and kept opening.","And she had to hurry up; otherwise, the mysterious merchant would leave in 10 minutes.","If these 40 Wishing Chests produced nothing good, Chu Fu planned to bet everything on the 80 Gold Coins she had left.","Thinking this, she closed her eyes, decided not to look at what she was opening, and frantically clicked in her mind while chanting “Experience card... experience card... experience card!”","Finally, the system emitted a cheerful notification.","[You obtained: New Version Experience Card.]","[New Version Experience Card: Grants priority experience of the game invasion version. Using this card allows you to extract your in-game character’s abilities into reality for 3 hours.]","She’d got it!","It took a full 39 chests to finally pull it out.","Chu Fu looked at the smile on Tianheng, the mysterious merchant, and felt like she was staring at a bastard who enjoyed messing with players.","Always giving you the good stuff at the very last second, creating a tidal wave of joy after a come-from-behind victory, tempting you to open a bit more.","Chu Fu wasn’t falling for it!","Card-pulling and chest-opening—nothing good ever came of them!","Chu Fu casually opened the last chest.","[A Little Poison Cloak (Rough-grade): Poison Attack +1. Special Trait: Can grow.]","Rough-grade was one level below White-grade, but one level above Damaged, because it was still usable.","But what did “Traject: Can grow” mean?","Chu Fu’s eyes went wide.","Had she stumbled onto a divine artifact?","Chu Fu immediately took out [A Little Poison Cloak] from her inventory.","It looked like a piece of rotten wood on the outside, inlaid with a small piece of turquoise. The most important thing was that the turquoise only had a faint hint of green at the very top, and its quality didn’t seem good at all.","[Growth Condition: Absorb a little bit of poison to advance to White-grade.]","“That’s far too outrageous, isn’t it?”","Chu Fu stared at the poison requirement.","But then, her expression suddenly paused.","Come to think of it, she currently had two poison-related items with her.","A Poison Vial.","And the Purple Poison Mushroom.","What’s more, the Purple Poison Mushroom could release spores, which contained poison. Even a single small mushroom could spew out 100,000 spores.","In an instant, Chu Fu’s expression grew brighter.","But now wasn’t the time to study the cloak.","Chu Fu went to find Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao and Suture Saint.","The two were still in town doing quests.","Since the servers hadn’t merged yet, the number of goblins outside was five times smaller. Everyone had decided not to hunt today, waiting only for midnight to arrive so they could start competing for B.O.S.S. Bosses and then dive into dungeons afterward.","“Jiao Jiao, here’s your money back. Saint, take this. Wait for Major Li’s message, and then extract the sew-corpse technique offline to help save the two soldiers.”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao saw the extraction card and immediately pressed for details.","“Where did you get this? Wow, I want one too!”","Chu Fu naturally planned to share her guide with the Thorn Guild. If they could be trusted, everyone could accumulate 100 Gold Coins, acquire this item, and get a full +1 to all stats—a fantastic deal.","Jiao Jiao hurriedly asked, “Besides the experience card, what other good stuff did you open?”","Chu Fu took out [A Little Poison Cloak].","“I’m not sure if this counts as good stuff. Mainly because its advancement condition is too harsh. I plan to head outside the city and test it.”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao looked thoughtful.","...","Inside Wangxi Manor.","Chu Feng stepped out of the gaming pod and headed to the kitchen.","In the kitchen, the nanny had already started simmering chicken soup.","It was meant to nourish Chu Fu properly.","“Great, I’ll go pick some grapes from the yard. Fufu loves them!”","Chu Feng said, leaving the kitchen.","At that moment, a ghostly figure trailed behind Chu Feng."]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Kidnap Chu Fu's brother and threaten Chu Fu to go offline","paragraphs":["This was none other than the 30-level assassin from the Beautiful Country, Laurent.","He had the information Ross had gathered, knowing that the young, handsome man before him was Chu Fu's brother.","Perfect timing.","Grab him, make the brother call Chu Fu, and force her to log out of the game.","Once the mission was completed swiftly, 100 million federal coins would be in his hands!","It was going too smoothly.","Laurent grinned ferociously, revealing white teeth and crimson gums, licking his lips.","He reached out and grabbed Chu Feng by the neck.","Chu Feng tilted his neck.","Laurent froze, thinking it was just luck, and reached out again.","Chu Feng took two steps forward.","Enraged, Laurent drew a dagger, planning to cut off Chu Feng’s leg first.","But the moment he pulled out the dagger, Chu Feng turned around.","Seeing the opponent’s weapon, he felt deeply disappointed.","“Can’t even bother to cash in a weapon? Broke loser!”","Unable to hold back any longer, Laurent blurted out a string of foreign gibberish.","“You’re the broke loser! Do you know how expensive it is to cash in gear? Wait...how did you know?”","Chu Feng also spoke the Beautiful Country’s language.","He had lived for many years after the game invasion, when the three major nations united to fight back. Through frequent exchanges, he naturally picked up the language.","But he didn’t answer Laurent’s question.","The next moment, Laurent saw Chu Feng pull a dagger emitting black smoke from his pants pocket.","The dagger was a full meter long—impossible to pull from a pocket in reality.","The only possibility was that he had taken it from his spatial backpack.","He cashed in a spatial backpack!","How rich did one have to be to cash in such things?","Before Laurent could recover from the shock, Chu Feng put the dagger away.","“No, if I kill you with a weapon, blood will splatter—hard to clean up, and if Fu Fu sees it, she’ll be scared and grossed out.”","So what would he use to kill him?","Laurent felt this man was too arrogant, too careless.","He was a top assassin from the Beautiful Country, a 30-level assassin in the game, capable of cashing in attributes, talents, and skills from the game world.","Yet he was being so underestimated.","He erupted with terrifying speed, charging at Chu Feng.","But for Chu Feng, his arrogant speed was as slow as a snail.","In an instant, Chu Feng sidestepped and threw a punch at Laurent’s head.","\"Boom!\"","Laurent’s skull deformed, his eyes bulging outward, and his entire body was blasted away by the immense force.","Even though he had cashed in physique attributes, this punch nearly knocked him out.","Chu Feng’s movements were eerily swift as he closed in, throwing a punch at Laurent’s throat.","If that landed, he was dead.","Laurent let out a furious roar, quickly activating Windwalk.","Chu Feng’s punch barely missed Laurent, hitting only the wind, causing him to flutter. Laurent raised his dagger and slashed at Chu Feng.","Hadn’t he already become invincible? Couldn’t he kill this man?","But Chu Feng wore a faint, mocking smile.","\"Clang!\"","The dagger emitted a crisp sound,","as if striking metal.","Chu Feng’s vest tore open, revealing an inner armor beneath.","He had cashed in his equipment.","That killer dagger—worth about 500,000 in the real world and considered high-quality—had no lethal power against a game item.","One second passed in the blink of an eye.","Chu Feng struck again.","Aimed at the throat once more.","\"Boom!\"","Under the punch, Laurent didn’t even have time to scream before his throat was completely crushed.","Laurent died.","Before the blood could spray, Chu Feng immediately stored the body into his spatial backpack.","He waved a hand in front of his nose, looking annoyed.","“What a stench.”","Then Chu Feng’s own figure vanished from within the Crescent Villa.","At that moment, the villa had been surrounded like an iron bucket.","Thermal imaging scanners and radar constantly monitored the area.","Despite their speed, they hadn’t realized that Laurent was faster, entering the compound before the blockade was complete.","What baffled every instrument even more was Chu Feng’s stealth—they detected nothing.","Because Chu Feng walked in the dark dimension.","It was as if he moved through a parallel plane, only stepping into the real world when he chose to tear open a spatial rift.","Soon, he reached the Crescent Hills.","A large number of hikers had been convinced to descend the mountain, citing reports of wild boars roaming about.","Military dogs sniffed everywhere, searching for any trace of Laurent.","Chu Feng casually found a spot, dumped the body, and turned away without a second glance.","Time to go back and pick grapes—he wanted to make a grape fruit tea for Chu Fu.","After he left, the military dogs in the hills began barking wildly. The group quickly discovered Laurent’s body, and shock spread.","How had he died?","Who killed him? Were they an enemy or a friend?","Had someone turned him in for the bounty, or had some hidden expert intervened?","At that moment, as they looked toward the distant Crescent Villa, they suddenly felt the people living within it were unfathomable.","Li Weizheng learned of the news and immediately called Chu Fu.","His voice carried a hint of caution.","“Classmate Chu, Laurent’s body has been found. Was it someone on your side who handled it? Don’t worry—killing foreign intruders like this won’t be punished; in fact, there’s a substantial reward.”","Chu Fu understood—her brother had made a move.","Her brother acted swiftly and left no trace, completely eluding the authorities.","Chu Fu didn’t respond directly. Instead, she said, “Send the fallen soldiers to Sister Suture Saint’s place! If you really want to reward me, reimburse the experience cards—40 gold coins.”","Li Weizheng’s eyes went wide.","40 gold coins?","At the current exchange rate between game currency and real-world currency, that was 40 million!","But considering the resurrection of two soldiers and the strength of the Thorn Guild Chu Fu belonged to, he gritted his teeth.","“Reimburse, I’ll definitely reimburse. At midnight, I’ll send a team into District 030 to acquire game coins. You can also arrange a player you trust, who’s reached level 10, to bring the gold there.”","Chu Fu hadn’t expected Li Weizheng to agree.","But she didn’t hold back.","After all, with the game invasion of reality, the assets of the Flora Kingdom would become worthless paper. Before that happened, why not use them wherever they could be spent?","Then they hung up, and Li Weizheng went to contact Suture Saint.","Three hours later.","At the garden villa of Suture Saint.","Two bodies lay on the ground.","“Classmate Li, they’re all here. Is there anything else you need to prepare?”","“No need. This will do.”","Suture Saint had abundant nutrition fluids, so she cashed in her talent, \"Flying Needles to Restore Life,\" \"Corpse-Sewing Art,\" and a portion of her mental attribute.","Of course, the silver needles in her hand were real-world items.","She flung the flying needles with invisible threads connecting them, stitching through the two bodies.","Soon, the wounds were closed.","She infused a surge of internal energy.","Their pale faces suddenly flushed with color.","Then Suture Saint performed the \"Flying Needles to Restore Life.\"","At that moment, she inadvertently triggered the \"Thousand Hands\" ability.","Then, the flying needles shot not only toward the ground but also toward Li Weizheng.","In an instant, the needles pierced his leg bones, foot bones, and arms one after another.","\"Ah!\" Li Weizheng exclaimed, feeling an unbearable itch all over his body. Then, a crack opened in his skin.","The steel pins that had been driven into his bones were forced out.","The chronic ailments and old wounds that had plagued him were swept away completely.","His eyes widened.","The next moment, his gaze blazed with a fervent light.","\"Li Zhenzhen, how much longer can your ability last?\""]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Li Weizheng's Excitement, Treating the Old Chief","paragraphs":["“3 hours.”","3 hours! More than enough!","However, Li Weizheng still asked, “But how many times can you perform such treatment? We need to make arrangements!”","Last time, Chu Fu had used an experience card, but she also mentioned that her mana was limited, so she could only mutate 10 plants and control 10 plants for attack.","If the Suture Saint could only use the skill 10 times, then three had already been used, right?","That left seven uses, which were still crucial.","Fortunately, the Suture Saint’s skill likely had group healing capabilities.","That way, more people could be saved.","Unexpectedly, the Suture Saint had even more surprises in store.","“My energy isn’t mana—it’s inner force. I can even recharge by giving myself acupuncture, so theoretically, my healing has no limits.”","A wave of immense joy washed over Li Weizheng.","He wanted to take the Suture Saint with him to save people.","But he dared not.","The Suture Saint was far too important—what if something unexpected happened outside?","What if another assassin infiltrated? Li Weizheng couldn’t bear that responsibility.","Not only that, but Wangxi Manor must have other top-tier guardians as well.","It was safest here.","“Li Zhenzhen, in these three hours, could you help treat the other soldiers? Don’t worry, I won’t let you work for free. Name your price, and I’ll make sure you’re satisfied.”","Li Zhenzhen was naturally willing to help.","Since the other party mentioned payment, she felt a little embarrassed.","After thinking it over, she said, “How about settling it in game coins? Corpses within 3 days can be revived using corpse-sewing techniques—10 silver coins each. Treating other injuries is 1 silver coin.”","Li Weizheng did the math in his head—this was practically a steal.","10 silver coins, equivalent to 10,000 yuan, for saving a life.","1 silver coin for chronic or serious illnesses—he knew health was often irreversible, and the Suture Saint could even treat terminal diseases.","If this came to light, it would cause a public uproar.","Even the Suture Saint’s life could be in danger.","Thinking of this, he gritted his teeth and said, “Skip the corpse-sewing—just focus on healing. I’ll pay 10 silver coins per person. I’ll make arrangements right away.”","Li Weizheng then looked at the two people who had gotten up from the ground. Their eyes were still full of shock.","They kept touching their necks.","Clearly dead, yet resurrected.","And that foreign assassin’s ability.","Was this the terror of in-game talents brought into reality?","Seeing this, Li Weizheng said, “Xu Ying, Liu Cheng, both of you will sign a confidentiality agreement later. Li Zhenzhen revived you for just 10,000 yuan—we’ll process it through your medical insurance.”","“Yes!”","“Yes!”","The Suture Saint thought: This can even go through medical insurance!","Soon, Li Weizheng’s phone was smoking from constant calls.","The first person he thought of was the Old Chief staying at the Military Region General Hospital.","The Old Chief was already 92, a very long-lived man, but as age crept up, the wartime injuries he suffered in his youth tormented him relentlessly.","He was long paralyzed in bed, barely clinging to life.","A month ago, the old man was on the verge of death, but a filial descendant brought him a game helmet.","The descendant said that since the Old Chief had lived through that era and seen the prosperity of their homeland, he should at least witness what future technology was like.","[The Primordial Gate] had brought great changes to the world, and in the game, the Old Chief could walk around and see things, which would lift his spirits—much better than languishing in bed.","After hearing this, the family agreed, even using a game pod.","This finally gave the Old Chief a renewed breath.","Not only that, but the Old Chief actually awakened a powerful talent.","[S-level Talent: Summon Loyal Spirits:","Feature 1: Summon Loyal Spirits: Summon loyal spirits to fight for you. When attacked, they block damage for you.","Feature 2: Spirit Possession: A loyal spirit can forcibly possess a target and control their actions. The weaker the target's soul, the higher the success rate and longer the duration.","Feature 3: Spirit and death-type damage +100%.]","When choosing a class, the old man called his great-grandson and selected a very dominant one.","Hidden class: Lich King.","Chu Fu's starting constitution was 1.","The Old Chief's constitution was a direct 0.","His health was only 1 point.","These numbers alone showed that he was truly at death's door.","Moreover, the Lich King couldn’t increase constitution or health.","But because the class was so overpowered, the Old Chief was now level 27 and governed Server Zone 0098888.","However, the Old Chief was too old for anyone to risk moving him, and he wasn’t skilled at playing the game.","His level was achieved thanks to a group of youngsters who carried him; he couldn’t share much useful information.","If they could fix the Old Chief’s body and give him more time, the military in their Linjiang City would finally have a seasoned figurehead and a powerful player.","After some coordination, the Old Chief’s family arranged for his nutrient pod to be escorted there.","Not only that,","A large number of retired soldiers injured in service were called back—no reason was given, but they followed orders unconditionally.","These were all exceptionally talented individuals.","Soon, Wangxi Manor was bustling, no matter by land or helicopter.","The security guards at the entrance were dumbfounded.","Originally, Li Weizheng’s protection was only covert.","The security and management of Wangxi Manor were still handled by a small contracted company.","But now, they directly took over.","Not long after, a low-key, black armored stretch car arrived, and the game pod was carried into the Suture Saint’s home.","Doctors and family members were all by the side.","A family member pressed the call button.","“Great-grandfather, we’re here. You need to log out!”","A hoarse, almost slurred voice came through.","“Wait till I kill this monster!”","An old lady in her seventies smiled awkwardly: “Doctor, please wait a moment—my dad’s a bit of a playboy, he loves this game!”","After a while, the game pod finally opened, revealing the old man inside.","If anyone saw this person for the first time, they would definitely find it horrifying.","He was incredibly thin, skin and bones, with sunken cheeks, lifeless eyes, sparse hair, and dense spots covering his skin.","He didn’t look alive.","More like a zombie from a Hong Kong film—very frightening.","Even the Suture Saint, with all her experience, was startled, but being a medical professional with a strong heart, she quickly calmed down.","She raised her needle and began acupuncture on the old man.","The Thousand-Hand Salvation activated, and multiple hands appeared, sending silver needles flying. Most targeted the old man, while a few treated the others incidentally.","“Ah!” The old man’s body twisted, itching unbearably.","His pajamas were pulled down, and an old scar on his chest suddenly split open, a yellow-orange object oozing out.","It was a bullet."]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Growth-Type Weapon: Jiaojiao Gets Disheartened Opening the Box","paragraphs":["Not only the old man, but also the 70-something grandmother beside him—the old man’s daughter—was treated as a bonus.","Through his silver needles, Suture Saint could sense the physical condition of others.","It was like triggering a function in a game and seeing a health bar.","The old man was astonished too.","He could feel the constant pain, weakness, and exhaustion that had plagued him all fading away. It wasn’t a complete rebirth, but his once immobile body suddenly regained strength.","His failing organs were revitalized.","“This... young lady, where did you get this ability? Can I have it too?”","His talent was summoning loyal spirits. Every one he summoned was a former comrade or subordinate.","Those souls looked as real as if they were alive, vivid and tangible.","He truly wanted to take these old comrades to see the world as it is now.","To see how prosperous the Flowering Nation had become.","Suture Saint said, “This is a game experience card my captain gave me. As for how to get one, I’ll need to ask him.","Of course, if the captain has already submitted a guide, then I can ask Major Li about it too.”","Sensing that this old man was someone important, Suture Saint gave a few instructions.","“The old man’s age has caught up with him. All his organs are failing. I’ve used my skill to restore his health, but it can only keep him from losing HP. His health cap is still very low. Be careful not to let him bump into anything, understand?”","His great-grandson nodded repeatedly.","“Got it, we understand! Miracle doctor! If I’d known, I would’ve chosen the healing path too!”","Suture Saint didn’t have time for small talk; Li Weizheng had invited too many people.","The old man was taken home by his family. They originally wanted to check him over and confirm his condition, but he wouldn’t leave the game pod.","Instead, the old man’s eldest daughter couldn’t resist going to the hospital for a blood test.","Something unbelievable happened.","An organ that had been removed due to a terminal illness had actually grown back.","“Quick, set up a game pod for me too. I want to play this game.”","...","Inside the game.","Chu Fu hung up the phone call from Li Weizheng.","She had submitted a guide for how to obtain the experience card items, but the drop rates were unpredictable.","As for the fact that level 30 allowed abilities to be manifested in reality, she kept that tightly under wraps.","Because once that got out, it would reveal that someone on their side had already reached level 30.","Then Chu Feng’s identity wouldn’t stay hidden.","Chu Fu didn’t want to stir up unnecessary trouble.","As the Lone Wolf Male Lead, Chu Feng naturally had a hidden halo about him—he wouldn’t cooperate with the national team. And Chu Fu wasn’t about to force him.","Besides, within a month, the fact that level 30 allowed real-world manifestation would inevitably become public knowledge.","There was no rush.","Chu Fu opened her Spirit Herb Pouch.","She force-ripened all the plants inside, stored them, then placed purple toxic mushrooms on the soil to mutate.","Under the influence of her talent, the purple toxic mushrooms instantly became more dreamlike.","What was once palm-sized grew to the size of a basketball, like a low stool.","Chu Fu continued to force-ripen them, releasing spores that floated outward.","The Spirit Herb Pouch had limited space, so the billions of drifting spores had nowhere to go but to land on the soil.","Soon, some underwent secondary mutation.","[Charm Mushroom (Gold Grade): Lures monsters within a 200-meter radius toward it.]","The purple mushroom grew even larger, now the size of a washbasin, and began to glow.","White polka-dot patterns refracted light into countless fine specks, flickering and shimmering like a galaxy of dazzling brilliance.","Was this meant to make monsters dance disco?","Of course, the Charm Mushroom still carried spore reproduction and came with a potent poison. Any monster lured in would meet its end.","In no time, the 50x50 plot of the Spirit Herb Pouch was covered entirely in Charm Mushrooms.","Chu Fu harvested them all into her storage with one click.","[You have obtained Charm Mushrooms × 10,000.]","[You have obtained Charm Mushroom Spore Powder × 5,000 kg.]","Chu Fu’s eyes lit up instantly.","This spore powder could probably be scattered as a poison.","She extracted the spore powder into her backpack, then dragged the [A Lit Bit Toxic Staff] onto the spore powder.","The next moment, the staff began absorbing the spore powder.","The green gem at the top turned into a sinister purple hue.","[A Lit Bit Toxic Staff (Standard Grade): Toxin Attack +10.","Ability 1: Growth Potential (Growth Requirement: Absorb 1 billion poison points to reach Black Iron Grade)]","This should be easy.","Chu Fu continued producing spore powder in the Spirit Herb Pouch.","Ten feedings of spore powder turned the staff into Black Iron.","Then she continued.","One hundred feedings!","This took a bit more time.","On a whim, Chu Fu also fed Charm Mushrooms directly to the staff, and it worked.","The staff upgraded to Bronze quality.","Its appearance changed too.","The rough wooden staff turned white and felt slightly springy to the touch.","The green turquoise gem became a purple sphere with white spots, glowing faintly with fluorescence.","The staff now looked like an elongated purple mushroom.","Purple cap, white stem!","Next target: Silver Grade!","One thousand feedings!","Grind.","If grinding didn’t kill her, she’d grind to death.","Chu Fu left the city, heading to an empty spot to release some plants to recover her mana, using her Plant Person’s fourth trait to restore her magic.","Outside Fengdu Town stretched a rice field.","The fields still had monsters like mutated rats, grass snakes, and frogs.","But at level 2, these monsters no longer bothered the players.","Even the townspeople were strong enough to handle them on their own.","Chu Fu crossed the fields, found a spot with no monsters and no crops, and summoned a patch of watermelon plants.","She sat down on a large watermelon, then repeated planting, harvesting, planting, harvesting without stopping.","Finally, just before midnight, Chu Fu evolved her staff to Silver Grade.","[A Lit Bit Toxic Staff (Silver Grade):","Toxin Attack +100.","Spirit +25.","Ability 1: Growth Potential (Growth Requirement: Absorb 1 trillion poison points to reach Gold Grade)","Ability 2: Charm: Cast on a target, forcibly charming them for 3 seconds, causing them to constantly move toward you without attacking.]","[System Notice: Your “A Lit Bit Toxic Staff” has acquired a special effect affix and can no longer grow by absorbing Charm Mushrooms or their materials.]","“Damn it!”","If it were just making mushrooms, even if it took a long time, Chu Fu felt it would be easy to finish.","She hadn’t expected this limitation.","Still, the staff’s stats were pretty impressive.","Chu Fu was currently level 15. A normal Silver-grade staff had an attack of about 75 points.","But [A Lit Bit Toxic Staff] was Chu Fu’s exclusive toxin attack, exceeding the Silver standard by 25 points.","That was already a significant boost.","...","Real-world time: 6 PM.","Suture Saint finally logged in.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao let out a scream in the team chat.","\"Suture Saint, boohoo, I'm bankrupt!\"","Suture Saint was startled.","\"What happened? What happened? How did you go bankrupt? It's okay, it's okay, I'll support you from now on. I earned so much money in these three hours! And I got a whole bunch of business cards.\"","Xie Lin gloated, \"She opened a 500-gold coin chest and ended up making only 50 gold. I told her gamblers never win, but she just wouldn't listen!\""]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Rush the Boss at 0:00, New Teammates","paragraphs":["“What?! How much did you lose???”","Suture Saint let out a shriek!","500 million!","That was 500 million!","We're coming for you, you trust-fund brats.","“No kid cries every day, no gambler loses every time!”","Jiaojiao Bujiao tried to save face while tempting Suture Saint.","“Saint, haven't you done that achievement yet? Come on, you can still summon the Mysterious Merchant once.”","Suture Saint knew about that achievement, but she didn't have the money, and she hadn't planned on buying 100 gold just to complete it.","But Jiaojiao Bujiao bought it.","She called Suture Saint over and traded her 100 gold coins.","The instant she received it, Suture Saint got the achievement.","“Here's the 100 gold back, I wasn't going to buy it anyway.”","She traded the 100 gold back to Jiaojiao Bujiao.","But the very next moment, a mysterious merchant appeared beside them, carrying his wares on a pole.","The goods were a mixed bag.","Jiaojiao Bujiao's hands itched again.","“Last hundred!”","“More like the last hundred million! That kind of hundred million! You're not allowed to buy!”","“But Plant Girl got a growable weapon, and I want one too. It feels like it could become an artifact!”","“Huh?” Suture Saint really hadn't expected that.","Chu Fu took the chance to chime in.","“Jiaojiao, opening boxes and pulling gacha is really addictive, but in the end, you always lose money.","Besides, that god Tiangheng is cunning. He knows you have money, so the more he keeps the good stuff away from you, the more you're tempted to keep opening chests!","Take my word for it—if Saint buys, she'll definitely get something good.”","“I don't believe it! Saint, you buy. I'm paying!”","“I'm not letting you pay!”","Suture Saint had money of her own now.","She looked at the goods in the Mysterious Merchant's hands. Besides the Wishing Chests, she didn't need anything else.","She glanced at the money in her bag.","15 gold.","5 of which she'd gotten yesterday from saving Jiang Yixing's team.","“Fine, I'll buy 5. That's the money that celebrity who starts with 'Xing' or whatever—his team gave me. Consider it like I never saved them!”","She bought 5 chests.","And opened them all in a row.","[You obtained: Fine Bandages (Black Iron) ×50]","[You obtained: Surgical Records (Blank) book.]","[You obtained: Nine-Vein Golden Needles (Gold-tier)]","[You obtained: Medicine Gourd (Silver-tier) off-hand weapon.]","[You obtained: Body-Strengthening Pill (Silver-tier elixir): CON +1.]","“Huh?”","Suture Saint was dumbfounded.","She posted the items to the team chat, and a wave of “666” messages flooded in.","Chu Fu felt like her mouth had been blessed. She'd mentioned it as a probability tip, but she didn't expect Suture Saint to be this lucky.","That wave was absolutely a huge win.","“That gold-tier weapon, and it's a signature weapon—that's worth 10 gold at least. Even a silver off-hand weapon is 1 gold. The strength pill is 100 silver. And the worst one, the blank book—that's actually a treasure. You can learn skills from it!”","Wait, that was a thing?","Suture Saint couldn't wait to flip the book open.","Jiaojiao Bujiao was broken.","“Damn it, you only scam me, don't you?! Kid, if I ever buy a single thing from you again, I'll take your last name!”","Jiaojiao Bujiao swore a solemn oath.","500 million was just for fun—if she didn't get anything good, she'd never touch it again.","“Hey, wake up. Don't be mad. Here, take this Body-Strengthening Pill! Eat it and boost your constitution! You'll have more stamina to tank mobs!”","Suture Saint handed the strength pill to Jiaojiao Bujiao.","“Alright, we're all here. Let's call 5 more people and farm the level-20 monsters. 10 minutes before the server merge at midnight, we'll go take down the Goblin Chieftain.”","There were five BOSSes on the town map!","They were:","The Goblin Tribe Chieftain.","The Goblin Overseer.","The Goblin Warlord.","The Goblin Frost King.","The Goblin Abyss Overlord.","The first-kill drop gave +2 to all attributes, though the bonus chest was still just Silver-tier.","So the chest wasn't exciting.","But the attribute points were worth fighting over.","Chu Fu picked her team members.","Shafu Liangu, Wu Yingchun, Little Sister Wu, and Zhimengzhe.","Zhimengzhe was socially anxious and a life-skill player, but her talent was actually pretty good.","[A-Tier Talent: Soul Giver:","Characteristic 1: You can grant souls to inanimate objects, allowing them to assist you, whether in battle or with chores.","Characteristic 2: Soul communication ability increased by 50%.]","Plus, Zhimengzhe's class was also a special one, [Doll Master], allowing her to craft dolls that would fight for her.","Also a summoner class.","The difference between her and Shafu Liangu was that her summoned dolls got prettier and prettier.","While the other's summoned bugs got more and more terrifying!","Shafu Liangu came flying in on a giant bug.","It was faster than the Wing Glider.","It was an oversized cockroach.","It looked horrifying.","As for the last slot, Chu Fu didn't fill it, because that person wasn't in the same server as her right now.","Once the server merged at midnight, she'd be able to see them.","Then,","Chu Fu and the others farmed level-20 monsters for over five hours and finally unlocked an achievement.","[Congratulations! Achievement completed—\"Goblin Slayer!\": Killed a cumulative 1,000,000 goblins. Reward: All attributes +1. Your damage against goblin-kind increased by 10%. Goblin-kind's hatred toward you increased by 10%.]","Not only that, but this quest had upgraded tiers as well.","[Goblin Massacre: Kill 10,000,000 goblins. Reward: 3 points to all attributes, 20% increased damage against goblins.]","[Tide of the Green Plague's Master: Kill 100,000,000 goblins. Reward: 5 points to all attributes, 30% increased damage against goblins.","Special Title: Master of the Green Tide. When equipped: All goblin units suffer a 15% reduction in all attributes when they encounter you.]","This was an achievement that would take a long time to complete, so there was no rush.","At this point, there were still 10 minutes until the server merge.","“Let's go! Time to face our first BOSS!”","Shen Chi summoned his mech, then pulled out a small bus cabin, and with the team aboard, they rumbled off toward the Goblin Chieftain's location.","Finally, midnight arrived.","[System Announcement: Beginner-area server merge for Fengdu Town. Servers 026, 027, 028, 029, and 030 have been merged into the 8888 server at server 0308888, beginner village: Wangxi Village.]","[System Announcement: During the server merge, player positions will be adjusted as necessary. Players in wilderness areas, please note that monster respawn rates are now five times the original mirrored-server amount.]","[System Announcement: Wilderness BOSSes have respawned. Dungeon [Goblin Nest] is now open. Public quest [Goblin Raids] is now open.]","As the announcements came through, double the monsters spawned in the forest below.","In front of a goblin cave, a hulking goblin over two meters tall appeared.","Not only that, but in the distance, numerous player figures appeared, overlapping with each other before the system automatically shifted their positions.","Chu Fu and her team didn't have that problem, because they were in the air.","Just then, Chu Fu received a message.","[System Notice: Bitter Melon King (Pain Warlock) has requested to join the party.]"]}]);
